ty across surface walkways, cycling trails, and waterfront boardwalks.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC8.png\\\" alt=\\\"Community Master Plan Overview\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Flexible Investment &amp; Payment Plan<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>A buyer-friendly, construction-linked payment structure is offered with flexible milestones, making property acquisition straightforward and stress-free.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC12.png\\\" alt=\\\"Milestone Payment Structure\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>World-Class Facilities &amp; Amenities<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Enjoy infinity swimming pools, state-of-the-art fitness centres, private beach cabanas, children\'s play areas, multi-sport courts, and fine-dining waterfront restaurants just steps from your front door.<\\/p>\",\"in_navbar\":1,\"show_in_projects\":1,\"show_in_commercial\":0,\"navbar_order\":86,\"is_published\":1,\"status\":\"publish\",\"meta_title\":\"punjab Properties | Luxury Investment & Community Guide\",\"meta_description\":\"Explore luxury waterfront homes, real estate, and investment projects in punjab.\",\"meta_keywords\":\"punjab, real estate in punjab, properties for sale in punjab\",\"og_image\":\"\\/images\\/hero\\/slide-1.jpg\"}', '[]', 'https://saimaprojects.com/admin/cities/6', '203.101.188.87', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/156.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', NULL, '2026-11-12 10:33:53', '2026-11-12 10:33:53'),
