(192, 'App\\Models\\User', 2, 'updated', 'App\\Models\\PageSection', 587, '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"Saima Mangroves at Korangi Creek Karachi Living & Waterfront Sanctuary\\\",\\\"intro\\\":\\\"<p class=\\\\\\\"saimaIntroP\\\\\\\">Saima Mangroves at Korangi Creek Karachi is a premier benchmark for luxury waterfront living, seamlessly blending contemporary architectural elegance with a tranquil coastal sanctuary. Residents enjoy fresh sea breezes, private beach access, and immediate connectivity to key metropolitan hubs.<\\\\\\/p><p class=\\\\\\\"saimaIntroP\\\\\\\" style=\\\\\\\"margin-top:1rem\\\\\\\">Located along prestigious shoreline corridors, the community offers an inspired lifestyle for professionals, investors, and families seeking refined island elegance away from urban congestion.<\\\\\\/p><p class=\\\\\\\"saimaIntroP\\\\\\\" style=\\\\\\\"margin-top:1rem\\\\\\\">Every residence offers a harmonious blend of sophistication, security, and long-term capital appreciation, presenting an extraordinary investment opportunity in one of the most coveted coastal addresses.<\\\\\\/p>\\\",\\\"html\\\":\\\"<p>Saima Mangroves is a residential enclave within The Mangrove, a master-planned waterfront community at Korangi Creek in Karachi. The project is being executed through National Management & Consultancy (Private) Limited, a special purpose vehicle of TPL REIT Fund I, under a Development Advisory Agreement with the Zeeshan Saleem Zaki Group of Saima Builders. Saima Mangroves Korangi Creek is a development offering panoramic views of the protected mangrove belt. For buyers seeking a structured, institutionally backed entry into Karachi\'s waterfront residential market, Saima Mangrove Residences Karachi represents a distinct proposition: a planned community rather than a standalone tower.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>The project is listed as \\\\\\\"Coming Soon\\\\\\\" on the developer\'s official project page and as \\\\\\\"Pre-Launch\\\\\\\" on independen