(198, 'App\\Models\\User', 2, 'updated', 'App\\Models\\PageSection', 594, '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"PIDC Living & Waterfront Sanctuary\\\",\\\"intro\\\":\\\"<p class=\\\\\\\"saimaIntroP\\\\\\\">PIDC is a premier benchmark for luxury waterfront living, seamlessly blending contemporary architectural elegance with a tranquil coastal sanctuary. Residents enjoy fresh sea breezes, private beach access, and immediate connectivity to key metropolitan hubs.<\\\\\\/p><p class=\\\\\\\"saimaIntroP\\\\\\\" style=\\\\\\\"margin-top:1rem\\\\\\\">Located along prestigious shoreline corridors, the community offers an inspired lifestyle for professionals, investors, and families seeking refined island elegance away from urban congestion.<\\\\\\/p><p class=\\\\\\\"saimaIntroP\\\\\\\" style=\\\\\\\"margin-top:1rem\\\\\\\">Every residence offers a harmonious blend of sophistication, security, and long-term capital appreciation, presenting an extraordinary investment opportunity in one of the most coveted coastal addresses.<\\\\\\/p>\\\",\\\"html\\\":\\\"<p class=\\\\\\\"saimaIntroP\\\\\\\"><br><\\\\\\/p>\\\",\\\"appt_title\\\":\\\"BOOK AN APPOINTMENT\\\",\\\"body\\\":\\\"<p class=\\\\\\\"saimaIntroP\\\\\\\"><br><\\\\\\/p>\\\"}\"}', '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"PIDC Living & Waterfront Sanctuary\\\",\\\"intro\\\":\\\"<p class=\\\\\\\"saimaIntroP\\\\\\\">PIDC is a premier benchmark for luxury waterfront living, seamlessly blending contemporary architectural elegance with a tranquil coastal sanctuary. Residents enjoy fresh sea breezes, private beach access, and immediate connectivity to key metropolitan hubs.<\\\\\\/p><p class=\\\\\\\"saimaIntroP\\\\\\\" style=\\\\\\\"margin-top:1rem\\\\\\\">Located along prestigious shoreline corridors, the community offers an inspired lifestyle for professionals, investors, and families seeking refined island elegance away from urban congestion.<\\\\\\/p><p class=\\\\\\\"saimaIntroP\\\\\\\" style=\\\\\\\"margin-top:1rem\\\\\\\">Every resid