(361, 'App\\Models\\User', 2, 'deleted', 'App\\Models\\Developer', 3, '{\"id\":3,\"name\":\"karogani Greek\",\"slug\":\"karogani-greek\",\"h1\":\"St Bride Printing Library in London,\",\"tagline\":\"but also the leap into electronic\",\"logo\":\"uploads\\/developers\\/1794587090_logo_cloud-rain-alt.svg\",\"cover_image\":\"uploads\\/developers\\/1794587090_cover_image-hero.jpg\",\"og_image\":\"uploads\\/developers\\/1794587090_cover_image-hero.jpg\",\"short_content\":\"<p><span style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; text-align: justify;\\\">&nbsp;the librarian at St Bride Printing Library in London, took a 1914 Cicero translation and scrambled it to make dummy text for Letraset\'s Body Type sheets. It has survived not only many decades, but also the leap into electronic typesetting, remaining essentially unchanged. It was popularised thanks to these sheets and more recently with desktop publishing software like Aldus PageMaker and Microsoft Word including versions of Lorem Ipsum.<\\/span><\\/p>\",\"full_content\":\"<p><span style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; text-align: justify;\\\"><\\/span><\\/p><span class=\\\"heading-inline heading-h2\\\" style=\\\"display: inline; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.25;\\\"><p><span style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; text-align: justify;\\\"><span class=\\\"heading-inline heading-h4\\\" style=\\\"display: inline; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.35;\\\">&nbsp;the librarian at St Bride Printing Library in London,<\\/span> <\\/span><\\/p><p><\\/p><\\/span><p><span style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; text-align: justify;\\\">took a 1914 Cicero translation and scrambled it to make dummy text for Letraset\'s Body Type sheets. It has survived not only many decades, but also the leap into electronic<\\/span><\