('laravel-cache-page_data_saima-greens', 'O:15:\"App\\Models\\Page\":39:{s:13:\"\0*\0connection\";s:5:\"mysql\";s:8:\"\0*\0table\";s:5:\"pages\";s:13:\"\0*\0primaryKey\";s:2:\"id\";s:10:\"\0*\0keyType\";s:3:\"int\";s:12:\"incrementing\";b:1;s:7:\"\0*\0with\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0withCount\";a:0:{}s:19:\"preventsLazyLoading\";b:0;s:10:\"\0*\0perPage\";i:15;s:6:\"exists\";b:1;s:18:\"wasRecentlyCreated\";b:0;s:28:\"\0*\0escapeWhenCastingToString\";b:0;s:13:\"\0*\0attributes\";a:16:{s:2:\"id\";i:99;s:5:\"title\";s:12:\"Saima Greens\";s:4:\"slug\";s:12:\"saima-greens\";s:4:\"body\";s:5305:\"<p>At its core, Saima Greens is a family apartment project built around greenery: more than 40% of the total project area is dedicated to landscaped parks and open green spaces, which is unusual for a site on one of Karachi\'s busiest roads. The apartments themselves are large, with 4-room, 5-room, and 6-room layouts ranging from about 1,200 to 2,300 square feet, designed for families who need more living space and greater comfort.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>This corridor of Shahrah-e-Faisal has become one of Karachi\'s fastest-growing residential and investment destinations, and Saima Greens Saima Builders is regularly shortlisted among green / gated apartments Karachi buyers compare on the airport side of the city. For family apartments Karachi searches, its combination of a main-road address and internal green space is the main draw.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Key Project Highlights</h2>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n<tbody><tr>\r\n<th>Feature</th>\r\n<th>Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Developer</td>\r\n<td>Saima Builders</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Property Type</td>\r\n<td>Residential</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Unit Types</td>\r\n<td>4, 5 & 6-room apartments</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Total Land Size</td>\r\n<td>15 acres</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Handover</td>\r\n<td>To be confirmed</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Location</td>\r\n<td>Main Shahrah-e-Faisal, near Jinnah International Airport, Karachi</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Payment Plan</td>\r\n<td>On Easy Installments</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Lifestyle</td>\r\n<td>Green living</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<h2>Master Plan and Development Framework</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Saima Greens Saima Builders is planned as a green residential community rather than a solid built-up block, with a master plan that reserves a large share of the site for landscaped parks and open spaces between the apartment buildings.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The framework reflects that green-first approach: towers arranged around open areas, community facilities placed within the scheme, and apartment layouts planned for light and ventilation. The Saima Greens floor plan keeps family living spaces generous, consistent with the project\'s larger-than-typical unit sizes.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Unit Types: 4, 5 & 6-Room Apartments</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>For buyers searching for apartments for sale Saima Greens Karachi or flats for sale Saima Greens Karachi, Saima Greens apartments Karachi offers large family layouts in three categories.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>4-Room Apartments in Saima Greens</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>The 4-room apartments in Saima Greens apartments Karachi are the project\'s entry category, offering a spacious layout for smaller families who still want the project\'s green setting and main-road location.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>5-Room Apartments in Saima Greens</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>The 5-room apartments in Saima Greens apartments Karachi suit larger families who need an additional bedroom or a flexible room, with sizes at the larger end of the project\'s range.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>6-Room Apartments in Saima Greens</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>The 6-room apartments in Saima Greens apartments Karachi are the project\'s largest residences, aimed at joint families who want maximum space within a gated, green community on Shahrah-e-Faisal.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Floor Plan</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>A floor plan for each apartment type in Saima Greens Saima Builders is available through the developer\'s authorised sales channel. Buyers seeking a Saima Greens apartment price or a Saima Greens floor plan should request the unit schedule alongside the floor plan from the authorised sales channel, as secondary listings are often incomplete.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Price and Booking Status</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>The Saima Greens price varies depending on unit type, size, and floor, and is disclosed through the developer\'s authorised sales channel. The Saima Greens payment plan is structured to accommodate various buyer profiles, with flexible instalment options available on request.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>A Saima Greens booking is processed through the developer\'s sales team, and the Saima Greens booking amount should be confirmed in writing alongside the Saima Greens apartments Karachi payment plan. The practical route to buy flat in Saima Greens Karachi is to register interest directly with Saima Builders or its designated sales partners and obtain the current Saima Greens apartment price before booking.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Saima Greens Karachi buyers should also confirm whether Saima Greens apartments on installments are being offered through a priority allocation system or on a first-come, first-served basis.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>NOC and Approval Status</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Saima Greens Saima Builders buyers should verify the project-specific approvals directly with the developer or the relevant authority before booking. Third-party pages claim approval for this project, but the current documents should be inspected rather than assumed.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Regulations shift and documentation gets updated, so a status reported earlier should be re-confirmed at the time of booking.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Possession Timeline</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>A formal possession date for Saima Greens apartments Karachi has not been announced as a single project-wide date, and the project is under construction, so handover is expected to be phased. Buyers should secure a documented possession schedule at the point of Saima Greens booking, and Saima Greens Saima Builders possession timelines should be confirmed in writing with the developer.</p>\";s:9:\"in_navbar\";i:1;s:16:\"show_in_projects\";i:1;s:18:\"show_in_commercial\";i:1;s:12:\"navbar_order\";i:51;s:12:\"is_published\";i:1;s:6:\"status\";s:7:\"publish\";s:10:\"meta_title\";s:52:\"Saima Greens Karachi | Apartments, Prices & Location\";s:16:\"meta_description\";s:142:\"Saima Greens in Tariq Bin Ziyad Society, Shahrah-e-Faisal, Karachi. Explore 4, 5 and 6-room apartments. Check prices and book your unit today!\";s:13:\"meta_keywords\";s:170:\"Saima Greens Karachi, Saima Greens, Saima Greens apartments, Saima Group Karachi, Saima Greens near Airport, Saima Greens Shahrah-e-Faisal, Saima Greens Faisal Cantonment\";s:8:\"og_image\";s:37:\"/images/projects/1793362365_sg-15.jpg\";s:10:\"created_at\";s:19:\"2026-10-30 17:12:45\";s:10:\"updated_at\";s:19:\"2026-11-10 15:12:32\";}s:11:\"\0*\0original\";a:16:{s:2:\"id\";i:99;s:5:\"title\";s:12:\"Saima Greens\";s:4:\"slug\";s:12:\"saima-greens\";s:4:\"body\";s:5305:\"<p>At its core, Saima Greens is a family apartment project built around greenery: more than 40% of the total project area is dedicated to landscaped parks and open green spaces, which is unusual for a site on one of Karachi\'s busiest roads. The apartments themselves are large, with 4-room, 5-room, and 6-room layouts ranging from about 1,200 to 2,300 square feet, designed for families who need more living space and greater comfort.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>This corridor of Shahrah-e-Faisal has become one of Karachi\'s fastest-growing residential and investment destinations, and Saima Greens Saima Builders is regularly shortlisted among green / gated apartments Karachi buyers compare on the airport side of the city. For family apartments Karachi searches, its combination of a main-road address and internal green space is the main draw.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Key Project Highlights</h2>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n<tbody><tr>\r\n<th>Feature</th>\r\n<th>Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Developer</