('laravel-cache-page_data_saima-luxury-apartments', 'O:15:\"App\\Models\\Page\":39:{s:13:\"\0*\0connection\";s:5:\"mysql\";s:8:\"\0*\0table\";s:5:\"pages\";s:13:\"\0*\0primaryKey\";s:2:\"id\";s:10:\"\0*\0keyType\";s:3:\"int\";s:12:\"incrementing\";b:1;s:7:\"\0*\0with\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0withCount\";a:0:{}s:19:\"preventsLazyLoading\";b:0;s:10:\"\0*\0perPage\";i:15;s:6:\"exists\";b:1;s:18:\"wasRecentlyCreated\";b:0;s:28:\"\0*\0escapeWhenCastingToString\";b:0;s:13:\"\0*\0attributes\";a:16:{s:2:\"id\";i:113;s:5:\"title\";s:23:\"Saima Luxury Apartments\";s:4:\"slug\";s:23:\"saima-luxury-apartments\";s:4:\"body\";s:5559:\"<p>At its core, Saima Luxury Apartments Saima Builders is apartment living from the ground up: five towers, each ground plus 12 floors, currently under construction with limited units still available. The layout is fairly standard but well thought out, including a terrace, a proper drawing room, a separate lounge, and attached baths in the bedrooms, a real step up from the cramped, single-purpose layouts found in older, cheaper buildings around the same area.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>What actually stands out here is the payment structure, spread over 48 monthly installments, which is the real reason this project keeps coming up whenever people search for affordable installment-based apartments in this part of Karachi. Within Saima Builders projects Karachi, it is the Bagh-e-Korangi apartment offer, and among apartments in Shah Faisal Karachi it is one of the most searched projects.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Key Project Highlights</h2>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n<tbody><tr>\r\n<th>Feature</th>\r\n<th>Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Developer</td>\r\n<td>Saima Builders</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Property Type</td>\r\n<td>Residential</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Unit Types</td>\r\n<td>3-room (Type C) & 4-room (Types B1, B, A) apartments</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Total Land Size</td>\r\n<td>3.5 Acres</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Handover</td>\r\n<td>Under construction</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Location</td>\r\n<td>Bagh-e-Korangi, Shah Faisal, Karachi</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Payment Plan</td>\r\n<td>On Easy Installments</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Lifestyle</td>\r\n<td>Family living</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<h2>Master Plan and Development Framework</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Saima Luxury Apartments Shah Faisal is planned as five separate towers, each ground plus 12 floors, giving the project a genuinely multi-building footprint rather than one standalone structure, with dedicated parking and shared common areas built into the overall site plan.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Each tower carries a mix of the available unit types, so buyers have some choice in configuration within the same building instead of being locked into a single layout per tower. The framework keeps functional spaces distinct, like terrace, drawing room, lounge, attached baths, instead of merging everything into one, and shared spaces are meant to give residents a sense of community across the five towers rather than five disconnected buildings sharing a name.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Unit Types: 3-Room & 4-Room Apartments</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>For buyers searching for apartments for sale Saima Luxury Apartments or flats for sale Saima Luxury Apartments Karachi, Saima Luxury Apartments Saima Builders offers family layouts in two categories.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>3-Room Apartments (Type C) in Saima Luxury Apartments</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Type C is the entry point at Saima Luxury Apartments Shah Faisal: a 3-room unit positioned as the most accessible price tier in the project, built around a terrace, a separate drawing room, a lounge, and attached baths.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>4-Room Apartments (Types B1, B & A) in Saima Luxury Apartments</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Types B1, B, and A at Saima Luxury Apartments Saima Builders are all 4-room configurations, differing mainly in size, positioning, and finish rather than fundamental layout, with Type A the largest of the three. Each keeps the project\'s signature layout of terrace, drawing room, lounge, and attached baths.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Floor Plan</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>The exact covered area varies by unit type and has not been published consistently, so buyers should confirm it directly for the unit they are interested in. Buyers seeking a Saima Luxury Apartments apartment price or floor plan should request the current unit schedule from the authorised sales channel.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Price and Booking Status</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>The Saima Luxury Apartments price is set by unit type: Type C at 3 rooms is the entry point, and Types B1, B, and A, which are all 4-room units, are priced progressively higher by differences in exact size, layout, and position within the towers rather than a flat price per room count. Floor level, tower position, and construction progress at booking also affect the final price.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>A Saima Luxury Apartments booking is processed through the developer\'s authorised sales channel, and the Saima Luxury Apartments booking amount should be confirmed in writing alongside the Saima Luxury Apartments payment plan. Since the project is marketed as having limited units left, buyers should check current availability directly rather than trusting an older listing.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Most transactions at Saima Luxury Apartments right now are pre-completion bookings rather than ready-to-move purchases, so buyers should factor the construction timeline into their decision alongside the payment schedule.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>NOC and Approval Status</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Saima Luxury Apartments Shah Faisal buyers should verify the project-specific approvals directly with the developer or the relevant authority before booking, as NOC status applies to the individual project.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Specific covered area figures have not been published consistently for every type, so buyers should confirm the exact area and documentation for the unit they are interested in at the time of booking.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Possession Timeline</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Saima Luxury Apartments Saima Builders is under construction, and no fixed completion date has been consistently published. Possession will follow completion of each buyer\'s own payment plan alongside the construction timeline for their specific tower, so buyers with a specific timeline in mind should confirm it directly with the developer and secure it in writing.</p>\";s:9:\"in_navbar\";i:1;s:16:\"show_in_projects\";i:1;s:18:\"show_in_commercial\";i:0;s:12:\"navbar_order\";i:64;s:12:\"is_published\";i:1;s:6:\"status\";s:7:\"publish\";s:10:\"meta_title\";s:51:\"Saima Luxury Apartments Karachi | Prices & Location\";s:16:\"meta_description\";s:148:\"Saima Luxury Apartments in Bagh-e-Korangi, Shah Faisal, Karachi. Explore 3 and 4-room apartments, prices and payment plan. Contact us to book today!\";s:13:\"meta_keywords\";s:50:\"Saima Luxury Apartments, luxury villas, properties\";s:8:\"og_image\";N;s:10:\"created_at\";s:19:\"2026-11-03 16:57:16\";s:10:\"updated_at\";s:19:\"2026-11-10 15:08:41\";}s:11:\"\0*\0original\";a:16:{s:2:\"id\";i:113;s:5:\"title\";s:23:\"Saima Luxury Apartments\";s:4:\"slug\";s:23:\"saima-luxury-apartments\";s:4:\"body\";s:5559:\"<p>At its core, Saima Luxury Apartments Saima Builders is apartment living from the ground up: five towers, each ground plus 12 floors, currently under construction with limited units still available. The layout is fairly standard but well thought out, including a terrace, a proper drawing room, a separate lounge, and attached baths in the bedrooms, a real step up from the cramped, single-purpose layouts found in older, cheaper buildings around the same area.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>What actually stands out here is the payment structure, spread over 48 monthly installments, which is the real reason this project keeps coming up whenever people search for affordable installment-based apartments in this part of Karachi. Within Saima Builders projects Karachi, it is the Bagh-e-Korangi apartment offer, and among apartments in Shah Faisal Karachi it is one of the most searched projects.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Key Project Highlights</h2>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n<tbody><tr>\r\n<th>Feature</th>\r\n<th>Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Developer</td>\r\n<td>Saima Builders</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Property Type</td>\r\n<td>Residential</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Unit Types</td>\r\n<td>3-room (Type C) & 4-room (Types B1, B, A) apartments</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Total Land Size</td>\r\n<td>3.5 Acres</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Handover</td>\r\n<td>Under construction</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Location</td>\r\n<td>Bagh-e-Korangi, Shah Faisal, Karachi</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Payment Plan</td>\r\n<td>On Easy Installments</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Lifestyle</td>\r\n<td>Family living</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<h2>Master Plan and Development Framework</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Saima Luxury Apartments Shah Faisal is planned as five separate towers, each ground plus 12 floors, giving the project a genuinely multi-building footprint rather than one standalone structure, with dedicated parking and shared common areas built into the overall site plan.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Each tower carries a mix of the available unit types, so buyers have some choice in configuration within the same building instead of being locked into a single layout per tower. The framework keeps functional spaces distinct, like terrace, drawing room, lounge, attached baths, instead of merging everything into one, and shared spaces are meant to give residents a sense of community across the five towers rather than five disconnected buildings sharing a name.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Unit Types: 3-Room & 4-Room Apartments</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>For buyers searching for apartments for sale Saima Luxury Apartments or flats for sale Saima Luxury Apartments Karachi, Saima Luxury Apartments Saima Builders offers family layouts in two categories.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>3-Room Apartments (Type C) in Saima Luxury Apartments</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Type C is the entry point at Saima Luxury Apartments Shah Faisal: a 3-room unit positioned as the most accessible price tier in the project, built around a terrace, a separate drawing room, a lounge, and attached baths.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>4-Room Apartments (Types B1, B & A) in Saima Luxury Apartments</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Types B1, B, and A at Saima Luxury Apartments Saima Builders are all 4-room configurations, differing mainly in size, positioning, and finish rather than fundamental layout, with Type A the largest of the three. Each keeps the project\'s signature layout of terrace, drawing room, lounge, and attached baths.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Floor Plan</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>The exact covered area varies by unit type and has not been published consistently, so buyers should confirm it directly for the unit they are interested in. Buyers seeking a Saima Luxury Apartments apartment price or floor plan should request the current unit schedule from the authorised sales channel.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Price and Booking Status</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>The Saima Luxury Apartments price is set by unit type: Type C at 3 rooms is the entry point, and Types B1, B, and A, which are all 4-room units, are priced progressively higher by differences in exact size, layout, and position within the towers rather than a flat price per room count. Floor level, tower position, and construction progress at booking also affect the final price.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>A Saima Luxury Apartments booking is processed through the developer\'s authorised sales channel, and the Saima Luxury Apartments booking amount should be confirmed in writing alongside the Saima Luxury Apartments payment plan. Since the project is marketed as having limited units left, buyers should check current availability directly rather than trusting an older listing.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Most transactions at Saima Luxury Apartments right now are pre-completion bookings rather than ready-to-move purchases, so buyers should factor the construction timeline into their decision alongside the payment schedule.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>NOC and Approval Status</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Saima Luxury Apartments Shah Faisal buyers should verify the project-specific approvals directly with the developer or the relevant authority before booking, as NOC status applies to the individual project.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Specific covered area figures have not been published consistently for every type, so buyers should confirm the exact area and documentation for the unit they are interested in at the time of booking.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Possession Timeline</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Saima Luxury Apartments Saima Builders is under construction, and no fixed completion date has been consistently published. Possession will follow completion of each buyer\'s own payment plan alongside the construction timeline for their specific tower, so buyers with a specific timeline in mind should confirm it directly with the developer and secure it in writing.</p>\";s:9:\"in_navbar\";i:1;s:16:\"show_in_projects\";i:1;s:18:\"show_in_commercial\";i:0;s:12:\"navbar_order\";i:64;s:12:\"is_published\";i:1;s:6:\"status\";s:7:\"publish\";s:10:\"meta_title\";s:51:\"Saima Luxury Apartments Karachi | Prices & Location\";s:16:\"meta_description\";s:148:\"Saima Luxury Apartments in Bagh-e-Korangi, Shah Faisal, Karachi. Explore 3 and 4-room apartments, prices and payment plan. Contact us to book today!\";s:13:\"meta_keywords\";s:50:\"Saima Luxury Apartments, luxury villas, properties\";s:8:\"og_image\";N;s:10:\"created_at\";s:19:\"2026-11-03 16:57:16\";s:10:\"updated_at\";s:19:\"2026-11-10 15:08:41\";}s:10:\"\0*\0changes\";a:0:{}s:11:\"\0*\0previous\";a:0:{}s:8:\"\0*\0casts\";a:5:{s:9:\"in_navbar\";s:7:\"boolean\";s:16:\"show_in_projects\";s:7:\"boolean\";s:18:\"show_in_commercial\";s:7:\"boolean\";s:12:\"is_published\";s:7:\"boolean\";s:12:\"navbar_order\";s:7:\"integer\";}s:17:\"\0*\0classCastCache\";a:0:{}s:21:\"\0*\0attributeCastCache\";a:0:{}s:13:\"\0*\0dateFormat\";N;s:10:\"\0*\0appends\";a:0:{}s:19:\"\0*\0dispatchesEvents\";a:0:{}s:14:\"\0*\0observables\";a:0:{}s:12:\"