horised sales channel.<\\/span><\\/font><\\/p>\",\"down_payment\":\"\",\"during_construction\":\"\",\"on_handover\":\"\",\"items\":[],\"rows\":[]}\";s:10:\"created_at\";s:19:\"2026-11-03 16:57:16\";s:10:\"updated_at\";s:19:\"2026-11-03 17:21:05\";}s:11:\"\0*\0original\";a:9:{s:2:\"id\";i:914;s:7:\"page_id\";i:113;s:11:\"section_key\";s:12:\"payment_plan\";s:12:\"section_name\";s:12:\"Payment Plan\";s:5:\"order\";i:7;s:9:\"is_active\";i:1;s:7:\"content\";s:1017:\"{\"title\":\"Saima Luxury Apartments Payment Plan\",\"description\":\"<p><span id=\\\"docs-internal-guid-97eeb1aa-7fff-2e67-7c71-f7584f72dfd4\\\"><\\/span><\\/p><p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"line-height:1.38;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\\\"><font color=\\\"#000000\\\" face=\\\"Arial, sans-serif\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14.6667px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\">The payment plan for Saima Luxury Apartments is one of its stronger selling points: booking, then a confirmation payment formalising the allocation, then 48 monthly installments \\u2014 or a 16-quarter installment plan for buyers whose income is not fixed and predictable every month \\u2014 and a final possession payment once the installments wrap up and the unit is ready. Development charges cover shared infrastructure and are usually itemised separately from the base price. Exact amounts are provided through the authorised sales channel.<\\/span><\\/font><\\/p>\",\"down_payment\":\"\",\"during_construction\":\"\",\"on_handover\":\"\",\"items\":[],\"rows\":[]}\";s:10:\"created_at\";s:19:\"2026-11-03 16:57:16\";s:10:\"updated_at\";s:19:\"2026-11-03 17:21:05\";}s:10:\"\0*\0changes\";a:0:{}s:11:\"\0*\0previous\";a:0:{}s:8:\"\0*\0casts\";a:3:{s:7:\"content\";s:5:\"array\";s:9:\"is_active\";s:7:\"boolean\";s:5:\"order\";s:7:\"integer\";}s:17:\"\0*\0classCastCache\";a:0:{}s:21:\"\0*\0attributeCastCache\";a:0:{}s:13:\"\0*\0dateFormat\";N;s:10:\"\0*\0appends\";a:0:{}s:19:\"\0*\0dispatchesEvents\";a:0:{}s:14:\"\0*\0obser