chi\",\"description\":\"\",\"items\":[],\"subtitle\":\"Saima Prestige Park is located on Memon Goth Road in Gadap Town, Malir District, Karachi. The project is associated with the Malir 15 and Memon Goth residential corridor, providing access to different parts of the eastern side of Karachi. The location offers connectivity towards Malir Cantonment, Jinnah International Airport, and other developing residential areas. However, buyers should confirm the exact project entrance and plot location through the developer\'s official location map.\",\"image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1794223602_6af1adf2276bb.jpg\"}\";s:10:\"created_at\";s:19:\"2026-11-09 15:57:57\";s:10:\"updated_at\";s:19:\"2026-11-09 16:26:42\";}s:11:\"\0*\0original\";a:9:{s:2:\"id\";i:1000;s:7:\"page_id\";i:130;s:11:\"section_key\";s:8:\"location\";s:12:\"section_name\";s:23:\"Location & Connectivity\";s:5:\"order\";i:9;s:9:\"is_active\";i:1;s:7:\"content\";s:657:\"{\"title\":\"Saima Prestige Park Location on Memon Goth Road, Karachi\",\"description\":\"\",\"items\":[],\"subtitle\":\"Saima Prestige Park is located on Memon Goth Road in Gadap Town, Malir District, Karachi. The project is associated with the Malir 15 and Memon Goth residential corridor, providing access to different parts of the eastern side of Karachi. The location offers connectivity towards Malir Cantonment, Jinnah International Airport, and other developing residential areas. However, buyers should confirm the exact project entrance and plot location through the developer\'s official location map.\",\"image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1794223602_6af1adf2276bb.jpg\"}\";s:10:\"created_at\";s:19:\"2026-11-09 15:57:57\";s:10:\"updated_at\";s:19:\"2026-11-09 16:26:42\";}s:10:\"\0*\0changes\";a:0:{}s:11:\"\0*\0previous\";a:0:{}s:8:\"\0*\0casts\";a:3:{s:7:\"content\";s:5:\"array\";s:9:\"is_active\";s:7:\"boolean\";s:5:\"order\";s:7:\"integer\";}s:17:\"\0*\0classCastCache\";a:0:{}s:21:\"\0*\0attributeCastCache\";a:0:{}s:13:\"\0*\0dateFormat\";N;s:10:\"\0*\0appends\";a:0:{}s:19:\"\0*\0dispatchesEvents\";a:0:{}s:14:\"\0*\0observables\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0relations\";a:0:{}s:10:\"\0*\0touches\";a:0:{}s:27:\"\0*\0relationAutoloadCallback\";N;s:26:\"\0*\0relationAutoloadContext\";N;s:10:\"timestamps\";b:1;s:13:\"usesUniqueIds\";b:0;s:9:\"\0*\0hidden\";a:0:{}s:10:\"\0*\0visible\";a:0:{}s:11:\"\0*\0fillable\";a:6:{i:0;s:7:\"page_id\";i:1;s:11:\"section_key\";i:2;s:12:\"section_name\";i:3;s:5:\"order\";i:4;s:9:\"is_active\";i:5;s:7:\"content\";}s:10:\"\0*\0guarded\";a:1:{i:0;s:1:\"*\";}s:21:\"\0*\0excludedAttributes\";a:0:{}s:10:\"auditEvent\";N;s:14:\"auditCustomOld\";N;s:14:\"auditCustomNew\";N;s:13:\"isCustomEvent\";b:0;s:21:\"preloadedResolverData\";a:0:{}}i:9;O:22:\"App\\Models\\PageSection\":39:{s:13:\"\0*\0connection\";s:5:\"mysql\";s:8:\"\0*\0table\";s:13:\"page_sections\";s:13:\"\0*\0primaryKey\";s:2:\"id\";s:10:\"\0*\0keyType\";s:3:\"int\";s:12:\"incrementing\";b:1;s:7:\"\0*\0with\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0withCount\";a:0:{}s:19:\"preventsLazyLoading\";b:0;s:10:\"\0*\0perPage\";i:15;s:6:\"exists\";b:1;s:18:\"wasRecentlyCreated\";b:0;s:28:\"\0*\0escapeWhenCastingToString\";b:0;s:13:\"\0*\0attributes\";a:9:{s:2:\"id\";i:1001;s:7:\"page_id\";i:130;s:11:\"section_key\";s:3:\"faq\";s:12:\"section_name\";s:13:\"FAQ Accordion\";s:5:\"order\";i:10;s:9:\"is_active\";i:1;s:7:\"content\";s:3298:\"{\"title\":\"\",\"description\":\"\",\"items\":[{\"q\":\"Where is Saima Prestige Park Karachi located?\",\"a\":\"Saima Prestige Park is located on Memon Goth Road in Gadap Town, Malir District, Karachi. The project is associated with the Malir 15 and Memon Goth area. Buyers should confirm the exact site location through the developer\'s authorised sales office.\"},{\"q\":\"What is Saima Prestige Park plot price?\",\"a\":\"According to the reported payment schedule dated 5 November 2026, a 120-square-yard plot costs PKR 68.5 lakh, a 175-square-yard plot costs PKR 1 crore, and a 240-square-yard plot costs PKR 1.37 crore. Additional charges may apply depending on plot location and documentation requirements.\"},{\"q\":\"What plot sizes are available in Saima Prestige Park?\",\"a\":\"The reported primary residential plot sizes are 120, 175, and 240 square yards. Some promotional listings also mention 160 and 500 square yards. Buyers should confirm the latest inventory and available categories with the developer.\"},{\"q\":\"What is Saima Prestige Park payment plan?\",\"a\":\"Saima Prestige Park has a reported three-year installment plan. It includes four opening payments, 36 monthly installments, 12 quarterly installments, development-stage payments, and a final possession payment. The exact schedule depends on the selected plot category.\"},{\"q\":\"Is Saima Prestige Park NOC approved?\",\"a\":\"Some promotional advertisements describe Saima Prestige Park as NOC approved. However, a verifiable approval number, issuing authority, and approval date have not been established through the available published information. Buyers should obtain and independently verify the project-specific NOC before booking.\"},{\"q\":\"Who is developing Saima Prestige Park?\",\"a\":\"Saima Prestige Park is associated with Saima Group, a property development group operating in Karachi. Buyers should confirm the project\'s legal developer and authorised booking arrangements through official documentation.\"},{\"q\":\"How can buyers book a plot in Saima Prestige Park?\",\"a\":\"Interested buyers can contact the authorised sales channel to check plot availability, obtain the latest payment schedule, review the layout plan, and understand the booking requirements. The reported initial payment starts from PKR 5 lakh for a 120-square-yard plot, subject to confirmation.\"},{\"q\":\"Is Saima Prestige Park suitable for property investment?\",\"a\":\"Saima Prestige Park may interest buyers looking for residential land in the Memon Goth and Malir 15 area. Its proposed residential layout and installment structure may suit buyers planning future construction. However, investment decisions should consider legal approvals, development progress, location, and resale demand.\"},{\"q\":\"How many acres does Saima Prestige Park cover?\",\"a\":\"Available project information reports an approximate development area of 24 acres, with around 300 plots. Buyers should verify the final land area and approved layout through the developer\'s documentation.\"},{\"q\":\"What facilities are planned in Saima Prestige Park?\",\"a\":\"The reported layout includes eight parks, a mosque, two school sites, a commercial area, a 60-foot main road, and internal roads. Buyers should confirm the final facilities through the latest authorised master plan.\"}],\"heading\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\"}\";s:10:\"created_at\";s:19:\"2026-11-09 15:57:57\";s:10:\"updated_at\";s:19:\"2026-11-09 16:24:06\";}s:11:\"\0*\0original\";a:9:{s:2:\"id\";i:1001;s:7:\"page_id\";i:130;s:11:\"section_key\";s:3:\"faq\";s:12:\"section_name\";s:13:\"FAQ Accordion\";s:5:\"order\";i:10;s:9:\"is_active\";i:1;s:7:\"content\";s:3298:\"{\"title\":\"\",\"description\":\"\",\"items\":[{\"q\":\"Where is Saima Prestige Park Karachi located?\",\"a\":\"Saima Prestige Park is located on Memon Goth Road in Gadap Town, Malir District, Karachi. The project is associated with the Malir 15 and Memon Goth area. Buyers should confirm the exact site location through the developer\'s authorised sales office.\"},{\"q\":\"What is Saima Prestige Park plot price?\",\"a\":\"According to the reported payment schedule dated 5 November 2026, a 120-square-yard plot costs PKR 68.5 lakh, a 175-square-yard plot costs PKR 1 crore, and a 240-square-yard plot costs PKR 1.37 crore. Additional charges may apply depending on plot location and documentation requirements.\"},{\"q\":\"What plot sizes are available in Saima Prestige Park?\",\"a\":\"The reported primary residential plot sizes are 120, 175, and 240 square yards. Some promotional listings also mention 160 and 500 square yards. Buyers should confirm the latest inventory and available categories with the developer.\"},{\"q\":\"What is Saima Prestige Park payment plan?\",\"a\":\"Saima Prestige Park has a reported three-year installment plan. It includes four opening payments, 36 monthly installments, 12 quarterly installments, development-stage payments, and a final possession payment. The exact schedule depends on the selected plot category.\"},{\"q\":\"Is Saima Prestige Park NOC approved?\",\"a\":\"Some promotional advertisements describe Saima Prestige Park as NOC approved. However, a verifiable approval number, issuing authority, and approval date have not been established through the available published information. Buyers should obtain and independently verify the project-specific NOC before booking.\"},{\"q\":\"Who is developing Saima Prestige Park?\",\"a\":\"Saima Prestige Park is associated with Saima Group, a property development group operating in Karachi. Buyers should confirm the project\'s legal developer and authorised booking arrangements through official documentation.\"},{\"q\":\"How can buyers book a plot in Saima Prestige Park?\",\"a\":\"Interested buyers can contact the authorised sales channel to check plot availability, obtain the latest payment schedule, review the layout plan, and understand the booking requirements. The reported initial payment starts from PKR 5 lakh for a 120-square-yard plot, subject to confirmation.\"},{\"q\":\"Is Saima Prestige Park suitable for property investment?\",\"a\":\"Saima Prestige Park may interest buyers looking for residential land in the Memon Goth and Malir 15 area. Its proposed residential layout and installment structure may suit buyers planning future construction. However, investment decisions should consider legal approvals, development progress, location, and resale demand.\"},{\"q\":\"How many acres does Saima Prestige Park cover?\",\"a\":\"Available project information reports an approximate development area of 24 acres, with around 300 plots. Buyers should verify the final land area and approved layout through the developer\'s documentation.\"},{\"q\":\"What facilities are planned in Saima Prestige Park?\",\"a\":\"The reported layout includes eight parks, a mosque, two school sites, a commercial area, a 60-foot main road, and internal roads. Buyers should confirm the final facilities through the latest authorised master plan.\"}],\"heading\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\"}\";s:10:\"created_at\";s:19:\"2026-11-09 15:57:57\";s:10:\"updated_at\";s:19:\"2026-11-09 16:24:06\";}s:10:\"\0*\0changes\";a:0:{}s:11:\"\0*\0previous\";a:0:{}s:8:\"\0*\0casts\";a:3:{s:7:\"content\";s:5:\"array\";s:9:\"is_active\";s:7:\"boolean\";s:5:\"order\";s:7:\"integer\";}s:17:\"\0*\0classCastCache\";a:0:{}s:21:\"\0*\0attributeCastCache\";a:0:{}s:13:\"\0*\0dateFormat\";N;s:10:\"\0*\0appends\";a:0:{}s:19:\"\0*\0dispatchesEvents\";a:0:{}s:14:\"\0*\0observables\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0relations\";a:0:{}s:10:\"\0*\0touches\";a:0:{}s:27:\"\0*\0relationAutoloadCallback\";N;s:26:\"\0*\0relationAutoloadContext\";N;s:10:\"timestamps\";b:1;s:13:\"usesUniqueIds\";b:0;s:9:\"\0*\0hidden\";a:0:{}s:10:\"\0*\0visible\";a:0:{}s:11:\"\0*\0fillable\";a:6:{i:0;s:7:\"page_id\";i:1;s:11:\"section_key\";i:2;s:12:\"section_name\";i:3;s:5:\"order\";i:4;s:9:\"is_active\";i:5;s:7:\"content\";}s:10:\"\0*\0guarded\";a:1:{i:0;s:1:\"*\";}s:21:\"\0*\0excludedAttributes\";a:0:{}s:10:\"auditEvent\";N;s:14:\"auditCustomOld\";N;s:14:\"auditCustomNew\";N;s:13:\"isCustomEvent\";b:0;s:21:\"preloadedResolverData\";a:0:{}}i:10;O:22:\"App\\Models\\PageSection\":39:{s:13:\"\0*\0connection\";s:5:\"mysql\";s:8:\"\0*\0table\";s:13:\"page_sections\";s:13:\"\0*\0primaryKey\";s:2:\"id\";s:10:\"\0*\0keyType\";s:3:\"int\";s:12:\"incrementing\";b:1;s:7:\"\0*\0with\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0withCount\";a:0:{}s:19:\"preventsLazyLoading\";b:0;s:10:\"\0*\0perPage\";i:15;s:6:\"exists\";b:1;s:18:\"wasRecentlyCreated\";b:0;s:28:\"\0*\0escapeWhenCastingToString\";b:0;s:13:\