INSERT INTO `pages` (`id`, `title`, `slug`, `body`, `in_navbar`, `show_in_projects`, `show_in_commercial`, `navbar_order`, `is_published`, `status`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`, `meta_keywords`, `og_image`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(1, 'Home', '/', '<p>Saima Builders is one of the names that buyers tracking real estate developers in Karachi encounter early in their search. Saima Builders and Developers, often referred to simply as Saima Group, has operated in Pakistan\'s property market for around four decades. Saima Builders Karachi remains the group\'s core focus, with a portfolio spanning apartments, villas, plots, and mixed-use developments. Saima Group Karachi is therefore best understood as a legacy developer rather than a new entrant, and that distinction matters when comparing options among best builders in Karachi.</p><h2>About Saima Builders and Developers</h2><p>Saima Builders was founded by Saleem Zaki, who established the company in the mid-1980s with a vision to provide quality housing and modern urban communities. The group is now led by Chairman Zeeshan Saleem Zaki, who joined the family business in 1988 and has overseen the delivery of more than 80 residential, commercial, and mixed-use projects. According to the company\'s own disclosures, it has more than 30 additional developments under way across Pakistan.</p><p>For buyers evaluating Saima Group, the relevant point is delivery history. Saima Builders and Developers is not a first-time developer launch. The group\'s record includes completed projects and a continuing pipeline. Saima Builders Karachi therefore benefits from an established sales, construction, and handover system. Saima Group Karachi buyers should still verify documents, but they are not underwriting an unknown builder. Among property developers in Karachi, that track record carries weight.</p><h2>Cities Where Saima Builders Operates</h2><p>Saima Builders Karachi remains the primary market, with projects in North Nazimabad, Gulshan-e-Maymar, Scheme 33, DHA, and near Jinnah International Airport.</p><p>Outside Karachi, Saima Builders has a presence in Hyderabad and Sukkur, reflecting its reach as one of the real estate developers in Pakistan with a multi-city footprint.</p><p>For buyers searching for a Saima project Karachi, the concentration in Karachi is an advantage. The developer knows the city\'s approval routes and demand patterns. Saima Builders Karachi is not a peripheral operator; it builds in established districts. When reviewing Saima projects in Karachi, location depth matters as much as project specifications.</p><h2>Saima Projects in Karachi</h2><p>The following projects represent the current pipeline of Saima Builders\' new projects and ongoing projects in Karachi.</p><h3>Saima Premium Empire</h3><p>Saima Premium Empire is a residential high-rise in Block A, North Nazimabad Town, Karachi Central District. It is listed by the developer as under construction. The project targets buyers who want central Karachi rather than a distant society. Saima Premium Empire therefore has a rental and end-user case that depends on location more than new amenities. Among Saima Builders\' new projects in Karachi, it stands out for its established urban setting.</p><h3>ZSZ Midtown Farms</h3><p>ZSZ Midtown Farms is one of the group\'s most ambitious upcoming projects, spanning 390 acres of residential development. It is positioned as a large-scale community and reflects the developer\'s ability to execute master-planned environments. For buyers comparing Saima Premium Empire with larger ventures, ZSZ Midtown Farms offers a different scale and lifestyle proposition. It represents the plotted development format within Saima Builders\' new projects.</p><h3>Saima Center Point</h3><p>Saima Center Point is a landmark mixed-use development on Main M.A. Jinnah Road, Karachi Cantt, near Capri Cinema in Saddar. The project is a Ground + 41-floor complex with a shopping mall, parking, and residential apartments. It offers 2- to 4-bedroom residences alongside commercial showrooms. For buyers seeking apartments for sale in Karachi within a mixed-use setting, Center Point demonstrates the developer\'s capability in large-scale urban projects, standing out among Saima\'s new projects in Karachi.</p><h3>Saima Dreams</h3><p>Saima Dreams is a luxury residential project in Scheme 33, featuring G+16 high-rise buildings with 4-, 5-, and 6-room apartments. It is designed for premium living near Main Safoora Chowrangi. Among Saima\'s new projects in Karachi, it competes directly with Saima Premium Empire in the premium apartment segment.</p><h3>Saima One Residency Clifton</h3><p>Saima One Residency in Clifton Block 5 is among the developer\'s most premium upcoming launches, offering sea-facing luxury apartments. It fills a genuine supply gap in one of Karachi\'s most exclusive corridors. As a Saima Builders new project, it represents the premium end of the portfolio.</p><h3>Saima Mangroves</h3><p>Saima Mangroves is a mixed-use waterfront development at Korangi Creek, being developed under a Development Advisory Agreement with the Zeeshan Saleem Zaki Group of Saima Builders. Spanning approximately 40 acres of waterfront land, the master plan envisages over 12 million square feet of built-up area, incorporating residential apartments, commercial offices, and a deluxe hotel. The project\'s launch drew an oversubscribed response, signaling institutional confidence.</p><h3>Saima Shield Towers</h3><p>Saima Shield Towers is a collaborative high-rise residential project in Gulshan-e-Iqbal, listed as under construction since June 2021. It spans 1,315,000 square feet and features 4- and 5-bedroom luxury apartments. Residents benefit from a secure gated environment with amenities including a gym, community hall, and standby generators.</p><h3>Saima Arabian Villas</h3><p>Saima Arabian Villas is a delivered gated villa community in North Karachi, representing the developer\'s low-rise and community format. It demonstrates Saima\'s ability to deliver completed, habitable communities, a track record that supports confidence in under-construction Saima Builders\' new projects.</p><h3>Saima Defence Mall and Residency</h3><p>Saima Defence Mall and Residency is a completed mixed-use development located in DHA Phase 1, Karachi. The project features 3-bedroom apartments alongside commercial showrooms, supported by amenities including a modern gymnasium, an in-house mosque, a coffee shop, and electricity backup. As completed stock, it serves as tangible evidence of construction quality and handover discipline.</p><h3>Saima Jinnah Icon</h3><p>Saima Jinnah Icon is a mixed-use and residential project in Karachi. It shows the group\'s ability to combine commercial and residential components. Investors reviewing Saima Builders\' ongoing projects in Karachi should note that mixed-use projects carry different leasing and maintenance dynamics compared to pure residential towers.</p><h2>Property Types in the Saima Portfolio</h2><p>Saima Builders offers a range of property formats across its portfolio. The table below maps these offerings to specific Saima projects in Karachi and delivered developments.</p><table><tbody><tr><td>Property Types</td><td>Projects</td></tr><tr><td>High-rise residential apartments</td><td>Saima Premium Empire, Saima Dreams, Saima Shield Towers, Saima Center Point</td></tr><tr><td>Mid-rise residential buildings</td><td>Saima Jinnah Icon</td></tr><tr><td>Gated villa and townhouse communities</td><td>Saima Arabian Villas</td></tr><tr><td>Mixed-use commercial and residential developments</td><td>Saima Jinnah Icon, Saima Defence Mall and Residency, Saima Mangroves, Saima Center Point</td></tr><tr><td>Plotted developments</td><td>ZSZ Midtown Farms</td></tr><tr><td>Waterfront and seafront towers</td><td>Saima One Residency Clifton, Saima Mangroves</td></tr></tbody></table><p><br>This diversification signals institutional experience. For buyers exploring Saima Builders\' new projects in Karachi, the portfolio spans entry-level apartments to premium seafront towers. Saima Builders\' new projects continue to be launched across these formats, reinforcing the group\'s position among residential and commercial developers in Karachi.</p><h2>Investment Potential</h2><p>Saima Builders offers real estate investment opportunities through its diverse portfolio, established locations, and four decades of delivery history. With growing interest in Karachi\'s premium property segment, the group presents opportunities for investors seeking long-term capital appreciation and rental income.</p><h3>Key Investment Highlights</h3><ul><li>Diverse portfolio spanning high-rise apartments, gated villas, plots, and mixed-use developments</li><li>Developed by Saima Builders and Developers, active since the mid-1980s</li><li>Appeal among end-users and overseas property investors</li><li>Locations across established Karachi districts, including North Nazimabad, DHA, and Clifton</li><li>Potential for long-term capital appreciation in Karachi\'s premium sector</li><li>Lifestyle destinations for families and professionals</li><li>Flexible payment plans across most projects, reducing entry barriers for buyers interested in apartments from Saima Builders Karachi</li><li>Institutional partnerships, including TPL REIT Fund I for Saima Mangroves</li></ul><h2>Location and Coverage: Saima Builders Karachi, Hyderabad, Sukkur</h2><p>Saima Builders operates across Karachi, Hyderabad, and Sukkur, making it one of the established builders in Karachi, Pakistan.</p><p>In Karachi, the group builds in North Nazimabad, Gulshan-e-Maymar, Scheme 33, DHA, and Clifton.</p><p>Outside Karachi, projects include Saima Uptown Sukkur in Sukkur and developments in Hyderabad.</p><p>The group ranks among real estate builders in Karachi, residential developers in Karachi, commercial developers in Karachi, and high-rise builders in Karachi, with towers like Saima Premium Empire and mixed-use projects like Saima Center Point. This multi-city footprint supports its position among builders in Karachi, Pakistan.<br></p>', 1, 1, 0, 1, 1, 'publish', 'Saima Group Builders | Latest Real Estate Projects in Pakistan', 'Saima Builders & Developers (Saima Group) is one of the Best real estate developers of the Pakistan with 117+ projects across Karachi, Islamabad & many more on', 'r', NULL, '2026-10-20 06:37:08', '2026-11-03 06:44:44'),
(2, 'About Us', 'about-us', '<h2>About Hudayriyat Island Real Estate</h2>\r\n<p>Welcome to your trusted source for exploring premier property opportunities on Hudayriyat Island, Abu Dhabi. We connect discerning homeowners, expatriate residents, and global investors with prestigious master-planned developments built by Modon Properties.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Our Core Services</h3>\r\n<p><strong>Property Advisory:</strong> Practical guidance to help you explore residential and investment opportunities based on your personal budget and lifestyle requirements.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Exclusive Listings:</strong> Full access to premier residential properties, villas, townhouses, and waterfront apartments across Hudayriyat Island.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Market Intelligence:</strong> Transparent, updated information regarding launch dates, construction milestones, payment schedules, and capital appreciation potential.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Our Mission, Vision & Values</h3>\r\n<p><strong>Our Mission:</strong> To provide accurate property intelligence, honest advisory, and reliable assistance to buyers and investors exploring Abu Dhabi\'s emerging master destinations.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Our Vision:</strong> To become the leading advisory reference for luxury island real estate in the UAE.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Our Values:</strong> Accuracy, transparency, and client-first commitment define everything we do.</p>', 1, 1, 0, 2, 1, 'publish', 'About Us – Hudayriyat Island Real Estate', 'Learn more about Hudayriyat Island property opportunities, expert advisory services, and master planning by Modon Properties in Abu Dhabi.', 'About Hudayriyat, Modon Properties, Abu Dhabi property advisory', NULL, '2026-10-20 06:37:08', '2026-10-28 06:07:14'),
(3, 'Contact Us', 'contact-us', '<h2>Get in Touch with Our Property Consultants</h2>\r\n<p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\">Have questions about Saima Builders and Developers projects, payment plans, or property options in Karachi? Our team is ready to guide you and help you find the right property for your needs.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Direct Contact Channels</h3>\r\n<p><strong>Phone & WhatsApp:</strong> +92 332 2495575</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Schedule a Private Consultation</h3>\r\n<p>Fill out the inquiry form on this page or connect with our sales desk to receive official brochures, floor plans, and VIP priority booking.</p>', 1, 1, 0, 3, 1, 'publish', 'Contact Us', 'Get in touch with luxury property advisors for Saima Projects', NULL, NULL, '2026-10-20 06:37:08', '2026-10-28 05:52:25'),
(14, 'Privacy Policy', 'privacy-policy', '<h2>1. Information Collection</h2>\n<p>We collect information when you interact with our website or contact us regarding properties and real estate opportunities on Hudayriyat Island and in Abu Dhabi.</p>\n<p>You may provide information when you submit an enquiry, request property information, or contact our advisory team via phone, email, or WhatsApp.</p>\n\n<h2>2. How We Use Information</h2>\n<p>We use the information we collect to understand your requirements, provide relevant property details, contact you regarding updates, and facilitate viewings and advisory services.</p>\n\n<h2>3. Information Sharing &amp; Disclosure</h2>\n<p>We respect your privacy and take reasonable steps to protect your personal information. We do not sell, rent, or trade your personal information to third parties for marketing purposes.</p>\n\n<h2>4. Data Security &amp; Integrity</h2>\n<p>We use reasonable technical and organizational measures to help protect your personal information from unauthorized access, use, alteration, or disclosure.</p>\n\n<h2>5. Your Rights &amp; Choices</h2>\n<p>You have the right to request access, correction, or deletion of your personal data held by us, or withdraw consent to receive marketing updates at any time.</p>\n\n<h2>6. Updates to This Policy</h2>\n<p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time to reflect changes in legal, regulatory, or operational requirements. Any revisions will be published on this page.</p>\n', 0, 1, 0, 14, 1, 'publish', 'Privacy Policy', 'Read our Privacy Policy to understand how we collect, use, and protect your personal information when you explore our website.', NULL, NULL, '2026-10-20 06:37:08', '2026-10-28 05:33:51'),
(15, 'Terms & Conditions', 'terms-and-conditions', '<h2>1. Agreement to Terms</h2>\n<p>By accessing or using this website, you agree to these Terms &amp;amp; Conditions. If you do not agree with any part of these terms, please stop using the website.</p>\n\n<h2>2. Website Use</h2>\n<p>This website provides general property information and real estate-related services, including information about properties and projects on Hudayriyat Island and across Abu Dhabi. You must use this website lawfully and responsibly.</p>\n\n<h2>3. Property Information</h2>\n<p>Property listings, prices, layouts, specifications, payment plans, availability, and handover dates are provided for general reference only. Property information may change without notice and does not constitute a binding offer or contract.</p>\n\n<h2>4. No Professional Advice</h2>\n<p>The information provided on this website does not constitute legal, financial, tax, investment, or immigration advice. You should conduct your own research and consult qualified professionals.</p>\n\n<h2>5. No Guarantee of Returns</h2>\n<p>No guarantee is provided regarding future property values, rental income, capital appreciation, or investment returns. Past performance of a property or developer does not guarantee future results.</p>\n\n<h2>6. User Responsibilities</h2>\n<p>You are responsible for providing accurate and complete information when submitting enquiries through this website. Unauthorized use or misrepresentation is strictly prohibited.</p>\n\n<h2>7. Intellectual Property</h2>\n<p>All text, logos, graphics, images, and content on this website are owned by their respective owners and protected by copyright and intellectual property laws.</p>\n\n<h2>8. Third-Party Links</h2>\n<p>This website may contain links to third-party websites. These links are provided for convenience only and we do not endorse or take responsibility for third-party content.</p>\n\n<h2>9. Limitation of Liability</h2>\n<p>We take reasonable steps to provide accurate information, but make no warranties regarding completeness or timeliness. Users should independently verify details before making a decision.</p>\n\n<h2>10. Governing Law</h2>\n<p>These Terms &amp;amp; Conditions shall be governed by the applicable laws and regulations of the United Arab Emirates and the Emirate of Abu Dhabi.</p>\n', 0, 1, 0, 15, 1, 'publish', 'Terms & Conditions – Hudayriyat Island', 'Official terms and conditions for Hudayriyat Island web portal.', NULL, NULL, '2026-10-20 06:37:08', '2026-10-28 05:50:36'),
(16, 'Disclaimer', 'disclaimer', '<h2>1. General Information Only</h2><p>The content on this website, including information about properties, property descriptions, prices, payment plans, rental yield estimates, project details, and real estate market updates, is provided for general informational purposes only. It does not constitute an offer, solicitation, or recommendation to buy, sell, or invest in any property.</p><h2>2. No Guarantee of Returns, Rental Yield or Appreciation</h2><p>Any rental yield percentage, return on investment (ROI), or capital appreciation figure mentioned on this website is an indicative estimate based on general market information available at the time of publication. It is not a forecast, promise, or guarantee of future performance. Actual returns may vary depending on market conditions, rental demand, tenancy, maintenance charges, property management, location, and the specific property purchased. Past performance of any property, housing society, or developer is not a reliable indicator of future results.</p><h2>3. Not Financial, Legal or Tax Advice</h2><p>Nothing on this website constitutes financial, legal, or tax advice. Property purchases and investments may involve financial risks, legal requirements, taxes, and other costs. You should obtain independent professional advice based on your individual circumstances before making any property or investment decision in Pakistan.</p><h2>4. Developer & Property Information</h2><p>Prices, availability, floor plans, payment plans, property specifications, possession dates, and project details are subject to change without notice. Information may be provided by property developers, builders, housing societies, real estate agents, and other available sources. We recommend verifying the latest property details, prices, payment terms, approvals, and availability directly with the relevant developer or authorized authority before making any commitment.</p><p>Buyers should independently verify the legal status of a property or housing project, including relevant approvals, ownership documents, land title, and applicable requirements from authorities such as the relevant Development Authority, local government, or other competent regulatory body.</p><h2>5. Regulatory Status</h2><p>Information provided on this website is intended for general property and real estate purposes in Pakistan. This website is not a government website and is not affiliated with or operated by any Pakistani government authority. Nothing on this website should be interpreted as official government communication, legal advice, or regulatory approval of any property, project, developer, or housing society.</p><h2>6. Testimonials</h2><p>Client testimonials published on this website reflect the individual experiences of the clients who provided them. Testimonials are not necessarily representative of the experience of every client. Previous client experiences or investment outcomes do not guarantee similar results for others.</p><h2>7. Third-Party Links</h2><p>This website may contain links to third-party websites for your convenience, including property developers, builders, housing societies, and other real estate service providers. We do not endorse and are not responsible for the content, accuracy, availability, or privacy practices of any third-party website. Users should review the relevant terms and policies before relying on information provided by third parties.</p><h2>8. Accuracy of Information</h2><p>We take reasonable care to keep the information on this website accurate and up to date. However, property prices, availability, project details, payment plans, possession dates, legal requirements, and market conditions may change without notice. We make no warranty regarding the completeness or accuracy of the information provided and accept no liability for errors or omissions to the extent permitted by applicable law.</p><p>Users are encouraged to verify all important information independently before making a property purchase, sale, or investment decision.</p><p>See also our Terms & Conditions for further information regarding the use of this website and limitations of liability.</p>', 0, 1, 0, 16, 1, 'publish', 'Disclaimer – Hudayriyat Island', 'Legal disclaimer for property information and floor plans.', NULL, NULL, '2026-10-20 06:37:08', '2026-10-28 02:05:37'),
(64, 'lahore', 'lahore', '<p class=\"saimaIntroP\">A premier benchmark for luxury waterfront living, seamlessly blending contemporary architectural elegance with a tranquil coastal sanctuary. Residents enjoy fresh sea breezes, private beach access, and immediate connectivity to key metropolitan hubs.</p>\r\n<p class=\"saimaIntroP\">Located along prestigious shoreline corridors, the community offers an inspired lifestyle for professionals, investors, and families seeking refined island elegance away from urban congestion.</p>\r\n<p class=\"saimaIntroP\">Every residence offers a harmonious blend of sophistication, security, and long-term capital appreciation, presenting an extraordinary investment opportunity in one of the most coveted coastal addresses.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>About the Developers</h2>\r\n<p>Crafted by premier developers renowned for shaping iconic waterfront communities across the region for decades. Buyers and international investors benefit from a celebrated track record of timely delivery, construction excellence, and sustainable urban design.</p>\r\n<p>Working alongside leading international architectural consultants and market advisory firms, every aspect of the project is engineered to global standards of prestige and durability.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Approvals &amp; Clearances</h2>\r\n<p>The project holds full regulatory clearance and title approvals from all relevant municipal and developmental authorities. Complying strictly with environmental and structural guidelines, purchasers can invest with absolute peace of mind and secure freehold ownership.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Prime Location &amp; Seamless Connectivity</h2>\r\n<p>Set within a scenic coastal landscape, the project offers rapid access to international airports, commercial business districts, premier private schools, and luxury retail destinations.</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/TOC1.png\" alt=\"Strategic Location &amp; Connectivity Map\" style=\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); width: 100%; margin: 15px 0;\"></p>\r\n<p>Surrounded by protected green reserves and pristine waters, residents wake up to panoramic coastal vistas and unpolluted air throughout the year.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Architectural Excellence &amp; Floor Plans</h2>\r\n<p>The layouts focus on space efficiency, panoramic natural lighting, and seamless indoor-outdoor living with spacious private terraces and balconies.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Curated Residences &amp; Layout Types</h3>\r\n<p><img src=\"/TOC2.png\" alt=\"Luxury Layout Plan - Type C\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\"></p>\r\n<p>Featuring open-plan living rooms, floor-to-ceiling double-glazed windows, designer show kitchens, and lavish en-suite master bedrooms designed for modern family living.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img src=\"/TOC3.png\" alt=\"Executive Layout Plan - Type B\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\"></p>\r\n<p>Expansive terraces provide seamless entertaining spaces overlooking lush landscaped courtyards and the sparkling coastline.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img src=\"/TOC4.png\" alt=\"Presidential Villa Layout Plan - Type A\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\"></p>\r\n<p>Generous multi-level accommodations including private elevators, maid\'s quarters, private swimming pools, and dedicated family lounges.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Master Plan &amp; Community Lifestyle</h2>\r\n<p>The community master plan establishes a secure, private, and walkable residential haven. Dedicated subterranean parking ensures pedestrian safety across surface walkways, cycling trails, and waterfront boardwalks.</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/TOC8.png\" alt=\"Community Master Plan Overview\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\"></p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Flexible Investment &amp; Payment Plan</h2>\r\n<p>A buyer-friendly, construction-linked payment structure is offered with flexible milestones, making property acquisition straightforward and stress-free.</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/TOC12.png\" alt=\"Milestone Payment Structure\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\"></p>\r\n\r\n<h2>World-Class Facilities &amp; Amenities</h2>\r\n<p>Enjoy infinity swimming pools, state-of-the-art fitness centres, private beach cabanas, children\'s play areas, multi-sport courts, and fine-dining waterfront restaurants just steps from your front door.</p>', 1, 1, 0, 23, 0, 'draft', 'lahore Properties | Luxury Investment & Community Guide', 'Explore luxury waterfront homes, real estate, and investment projects in lahore.', 'lahore, real estate in lahore, properties for sale in lahore', '/images/hero/slide-1.jpg', '2026-10-27 06:14:02', '2026-10-29 04:21:26'),
(68, 'Jamshed road number', 'jamshed-road-number', '<p class=\"saimaIntroP\">A premier benchmark for luxury waterfront living, seamlessly blending contemporary architectural elegance with a tranquil coastal sanctuary. Residents enjoy fresh sea breezes, private beach access, and immediate connectivity to key metropolitan hubs.</p>\r\n<p class=\"saimaIntroP\">Located along prestigious shoreline corridors, the community offers an inspired lifestyle for professionals, investors, and families seeking refined island elegance away from urban congestion.</p>\r\n<p class=\"saimaIntroP\">Every residence offers a harmonious blend of sophistication, security, and long-term capital appreciation, presenting an extraordinary investment opportunity in one of the most coveted coastal addresses.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>About the Developers</h2>\r\n<p>Crafted by premier developers renowned for shaping iconic waterfront communities across the region for decades. Buyers and international investors benefit from a celebrated track record of timely delivery, construction excellence, and sustainable urban design.</p>\r\n<p>Working alongside leading international architectural consultants and market advisory firms, every aspect of the project is engineered to global standards of prestige and durability.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Approvals &amp; Clearances</h2>\r\n<p>The project holds full regulatory clearance and title approvals from all relevant municipal and developmental authorities. Complying strictly with environmental and structural guidelines, purchasers can invest with absolute peace of mind and secure freehold ownership.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Prime Location &amp; Seamless Connectivity</h2>\r\n<p>Set within a scenic coastal landscape, the project offers rapid access to international airports, commercial business districts, premier private schools, and luxury retail destinations.</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/TOC1.png\" alt=\"Strategic Location &amp; Connectivity Map\" style=\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); width: 100%; margin: 15px 0;\"></p>\r\n<p>Surrounded by protected green reserves and pristine waters, residents wake up to panoramic coastal vistas and unpolluted air throughout the year.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Architectural Excellence &amp; Floor Plans</h2>\r\n<p>The layouts focus on space efficiency, panoramic natural lighting, and seamless indoor-outdoor living with spacious private terraces and balconies.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Curated Residences &amp; Layout Types</h3>\r\n<p><img src=\"/TOC2.png\" alt=\"Luxury Layout Plan - Type C\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\"></p>\r\n<p>Featuring open-plan living rooms, floor-to-ceiling double-glazed windows, designer show kitchens, and lavish en-suite master bedrooms designed for modern family living.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img src=\"/TOC3.png\" alt=\"Executive Layout Plan - Type B\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\"></p>\r\n<p>Expansive terraces provide seamless entertaining spaces overlooking lush landscaped courtyards and the sparkling coastline.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img src=\"/TOC4.png\" alt=\"Presidential Villa Layout Plan - Type A\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\"></p>\r\n<p>Generous multi-level accommodations including private elevators, maid\'s quarters, private swimming pools, and dedicated family lounges.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Master Plan &amp; Community Lifestyle</h2>\r\n<p>The community master plan establishes a secure, private, and walkable residential haven. Dedicated subterranean parking ensures pedestrian safety across surface walkways, cycling trails, and waterfront boardwalks.</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/TOC8.png\" alt=\"Community Master Plan Overview\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\"></p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Flexible Investment &amp; Payment Plan</h2>\r\n<p>A buyer-friendly, construction-linked payment structure is offered with flexible milestones, making property acquisition straightforward and stress-free.</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/TOC12.png\" alt=\"Milestone Payment Structure\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\"></p>\r\n\r\n<h2>World-Class Facilities &amp; Amenities</h2>\r\n<p>Enjoy infinity swimming pools, state-of-the-art fitness centres, private beach cabanas, children\'s play areas, multi-sport courts, and fine-dining waterfront restaurants just steps from your front door.</p>', 1, 1, 0, 26, 0, 'draft', 'Jamshed road number Karachi Properties | Luxury Investment & Community Guide', 'Explore luxury waterfront homes, real estate, and investment projects in Jamshed road number, Karachi.', 'Jamshed road number, real estate in Jamshed road number, properties for sale in Jamshed road number', '/images/hero/slide-1.jpg', '2026-10-27 07:01:36', '2026-10-29 04:22:01'),
(75, 'MA Jinnah Road', 'ma-jinnah-road', '<h2>Investing in MA Jinnah Road Karachi – Prime Commercial Real Estate Opportunities</h2><p>MA Jinnah Road is one of Karachi\'s most established commercial corridors, offering investors access to a busy business environment, retail activity, corporate offices, and established trading markets. Located in the heart of Karachi, this major road connects several important commercial and residential areas, making it a recognised destination for businesses, entrepreneurs, and property investors.</p><p>For investors exploring commercial real estate in Karachi, MA Jinnah Road presents opportunities to consider shops, offices, commercial buildings, and other business-oriented properties. Its established commercial identity, accessibility, and surrounding business activity make it an important location to evaluate when planning a long-term property investment.</p><h2>Why Invest in MA Jinnah Road Karachi?</h2><p>Location plays an important role in commercial property investment, and MA Jinnah Road offers several factors that attract business owners and investors. The area has a long-established commercial presence, supported by retail outlets, wholesale markets, financial services, offices, and various business activities.</p><p>Investors looking for commercial property can explore opportunities based on their investment objectives, whether they are interested in rental income, business ownership, property appreciation, or long-term asset ownership.</p><p>Some important investment considerations include:</p><ul><li>Established Commercial Environment: MA Jinnah Road has a recognised business identity with different commercial activities operating throughout the area.</li><li>Business Connectivity: Its location provides connections to several important commercial districts of Karachi.</li><li>Retail Opportunities: The surrounding markets and business establishments create opportunities for different retail operations.</li><li>Office Space Demand: Businesses and professionals can consider commercial office spaces depending on their operational requirements.</li><li>Long-Term Investment Potential: Investors can evaluate properties based on location, building quality, ownership documentation, and future market conditions.</li></ul><h2>Strategic Location and Connectivity</h2><p>MA Jinnah Road is an important transportation and commercial route in Karachi. It connects different parts of the city and provides access to several established business destinations.</p><p>Its connectivity makes the area relevant for businesses that depend on customer access, supplier networks, employee movement, and commercial transportation.</p><p>Important nearby commercial and business destinations include I.I. Chundrigar Road, Saddar, Shahrah-e-Faisal, and other central Karachi locations. These surrounding areas contribute to the wider commercial importance of the district.</p><p>For property investors, accessibility is an important factor when comparing commercial locations. Properties with convenient road access, suitable parking arrangements, visible entrances, and easy customer access may offer practical advantages over less accessible alternatives.</p><h2>Commercial Property Investment Opportunities</h2><p>MA Jinnah Road offers different types of commercial real estate opportunities for investors. The right property depends on the available budget, investment strategy, and intended use.</p><h3>1. Commercial Shops and Retail Spaces</h3><p>Commercial shops are among the property types investors can consider in established business districts. MA Jinnah Road has a long-standing retail environment, with different markets and commercial establishments attracting customers.</p><p>Investors can evaluate retail units based on their frontage, floor level, visibility, surrounding businesses, pedestrian movement, and accessibility.</p><p>A strategically positioned retail unit may appeal to businesses looking for a location within an established commercial market. However, rental performance depends on the specific property, market conditions, and tenant demand.</p><h3>2. Commercial Office Spaces</h3><p>Office spaces provide another investment option for buyers interested in business-oriented properties. Companies, consultants, service providers, and other professionals may consider centrally located offices based on their operational needs.</p><p>Investors should assess office layouts, building maintenance, elevators, security arrangements, parking, utilities, and accessibility before purchasing.</p><p>Well-maintained commercial buildings with practical facilities can be more attractive to potential business tenants.</p><h3>3. Commercial Buildings</h3><p>Investing in an entire commercial building can offer opportunities for buyers with larger investment budgets. Such properties may include multiple shops, offices, or other commercial units.</p><p>Before investing, buyers should examine the building\'s construction quality, approved usage, occupancy status, maintenance requirements, ownership structure, and existing tenancy agreements.</p><p>Commercial buildings require careful financial and legal assessment because their operating costs and management responsibilities can vary considerably.</p><h2>Business Environment Around MA Jinnah Road</h2><p>The surrounding business environment is an important consideration for commercial property investors. MA Jinnah Road is associated with established trading activities, retail businesses, wholesale markets, financial services, and professional establishments.</p><p>This commercial activity creates an environment where businesses can operate near suppliers, customers, and other service providers.</p><p>For investors, understanding the surrounding business mix can help identify suitable property opportunities. For example, retail spaces may be more relevant in areas with customer-facing commercial activity, while office spaces may suit businesses that prioritise central accessibility.</p><p>The suitability of a property should always be evaluated according to its exact location rather than relying only on the reputation of the wider road.</p><h2>Rental Income and Long-Term Investment Potential</h2><p>Commercial real estate can be considered by investors seeking rental income and long-term asset ownership. However, rental returns are not guaranteed and depend on several factors, including purchase price, property condition, tenant demand, maintenance expenses, and the overall economic environment.</p><p>MA Jinnah Road\'s established commercial presence makes it a location worth evaluating for investors interested in rental-oriented properties.</p><p>Before purchasing, investors should compare the expected rental income with the total acquisition cost and recurring expenses. They should also consider vacancy periods, property taxes, maintenance charges, building management costs, and potential renovation requirements.</p><p>A realistic investment calculation can help buyers understand whether a property matches their financial objectives.</p><h2>Factors to Consider Before Investing</h2><p>Purchasing commercial property requires proper research and due diligence. Although location is important, several other factors can influence the suitability of an investment.</p><h3>Property Documentation and Legal Verification</h3><p>Verify the ownership documents, title records, approved building plans, commercial permissions, and relevant approvals before making a purchase. Investors should also check whether the property has any outstanding disputes, mortgages, or legal restrictions.</p><h3>Building Quality and Facilities</h3><p>Examine the construction quality, electrical systems, water supply, elevators, fire safety arrangements, security, and general maintenance. Building facilities can influence the property\'s usability and appeal to potential tenants.</p><h3>Accessibility and Parking</h3><p>Evaluate road access, public transportation options, parking availability, and customer convenience. These factors can influence how effectively a commercial property serves businesses and visitors.</p><h3>Market Price and Rental Assessment</h3><p>Compare similar commercial properties in the surrounding area. Review asking prices, recent transactions where available, rental expectations, and ongoing maintenance expenses.</p><h3>Investment Objectives</h3><p>Decide whether the objective is to operate a business, generate rental income, purchase an asset for long-term ownership, or explore future resale opportunities. A clear investment strategy can help narrow down suitable properties.</p><h2>Who Should Consider Investing in MA Jinnah Road?</h2><p>MA Jinnah Road may be worth considering for different categories of commercial property investors.</p><ul><li>Individual Investors: Buyers interested in owning commercial property and evaluating potential rental opportunities.</li><li>Business Owners: Entrepreneurs looking for shops, offices, or commercial premises for their operations.</li><li>Property Investors: Individuals comparing established commercial locations across Karachi.</li><li>Long-Term Buyers: Investors interested in holding commercial assets over an extended period.</li><li>Business Groups: Buyers evaluating larger commercial properties for multiple business activities.</li></ul><p>The appropriate investment option depends on the buyer\'s budget, risk tolerance, property requirements, and financial goals.</p><h2>Explore Commercial Real Estate Opportunities on MA Jinnah Road</h2><p>MA Jinnah Road remains an important commercial location for anyone researching business-oriented real estate in Karachi. Its established trading environment, central connectivity, and surrounding commercial activity make it relevant for investors comparing different property opportunities.</p><p>Whether you are considering a commercial shop, office space, or a larger commercial property, conducting proper research is essential before making a decision.</p><p>Explore available commercial properties, compare investment options, and review their location, documentation, pricing, and potential rental performance. With careful evaluation and professional guidance, investors can make more informed decisions when considering commercial real estate on MA Jinnah Road.</p><h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2><h3>Is MA Jinnah Road Karachi a good location for commercial property investment?</h3><p>MA Jinnah Road is an established commercial area with retail markets, offices, and business activities. Investors can evaluate available properties based on location, pricing, accessibility, and rental potential.</p><h3>What types of commercial properties are available on MA Jinnah Road?</h3><p>Investment options may include commercial shops, retail units, office spaces, and larger commercial buildings, depending on current availability.</p><h3>Can investors earn rental income from commercial property on MA Jinnah Road?</h3><p>Commercial properties may generate rental income when suitable tenants are secured. Actual returns depend on the purchase price, rental demand, property condition, and operating expenses.</p><h3>What should I check before buying commercial property?</h3><p>Buyers should verify ownership documents, approved commercial usage, building condition, market pricing, accessibility, parking, and any outstanding legal or financial obligations.</p><h3>Why is location important when investing in MA Jinnah Road?</h3><p>A property\'s exact position can influence customer access, business visibility, tenant demand, and overall investment suitability. Investors should assess the individual property\'s surroundings before purchasing.</p>', 1, 1, 0, 27, 1, 'publish', 'Ma Properties | Luxury Investment & Community Guide', 'Explore luxury waterfront homes, real estate, and investment projects in Ma.', 'Ma, real estate in Ma, properties for sale in Ma', '/images/hero/slide-1.jpg', '2026-10-29 12:00:07', '2026-10-30 12:10:15'),
(76, 'Saima Center Point 2', 'saima-center-point-2', '<p>At present, Saima Center Point 2 M.A. Jinnah Road exists as a name in circulation rather than a launched project: it has been described as a Coming Soon development, but no dedicated official page, launch event, or documentation set has been published for it. That makes it fundamentally different from a project buyers can inspect, price, or book today.</p><p>Within Saima Builders projects Karachi, the confirmed M.A. Jinnah Road project is Saima Center Point. Until Saima Builders publishes a launch announcement for Saima Center Point 2 Saima Builders, the accurate position is that buyers can register interest and monitor official channels. Nothing more should be promised, and no payment should change hands against this name.</p><h2>Key Project Highlights</h2><table><thead><tr><th>Feature</th><th>Details</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Developer</td><td>Saima Builders</td></tr><tr><td>Property Type</td><td>To be announced</td></tr><tr><td>Unit Types</td><td>To be announced</td></tr><tr><td>Total Land Size</td><td>Not disclosed</td></tr><tr><td>Handover</td><td>To be announced</td></tr><tr><td>Location</td><td>M.A. Jinnah Road, Karachi (reported, unconfirmed)</td></tr><tr><td>Payment Plan</td><td>To be announced</td></tr><tr><td>Lifestyle</td><td>To be announced</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>Master Plan and Development Framework</h2><p>No master plan has been published for Saima Center Point 2. The project\'s structure, tower count, and layout will only become clear if and when the developer releases official documentation.</p><p>Buyers comparing material online should be careful: details belonging to the original Saima Center Point are sometimes repeated under the Center Point 2 name. Floor plans, unit types, and schedules from the first project must not be assumed to apply to Saima Center Point 2 M.A. Jinnah Road.</p><h2>Unit Types: To Be Announced</h2><p>No unit schedule has been published for Saima Center Point 2 Saima Builders, so the honest position is set out below rather than a list of invented apartment types.</p><h3>Apartments in Saima Center Point 2 (To Be Announced)</h3><p>The unit mix for Saima Center Point 2 M.A. Jinnah Road has not been announced. Apartment sizes, bedroom counts, and floor plans will only be known when the developer publishes a unit schedule at launch, and no layout from Saima Center Point should be assumed to carry over.</p><p>Buyers seeking apartments for sale Saima Center Point 2 or flats for sale Saima Center Point 2 Karachi should register interest and wait for the official unit schedule rather than relying on third-party listings.</p><h2>Floor Plan</h2><p>A floor plan for every unit category is available through the developer\'s authorised sales channel. Buyers seeking a Saima Center Point 2 price or a Saima Center Point floor plan should request the unit schedule alongside the floor plan from the authorised sales channel.</p><h2>Price and Booking Status</h2><p>There is no official Saima Center Point 2 price, because no price list has been published. Pricing will only become real when the developer releases an authorised schedule at launch.</p><p>No Saima Center Point 2 booking is officially open. Buyers searching for a Saima Center Point 2 apartment price or Saima Center Point 2 booking amount should register interest only and should not pay any amount to any party claiming to collect bookings for this project before an official launch.</p><p>Buyers who need a bookable M.A. Jinnah Road option today should instead review the confirmed Saima Center Point project through the developer\'s authorised sales channel.</p><h2>NOC and Approval Status</h2><p>No NOC or approval documentation specific to Saima Center Point 2 Saima Builders has been published. Buyers should verify the position directly with the developer or the relevant authority if the project is formally launched.</p><p>Approvals granted to Saima Center Point do not automatically extend to a separate project under the Center Point 2 name, and the two should never be treated as interchangeable in documentation.</p><h2>Possession Timeline</h2><p>No possession timeline exists for Saima Center Point 2 M.A. Jinnah Road, because the project has not been formally launched. Any possession date quoted today would be speculation, and buyers should wait for the developer\'s official launch documentation.</p>', 1, 1, 1, 28, 1, 'publish', 'Saima Center Point 2 Karachi | Prices & Payment Plan', 'Saima Center Point 2 in Karachi. Discover project details, prices and payment plan information. Contact us today to learn more and book your unit!', NULL, '/images/projects/1793275478_images-1.webp', '2026-10-29 12:04:38', '2026-11-10 10:20:48');
INSERT INTO `pages` (`id`, `title`, `slug`, `body`, `in_navbar`, `show_in_projects`, `show_in_commercial`, `navbar_order`, `is_published`, `status`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`, `meta_keywords`, `og_image`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(77, 'Saima Mangroves', 'saima-mangroves', '<p>Saima Mangroves is a residential enclave within The Mangrove, a master-planned waterfront community at Korangi Creek in Karachi. The project is being executed through National Management & Consultancy (Private) Limited, a special purpose vehicle of TPL REIT Fund I, under a Development Advisory Agreement with the Zeeshan Saleem Zaki Group of Saima Builders. Saima Mangroves Korangi Creek is a development offering panoramic views of the protected mangrove belt. For buyers seeking a structured, institutionally backed entry into Karachi\'s waterfront residential market, Saima Mangrove Residences Karachi represents a distinct proposition: a planned community rather than a standalone tower.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The project is listed as \"Coming Soon\" on the developer\'s official project page and as \"Pre-Launch\" on independent property portals. The formal launch of Waterfront Apartments Korangi Creek Karachi under the Saima Mangrove Residences Karachi brand was held on 10–11 October 2026 and was reported as \"overwhelmingly successful and heavily over-subscribed\" in a public disclosure. Saima Mangroves Korangi Creek is best understood as the residential brand within the larger The Mangrove master plan.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Key Project Highlights</h2>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n    <tbody><tr>\r\n        <th>Feature</th>\r\n        <th>Details</th>\r\n    </tr>\r\n    <tr>\r\n        <td>Developer</td>\r\n        <td>Saima Builders</td>\r\n    </tr>\r\n    <tr>\r\n        <td>Property Type</td>\r\n        <td>Apartments</td>\r\n    </tr>\r\n    <tr>\r\n        <td>Unit Types</td>\r\n        <td>3, 4 and 5-bedroom Apartments</td>\r\n    </tr>\r\n    <tr>\r\n        <td>Total Land Size</td>\r\n        <td>40-acre waterfront land parcel</td>\r\n    </tr>\r\n    <tr>\r\n        <td>Handover</td>\r\n        <td>Multiple phases</td>\r\n    </tr>\r\n    <tr>\r\n        <td>Location</td>\r\n        <td>Korangi Creek, Karachi</td>\r\n    </tr>\r\n    <tr>\r\n        <td>Payment Plan</td>\r\n        <td>Flexible installments</td>\r\n    </tr>\r\n    <tr>\r\n        <td>Lifestyle</td>\r\n        <td>Waterfront living</td>\r\n    </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<ul><li>40-Acre Premium Residential & Commercial Gated Community</li><li>16 Towers planned</li><li>Currently, 2 Towers are ready for launch</li><li>Each Tower is built on approximately 1 Acre</li><li>Tower Structure: Ground + 31 Floors</li></ul><h3>TOWER LAYOUT</h3><ul><li>Ground Floor: Commercial Showrooms</li><li>1st to 4th Floors: Dedicated Covered Parking</li><li>5th Floor: Exclusive Amenities Floor</li><li>6th to 31st Floors: Residential Apartments</li><li>14 Apartments on each residential floor</li></ul><h2>Master Plan and Development Framework</h2><p><img src=\"/uploads/content/1794493841_whatsapp-image-2026-11-12-at-44315-pm.jpeg\" style=\"display: block; max-width: 100%; border-radius: 8px; margin: 15px 0px; width: 100%;\"></p><p>Saima Mangroves is the residential component of The Mangrove, a master plan prepared with an emphasis on preserving the surrounding mangrove ecosystem.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The residential offering at Saima Mangroves Korangi Creek is centred on Saima Mangrove Residences Karachi, on Korangi Creek Road near IoBM. It therefore sits within an active development programme rather than a conceptual launch. The involvement of TPL REIT Fund I, a Shariah-compliant hybrid REIT managed by a subsidiary of the publicly listed TPL Properties, introduces institutional reporting and fund-level oversight to Saima Mangrove Residences Karachi. For buyers comparing Saima Mangroves Korangi Creek Karachi with other waterfront projects, the REIT-backed structure is a material differentiator.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Unit Types: 3, 4, and 5 Room Apartments</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>For buyers searching for a 3 room apartment Korangi Creek Karachi, a 4 room apartment Korangi Creek Karachi, or a 5 room apartment Korangi Creek Karachi, Saima Mangroves Korangi Creek offers family-sized layouts consistent with the premium positioning of The Mangrove.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>3 Room Apartment Korangi Creek Karachi</h3><p><img src=\"/uploads/content/1794493867_4.jpg\" style=\"display: block; max-width: 100%; border-radius: 8px; margin: 15px 0px; width: 100%;\"></p><p>The 3-room configuration includes two bedrooms, two bathrooms, a kitchen, lounge, lobby, wardrobes, and a terrace.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>4 Room Apartment Korangi Creek Karachi</h3><p><img src=\"/uploads/content/1794493886_3.jpg\" style=\"display: block; max-width: 100%; border-radius: 8px; margin: 15px 0px; width: 100%;\"></p><p>The 4-room layout is more spacious and adds a third bedroom and bathroom, with a lounge.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>5 Room Apartment Korangi Creek Karachi</h3><p><img src=\"/uploads/content/1794493932_2.jpg\" style=\"display: block; max-width: 100%; border-radius: 8px; margin: 15px 0px; width: 100%;\"></p><p>The 5-room apartments are offered in multiple sub-types, with configurations ranging from three to four bedrooms and larger drawing and lounge areas.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Floor Plan</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>A floor plan for every unit category is available through the developer\'s authorised sales channel. Buyers seeking a 3 room apartment Saima Mangroves price, a 4 room apartment Saima Mangroves price, or a 5 room apartment Saima Mangroves price should request the unit schedule alongside the Saima Mangroves floor plan from the authorised sales channel, as Mangrove-facing apartment Karachi listings for Saima Mangroves Korangi Creek Karachi are often incomplete.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Price and Booking Status</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>The Saima Mangroves price is positioned competitively for waterfront living and is disclosed through the developer\'s authorised sales channel. The Saima Mangroves payment plan is structured to accommodate various buyer profiles, with flexible instalment options and construction-linked milestones available on request.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>A Saima Mangroves booking is processed through the developer\'s sales team, and the Saima Mangroves booking amount should be confirmed in writing alongside the Saima Mangroves payment plan. For buyers seeking a waterfront apartment on instalments Korangi Creek, the practical route to buy an apartment in Saima Mangroves Karachi is to register interest directly with Saima Builders or TPL\'s designated sales partners and obtain the current Saima Mangroves payment plan before booking.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Saima Mangroves Korangi Creek Karachi buyers should also confirm whether apartments for sale Korangi Creek Karachi are being offered through a priority allocation system or on a first-come, first-served basis.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>NOC and Approval Status</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>The developer states that Saima Mangroves Korangi Creek is NOC approved. The project has been registered with the relevant development authorities, and it meets environmental and construction requirements. The regulatory foundation for Saima Mangroves Korangi Creek Karachi is the master plan approval granted by the Cantonment Board Korangi Creek to the project\'s special purpose vehicle, with building plans submitted for approval as the project progresses through its phases.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Buyers completing booking should request both the master plan approval and the latest building-level approval documentation from the developer\'s authorised sales channel to confirm the current status for their specific tower and unit. The institutional involvement of TPL REIT Fund I adds a layer of fund-level oversight to Saima Mangrove Residences Karachi, though buyers should still independently verify all approvals before purchase.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Possession Timeline</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>A formal possession date for the Saima Mangroves Korangi Creek residential towers has not been announced as a single project-wide date. The project is being delivered in phases, and buyers should anticipate a phased handover for the Saima Mangrove Residences Karachi twin towers. Buyers should secure a documented possession schedule at the point of Saima Mangroves booking. Saima Mangroves Korangi Creek Karachi possession timelines should be confirmed in writing with the developer, and buyers should plan for a medium- to long-term horizon rather than immediate occupancy.</p><h3>KEY SELLING POINTS</h3><ul><li>Waterfront Living – Experience a premium lifestyle with a unique waterfront setting.</li><li>Mangrove Views – Enjoy beautiful mangrove and lagoon views from the residential towers.</li><li>Swimming Pool – Dedicated recreational space for residents.</li><li>Padel Court – Modern sports and fitness facility.</li><li>Kids Play Area – Dedicated safe space for children.</li><li>Fully Equipped Gym – Fitness facility for residents.</li><li>40-Acre Gated Community – Premium residential and commercial development.</li><li>Dedicated Parking – Four floors allocated for covered parking.</li><li>Commercial Showrooms – Commercial activity within the development.</li><li>Exclusive Amenities Floor – Dedicated lifestyle and recreational facilities.</li><li>48-Months Payment Plan – Flexible installment option.</li></ul>', 1, 1, 0, 29, 1, 'publish', 'Saima Mangroves Residence Book Now', 'Saima Mangroves in Korangi Creek, Karachi. Explore waterfront apartments, prices and payment plan , floor plan details. Contact us today to book your apartment!', 'Saima Mangroves Korangi Creek Karachi, Saima Mangroves Karachi, Saima Mangrove Residences Karachi, Saima Mangroves price, Saima Mangroves payment plan', '/images/projects/1793341694_gallery-6ab772967c61b-9c65ff4d-c.webp', '2026-10-30 06:28:14', '2026-11-12 14:32:43'),
(78, 'PIDC', 'pidc', '<p class=\"saimaIntroP\"><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; text-align: justify;\">Lorem Ipsum</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; text-align: justify;\"> is simply dummy text of the printing and typesetting industry. Lorem Ipsum has been the industry\'s standard dummy text ever since 1966, when designers at Letraset and James Mosley, the librarian at St Bride Printing Library in London, took a 1914 Cicero translation and scrambled it to make dummy text for Letraset\'s Body Type sheets. It has survived not only many decades, but also the leap into electronic typesetting, remaining essentially unchanged. It was popularised thanks to these sheets and more recently with desktop publishing software like Aldus PageMaker and Microsoft Word including versions of Lorem Ipsum.</span></p>', 1, 1, 0, 30, 1, 'publish', 'PIDC Properties | Luxury Investment & Community Guide', 'Explore luxury waterfront homes, real estate, and investment projects in PIDC.', 'PIDC, real estate in PIDC, properties for sale in PIDC', '/images/hero/slide-1.jpg', '2026-10-30 06:36:21', '2026-11-12 11:58:15'),
(79, 'Korangi Creek', 'korangi-creek', '<p class=\"saimaIntroP\">A premier benchmark for luxury waterfront living, seamlessly blending contemporary architectural elegance with a tranquil coastal sanctuary. Residents enjoy fresh sea breezes, private beach access, and immediate connectivity to key metropolitan hubs.</p>\r\n<p class=\"saimaIntroP\">Located along prestigious shoreline corridors, the community offers an inspired lifestyle for professionals, investors, and families seeking refined island elegance away from urban congestion.</p>\r\n<p class=\"saimaIntroP\">Every residence offers a harmonious blend of sophistication, security, and long-term capital appreciation, presenting an extraordinary investment opportunity in one of the most coveted coastal addresses.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>About the Developers</h2>\r\n<p>Crafted by premier developers renowned for shaping iconic waterfront communities across the region for decades. Buyers and international investors benefit from a celebrated track record of timely delivery, construction excellence, and sustainable urban design.</p>\r\n<p>Working alongside leading international architectural consultants and market advisory firms, every aspect of the project is engineered to global standards of prestige and durability.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Approvals &amp; Clearances</h2>\r\n<p>The project holds full regulatory clearance and title approvals from all relevant municipal and developmental authorities. Complying strictly with environmental and structural guidelines, purchasers can invest with absolute peace of mind and secure freehold ownership.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Prime Location &amp; Seamless Connectivity</h2>\r\n<p>Set within a scenic coastal landscape, the project offers rapid access to international airports, commercial business districts, premier private schools, and luxury retail destinations.</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>Surrounded by protected green reserves and pristine waters, residents wake up to panoramic coastal vistas and unpolluted air throughout the year.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Architectural Excellence &amp; Floor Plans</h2>\r\n<p>The layouts focus on space efficiency, panoramic natural lighting, and seamless indoor-outdoor living with spacious private terraces and balconies.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Curated Residences &amp; Layout Types</h3>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>Featuring open-plan living rooms, floor-to-ceiling double-glazed windows, designer show kitchens, and lavish en-suite master bedrooms designed for modern family living.</p>\r\n\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>Expansive terraces provide seamless entertaining spaces overlooking lush landscaped courtyards and the sparkling coastline.</p>\r\n\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>Generous multi-level accommodations including private elevators, maid\'s quarters, private swimming pools, and dedicated family lounges.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Master Plan &amp; Community Lifestyle</h2>\r\n<p>The community master plan establishes a secure, private, and walkable residential haven. Dedicated subterranean parking ensures pedestrian safety across surface walkways, cycling trails, and waterfront boardwalks.</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Flexible Investment &amp; Payment Plan</h2>\r\n<p>A buyer-friendly, construction-linked payment structure is offered with flexible milestones, making property acquisition straightforward and stress-free.</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n\r\n<h2>World-Class Facilities &amp; Amenities</h2>\r\n<p>Enjoy infinity swimming pools, state-of-the-art fitness centres, private beach cabanas, children\'s play areas, multi-sport courts, and fine-dining waterfront restaurants just steps from your front door.</p>', 1, 1, 0, 31, 1, 'publish', 'Korangi Creek Karachi Properties | Luxury Investment & Community Guide', 'Explore luxury waterfront homes, real estate, and investment projects in Korangi Creek, Karachi.', 'Korangi Creek, real estate in Korangi Creek, properties for sale in Korangi Creek', '/images/hero/slide-1.jpg', '2026-10-30 06:36:53', '2026-11-12 08:51:54'),
(80, 'Saima Corporate Center', 'saima-corporate-center-at-pidc-karachi', '<p>At its core, Saima Corporate Center is a mixed-use commercial tower with corporate offices, retail shops, showrooms, and business suites, all housed under one roof rather than scattered across separate buildings. The idea of Saima Corporate Center Saima Builders is fairly straightforward: give business owners a modern workspace that also functions as a legitimate investment property, and give investors a building with enough variety in unit types that demand does not rely on just one kind of tenant. There is a clear separation between the retail floors, which are meant to handle daily footfall and walk-in customers, and the office floors above, which are quieter and meant for people who actually work there.</p><p>Saima Corporate Center Saima Builders has become one of the names that comes up fairly often in investor circles when the conversation turns to serious business addresses in Karachi, usually in the same breath as questions about location, pricing, and whether it is actually worth the money. With a known developer, a location that is not buried somewhere inconvenient, and a mix of office space, retail shops, and business suites, Saima Corporate Center offices is one of the notable commercial projects Karachi buyers compare when looking at corporate commercial towers Karachi.</p><h2>Key Project Highlights</h2><table><tbody><tr><th>Feature</th><th>Details</th></tr><tr><td>Developer</td><td>Saima Builders</td></tr><tr><td>Property Type</td><td>Commercial</td></tr><tr><td>Unit Types</td><td>Corporate offices, retail shops, showrooms and business suites</td></tr><tr><td>Total Land Size</td><td>Not disclosed</td></tr><tr><td>Handover</td><td>To be confirmed</td></tr><tr><td>Location</td><td>PIDC, opposite PC Hotel, Karachi</td></tr><tr><td>Payment Plan</td><td>Flexible installments</td></tr><tr><td>Lifestyle</td><td>Business hub</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>Master Plan and Development Framework</h2><p>Saima Corporate Center offices are planned as a contemporary business hub rather than a traditional commercial plaza, with a master plan prepared with an emphasis on functionality, efficient circulation, and separating business activity by floor.</p><p>The master plan of Saima Corporate Center Saima Builders reflects an attempt to balance pure functionality with something closer to an actual business district feel: dedicated parking that does not feel like an afterthought, common areas built with business use in mind rather than just decorative lobbies, and enough vertical space to comfortably fit a genuine mix of unit types without the building feeling cramped. The Saima Corporate Center floor plan follows a well-planned vertical layout that separates retail, parking, and corporate office spaces, with dedicated parking levels, premium office floors, and recreational facilities creating a complete commercial ecosystem for business offices Karachi.</p><h2>Unit Types: Offices, Shops, Showrooms and Business Suites</h2><p>For buyers searching for commercial offices for sale Karachi, office space for sale Karachi, or corporate offices Karachi, Saima Corporate Center offices offers commercial layouts in four unit categories.</p><ul><li>Corporate offices</li><li>Retail shops</li><li>Showrooms</li><li>Business suites</li></ul><h3>Corporate Offices in Saima Corporate Center</h3><p>Saima Corporate Center offers premium office spaces for businesses that value a professional corporate address and a modern working environment. Saima Corporate Center offices are ideal for consultancies, corporate headquarters, branch offices, IT firms, financial institutions, and other service-based businesses looking to establish a strong presence among corporate offices Karachi.</p><h3>Retail Shops in Saima Corporate Center</h3><p>Ground and lower floors are generally set aside for retail, and shop owners on these floors get visibility and passing footfall that upper-floor units simply cannot compete with, no matter how nicely they are finished.</p><h3>Showrooms in Saima Corporate Center</h3><p>Larger-format units of Saima Corporate Center offices are meant for businesses that genuinely need display space, including furniture retailers, electronics brands, lifestyle stores, anything that benefits from a strong visual presence rather than a small storefront tucked in a corner.</p><h3>Business Suites in Saima Corporate Center</h3><p>Smaller, more flexible spaces are aimed at startups, freelancers, and small teams who want a legitimate business address without committing to an entire floor they do not actually need yet, which is a practical small office for sale Karachi option inside a recognised commercial tower.</p><h2>Floor Plan</h2><p>A floor plan for every unit category in Saima Corporate Center offices is available through the developer\'s authorised sales channel. Buyers seeking a Saima Corporate Center floor plan should request the unit schedule alongside the floor plan from the authorised sales channel, as office for sale Saima Corporate Center Karachi listings are often incomplete.</p><h2>Price and Booking Status</h2><p>The Saima Corporate Center price varies depending on unit type, floor, and size, and is disclosed through the developer\'s authorised sales channel. Retail shops on lower floors usually carry a premium over office units higher up, while business suites tend to sit at a more accessible price point. The Saima Corporate Center payment plan is structured to accommodate various buyer profiles, with flexible instalment options available on request.</p><p>A Saima Corporate Center booking is processed through the developer\'s sales team, and the Saima Corporate Center booking amount should be confirmed in writing alongside the Saima Corporate Center payment plan. For buyers seeking a commercial office on installments Karachi, the practical route to buy office in Saima Corporate Center Karachi is to register interest directly with Saima Builders or its designated sales partners and obtain the current Saima Corporate Center payment plan before booking. Buyers should also request the Saima Corporate Center office price per sqft for their preferred unit type and floor.</p><p>Saima Corporate Center Saima Builders buyers should also confirm whether office space for sale Karachi at this project is being offered through a priority allocation system or on a first-come, first-served basis.</p><h2>NOC and Approval Status</h2><p>Saima Corporate Center is stated to have obtained its No Objection Certificate from the relevant municipal authorities, which is a reassuring sign for anyone considering a purchase in a market where projects have run into regulatory trouble, stalled construction, and missing approvals.</p><p>That said, buyers should still independently verify the current approval status directly with the developer or the authority in question before committing any money. Regulations shift, documentation gets updated, and a status that was accurate six months ago is not necessarily accurate today.</p><h2>Possession Timeline</h2><p>A formal possession date for Saima Corporate Center offices has not been announced as a single project-wide date. The final payment is made before possession, after which buyers can take ownership of their office space. Buyers should secure a documented possession schedule at the point of Saima Corporate Center booking, and Saima Corporate Center Karachi possession timelines should be confirmed in writing with the developer.</p>', 1, 1, 1, 32, 1, 'publish', 'Saima Corporate Center PIDC Karachi Prices & Payment Plan', 'Saima Corporate Center at PIDC, Karachi, opposite Pearl Continental Hotel. Find office spaces, prices and payment plan. Contact us to book today!', NULL, '/images/projects/1793342771_saima-hero-100kb.webp', '2026-10-30 06:46:11', '2026-11-10 10:19:28'),
(81, 'Main Super Highway', 'main-super-highway', '<p class=\"saimaIntroP\">A premier benchmark for luxury waterfront living, seamlessly blending contemporary architectural elegance with a tranquil coastal sanctuary. Residents enjoy fresh sea breezes, private beach access, and immediate connectivity to key metropolitan hubs.</p>\r\n<p class=\"saimaIntroP\">Located along prestigious shoreline corridors, the community offers an inspired lifestyle for professionals, investors, and families seeking refined island elegance away from urban congestion.</p>\r\n<p class=\"saimaIntroP\">Every residence offers a harmonious blend of sophistication, security, and long-term capital appreciation, presenting an extraordinary investment opportunity in one of the most coveted coastal addresses.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>About the Developers</h2>\r\n<p>Crafted by premier developers renowned for shaping iconic waterfront communities across the region for decades. Buyers and international investors benefit from a celebrated track record of timely delivery, construction excellence, and sustainable urban design.</p>\r\n<p>Working alongside leading international architectural consultants and market advisory firms, every aspect of the project is engineered to global standards of prestige and durability.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Approvals &amp; Clearances</h2>\r\n<p>The project holds full regulatory clearance and title approvals from all relevant municipal and developmental authorities. Complying strictly with environmental and structural guidelines, purchasers can invest with absolute peace of mind and secure freehold ownership.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Prime Location &amp; Seamless Connectivity</h2>\r\n<p>Set within a scenic coastal landscape, the project offers rapid access to international airports, commercial business districts, premier private schools, and luxury retail destinations.</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/TOC1.png\" alt=\"Strategic Location &amp; Connectivity Map\" style=\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); width: 100%; margin: 15px 0;\"></p>\r\n<p>Surrounded by protected green reserves and pristine waters, residents wake up to panoramic coastal vistas and unpolluted air throughout the year.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Architectural Excellence &amp; Floor Plans</h2>\r\n<p>The layouts focus on space efficiency, panoramic natural lighting, and seamless indoor-outdoor living with spacious private terraces and balconies.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Curated Residences &amp; Layout Types</h3>\r\n<p><img src=\"/TOC2.png\" alt=\"Luxury Layout Plan - Type C\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\"></p>\r\n<p>Featuring open-plan living rooms, floor-to-ceiling double-glazed windows, designer show kitchens, and lavish en-suite master bedrooms designed for modern family living.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img src=\"/TOC3.png\" alt=\"Executive Layout Plan - Type B\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\"></p>\r\n<p>Expansive terraces provide seamless entertaining spaces overlooking lush landscaped courtyards and the sparkling coastline.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img src=\"/TOC4.png\" alt=\"Presidential Villa Layout Plan - Type A\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\"></p>\r\n<p>Generous multi-level accommodations including private elevators, maid\'s quarters, private swimming pools, and dedicated family lounges.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Master Plan &amp; Community Lifestyle</h2>\r\n<p>The community master plan establishes a secure, private, and walkable residential haven. Dedicated subterranean parking ensures pedestrian safety across surface walkways, cycling trails, and waterfront boardwalks.</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/TOC8.png\" alt=\"Community Master Plan Overview\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\"></p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Flexible Investment &amp; Payment Plan</h2>\r\n<p>A buyer-friendly, construction-linked payment structure is offered with flexible milestones, making property acquisition straightforward and stress-free.</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/TOC12.png\" alt=\"Milestone Payment Structure\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\"></p>\r\n\r\n<h2>World-Class Facilities &amp; Amenities</h2>\r\n<p>Enjoy infinity swimming pools, state-of-the-art fitness centres, private beach cabanas, children\'s play areas, multi-sport courts, and fine-dining waterfront restaurants just steps from your front door.</p>', 1, 1, 0, 33, 1, 'publish', 'Main Super Highway Karachi Properties | Luxury Investment & Community Guide', 'Explore luxury waterfront homes, real estate, and investment projects in Main Super Highway, Karachi.', 'Main Super Highway, real estate in Main Super Highway, properties for sale in Main Super Highway', '/images/hero/slide-1.jpg', '2026-10-30 06:52:14', '2026-10-30 06:52:14'),
(82, 'ZSZ Midtown Farms', 'zsz-midtown-farms', '<p>At its core, ZSZ Midtown Farms Bahria Town Karachi is a plots-based gated community, not a tower project. Spread across 390 acres and organised as a single planned layout, it offers plots ranging from 175 square yards to 1,000 square yards. Buyers can choose from compact residential plots to large farmhouse-sized holdings within the same gated boundary. Wide carpeted roads, reliable utilities, and extensive green spaces are incorporated into the development plan.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Among Main Super Highway Karachi plots, ZSZ Midtown Farms Super Highway competes on two key factors: scale and location. A 390-acre gated community adjacent to Bahria Town Karachi (Bahria-2) offers a different proposition from a small standalone scheme, while its Super Highway frontage maintains connectivity with the city. As ZSZ Midtown Farms Super Highway is currently Coming Soon, buyers are registering interest and positioning themselves early rather than purchasing completed inventory.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Key Project Highlights</h2>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n<tbody><tr><th>Feature</th><th>Details</th></tr>\r\n<tr><td>Developer</td><td>Saima Group (Saima Builders)</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>Property Type</td><td>Residential</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>Unit Types</td><td>Plots of 175, 240, 500 and 1,000 sq. yd.</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>Total Land Size</td><td>390 acres</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>Handover</td><td>Coming Soon</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>Location</td><td>Main Super Highway, adjacent to Bahria Town Karachi (Bahria-2), Karachi</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>Payment Plan</td><td>To be announced</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>Lifestyle</td><td>Gated community</td></tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<h2>Master Plan and Development Framework</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>ZSZ Midtown Farms is planned as a single 390-acre gated community featuring residential plots in four sizes, dedicated commercial zones for everyday retail and business, and community infrastructure. The planned facilities include a community centre, mosques, play areas, jogging tracks, and green spaces distributed throughout the layout.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The development framework for ZSZ Midtown Farms Super Highway focuses on community living, with a gated boundary, CCTV surveillance, wide carpeted internal roads, and utilities covering electricity, gas, and water. These essential services are incorporated into the neighbourhood plan rather than being left to develop piecemeal. The ZSZ Midtown Farms master plan also keeps commercial activities within dedicated zones, helping maintain residential streets for residential use.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Unit Types: 175, 240, 500 and 1,000 Sq. Yd. Plots</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>For buyers searching for plots for sale ZSZ Midtown Farms or farmhouses for sale ZSZ Midtown Farms Karachi, the project offers residential plot options in four sizes near Bahria Town Karachi 2. These gated community plots Karachi cater to different residential requirements and investment preferences.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>175 and 240 Sq. Yd. Plots in ZSZ Midtown Farms</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>The 175 and 240 square yard plots in ZSZ Midtown Farms Bahria Town Karachi are the community\'s entry-level options. They are suited to families looking for a gated-community plot along the Super Highway corridor at a comparatively accessible price point, with access to the planned roads, utilities, and green spaces.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>500 Sq. Yd. Plots in ZSZ Midtown Farms</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>The 500 square yard plots in ZSZ Midtown Farms Bahria Town Karachi offer a middle-range option, providing space for a larger family home with additional outdoor areas while remaining within a mid-range budget category.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>1,000 Sq. Yd. Plots in ZSZ Midtown Farms</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>The 1,000 square yard plots in ZSZ Midtown Farms Bahria Town Karachi are the project\'s largest residential holdings. They are aimed at buyers seeking a farmhouse-sized residence with extensive private grounds within a gated and serviced community.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Floor Plan</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Plot availability and exact positioning within ZSZ Midtown Farms Super Highway will be confirmed when bookings open. Buyers seeking a ZSZ Midtown Farms plot price or plot layout should request the latest plot schedule from the developer\'s authorised sales channel at launch.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Price and Booking Status</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>The ZSZ Midtown Farms price will vary according to plot size and location within the community. No confirmed public price list has been released yet. Buyers should obtain the latest pricing schedule for ZSZ Midtown Farms Bahria Town Karachi through the developer\'s authorised sales channel once it becomes available.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>A ZSZ Midtown Farms booking is not officially open yet. Buyers searching for a ZSZ Midtown Farms plot price or ZSZ Midtown Farms booking amount should register their interest through the developer\'s authorised sales channel and wait for the official schedule. This is preferable to relying on older listings that quoted foreign-currency figures with mismatched project descriptions.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Buyers interested in ZSZ Midtown Farms plots on installments should also confirm whether allocations will follow a priority-based system or a first-come, first-served process when bookings officially open.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>NOC and Approval Status</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Buyers should verify project-specific approvals for ZSZ Midtown Farms directly with the developer or the relevant authority before making a booking, as NOC status applies to the individual project.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Since ZSZ Midtown Farms Super Highway is currently Coming Soon, buyers should ensure that any approval documents presented to them specifically refer to ZSZ Midtown Farms and not to a neighbouring development along the same corridor.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Possession Timeline</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>No possession date has been announced for ZSZ Midtown Farms because the project is currently Coming Soon. Once bookings open, buyers should obtain a documented possession schedule in writing at the time of booking. This should include details of phased possession across the 390-acre layout for ZSZ Midtown Farms Bahria Town Karachi.</p>', 1, 1, 0, 34, 1, 'publish', 'ZSZ Midtown Farms Karachi | Plots Near Bahria Town', 'ZSZ Midtown Farms on Main Super Highway, Karachi, near Bahria Town. Explore residential plots, prices and project details. Contact us to book your plot!', 'ZSZ Midtown Farms Karachi, ZSZ Midtown Farms, ZSZ Midtown Farms Super Highway, ZSZ Midtown Farms Bahria Town Karachi', '/images/projects/1793343224_hero_8fc9582b-19b4-4d43-8557-40a624a6.webp', '2026-10-30 06:53:44', '2026-11-10 10:19:02'),
(83, 'Clifton', 'clifton', '<p class=\"saimaIntroP\">A premier benchmark for luxury waterfront living, seamlessly blending contemporary architectural elegance with a tranquil coastal sanctuary. Residents enjoy fresh sea breezes, private beach access, and immediate connectivity to key metropolitan hubs.</p>\r\n<p class=\"saimaIntroP\">Located along prestigious shoreline corridors, the community offers an inspired lifestyle for professionals, investors, and families seeking refined island elegance away from urban congestion.</p>\r\n<p class=\"saimaIntroP\">Every residence offers a harmonious blend of sophistication, security, and long-term capital appreciation, presenting an extraordinary investment opportunity in one of the most coveted coastal addresses.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>About the Developers</h2>\r\n<p>Crafted by premier developers renowned for shaping iconic waterfront communities across the region for decades. Buyers and international investors benefit from a celebrated track record of timely delivery, construction excellence, and sustainable urban design.</p>\r\n<p>Working alongside leading international architectural consultants and market advisory firms, every aspect of the project is engineered to global standards of prestige and durability.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Approvals &amp; Clearances</h2>\r\n<p>The project holds full regulatory clearance and title approvals from all relevant municipal and developmental authorities. Complying strictly with environmental and structural guidelines, purchasers can invest with absolute peace of mind and secure freehold ownership.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Prime Location &amp; Seamless Connectivity</h2>\r\n<p>Set within a scenic coastal landscape, the project offers rapid access to international airports, commercial business districts, premier private schools, and luxury retail destinations.</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/TOC1.png\" alt=\"Strategic Location &amp; Connectivity Map\" style=\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); width: 100%; margin: 15px 0;\"></p>\r\n<p>Surrounded by protected green reserves and pristine waters, residents wake up to panoramic coastal vistas and unpolluted air throughout the year.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Architectural Excellence &amp; Floor Plans</h2>\r\n<p>The layouts focus on space efficiency, panoramic natural lighting, and seamless indoor-outdoor living with spacious private terraces and balconies.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Curated Residences &amp; Layout Types</h3>\r\n<p><img src=\"/TOC2.png\" alt=\"Luxury Layout Plan - Type C\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\"></p>\r\n<p>Featuring open-plan living rooms, floor-to-ceiling double-glazed windows, designer show kitchens, and lavish en-suite master bedrooms designed for modern family living.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img src=\"/TOC3.png\" alt=\"Executive Layout Plan - Type B\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\"></p>\r\n<p>Expansive terraces provide seamless entertaining spaces overlooking lush landscaped courtyards and the sparkling coastline.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img src=\"/TOC4.png\" alt=\"Presidential Villa Layout Plan - Type A\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\"></p>\r\n<p>Generous multi-level accommodations including private elevators, maid\'s quarters, private swimming pools, and dedicated family lounges.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Master Plan &amp; Community Lifestyle</h2>\r\n<p>The community master plan establishes a secure, private, and walkable residential haven. Dedicated subterranean parking ensures pedestrian safety across surface walkways, cycling trails, and waterfront boardwalks.</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/TOC8.png\" alt=\"Community Master Plan Overview\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\"></p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Flexible Investment &amp; Payment Plan</h2>\r\n<p>A buyer-friendly, construction-linked payment structure is offered with flexible milestones, making property acquisition straightforward and stress-free.</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/TOC12.png\" alt=\"Milestone Payment Structure\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\"></p>\r\n\r\n<h2>World-Class Facilities &amp; Amenities</h2>\r\n<p>Enjoy infinity swimming pools, state-of-the-art fitness centres, private beach cabanas, children\'s play areas, multi-sport courts, and fine-dining waterfront restaurants just steps from your front door.</p>', 1, 1, 0, 35, 1, 'publish', 'Clifton Karachi Properties | Luxury Investment & Community Guide', 'Explore luxury waterfront homes, real estate, and investment projects in Clifton, Karachi.', 'Clifton, real estate in Clifton, properties for sale in Clifton', '/images/hero/slide-1.jpg', '2026-10-30 07:08:17', '2026-10-30 07:08:17'),
(84, 'Saima One Residency', 'saima-one-residency', '<p>Saima One Residency Clifton is a luxurious high-rise residence in the heart of Clifton, Karachi. Also searched as Saima One Residence Clifton, the project features modern architecture, premium living standards, and a prime location within Clifton Block 5. Saima One Residency Park Tower Clifton is best understood as a limited-inventory luxury tower rather than a standard apartment building.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Saima One Residence Clifton is listed as \"Coming Soon\" on the developer\'s official project page. For buyers seeking a structured entry into Karachi\'s premium residential market, Saima One Residency Clifton Karachi represents a distinct proposition: a planned luxury community in one of the city\'s most established neighbourhoods, with panoramic sea and city views, strong rental demand, and the Clifton address that continues to attract executives, expatriates, and overseas Pakistanis.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Key Project Highlights</h2>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n<tbody><tr>\r\n<th>Feature</th>\r\n<th>Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Developer</td>\r\n<td>Saima Builders</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Property Type</td>\r\n<td>Apartments</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Unit Types</td>\r\n<td>3 and 4-bedroom Apartments</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Total Land Size</td>\r\n<td>1 acre</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Handover</td>\r\n<td>To be announced</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Location</td>\r\n<td>Clifton Block 5, near Park Tower, Karachi</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Payment Plan</td>\r\n<td>Flexible installments</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Lifestyle</td>\r\n<td>Luxury high-rise</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<h2>Master Plan and Development Framework</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Saima One Residency is planned as a vertical luxury residence, with an emphasis on privacy, exclusivity, and preserving open views across Clifton.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The residential offering at Saima One Residency Clifton Karachi is centred on Saima One Residency Park Tower Clifton, in Clifton Block 5 near Boat Basin and Dolmen Mall Clifton. Several basement floors are completely reserved for the secure parking of residents and visitors. The tower rises above the parking floors with a spacious entrance lobby, followed by residential floors meticulously designed for comfort and spacious family layouts. The master plan of Saima One Residence Clifton follows a limited-inventory approach, further emphasising the exclusivity of the project. For buyers comparing Saima One Residency Clifton Karachi with other Clifton projects, the low-density planning and sea and city views are important differentiators.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Unit Types: 3 and 4 Bedroom Apartments</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>For buyers searching for a 3 bed apartment Clifton Karachi, a 4 bed apartment Clifton Karachi, or luxury apartments in Clifton Karachi, Saima One Residency Clifton Karachi offers family-sized layouts consistent with the premium positioning of Clifton Block 5.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>3 Bed Apartment Clifton Karachi</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>The 3 Bed D/D Type-A configuration in Saima One Residence Clifton includes three generously sized bedrooms with attached bathrooms, a formal drawing room, a large family lounge, a dining area, a modern kitchen, and servant accommodation. It is an ideal 3 bed luxury apartment near Park Tower Clifton, designed for families who want spacious living without compromising functionality.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>4 Bed Apartment Clifton Karachi</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>The 4 Bed D/D Type-XL layout in Saima One Residence Clifton offers additional space for larger families seeking luxury living in Clifton, with four spacious en-suite bedrooms, a formal drawing room, a generous family lounge, a dedicated dining area, a modern kitchen, servant quarters, and ample wardrobe space. As a 4 bed sea facing apartment Clifton Karachi option, it provides privacy, comfort, and an ideal setting for both daily life and entertaining guests.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Floor Plan</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>A floor plan for every unit category in Saima One Residence Clifton is available through the developer\'s authorised sales channel. Buyers seeking a Saima One Residency 3 bed price, a Saima One Residency 4 bed price, or a Saima One Residency floor plan should request the unit schedule alongside the floor plan from the authorised sales channel, as apartments for sale in Clifton Karachi listings for Saima One Residency Clifton Karachi are often incomplete.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Price and Booking Status</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>The Saima One Residency price is positioned at the premium end of the Clifton market and is disclosed through the developer\'s authorised sales channel. The Saima One Residency payment plan is structured to accommodate different buyer profiles, with flexible instalment options and construction-linked milestones available on request.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>A Saima One Residency booking is processed through the developer\'s sales team, and the Saima One Residency booking amount should be confirmed in writing alongside the Saima One Residency payment plan. For buyers seeking to buy an apartment in Clifton on instalments, the practical route to book in Saima One Residency Karachi is to register interest directly with Saima Builders or its designated sales partners and obtain the current Saima One Residency payment plan before booking.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Saima One Residency Clifton Karachi buyers should also confirm whether apartments for sale in Clifton Karachi at this project are being offered through a priority allocation system or on a first-come, first-served basis.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>NOC and Approval Status</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Saima One Residency Clifton comes under the supervision of the Sindh Building Control Authority (SBCA), and the project\'s structural planning is stated to be consistent with SBCA construction regulations and legal standards.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Buyers completing Saima One Residency Park Tower Clifton booking should request the project-specific approval documentation from the developer\'s authorised sales channel and check the most recent NOC information on official SBCA platforms before making any booking or financial transaction. This helps confirm the current approval status for their specific unit.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Possession Timeline</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>A formal possession date for Saima One Residency Clifton has not been announced. Saima One Residency Park Tower Clifton is at the Coming Soon stage, and buyers should secure a documented possession schedule at the point of Saima One Residency booking. Saima One Residency Clifton Karachi possession timelines should be confirmed in writing with the developer, and buyers should plan for a medium- to long-term horizon rather than immediate occupancy.</p>', 1, 1, 0, 36, 1, 'publish', 'Saima One Residency Clifton Karachi | Apartments Prices', 'Saima One Residency in Clifton Block 5, Karachi, near Park Towers. Discover apartment details, prices and payment plan. Contact us to book today!', NULL, '/images/projects/1793344133_saima-onejpg.webp', '2026-10-30 07:08:53', '2026-11-10 10:18:14');
