(91, 'Saima Dreams', 'saima-dreams', '<p>At its core, Saima Dreams Saima Builders is a family apartment project whose standout feature is sizing: 4-room, 5-room, and 6-room apartments, which is bigger than what most projects in this price bracket offer. That alone changes who Saima Dreams Saima Builders makes sense for, a joint family that has been renting a house for years and finally wants to own something with enough rooms for everyone is exactly the buyer these layouts are built for. The towers are planned as high-rise buildings, so the larger layouts come with lift access and shared facilities rather than a low-rise walk-up format.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Within Saima Builders residential projects Karachi, Saima Dreams Saima Builders represents the larger-family end of the Scheme 33 supply, and it is regularly compared with other high-rise apartments Karachi buyers shortlist in the Gulzar-e-Hijri corridor. Its position near Safoora Chowrangi, in a neighbourhood where the developer has several projects, gives it a recognisable address for both end-users and investors.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Key Project Highlights</h2>\r\n<table>\r\n<tbody><tr>\r\n<th>Feature</th>\r\n<th>Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Developer</td>\r\n<td>Saima Builders</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Property Type</td>\r\n<td>Residential</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Unit Types</td>\r\n<td>4, 5 & 6-room apartments</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Total Land Size</td>\r\n<td>2 acres</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Handover</td>\r\n<td>To be confirmed</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Location</td>\r\n<td>Scheme 33, near Safoora Chowrangi, Karachi</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Payment Plan</td>\r\n<td>On easy installments</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Lifestyle</td>\r\n<td>Family living</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<h2>Master Plan and Development Framework</h2>\r\n<p>Saima Dreams is planned around contemporary family living, with a master plan that balances apartment towers with shared open and recreational spaces rather than filling the entire site with built-up area.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The framework is designed to provide residents with a balance of comfort, convenience, and usable shared space: apartments arranged for space efficiency, natural light, and ventilation, with community areas, parking, and facilities planned into the layout. The Saima Dreams floor plan reflects this approach, keeping family living spaces generous in line with the project\'s larger room counts.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Unit Types: 4, 5 & 6-Room Apartments</h2>\r\n<p>For buyers searching for apartments for sale Saima Dreams Karachi or flats for sale Saima Dreams Karachi, Saima Dreams Karachi offers family layouts in three categories.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>4-Room Apartments in Saima Dreams</h3>\r\n<p>The Saima Dreams apartments Karachi 4-room apartments suit families who want more space than a standard compact flat, with room for a growing household while staying within the project\'s most accessible layout category.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>5-Room Apartments in Saima Dreams</h3>\r\n<p>The Saima Dreams apartments Karachi 5-room apartments suit larger families who need an additional bedroom or a flexible room for guests, parents, or a home office, without moving up to the largest category.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>6-Room Apartments in Saima Dreams</h3>\r\n<p>The Saima Dreams apartments Karachi 6-room apartments are the project\'s largest layouts, aimed at joint families who want everyone under one roof with proper living space, the category that most clearly sets this project apart from typical Scheme 33 supply.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Floor Plan</h2>\r\n<p>A floor plan for each apartment type in Saima Dreams Saima Builders is available through the developer\'s authorised sales channel. Buyers seeking a Saima Dreams apartment price or a Saima Dreams floor plan should request the unit schedule alongside the floor plan from the authorised sales channel, as secondary listings are often incomplete.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Price and Booking Status</h2>\r\n<p>The Saima Dreams price varies depending on unit type, size, and floor, and is disclosed through the developer\'s authorised sales channel. The Saima Dreams payment plan is structured to accommodate various buyer profiles, with flexible instalment options available on request.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>A Saima Dreams booking is processed through the developer\'s sales team, and the Saima Dreams booking amount should be confirmed in writing alongside the Saima Dreams payment plan. The practical route to buy flat in Saima Dreams Karachi is to register interest directly with Saima Builders or its designated sales partners and obtain the current Saima Dreams apartment price before booking.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Saima Dreams Saima Builders buyers should also confirm whether Saima Dreams apartments on installments are being offered through a priority allocation system or on a first-come, first-served basis.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>NOC and Approval Status</h2>\r\n<p>Saima Dreams apartments Karachi buyers should verify the project-specific approvals for the project directly with the developer or the relevant authority before booking, as NOC status applies to the individual project and its phases.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Regulations shift and documentation gets updated, so a status reported earlier should be re-confirmed at the time of booking rather than assumed to still apply.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Possession Timeline</h2>\r\n<p>A formal possession date for Saima Dreams has not been announced as a single project-wide date, and handover in a project of this type is normally phased by tower. Buyers should secure a documented possession schedule at the point of Saima Dreams booking, and the possession timelines for Saima Dreams 4-room apartments should be confirmed in writing with the developer.</p>', 1, 1, 0, 43, 1, 'publish', 'Saima Dreams Karachi | Payment Plan & Prices 2026', 'Saima Dreams in Gulzar-e-Hijri, Scheme 33, Karachi, near Safoora Chowrangi. Explore project features, prices and payment plan. Book your unit today!', NULL, '/images/projects/1793346968_s-d-1.jpg', '2026-10-30 07:56:08', '2026-11-10 10:17:06'),
(92, 'Saima Shield Towers', 'saima-shield-towers', '<p>At its core, Saima Shield Towers Saima Builders is high-rise living built for families, not singles or couples looking for a small flat: bigger balconies, wider corridors, and apartments finished a notch above the older buildings around Gulshan-e-Iqbal. Instead of one lone block, the project features multiple residential towers, which gives it more of a community feel, and the gated setting provides controlled access and improved security for residents.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Among high-rise towers Karachi buyers compare, Saima Shield Towers stands out for bringing a gated, planned format to an established neighbourhood rather than a developing one. It sits naturally within Saima Builders towers Karachi, and its rental logic is straightforward: universities and hospitals nearby keep demand steady in this area, which is why gated community apartments Karachi investors watch include this project.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Key Project Highlights</h2>\r\n<table>\r\n<tbody><tr>\r\n<th>Feature</th>\r\n<th>Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Developer</td>\r\n<td>Saima Builders</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Property Type</td>\r\n<td>Residential</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Unit Types</td>\r\n<td>4 & 5-room apartments</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Total Land Size</td>\r\n<td>3.5 acres</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Handover</td>\r\n<td>To be confirmed</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Location</td>\r\n<td>Gulshan-e-Iqbal, near Mosamiyat, Karachi</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Payment Plan</td>\r\n<td>On easy installments</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Lifestyle</td>\r\n<td>Gated community</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<h2>Master Plan and Development Framework</h2>\r\n<p>Saima Shield Towers Saima Builders is planned as a multi-tower gated community rather than a single apartment block, with a master plan that separates the residential towers, parking, and an internal commercial zone for everyday shopping.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The framework reflects an attempt to give residents a complete community inside the boundary: properly planned parking, community spaces where residents can hold a function without renting an outside venue, and towers arranged for privacy, natural ventilation, and efficient space use. The Saima Shield Towers floor plan follows this approach, with separate living and dining areas, spacious bedrooms, modern kitchens, and well-planned bathrooms in each layout.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Unit Types: 4 & 5-Room Apartments</h2>\r\n<p>For buyers searching for apartments for sale Saima Shield Towers or flats for sale Shield Towers Karachi, Saima Shield Towers Karachi offers family layouts in two categories.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>4-Room Apartments in Saima Shield Towers</h3>\r\n<p>The 4-room apartments (Types B and B1) in Saima Shield Towers include 2 bedrooms and 3 bathrooms, making them suitable for small families and professionals who want a modern layout in Gulshan-e-Iqbal at the project\'s more accessible price point.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>5-Room Apartments in Saima Shield Towers</h3>\r\n<p>The 5-room apartments (Types A and A1) in Saima Shield Towers feature 3 bedrooms and 4 bathrooms, providing additional space for larger families who need the extra room without leaving the neighbourhood.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Floor Plan</h2>\r\n<p>A floor plan for each apartment type is available through the developer\'s authorised sales channel. Buyers seeking a Saima Shield Towers apartment price or a Saima Shield Towers floor plan should request the unit schedule alongside the floor plan from the authorised sales channel, as secondary listings are often incomplete.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Price and Booking Status</h2>\r\n<p>The Saima Shield Towers price varies depending on unit type, size, and floor, and is disclosed through the developer\'s authorised sales channel. The Saima Shield Towers payment plan is structured to accommodate various buyer profiles, with flexible instalment options available on request.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>A Saima Shield Towers booking is processed through the developer\'s sales team, and the Shield Towers Karachi booking amount should be confirmed in writing alongside the Saima Shield Towers payment plan. The practical route to buy flat in Saima Shield Towers Karachi is to register interest directly with Saima Builders or its designated sales partners and obtain the current Saima Shield Towers apartment price before booking.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Saima Shield Towers Saima Builders buyers should also confirm whether Saima Shield Towers apartments on installments are being offered through a priority allocation system or on a first-come, first-served basis.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>NOC and Approval Status</h2>\r\n<p>Saima Shield Towers Saima Builders buyers should ask for the actual NOC before paying anything, not a verbal assurance, but the document and reference number that can be verified independently with the relevant authority.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Approval status and reference details can be updated as a project moves through different phases of construction, so whatever a buyer is told should be current, not something carried over from an older listing.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Possession Timeline</h2>\r\n<p>A formal possession date for Saima Shield Towers has not been announced as a single project-wide date, and the project is under construction, so handover is expected to be phased by tower. Buyers should secure a documented possession schedule at the point of Saima Shield Towers booking, and Saima Shield Towers Saima Builders possession timelines should be confirmed in writing with the developer.</p>', 1, 1, 1, 44, 1, 'publish', 'Saima Shield Towers Karachi | Prices & Payment Plan', 'Saima Shield Towers in Gulshan-e-Iqbal, Karachi, near Mosamiyat. View apartment details, prices and payment plan. Contact us to book your unit today!', 'Saima Shield Towers Karachi, Saima Shield Towers, Saima Shield Towers Saima Builders', '/images/projects/1793356699_featured-saima-shield-towers-1536x1075.jpg', '2026-10-30 10:38:19', '2026-11-10 10:15:12'),
(93, 'Saima Ace Residency', 'saima-ace-residency', '<p>At its core, Saima Ace Residency Saima Builders is positioned as a luxury residential apartment project within Saima Builders residential projects Karachi. Official project documentation, like the brochure, floor plans, and price schedule, has not been published yet, so this page sets out what is known, what is still to be confirmed, and how buyers should approach a pre-launch project of this kind.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Among high-rise apartments Karachi buyers research, new announcements from established developers attract early interest because launch-stage buyers usually get the widest unit choice. Saima Ace Residency apartments sits in that category: a name to register interest in early, while keeping every commitment conditional on the official documents. It should not be confused with gated community apartments Karachi listings for other Saima projects, and it is a separate project from Saima Ace Avenue in Scheme 33.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Key Project Highlights</h2>\r\n<table>\r\n<tbody><tr>\r\n<th>Feature</th>\r\n<th>Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Developer</td>\r\n<td>Saima Builders</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Property Type</td>\r\n<td>Residential</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Unit Types</td>\r\n<td>Apartments (mix to be confirmed)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Total Land Size</td>\r\n<td>Not publicly disclosed</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Handover</td>\r\n<td>To be confirmed</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Location</td>\r\n<td>Karachi (exact location to be confirmed)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Payment Plan</td>\r\n<td>On easy installments</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Lifestyle</td>\r\n<td>Family living</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<h2>Master Plan and Development Framework</h2>\r\n<p>A detailed master plan for Saima Ace Residency apartments has not been published yet. Based on the developer\'s other residential projects, the plan is expected to organise apartment towers with parking and shared facilities, but the confirmed layout will only be available with the official brochure.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Buyers should request the approved master plan and the Saima Ace Residency floor plan together when they are released, and check that the unit they are offered matches the approved layout before paying a booking amount.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Unit Types: Luxury Apartments</h2>\r\n<p>For buyers searching for apartments for sale Saima Ace Residency Karachi or flats for sale Saima Ace Residency Karachi, the confirmed unit mix is still to be published, and the categories below reflect the project\'s announced positioning.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Apartments in Saima Ace Residency</h3>\r\n<p>Saima Ace Residency apartments is planned as an apartment project, and the marketed positioning is luxury apartments Saima Ace Residency within the developer\'s Karachi portfolio. The confirmed unit categories and sizes will be published with the official brochure.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>New Apartments in Saima Ace Residency Karachi</h3>\r\n<p>As new apartments Saima Ace Residency Karachi are released at launch, early buyers typically get the widest choice of floors and orientations. Buyers should compare the released floor plans carefully rather than booking from pre-launch descriptions.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Floor Plan</h2>\r\n<p>The official Saima Ace Residency floor plan has not been released yet. Buyers seeking a Saima Ace Residency apartment price or floor plan should register with the authorised sales channel and request the documents as soon as they are published.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Price and Booking Status</h2>\r\n<p>The Saima Ace Residency apartments price has not been officially released, and any figures circulating in third-party listings should be treated as unverified. Confirmed pricing will be disclosed through the developer\'s authorised sales channel at launch.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>A Saima Ace Residency booking should only be processed through the developer\'s authorised sales team once official documentation is available, and the Saima Ace Residency booking amount should be confirmed in writing alongside the Saima Ace Residency payment plan. The practical route to buy flat in Saima Ace Residency Karachi is to register interest now and complete the booking when the official Saima Ace Residency apartment price is published.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Saima Ace Residency apartments buyers should also confirm whether Saima Ace Residency apartments on installments will be offered through a priority allocation system or on a first-come, first-served basis at launch.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>NOC and Approval Status</h2>\r\n<p>Saima Ace Residency Saima Builders buyers should verify the project-specific approvals directly with the developer or the relevant authority once the documentation is released, and should not book on the basis of a portfolio-level claim.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Regulations shift and documentation gets updated, so approval status should be confirmed as current at the time of booking rather than assumed from an announcement.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Possession Timeline</h2>\r\n<p>A formal possession date for Saima Ace Residency apartments has not been announced. Buyers should secure a documented possession schedule at the point of Saima Ace Residency booking once the project is formally launched, and confirm Saima Ace Residency Saima Builders possession timelines in writing with the developer.</p>', 1, 1, 0, 45, 1, 'publish', 'Saima Ace Residency Karachi | Scheme 33 Apartments', 'Saima Ace Residency in Scheme 33, Karachi. Explore apartment details, prices and payment plan. Get the latest project information and book today!', 'Saima Ace Residency Karachi, Saima Ace Residency, Saima Group Karachi, Saima apartments Karachi', '/images/projects/1793357558_cover-1791555223695.webp', '2026-10-30 10:52:38', '2026-11-10 10:14:58');
