(94, 'Indus Chowrangi', 'indus-chowrangi', '<p class=\"saimaIntroP\">A premier benchmark for luxury waterfront living, seamlessly blending contemporary architectural elegance with a tranquil coastal sanctuary. Residents enjoy fresh sea breezes, private beach access, and immediate connectivity to key metropolitan hubs.</p>\r\n<p class=\"saimaIntroP\">Located along prestigious shoreline corridors, the community offers an inspired lifestyle for professionals, investors, and families seeking refined island elegance away from urban congestion.</p>\r\n<p class=\"saimaIntroP\">Every residence offers a harmonious blend of sophistication, security, and long-term capital appreciation, presenting an extraordinary investment opportunity in one of the most coveted coastal addresses.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>About the Developers</h2>\r\n<p>Crafted by premier developers renowned for shaping iconic waterfront communities across the region for decades. Buyers and international investors benefit from a celebrated track record of timely delivery, construction excellence, and sustainable urban design.</p>\r\n<p>Working alongside leading international architectural consultants and market advisory firms, every aspect of the project is engineered to global standards of prestige and durability.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Approvals &amp; Clearances</h2>\r\n<p>The project holds full regulatory clearance and title approvals from all relevant municipal and developmental authorities. Complying strictly with environmental and structural guidelines, purchasers can invest with absolute peace of mind and secure freehold ownership.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Prime Location &amp; Seamless Connectivity</h2>\r\n<p>Set within a scenic coastal landscape, the project offers rapid access to international airports, commercial business districts, premier private schools, and luxury retail destinations.</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/TOC1.png\" alt=\"Strategic Location &amp; Connectivity Map\" style=\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); width: 100%; margin: 15px 0;\"></p>\r\n<p>Surrounded by protected green reserves and pristine waters, residents wake up to panoramic coastal vistas and unpolluted air throughout the year.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Architectural Excellence &amp; Floor Plans</h2>\r\n<p>The layouts focus on space efficiency, panoramic natural lighting, and seamless indoor-outdoor living with spacious private terraces and balconies.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Curated Residences &amp; Layout Types</h3>\r\n<p><img src=\"/TOC2.png\" alt=\"Luxury Layout Plan - Type C\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\"></p>\r\n<p>Featuring open-plan living rooms, floor-to-ceiling double-glazed windows, designer show kitchens, and lavish en-suite master bedrooms designed for modern family living.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img src=\"/TOC3.png\" alt=\"Executive Layout Plan - Type B\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\"></p>\r\n<p>Expansive terraces provide seamless entertaining spaces overlooking lush landscaped courtyards and the sparkling coastline.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img src=\"/TOC4.png\" alt=\"Presidential Villa Layout Plan - Type A\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\"></p>\r\n<p>Generous multi-level accommodations including private elevators, maid\'s quarters, private swimming pools, and dedicated family lounges.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Master Plan &amp; Community Lifestyle</h2>\r\n<p>The community master plan establishes a secure, private, and walkable residential haven. Dedicated subterranean parking ensures pedestrian safety across surface walkways, cycling trails, and waterfront boardwalks.</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/TOC8.png\" alt=\"Community Master Plan Overview\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\"></p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Flexible Investment &amp; Payment Plan</h2>\r\n<p>A buyer-friendly, construction-linked payment structure is offered with flexible milestones, making property acquisition straightforward and stress-free.</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/TOC12.png\" alt=\"Milestone Payment Structure\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\"></p>\r\n\r\n<h2>World-Class Facilities &amp; Amenities</h2>\r\n<p>Enjoy infinity swimming pools, state-of-the-art fitness centres, private beach cabanas, children\'s play areas, multi-sport courts, and fine-dining waterfront restaurants just steps from your front door.</p>', 1, 1, 0, 46, 1, 'publish', 'Indus Chowrangi Karachi Properties | Luxury Investment & Community Guide', 'Explore luxury waterfront homes, real estate, and investment projects in Indus Chowrangi, Karachi.', 'Indus Chowrangi, real estate in Indus Chowrangi, properties for sale in Indus Chowrangi', '/images/hero/slide-1.jpg', '2026-10-30 11:05:47', '2026-10-30 11:05:47'),
(95, 'Saima Business Park', 'saima-business-park', '<p>At its core, Saima Business Park Korangi Township is a commercial project built for the Korangi economy: offices for the firms that run the industrial area, and shops for the traders who serve it. Unlike a high-street plaza, a business park format groups the units in one planned development with organised access and parking, which matters in a district where commercial space is usually scattered and improvised.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Among Korangi commercial projects Karachi, Saima Business Park Korangi Township stands out for carrying an established developer\'s name into a district dominated by industrial plots and older commercial buildings. As business parks in Karachi are still relatively few, a purpose-planned scheme in Korangi Township offices territory gives both end-users and investors a clearer product to evaluate among commercial hubs Karachi.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Key Project Highlights</h2>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n<tbody><tr>\r\n<th>Feature</th>\r\n<th>Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Developer</td>\r\n<td>Saima Builders</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Property Type</td>\r\n<td>Commercial</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Unit Types</td>\r\n<td>Offices and shops</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Total Land Size</td>\r\n<td>Not disclosed</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Handover</td>\r\n<td>To be confirmed</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Location</td>\r\n<td>Korangi Township, near Singer Chowrangi, Karachi</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Payment Plan</td>\r\n<td>On Easy Installments</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Lifestyle</td>\r\n<td>Business hub</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<h2>Master Plan and Development Framework</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Saima Business Park Korangi Karachi is planned as a commercial development rather than a single building, with a master plan that organises office and shop units, parking, and internal access for business traffic.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The framework reflects the needs of an industrial district: practical unit layouts, room for loading and customer parking, and a layout that separates office activity from retail frontage where the plan allows. The Saima Business Park floor plan should be reviewed unit by unit, as sizes and frontage differ across the scheme.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Unit Types: Offices and Shops</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>For buyers searching for offices for sale Korangi Karachi, shops for sale Korangi Karachi, or commercial property Korangi Township Karachi, Saima Business Park Korangi Township offers commercial units in two categories.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Offices in Saima Business Park</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>The offices in Saima Business Park Korangi Karachi suit the firms that operate in and around the Korangi Industrial Area, including traders, service providers, and company offices that need a planned business address in the district rather than a converted residential unit.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Shops in Saima Business Park</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>The shops in Saima Business Park are aimed at retailers serving the township\'s large residential and workforce population, with frontage units positioned for passing trade within the scheme.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>A floor plan for each unit category is available through the developer\'s authorised sales channel.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Floor Plan</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Buyers seeking a Saima Business Park floor plan should request the unit schedule alongside the floor plan from the authorised sales channel, as secondary listings are often incomplete.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Price and Booking Status</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>The Saima Business Park price varies depending on unit type, size, and floor, and is disclosed through the developer\'s authorised sales channel. Shops with main frontage usually carry a premium over internal units, while offices are priced by size and floor. The Saima Business Park Korangi Township payment plan is structured to accommodate various buyer profiles, with flexible instalment options available on request.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>A Saima Business Park booking is processed through the developer\'s sales team, and the booking amount should be confirmed in writing alongside the Saima Business Park payment plan. Buyers should request the Saima Business Park office price per sqft for their preferred unit, and the practical route to an office for sale Saima Business Park Korangi is to register interest directly with Saima Builders or its designated sales partners.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Saima Business Park Karachi buyers should also confirm whether a commercial office on installments Korangi Karachi at this project is being offered through a priority allocation system or on a first-come, first-served basis.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>NOC and Approval Status</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Saima Business Park Korangi Karachi buyers should verify the project-specific approvals directly with the developer or the relevant authority before booking, as NOC status applies to the individual project and its phases.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Regulations shift and documentation gets updated, so a status reported earlier should be re-confirmed at the time of booking rather than assumed to still apply.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Possession Timeline</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>A formal possession date for Saima Business Park has not been announced as a single project-wide date, and handover in a commercial scheme of this type is normally phased. Buyers should secure a documented possession schedule at the point of Saima Business Park booking, and Saima Business Park Korangi Township possession timelines should be confirmed in writing with the developer.</p>', 1, 1, 0, 47, 1, 'publish', 'Saima Business Park Karachi | Offices Price & Payment Plan', 'Saima Business Park in Korangi Township, Karachi, near Singer Chowrangi. Find office spaces, prices and payment plan. Contact us to book your space!', 'Saima Business Park Karachi, Saima Business Park Korangi, Saima Business Park Korangi Township, Saima Builders commercial project', '/images/projects/1793358386_images-2.webp', '2026-10-30 11:06:26', '2026-11-10 10:14:22'),
(96, 'Saima Jinnah Mall and Residence', 'saima-jinnah-mall-and-residence', '<p>At its core, Saima Jinnah Mall Main Jinnah Avenue is a mixed-use project: a retail mall component with shops and showrooms, and residential apartments above it, in one development on Main Jinnah Avenue. That structure sets Saima Jinnah Mall Main Jinnah Avenue apart from the purely residential Saima projects — a single buyer can choose between a shop, an apartment, or eventually both, all within the same building.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Among mixed-use developments Karachi, this project is positioned for the Jinnah Avenue corridor\'s growth: as Scheme 33 and the surrounding population keep expanding, main-road retail with a residential catchment above it has a built-in customer base. Within opposite Malir Cantt projects, Saima Jinnah Mall Main Jinnah Avenue mall-plus-residence format is the differentiator, and it is regularly compared with other Scheme 33 Jinnah Avenue projects by both families and shop investors.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Key Project Highlights</h2>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n<tbody><tr>\r\n<th>Feature</th>\r\n<th>Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Developer</td>\r\n<td>Saima Builders</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Property Type</td>\r\n<td>Mixed-use</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Unit Types</td>\r\n<td>3 & 4-bed apartments, shops and showrooms</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Total Land Size</td>\r\n<td>4.4 acres</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Handover</td>\r\n<td>To be confirmed</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Location</td>\r\n<td>Main Jinnah Avenue, opposite Malir Cantt Checkpost 5, Karachi</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Payment Plan</td>\r\n<td>On Easy Installments</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Lifestyle</td>\r\n<td>Mixed-use living</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<h2>Master Plan and Development Framework</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Saima Jinnah Mall Malir Karachi and Residence is planned as a mixed-use development, with a master plan that separates the retail mall floors from the residential floors above while sharing access, parking, and services within one scheme.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The framework reflects how such projects work in practice: retail activity concentrated at the lower levels where footfall is natural, and residences placed above with their own lift access and privacy. The Saima Jinnah Mall and Residence floor plan should be reviewed separately for shop and apartment units, as sizes and frontage differ sharply between the two.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Unit Types: Apartments, Shops and Showrooms</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>For buyers searching for shops for sale Main Jinnah Avenue Karachi, a 3 bed apartment Main Jinnah Avenue Karachi, or a 4 bed apartment Main Jinnah Avenue Karachi, Saima Jinnah Mall and Residence Karachi offers mixed-use units in three categories.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>3-Bedroom Apartments in Saima Jinnah Mall and Residence</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>The 3-bed apartments (5-room layouts) in Saima Jinnah Mall and Residence suit families who want a main-avenue address with shopping downstairs, in the Malir–Scheme 33 corridor.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>4-Bedroom Apartments in Saima Jinnah Mall and Residence</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>The 4-bed apartments (6-room layouts) in Saima Jinnah Mall Main Jinnah Avenue are the project\'s larger residences, aimed at bigger families who need the extra room in the same mixed-use setting.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Shops and Showrooms in Saima Jinnah Mall and Residence</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>The retail component offers shops and showrooms within the mall, aimed at traders and brands serving the Jinnah Avenue traffic and the project\'s own residents — the mall shops for sale Karachi category within this development.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Floor Plan</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>A floor plan for each unit category is available through the developer\'s authorised sales channel. Buyers seeking a Saima Jinnah Mall and Residence price or floor plan should request the unit schedule alongside the floor plan from the authorised sales channel, as secondary listings are often incomplete.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Price and Booking Status</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>The Saima Jinnah Mall and Residence price varies depending on unit type, size, and floor, and is disclosed through the developer\'s authorised sales channel. Mall shops with main-road frontage usually carry a premium, while apartment pricing follows size and floor. The Saima Jinnah Mall and Residence payment plan is structured to accommodate various buyer profiles, with flexible instalment options available on request.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>A Saima Jinnah Mall and Residence booking is processed through the developer\'s sales team, and the Saima Jinnah Mall booking amount should be confirmed in writing alongside the payment plan. Buyers comparing the shop for sale Saima Jinnah Mall price, 3 bed apartment Saima Jinnah Mall price, and 4 bed apartment Saima Jinnah Mall price should request all three schedules together to compare total payable.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Saima Jinnah Mall and Residence Karachi buyers should also confirm whether units in this mixed-use project Main Jinnah Avenue Karachi are being offered through a priority allocation system or on a first-come, first-served basis.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>NOC and Approval Status</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Saima Jinnah Mall Main Jinnah Avenue buyers should verify the project-specific approvals directly with the developer or the relevant authority before booking, as NOC status applies to the individual project and, in mixed-use schemes, can differ between the commercial and residential components.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Regulations shift and documentation gets updated, so a status reported earlier should be re-confirmed at the time of booking rather than assumed to still apply.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Possession Timeline</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>A formal possession date for Saima Jinnah Mall Malir Karachi and Residence has not been announced as a single project-wide date, and handover in a mixed-use project is normally phased between the retail and residential components. Buyers should secure a documented possession schedule at the point of Saima Jinnah Mall and Residence booking, confirmed in writing with the developer.</p>', 1, 1, 0, 48, 1, 'publish', 'Saima Jinnah Mall & Residence Karachi | Price & Payment Plan', 'Saima Jinnah Mall and Residence on Main Jinnah Avenue, Karachi. Explore apartments, shops, prices and payment plans. Contact us for booking today!', 'Saima Jinnah Mall and Residence, Saima Jinnah Mall Karachi, Saima Jinnah Mall Main Jinnah Avenue, Saima Jinnah Mall Malir', '/images/projects/1793359337_asset-5.png', '2026-10-30 11:22:17', '2026-11-10 10:14:07'),
(97, 'Saima Center Point', 'saima-center-point', '<p>At its core, Saima Center Point M.A. Jinnah Road is a central-city apartment project: instead of a suburban scheme, it places 2-bed, 3-bed, and 4-bed apartments on the road that runs through the middle of Karachi\'s oldest commercial district. That positioning is the whole story — new residential supply in Saddar is rare because land here is built up and expensive, so a developer-backed project on this corridor serves a demand that mostly relies on old buildings and resale flats.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Among Saddar Karachi luxury projects and central Karachi apartments generally, Saima Center Point Saddar Karachi competes on address rather than sprawl: established markets, hospitals, schools, and transport are already around it, and rental demand in Saddar does not depend on a new neighbourhood developing. It is one of the few Saima Builders projects aimed squarely at the old-city buyer.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Key Project Highlights</h2>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n<tbody><tr>\r\n<th>Feature</th>\r\n<th>Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Developer</td>\r\n<td>Saima Builders</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Property Type</td>\r\n<td>Residential</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Unit Types</td>\r\n<td>2, 3 & 4-bed apartments</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Total Land Size</td>\r\n<td>11-15 acres</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Handover</td>\r\n<td>To be confirmed</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Location</td>\r\n<td>Main M.A. Jinnah Road, near Saddar, Karachi</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Payment Plan</td>\r\n<td>On Easy Installments</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Lifestyle</td>\r\n<td>Central city living</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<h2>Master Plan and Development Framework</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Saima Center Point is planned as a high-rise residential development on a central-city plot, with a master plan that has to balance apartment floors, parking, and services on a constrained Saddar site rather than a large suburban layout.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The framework reflects that constraint: vertical planning, lift-served floors, and organised parking instead of open sprawl. The Saima Center Point floor plan keeps family living spaces practical within city-centre plot sizes, and buyers should review the plan for their specific unit type before booking.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Unit Types: 2, 3 & 4-Bedroom Apartments</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>For buyers searching for a 2 bed apartment M.A. Jinnah Road Karachi, 3 bed apartment M.A. Jinnah Road Karachi, or 4 bed apartment M.A. Jinnah Road Karachi, Saima Center Point Karachi offers central-city layouts in three categories.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>2-Bedroom Apartments in Saima Center Point</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>The 2-bed apartments in Saima Center Point M.A. Jinnah Road suit small families and professionals who work in Saddar or the old city and want a central address at the project\'s most accessible price point.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>3-Bedroom Apartments in Saima Center Point</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>The 3-bed apartments in Saima Center Point M.A. Jinnah Road suit growing families who need an extra bedroom while keeping a central location, and they are typically the most balanced option in the project\'s mix.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>4-Bedroom Apartments in Saima Center Point</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>The 4-bed apartments in Saima Center Point M.A. Jinnah Road are the project\'s largest layouts, aimed at joint families and buyers who want maximum space in the centre of the city.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Floor Plan</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>A floor plan for each apartment type is available through the developer\'s authorised sales channel. Buyers seeking a Saima Center Point Saddar Karachi price or floor plan should request the unit schedule alongside the floor plan from the authorised sales channel, as secondary listings are often incomplete.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Price and Booking Status</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>The Saima Center Point price varies depending on unit type, size, and floor, and is disclosed through the developer\'s authorised sales channel. The Saima Center Point M.A. Jinnah Road payment plan is structured to accommodate various buyer profiles, with flexible instalment options available on request.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>A Saima Center Point booking is processed through the developer\'s sales team, and the Saima Center Point booking amount should be confirmed in writing alongside the Saima Center Point payment plan. Buyers comparing the 2 bed apartment Saima Center Point price, 3 bed apartment price, and 4 bed apartment Saima Center Point price should request all three schedules together to compare total payable.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Saima Center Point Karachi buyers should also confirm whether units in this project are being offered through a priority allocation system or on a first-come, first-served basis.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>NOC and Approval Status</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Saima Center Point Saddar Karachi buyers should verify the project-specific approvals directly with the developer or the relevant authority before booking, as NOC status applies to the individual project.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Regulations shift and documentation gets updated, so a status reported earlier should be re-confirmed at the time of booking rather than assumed to still apply.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Possession Timeline</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>A formal possession date for Saima Center Point has not been announced as a single project-wide date. Buyers should secure a documented possession schedule at the point of Saima Center Point booking, and Saima Center Point M.A. Jinnah Road Karachi possession timelines should be confirmed in writing with the developer.</p>', 1, 1, 1, 49, 1, 'publish', 'Saima Center Point Karachi | 2, 3 & 4-Bed Apartments', 'Saima Center Point on M.A. Jinnah Road, near Saddar, Karachi. View 2, 3 and 4-bedroom apartments, prices and payment plan. Book your apartment today!', 'Saima Center Point Saddar, Saima Center Point M.A. Jinnah Road, Saima Center Point apartments', '/images/projects/1793360461_scp1.jpg', '2026-10-30 11:41:01', '2026-11-10 10:13:43'),
(98, 'Main Shahra-e-Faisal', 'main-shahra-e-faisal', '<p class=\"saimaIntroP\">A premier benchmark for luxury waterfront living, seamlessly blending contemporary architectural elegance with a tranquil coastal sanctuary. Residents enjoy fresh sea breezes, private beach access, and immediate connectivity to key metropolitan hubs.</p>\r\n<p class=\"saimaIntroP\">Located along prestigious shoreline corridors, the community offers an inspired lifestyle for professionals, investors, and families seeking refined island elegance away from urban congestion.</p>\r\n<p class=\"saimaIntroP\">Every residence offers a harmonious blend of sophistication, security, and long-term capital appreciation, presenting an extraordinary investment opportunity in one of the most coveted coastal addresses.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>About the Developers</h2>\r\n<p>Crafted by premier developers renowned for shaping iconic waterfront communities across the region for decades. Buyers and international investors benefit from a celebrated track record of timely delivery, construction excellence, and sustainable urban design.</p>\r\n<p>Working alongside leading international architectural consultants and market advisory firms, every aspect of the project is engineered to global standards of prestige and durability.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Approvals &amp; Clearances</h2>\r\n<p>The project holds full regulatory clearance and title approvals from all relevant municipal and developmental authorities. Complying strictly with environmental and structural guidelines, purchasers can invest with absolute peace of mind and secure freehold ownership.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Prime Location &amp; Seamless Connectivity</h2>\r\n<p>Set within a scenic coastal landscape, the project offers rapid access to international airports, commercial business districts, premier private schools, and luxury retail destinations.</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/TOC1.png\" alt=\"Strategic Location &amp; Connectivity Map\" style=\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); width: 100%; margin: 15px 0;\"></p>\r\n<p>Surrounded by protected green reserves and pristine waters, residents wake up to panoramic coastal vistas and unpolluted air throughout the year.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Architectural Excellence &amp; Floor Plans</h2>\r\n<p>The layouts focus on space efficiency, panoramic natural lighting, and seamless indoor-outdoor living with spacious private terraces and balconies.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Curated Residences &amp; Layout Types</h3>\r\n<p><img src=\"/TOC2.png\" alt=\"Luxury Layout Plan - Type C\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\"></p>\r\n<p>Featuring open-plan living rooms, floor-to-ceiling double-glazed windows, designer show kitchens, and lavish en-suite master bedrooms designed for modern family living.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img src=\"/TOC3.png\" alt=\"Executive Layout Plan - Type B\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\"></p>\r\n<p>Expansive terraces provide seamless entertaining spaces overlooking lush landscaped courtyards and the sparkling coastline.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img src=\"/TOC4.png\" alt=\"Presidential Villa Layout Plan - Type A\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\"></p>\r\n<p>Generous multi-level accommodations including private elevators, maid\'s quarters, private swimming pools, and dedicated family lounges.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Master Plan &amp; Community Lifestyle</h2>\r\n<p>The community master plan establishes a secure, private, and walkable residential haven. Dedicated subterranean parking ensures pedestrian safety across surface walkways, cycling trails, and waterfront boardwalks.</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/TOC8.png\" alt=\"Community Master Plan Overview\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\"></p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Flexible Investment &amp; Payment Plan</h2>\r\n<p>A buyer-friendly, construction-linked payment structure is offered with flexible milestones, making property acquisition straightforward and stress-free.</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/TOC12.png\" alt=\"Milestone Payment Structure\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\"></p>\r\n\r\n<h2>World-Class Facilities &amp; Amenities</h2>\r\n<p>Enjoy infinity swimming pools, state-of-the-art fitness centres, private beach cabanas, children\'s play areas, multi-sport courts, and fine-dining waterfront restaurants just steps from your front door.</p>', 1, 1, 0, 50, 1, 'publish', 'Main Shahra-e-Faisal Karachi Properties | Luxury Investment & Community Guide', 'Explore luxury waterfront homes, real estate, and investment projects in Main Shahra-e-Faisal, Karachi.', 'Main Shahra-e-Faisal, real estate in Main Shahra-e-Faisal, properties for sale in Main Shahra-e-Faisal', '/images/hero/slide-1.jpg', '2026-10-30 12:05:43', '2026-10-30 12:05:43'),
(99, 'Saima Greens', 'saima-greens', '<p>At its core, Saima Greens is a family apartment project built around greenery: more than 40% of the total project area is dedicated to landscaped parks and open green spaces, which is unusual for a site on one of Karachi\'s busiest roads. The apartments themselves are large, with 4-room, 5-room, and 6-room layouts ranging from about 1,200 to 2,300 square feet, designed for families who need more living space and greater comfort.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>This corridor of Shahrah-e-Faisal has become one of Karachi\'s fastest-growing residential and investment destinations, and Saima Greens Saima Builders is regularly shortlisted among green / gated apartments Karachi buyers compare on the airport side of the city. For family apartments Karachi searches, its combination of a main-road address and internal green space is the main draw.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Key Project Highlights</h2>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n<tbody><tr>\r\n<th>Feature</th>\r\n<th>Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Developer</td>\r\n<td>Saima Builders</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Property Type</td>\r\n<td>Residential</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Unit Types</td>\r\n<td>4, 5 & 6-room apartments</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Total Land Size</td>\r\n<td>15 acres</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Handover</td>\r\n<td>To be confirmed</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Location</td>\r\n<td>Main Shahrah-e-Faisal, near Jinnah International Airport, Karachi</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Payment Plan</td>\r\n<td>On Easy Installments</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Lifestyle</td>\r\n<td>Green living</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<h2>Master Plan and Development Framework</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Saima Greens Saima Builders is planned as a green residential community rather than a solid built-up block, with a master plan that reserves a large share of the site for landscaped parks and open spaces between the apartment buildings.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The framework reflects that green-first approach: towers arranged around open areas, community facilities placed within the scheme, and apartment layouts planned for light and ventilation. The Saima Greens floor plan keeps family living spaces generous, consistent with the project\'s larger-than-typical unit sizes.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Unit Types: 4, 5 & 6-Room Apartments</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>For buyers searching for apartments for sale Saima Greens Karachi or flats for sale Saima Greens Karachi, Saima Greens apartments Karachi offers large family layouts in three categories.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>4-Room Apartments in Saima Greens</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>The 4-room apartments in Saima Greens apartments Karachi are the project\'s entry category, offering a spacious layout for smaller families who still want the project\'s green setting and main-road location.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>5-Room Apartments in Saima Greens</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>The 5-room apartments in Saima Greens apartments Karachi suit larger families who need an additional bedroom or a flexible room, with sizes at the larger end of the project\'s range.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>6-Room Apartments in Saima Greens</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>The 6-room apartments in Saima Greens apartments Karachi are the project\'s largest residences, aimed at joint families who want maximum space within a gated, green community on Shahrah-e-Faisal.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Floor Plan</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>A floor plan for each apartment type in Saima Greens Saima Builders is available through the developer\'s authorised sales channel. Buyers seeking a Saima Greens apartment price or a Saima Greens floor plan should request the unit schedule alongside the floor plan from the authorised sales channel, as secondary listings are often incomplete.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Price and Booking Status</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>The Saima Greens price varies depending on unit type, size, and floor, and is disclosed through the developer\'s authorised sales channel. The Saima Greens payment plan is structured to accommodate various buyer profiles, with flexible instalment options available on request.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>A Saima Greens booking is processed through the developer\'s sales team, and the Saima Greens booking amount should be confirmed in writing alongside the Saima Greens apartments Karachi payment plan. The practical route to buy flat in Saima Greens Karachi is to register interest directly with Saima Builders or its designated sales partners and obtain the current Saima Greens apartment price before booking.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Saima Greens Karachi buyers should also confirm whether Saima Greens apartments on installments are being offered through a priority allocation system or on a first-come, first-served basis.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>NOC and Approval Status</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Saima Greens Saima Builders buyers should verify the project-specific approvals directly with the developer or the relevant authority before booking. Third-party pages claim approval for this project, but the current documents should be inspected rather than assumed.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Regulations shift and documentation gets updated, so a status reported earlier should be re-confirmed at the time of booking.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Possession Timeline</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>A formal possession date for Saima Greens apartments Karachi has not been announced as a single project-wide date, and the project is under construction, so handover is expected to be phased. Buyers should secure a documented possession schedule at the point of Saima Greens booking, and Saima Greens Saima Builders possession timelines should be confirmed in writing with the developer.</p>', 1, 1, 1, 51, 1, 'publish', 'Saima Greens Karachi | Apartments, Prices & Location', 'Saima Greens in Tariq Bin Ziyad Society, Shahrah-e-Faisal, Karachi. Explore 4, 5 and 6-room apartments. Check prices and book your unit today!', 'Saima Greens Karachi, Saima Greens, Saima Greens apartments, Saima Group Karachi, Saima Greens near Airport, Saima Greens Shahrah-e-Faisal, Saima Greens Faisal Cantonment', '/images/projects/1793362365_sg-15.jpg', '2026-10-30 12:12:45', '2026-11-10 10:12:32'),
(100, 'Saima Twin Tower', 'saima-twin-tower', '<p>The project is a twin-tower residential high-rise on the CDA Service Road in Capital Enclave. Among high-rise apartments in Islamabad, a twin-tower layout gives buyers a choice of studios for compact living and lounge apartments for families. For anyone reviewing Islamabad real estate projects or luxury residential projects in Islamabad, the appeal here is an expressway-corridor address and an instalment-based route to ownership, not a finished building.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The listing shows Under Construction and carries a verified badge. As a Saima Builders Islamabad project, it should be judged on its own paperwork, not on the developer’s Karachi record.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Investors weighing Saima Twin Tower Islamabad investment opportunities usually look at studios and one-bedroom apartments, but rental income and resale gains are never guaranteed. Anyone comparing apartments for investment in Islamabad should also look at finished stock, which carries less construction risk.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Key Project Highlights</h2>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n<tbody><tr>\r\n<th>Feature</th>\r\n<th>Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Developer</td>\r\n<td>Saima Group (Saima Builders)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Property Type</td>\r\n<td>Apartments</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Unit Types</td>\r\n<td>Studio, 1, 2 and 3-bed lounge apartments</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Towers</td>\r\n<td>Two</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Location</td>\r\n<td>Capital Enclave, CDA Service Road, Islamabad</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Status</td>\r\n<td>Under construction</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Handover</td>\r\n<td>Not announced</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Payment Plan</td>\r\n<td>Construction-linked; amounts to be confirmed</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<h2>Master Plan and Development Framework</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>No public master plan has been released for Saima Twin Tower Islamabad Pakistan. The listing splits the homes across two wings:</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Tower A offers studios and one- and two-bedroom lounge apartments (types B1 to B4 and C1 to C3).</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Tower B offers studios, one- and two-bedroom lounge apartments, and three-bedroom lounge apartments (Type A1).</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Because the towers are described as a pair, ask whether they share podium parking, lifts, security and maintenance charges. Listings mention gated security and ongoing professional management. Who will run the building, and how service charges will be set, should be agreed in writing before you pay.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Unit Types: Studio, 1, 2 and 3 Bed Lounge Apartments</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>For buyers searching for apartments in Saima Twin Tower Islamabad, the portal’s unit selector shows studio types S1 and S2, one-bedroom lounge types C1 to C4, two-bedroom lounge types B1 to B6 and a three-bedroom lounge Type A1. Unit areas are not public, so request them in writing.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Studio Apartments</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Studios are the compact entry option and appear in both towers. Check the usable area, kitchen layout and balcony before comparing the price per square foot.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>1 Bed Lounge Apartments</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>One-bedroom lounge types suit couples, single professionals and small investors. Ask whether the lounge is separate or combined with the dining space.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>2 Bed Lounge Apartments</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Two-bedroom lounge types come in the most variants, so compare layouts side by side. They suit small families and shared living.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>3 Bed Lounge Apartments</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>The three-bedroom lounge apartment is listed as Type A1 in Tower B. It is the family-size option, so confirm how many units exist and their covered area.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Floor Plan</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Unit-wise floor plans and unit pricing are not confirmed yet. Request the full set from Saima’s authorised sales channel, along with a unit-wise Saima Twin Tower price list and the approved building plan. Compare orientation, balcony size and lift access before choosing a floor.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Price and Booking Status</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>The Saima Twin Tower price starts from around PKR 7.85 million to PKR 8.95 million, so treat both figures as indicative. Buyers who need Saima Twin Tower Islamabad apartment prices by unit type should ask for a written price list.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>A Saima Twin Tower booking typically involves registering interest, choosing a unit, confirming the booking amount and signing written terms. Saima Twin Tower Islamabad booking details, including receipts, unit number, allocation terms and refund conditions, should be confirmed before any payment. Buyers comparing apartments for sale in Islamabad should also ask whether the Saima Twin Tower payment plan differs by tower and unit type.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>NOC and Approval Status</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>The NOC and approval status of Saima Twin Tower Islamabad Pakistan is not publicly documented by Saima. Ask for the approved building plan, the NOC with its reference number and the title documents, then confirm them directly with CDA.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Possession Timeline</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>No possession date has been announced for the project, and the listing shows Under Construction without a completion date. Secure a documented possession schedule, including delay terms, at the point of booking. Plan for a medium- to long-term investment horizon, not immediate occupancy.</p>', 1, 1, 0, 51, 1, 'publish', 'Saima Twin Tower Islamabad | Apartments Payment Plan & Price', 'Saima Twin Tower in Capital Enclave, Islamabad. View high-rise apartments, prices and payment plan details. Contact us today to book your apartment!', 'Saima Twin Tower, luxury villas, properties', '/images/projects/1793689907_hero_modern-high-rise-towers-by-the-waterfront.png', '2026-11-03 07:11:47', '2026-11-10 10:12:15'),
(101, 'North Nazimabad', 'north-nazimabad', '<p class=\"saimaIntroP\">A premier benchmark for luxury waterfront living, seamlessly blending contemporary architectural elegance with a tranquil coastal sanctuary. Residents enjoy fresh sea breezes, private beach access, and immediate connectivity to key metropolitan hubs.</p>\r\n<p class=\"saimaIntroP\">Located along prestigious shoreline corridors, the community offers an inspired lifestyle for professionals, investors, and families seeking refined island elegance away from urban congestion.</p>\r\n<p class=\"saimaIntroP\">Every residence offers a harmonious blend of sophistication, security, and long-term capital appreciation, presenting an extraordinary investment opportunity in one of the most coveted coastal addresses.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>About the Developers</h2>\r\n<p>Crafted by premier developers renowned for shaping iconic waterfront communities across the region for decades. Buyers and international investors benefit from a celebrated track record of timely delivery, construction excellence, and sustainable urban design.</p>\r\n<p>Working alongside leading international architectural consultants and market advisory firms, every aspect of the project is engineered to global standards of prestige and durability.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Approvals &amp; Clearances</h2>\r\n<p>The project holds full regulatory clearance and title approvals from all relevant municipal and developmental authorities. Complying strictly with environmental and structural guidelines, purchasers can invest with absolute peace of mind and secure freehold ownership.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Prime Location &amp; Seamless Connectivity</h2>\r\n<p>Set within a scenic coastal landscape, the project offers rapid access to international airports, commercial business districts, premier private schools, and luxury retail destinations.</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/TOC1.png\" alt=\"Strategic Location &amp; Connectivity Map\" style=\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); width: 100%; margin: 15px 0;\"></p>\r\n<p>Surrounded by protected green reserves and pristine waters, residents wake up to panoramic coastal vistas and unpolluted air throughout the year.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Architectural Excellence &amp; Floor Plans</h2>\r\n<p>The layouts focus on space efficiency, panoramic natural lighting, and seamless indoor-outdoor living with spacious private terraces and balconies.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Curated Residences &amp; Layout Types</h3>\r\n<p><img src=\"/TOC2.png\" alt=\"Luxury Layout Plan - Type C\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\"></p>\r\n<p>Featuring open-plan living rooms, floor-to-ceiling double-glazed windows, designer show kitchens, and lavish en-suite master bedrooms designed for modern family living.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img src=\"/TOC3.png\" alt=\"Executive Layout Plan - Type B\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\"></p>\r\n<p>Expansive terraces provide seamless entertaining spaces overlooking lush landscaped courtyards and the sparkling coastline.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img src=\"/TOC4.png\" alt=\"Presidential Villa Layout Plan - Type A\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\"></p>\r\n<p>Generous multi-level accommodations including private elevators, maid\'s quarters, private swimming pools, and dedicated family lounges.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Master Plan &amp; Community Lifestyle</h2>\r\n<p>The community master plan establishes a secure, private, and walkable residential haven. Dedicated subterranean parking ensures pedestrian safety across surface walkways, cycling trails, and waterfront boardwalks.</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/TOC8.png\" alt=\"Community Master Plan Overview\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\"></p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Flexible Investment &amp; Payment Plan</h2>\r\n<p>A buyer-friendly, construction-linked payment structure is offered with flexible milestones, making property acquisition straightforward and stress-free.</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/TOC12.png\" alt=\"Milestone Payment Structure\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\"></p>\r\n\r\n<h2>World-Class Facilities &amp; Amenities</h2>\r\n<p>Enjoy infinity swimming pools, state-of-the-art fitness centres, private beach cabanas, children\'s play areas, multi-sport courts, and fine-dining waterfront restaurants just steps from your front door.</p>', 1, 1, 0, 52, 1, 'publish', 'North Nazimabad Karachi Properties | Luxury Investment & Community Guide', 'Explore luxury waterfront homes, real estate, and investment projects in North Nazimabad, Karachi.', 'North Nazimabad, real estate in North Nazimabad, properties for sale in North Nazimabad', '/images/hero/slide-1.jpg', '2026-11-03 07:26:08', '2026-11-03 07:26:08');
