(102, 'Saima Premium Empire', 'saima-premium-empire', '<p>At its core, Saima Premium Empire Saima Builders is about elite apartment living in a neighbourhood that already works. North Nazimabad\'s markets, schools, hospitals, and transport links are established, so the project adds a newer high-rise with larger 4-room, 5-room, and 6-room layouts instead of asking buyers to wait for a new society\'s infrastructure to arrive.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Among premium luxury projects Karachi, Saima Premium Empire competes by offering more room than a typical mid-range flat without moving to DHA-style price territory. It sits naturally among high-rise luxury apartments Karachi and Saima Builders premium projects, with an address that is familiar to families and investors across the city.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Key Project Highlights</h2>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n<tbody><tr><th>Feature</th><th>Details</th></tr>\r\n<tr><td>Developer</td><td>Saima Builders</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>Property Type</td><td>Residential</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>Unit Types</td><td>4, 5 & 6-room luxury apartments</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>Total Land Size</td><td>2 acres</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>Handover</td><td>To be confirmed</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>Location</td><td>Block A, North Nazimabad, near Saifee Hospital, Karachi</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>Payment Plan</td><td>On Easy Installments</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>Lifestyle</td><td>Premium family living</td></tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<h2>Master Plan and Development Framework</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Saima Premium Empire Saima Builders is planned as one residential high-rise in Block A, organised around several apartment categories rather than a single repeated unit type, so buyers can choose according to family size and budget.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The framework emphasises practical movement and everyday comfort: elevators and stairwells positioned for convenient access, floors organised by apartment category, and spacious parking planned from the start. The Saima Premium Empire floor plan uses separate drawing and dining areas in the larger units, with bedrooms arranged for privacy and functional daily living.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Unit Types: 4, 5 & 6-Room Luxury Apartments</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>For buyers searching for luxury apartments Saima Premium Empire or apartments for sale Premium Empire Karachi, Saima Premium Empire Karachi offers spacious layouts in three premium categories.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>4-Room Apartments in Saima Premium Empire</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>The 4-room apartments in Saima Premium Empire Saima Builders are the entry point to the project\'s elite categories, suited to families who want a larger layout and a North Nazimabad address without moving to the largest configurations.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>5-Room Apartments in Saima Premium Empire</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>The 5-room apartments in Saima Premium Empire provide additional living space for growing families, with separate social and private areas that make daily family life more comfortable.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>6-Room Apartments in Saima Premium Empire</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>The 6-room apartments in Saima Premium Empire are the project\'s largest residences, designed for bigger and joint families who need maximum room within a secure high-rise setting.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Floor Plan</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>A floor plan for each apartment category is available through the developer\'s authorised sales channel. Buyers seeking a Saima Premium Empire apartment price or a Saima Premium Empire floor plan should request the category-specific covered area and unit schedule, as listings vary across categories and phases.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Price and Booking Status</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>The Saima Premium Empire price varies depending on room count, covered area, floor, and facing, and current pricing is disclosed through the developer\'s authorised sales channel. Older listing figures should not be treated as a current rate sheet because prices and payment structures change by category.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>A Saima Premium Empire booking is processed through the developer\'s sales team, and the booking amount should be confirmed in writing alongside the Saima Premium Empire payment plan. The practical route to buy flat in Saima Premium Empire Karachi is to register interest directly with Saima Builders or its designated sales partners and obtain the current Saima Premium Empire apartment price before booking.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Saima Premium Empire Karachi buyers should also confirm whether Premium Empire apartments on installments are being offered through a priority allocation system or on a first-come, first-served basis.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>NOC and Approval Status</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Saima Premium Empire Saima Builders buyers should verify the project-specific approvals directly with the developer or the relevant authority before booking, as NOC status applies to the individual project and its current phase.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Regulations and documentation can be updated, so any approval status reported in an older listing should be re-confirmed at the time of booking rather than assumed to still apply.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Possession Timeline</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>A formal possession date for Saima Premium Empire has not been announced as a single project-wide date, and progress can differ by category and floor. Buyers should secure a documented possession schedule at the point of Saima Premium Empire booking and confirm Saima Premium Empire Karachi possession timelines in writing with the developer.</p>', 1, 1, 0, 53, 1, 'publish', 'Saima Premium Empire Apartments Price, Payment Plan & Location', 'Saima Premium Empire in North Nazimabad, Karachi. Explore luxury apartments, prices and payment plan. Get project details and book your apartment!', 'Saima Premium Empire Karachi, Saima Premium Empire Saima Builders, Premium Empire Karachi,', NULL, '2026-11-03 07:26:44', '2026-11-10 10:11:37'),
(103, 'North Karachi', 'north-karachi', '<p class=\"saimaIntroP\">A premier benchmark for luxury waterfront living, seamlessly blending contemporary architectural elegance with a tranquil coastal sanctuary. Residents enjoy fresh sea breezes, private beach access, and immediate connectivity to key metropolitan hubs.</p>\r\n<p class=\"saimaIntroP\">Located along prestigious shoreline corridors, the community offers an inspired lifestyle for professionals, investors, and families seeking refined island elegance away from urban congestion.</p>\r\n<p class=\"saimaIntroP\">Every residence offers a harmonious blend of sophistication, security, and long-term capital appreciation, presenting an extraordinary investment opportunity in one of the most coveted coastal addresses.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>About the Developers</h2>\r\n<p>Crafted by premier developers renowned for shaping iconic waterfront communities across the region for decades. Buyers and international investors benefit from a celebrated track record of timely delivery, construction excellence, and sustainable urban design.</p>\r\n<p>Working alongside leading international architectural consultants and market advisory firms, every aspect of the project is engineered to global standards of prestige and durability.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Approvals &amp; Clearances</h2>\r\n<p>The project holds full regulatory clearance and title approvals from all relevant municipal and developmental authorities. Complying strictly with environmental and structural guidelines, purchasers can invest with absolute peace of mind and secure freehold ownership.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Prime Location &amp; Seamless Connectivity</h2>\r\n<p>Set within a scenic coastal landscape, the project offers rapid access to international airports, commercial business districts, premier private schools, and luxury retail destinations.</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/TOC1.png\" alt=\"Strategic Location &amp; Connectivity Map\" style=\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); width: 100%; margin: 15px 0;\"></p>\r\n<p>Surrounded by protected green reserves and pristine waters, residents wake up to panoramic coastal vistas and unpolluted air throughout the year.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Architectural Excellence &amp; Floor Plans</h2>\r\n<p>The layouts focus on space efficiency, panoramic natural lighting, and seamless indoor-outdoor living with spacious private terraces and balconies.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Curated Residences &amp; Layout Types</h3>\r\n<p><img src=\"/TOC2.png\" alt=\"Luxury Layout Plan - Type C\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\"></p>\r\n<p>Featuring open-plan living rooms, floor-to-ceiling double-glazed windows, designer show kitchens, and lavish en-suite master bedrooms designed for modern family living.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img src=\"/TOC3.png\" alt=\"Executive Layout Plan - Type B\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\"></p>\r\n<p>Expansive terraces provide seamless entertaining spaces overlooking lush landscaped courtyards and the sparkling coastline.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img src=\"/TOC4.png\" alt=\"Presidential Villa Layout Plan - Type A\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\"></p>\r\n<p>Generous multi-level accommodations including private elevators, maid\'s quarters, private swimming pools, and dedicated family lounges.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Master Plan &amp; Community Lifestyle</h2>\r\n<p>The community master plan establishes a secure, private, and walkable residential haven. Dedicated subterranean parking ensures pedestrian safety across surface walkways, cycling trails, and waterfront boardwalks.</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/TOC8.png\" alt=\"Community Master Plan Overview\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\"></p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Flexible Investment &amp; Payment Plan</h2>\r\n<p>A buyer-friendly, construction-linked payment structure is offered with flexible milestones, making property acquisition straightforward and stress-free.</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/TOC12.png\" alt=\"Milestone Payment Structure\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\"></p>\r\n\r\n<h2>World-Class Facilities &amp; Amenities</h2>\r\n<p>Enjoy infinity swimming pools, state-of-the-art fitness centres, private beach cabanas, children\'s play areas, multi-sport courts, and fine-dining waterfront restaurants just steps from your front door.</p>', 1, 1, 0, 54, 1, 'publish', 'North Karachi Karachi Properties | Luxury Investment & Community Guide', 'Explore luxury waterfront homes, real estate, and investment projects in North Karachi, Karachi.', 'North Karachi, real estate in North Karachi, properties for sale in North Karachi', '/images/hero/slide-1.jpg', '2026-11-03 07:53:18', '2026-11-03 07:53:18'),
(104, 'Saima Arabian Villas', 'saima-arabian-villas', '<p>At its core, Saima Arabian Villas is a villa-based housing society, not an apartment project, and that distinction matters: buyers get ground-level, single-family living with their own boundary wall and their own piece of land, in houses that can be renovated or extended later. The most common options are 120 sq. yd. and 160 sq. yd. houses for small and medium-sized families, with a 240 sq. yd. option for buyers who want more room.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Among villas in Karachi, this society stands out for its longevity: it has been around long enough to have a real resale and rental market, not just pre-launch bookings, and its listings circulate constantly on the major portals. Within gated villa communities Karachi, its Arabian style villas Karachi identity and its position in the North Karachi belt keep it on the shortlist of families who want a house rather than a flat.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Key Project Highlights</h2>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n<tbody><tr>\r\n<th>Feature</th>\r\n<th>Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Developer</td>\r\n<td>Saima Builders</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Property Type</td>\r\n<td>Residential</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Unit Types</td>\r\n<td>Villas and residential plots</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Total Land Size</td>\r\n<td>100 acres</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Handover</td>\r\n<td>Ready in developed blocks</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Location</td>\r\n<td>Sector 5-A, Gadap Town, North Karachi, near 4K Chowrangi</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Payment Plan</td>\r\n<td>Cash / limited installments</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Lifestyle</td>\r\n<td>Gated villa community</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<h2>Master Plan and Development Framework</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Saima Arabian Villas Saima Builders is structured into multiple blocks, Block A through Block H, with different unit types across the blocks, and a master plan that connects each block through internal roads back to the main access route near 4K Chowrangi.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The society includes well-maintained wide roads, lush green parks distributed through the community, a designated commercial stretch for everyday shopping, and community facilities including a Jamia Mosque and a playground. Which block a buyer chooses genuinely affects resale value and day-to-day convenience, so the block layout should be understood before committing to a specific unit.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Unit Types: Villas and Residential Plots</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>For buyers searching for villas for sale Karachi, Arabian villas for sale Karachi, or luxury villas Karachi, Saima Arabian Villas Saima Builders offers ground-level options in four categories.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>120 Sq. Yd. Villas in Saima Arabian Villas</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>The 120 sq. yd. villas are the Arabian Villas Karachi Saima society\'s most common and accessible category, with listings showing 2-bed and 4-bed houses in single-storey and ground-plus-one formats, suited to small families.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>160 Sq. Yd. Villas in Saima Arabian Villas</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>The 160 sq. yd. Villas in Arabian Villas Karachi Saima give medium-sized families more covered area and breathing room than the entry category, while staying within the society\'s established blocks.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>240 Sq. Yd. Villas in Saima Arabian Villas</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>The 240 sq. yd. villas are the Arabian Villas Karachi Saima society\'s largest standard houses, with listings showing larger 3-bed units for buyers who want maximum space in the same gated setting.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Residential Plots in Saima Arabian Villas</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Beyond built villas, Arabian Villas Karachi Saima society also includes residential plots in 120, 160, and 240 sq. yd. sizes for buyers who would rather design and construct their own house from scratch.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Floor Plan</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Villa layouts at Saima Arabian Villas North Karachi vary across Blocks A to H, with different sq yd options. Buyers seeking a villa for sale Saima Arabian Villas Karachi should confirm block, size, and payment basis with the developer\'s authorised sales channel, as listings for Saima Arabian Villas Saima Builders are often incomplete.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Price and Booking Status</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Saima Arabian Villas prices vary by size, block, position, and construction quality: corner and park-facing units carry premiums, and developed, occupied blocks price higher than those still under construction. Most figures in circulation come from resale or secondary listings, including the Arabian Villas Karachi price ranges on portals, rather than fixed developer pricing.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>A Saima Arabian Villas booking generally involves selecting the plot or house, submitting standard documentation, and paying the booking amount where applicable, with formal written confirmation from the developer or an authorised consultant. Buyers looking for a luxury villa on installments Karachi should confirm case by case whether their chosen unit carries an installment option or is cash-only.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Before paying anything, buyers should confirm the current price, payment structure, and development charges for the exact unit, as these are itemised separately and change with availability.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>NOC and Approval Status</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Saima Arabian Villas Saima Builders is stated to be an SBCA-approved housing society, which is a reassuring baseline for buyers. That said, NOC and legal documentation should still be independently checked for the specific unit and block being purchased, even though the society as a whole is approved.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Documentation and allotment status can differ between blocks and phases, so current papers for the exact plot or house should be inspected with the developer or the relevant authority before any payment.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Possession Timeline</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Possession status differs block to block at Arabian Villas Karachi Saima: some units, particularly in developed blocks, are ready for possession, while others remain tied to ongoing construction, especially in newer extensions. Buyers should confirm the possession status of their specific unit in writing at booking rather than assuming a society-wide timeline.</p>', 1, 1, 0, 55, 1, 'publish', 'Saima Arabian Villas Karachi | Villas & Plots Prices', 'Saima Arabian Villas near 4K Chowrangi, North Karachi. Find residential villas, plots, prices and payment plan details. Contact us to book today!', 'Saima Arabian Villas, luxury villas, properties', NULL, '2026-11-03 07:53:47', '2026-11-10 10:11:12'),
(105, 'Saima Arabian Ranches', 'saima-arabian-ranches', '<p>At its core, Arabian Ranches Karachi Saima is a plot phase, not a built-villa launch: the main offering is 120 sq. yd. residential plots sold on installments, inside a phase that has its own inventory and development plan while sharing the wider Arabian Villas community. That structure is the appeal, as buyers get a newer section of the society without giving up the established surroundings, occupied blocks, and facilities that already exist around it.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Among ranch communities Karachi and farmhouse projects Karachi searches, this phase appears because of its name and its open, green setting, but buyers should be clear about what is actually being sold: residential plots in a gated villa society, marketed at the premium end of that society, rather than farmhouses. Positioned among luxury ranches Karachi in name, its real value is the combination of an installment plan and an established address.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Key Project Highlights</h2>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n<tbody><tr>\r\n<th>Feature</th>\r\n<th>Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Developer</td>\r\n<td>Saima Builders</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Property Type</td>\r\n<td>Residential</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Unit Types</td>\r\n<td>120 sq. yd. plots; villas in listings</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Total Land Size</td>\r\n<td>120 sq. yd.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Handover</td>\r\n<td>Phased</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Location</td>\r\n<td>Within Saima Arabian Villas, near 4K Chowrangi, North Karachi</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Payment Plan</td>\r\n<td>Easy monthly installments</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Lifestyle</td>\r\n<td>Gated community</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<h2>Master Plan and Development Framework</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Saima Arabian Ranches functions as a dedicated block within the wider Arabian Villas master plan, which is organised around multiple sectors and blocks, with the Ranches phase following its own development plan for plots and infrastructure.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Internal roads connect the Ranches block back to the main access route near 4K Chowrangi, tying it into the same road network as the rest of the society. Green public parks, a grand mosque, a school, and small markets are part of the community framework, and roads, boundary walls, and shared facilities are being developed as part of the phase\'s rollout.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Unit Types: Plots and Villas</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>For buyers searching for ranches for sale Karachi, farmhouses / ranches Karachi, or villas / ranches Saima Arabian, Arabian Ranches Karachi Saima offers options centred on one main category.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>120 Sq. Yd. Residential Plots in Saima Arabian Ranches</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>The 120 sq. yd. plot is the Saima Arabian Ranches Saima Builders phase\'s primary offering and its accessible entry point, giving buyers the freedom to design a personalised home, choose their own materials, and customise the interior to their own vision.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Villas and Townhouses in Saima Arabian Ranches</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Alongside plots, Saima Arabian Ranches Saima Builders listings also reference elegant villas and townhouses within the wider community, and some finished or partially finished houses appear within Ranches, although plot bookings remain the more commonly available option at this stage.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Current availability should be confirmed with the developer\'s sales office, as plot inventory in the phase changes with the rollout. Buyers seeking a ranch for sale Saima Arabian Ranches Karachi should clarify whether a listing is for a Ranches-phase plot or an older Arabian Villas section before booking.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Floor Plan</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Plot layouts at Arabian Ranches Karachi Saima Karachi vary across multiple blocks, with 120 sq. yd. and other residential options available. Buyers seeking a plot or home in Saima Arabian Ranches Saima Builders should confirm block, size, and payment basis with the developer\'s authorised sales channel, as listings for Saima Arabian Ranches Karachi are often incomplete.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Price and Booking Status</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Saima Arabian Ranches plot prices vary depending on block position, orientation such as east-open, and current market conditions, and most pricing references centre on the 120 sq. yd. size. Where finished villas or houses are available within Ranches, pricing sits higher than raw plots, reflecting the construction cost.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>A Saima Arabian Ranches booking follows the standard process: select the plot, submit documentation, and pay the initial booking amount, with written confirmation from the developer or an authorised consultant. Buyers searching for a farmhouse on installments Karachi should note that the installment product here is a residential plot within a villa society, which they can later build on to their own design.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Before committing, buyers should confirm the total payable including development and possession charges, as these are separate from the base plot price and are a common source of confusion in older listings.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>NOC and Approval Status</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>According to project sources, Saima Arabian Ranches operates under the same SBCA-approved NOC as the rest of Saima Arabian Villas. Buyers should still check the legal documentation for the specific plot and block they are buying into, even though the wider society is approved.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Phase-level documentation and development status can change as the rollout progresses, so current papers should be verified with the developer or the relevant authority at the time of booking.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Possession Timeline</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Possession at Arabian Ranches Karachi Saima follows the phase\'s development rollout and completion of the installment schedule, with the final possession payment typically due before handover of the plot. Because the phase is still developing, buyers should confirm the possession timeline for their specific plot in writing at the point of Saima Arabian Ranches booking.</p>', 1, 1, 0, 56, 1, 'publish', 'Saima Arabian Ranches Karachi | 120 Sq Yd Plots Location & Prices', 'Saima Arabian Ranches near 4K Chowrangi, North Karachi. Explore 120 sq yd residential plots, prices and payment plan. Get details and book your plot!', 'Saima Arabian Ranches, luxury villas, properties', NULL, '2026-11-03 08:10:40', '2026-11-10 10:10:50'),
(106, 'Gulistan-e-Johar', 'gulistan-e-johar', '<p class=\"saimaIntroP\">A premier benchmark for luxury waterfront living, seamlessly blending contemporary architectural elegance with a tranquil coastal sanctuary. Residents enjoy fresh sea breezes, private beach access, and immediate connectivity to key metropolitan hubs.</p>\r\n<p class=\"saimaIntroP\">Located along prestigious shoreline corridors, the community offers an inspired lifestyle for professionals, investors, and families seeking refined island elegance away from urban congestion.</p>\r\n<p class=\"saimaIntroP\">Every residence offers a harmonious blend of sophistication, security, and long-term capital appreciation, presenting an extraordinary investment opportunity in one of the most coveted coastal addresses.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>About the Developers</h2>\r\n<p>Crafted by premier developers renowned for shaping iconic waterfront communities across the region for decades. Buyers and international investors benefit from a celebrated track record of timely delivery, construction excellence, and sustainable urban design.</p>\r\n<p>Working alongside leading international architectural consultants and market advisory firms, every aspect of the project is engineered to global standards of prestige and durability.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Approvals &amp; Clearances</h2>\r\n<p>The project holds full regulatory clearance and title approvals from all relevant municipal and developmental authorities. Complying strictly with environmental and structural guidelines, purchasers can invest with absolute peace of mind and secure freehold ownership.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Prime Location &amp; Seamless Connectivity</h2>\r\n<p>Set within a scenic coastal landscape, the project offers rapid access to international airports, commercial business districts, premier private schools, and luxury retail destinations.</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/TOC1.png\" alt=\"Strategic Location &amp; Connectivity Map\" style=\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); width: 100%; margin: 15px 0;\"></p>\r\n<p>Surrounded by protected green reserves and pristine waters, residents wake up to panoramic coastal vistas and unpolluted air throughout the year.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Architectural Excellence &amp; Floor Plans</h2>\r\n<p>The layouts focus on space efficiency, panoramic natural lighting, and seamless indoor-outdoor living with spacious private terraces and balconies.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Curated Residences &amp; Layout Types</h3>\r\n<p><img src=\"/TOC2.png\" alt=\"Luxury Layout Plan - Type C\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\"></p>\r\n<p>Featuring open-plan living rooms, floor-to-ceiling double-glazed windows, designer show kitchens, and lavish en-suite master bedrooms designed for modern family living.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img src=\"/TOC3.png\" alt=\"Executive Layout Plan - Type B\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\"></p>\r\n<p>Expansive terraces provide seamless entertaining spaces overlooking lush landscaped courtyards and the sparkling coastline.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img src=\"/TOC4.png\" alt=\"Presidential Villa Layout Plan - Type A\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\"></p>\r\n<p>Generous multi-level accommodations including private elevators, maid\'s quarters, private swimming pools, and dedicated family lounges.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Master Plan &amp; Community Lifestyle</h2>\r\n<p>The community master plan establishes a secure, private, and walkable residential haven. Dedicated subterranean parking ensures pedestrian safety across surface walkways, cycling trails, and waterfront boardwalks.</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/TOC8.png\" alt=\"Community Master Plan Overview\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\"></p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Flexible Investment &amp; Payment Plan</h2>\r\n<p>A buyer-friendly, construction-linked payment structure is offered with flexible milestones, making property acquisition straightforward and stress-free.</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/TOC12.png\" alt=\"Milestone Payment Structure\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\"></p>\r\n\r\n<h2>World-Class Facilities &amp; Amenities</h2>\r\n<p>Enjoy infinity swimming pools, state-of-the-art fitness centres, private beach cabanas, children\'s play areas, multi-sport courts, and fine-dining waterfront restaurants just steps from your front door.</p>', 1, 1, 0, 57, 1, 'publish', 'Gulistan-e-Johar Karachi Properties | Luxury Investment & Community Guide', 'Explore luxury waterfront homes, real estate, and investment projects in Gulistan-e-Johar, Karachi.', 'Gulistan-e-Johar, real estate in Gulistan-e-Johar, properties for sale in Gulistan-e-Johar', '/images/hero/slide-1.jpg', '2026-11-03 08:26:01', '2026-11-03 08:26:01'),
(107, 'Saima Elite Enclave', 'saima-elite-enclave', '<p>At its core, Saima Elite Enclave Gulistan-e-Johar is chasing space rather than a luxury tag: 4-room, 5-room, and 6-room apartments from about 1,108 up to 2,292 square feet, with attached baths in every bedroom, a proper drawing room kept separate from the lounge, and a terrace. That combination puts it a step above much of the mid-range apartment stock in Karachi, where everything gets squeezed into one open space. It is built for families who have been renting a house for years because no apartment ever had enough rooms.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Among Kamran Chowrangi projects and high-rise apartments Gulistan-e-Johar, Saima Elite Enclave Kamran Chowrangi is regularly shortlisted by families comparing installment-based projects in this part of the city. Within Johar Karachi luxury apartments in the spacious-family sense, its differentiator is size per rupee in an established, dense, lived-in neighbourhood rather than a suburb still figuring itself out.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Key Project Highlights</h2>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n<tbody><tr>\r\n<th>Feature</th>\r\n<th>Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Developer</td>\r\n<td>Saima Builders / ZSZ Group</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Property Type</td>\r\n<td>Residential</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Unit Types</td>\r\n<td>4, 5 & 6-room apartments</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Total Land Size</td>\r\n<td>1.75 Acres</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Handover</td>\r\n<td>Phased</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Location</td>\r\n<td>Block 11, Gulistan-e-Johar, beside Kamran Chowrangi, Karachi</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Payment Plan</td>\r\n<td>On Easy Installments</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Lifestyle</td>\r\n<td>Family living</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<h2>Master Plan and Development Framework</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Saima Elite Enclave Saima Builders is planned with towers arranged within Block 11 to balance privacy for individual units against easy access to shared amenities and parking, rather than stacking one repeated layout over and over.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Every residential floor carries the full mix of 4, 5, and 6-room units, so buyers get real choice within the same building. Parking is built into the master plan from the start, which is not optional in a location this busy, and landscaped and community areas are worked into the layout where it allows. The Saima Elite Enclave floor plan keeps living and drawing spaces separate, each doing its own job.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Unit Types: 4, 5 & 6-Room Apartments</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>For buyers searching for a 4 room apartment Gulistan-e-Johar Karachi, 5 room apartment Gulistan-e-Johar Karachi, or 6 room apartment Gulistan-e-Johar Karachi, Saima Elite Enclave Gulistan-e-Johar offers large family layouts in three categories.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>4-Room Apartments in Saima Elite Enclave</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>The 4-room apartments, from around 1,108 square feet, are Saima Elite Enclave Gulistan-e-Johar’s entry category, already on the larger end for a family flat, with attached baths, a separate drawing room, a wide lounge, and a terrace.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>5-Room Apartments in Saima Elite Enclave</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>The 5-room apartments in Saima Elite Enclave Gulistan-e-Johar give growing families an additional room while keeping the same layout principles: separate drawing and living spaces, attached baths, and a terrace.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>6-Room Apartments in Saima Elite Enclave</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>The 6-room apartments in Saima Elite Enclave Gulistan-e-Johar, up to about 2,292 square feet, are the project\'s largest residences, aimed at joint families who need maximum space in Gulistan-e-Johar.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Floor Plan</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>A floor plan for each apartment category is available through the developer\'s authorised sales channel. Buyers seeking a Saima Elite Enclave price or floor plan should request the exact covered area for their specific unit rather than working off an average, as sizes vary widely across categories.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Price and Booking Status</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>The Saima Elite Enclave Kamran Chowrangi price varies depending on room count, covered area, floor, and construction stage at booking, and current pricing is disclosed through the developer\'s authorised sales channel. This is positioned as a premium, spacious option rather than a budget entry-level flat.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>A Saima Elite Enclave booking is processed through the developer\'s sales team, and the Saima Elite Enclave booking amount should be confirmed in writing alongside the Saima Elite Enclave payment plan. Buyers comparing the 4 room apartment Saima Elite Enclave price and 5 room apartment Saima Elite Enclave price should request both schedules together to compare total payable, including whether development charges are included or separate.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Saima Elite Enclave Karachi buyers should also confirm whether units are being offered through a priority allocation system or on a first-come, first-served basis.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>NOC and Approval Status</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Saima Elite Enclave Kamran Chowrangi buyers should verify the project-specific approvals directly with the developer or the relevant authority before booking, as NOC status applies to the individual project.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Regulations shift and documentation gets updated, so a status reported earlier should be re-confirmed at the time of booking rather than assumed to still apply.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Possession Timeline</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Possession at Saima Elite Enclave Gulistan-e-Johar depends on the specific tower and unit, as development is happening in phases. Buyers should confirm the possession status and timeline for their exact unit in writing at the point of Saima Elite Enclave booking, rather than assuming it is uniform across the project.</p>', 1, 1, 0, 58, 1, 'publish', 'Saima Elite Enclave Karachi | 4, 5 & 6-Room Flats Prices', 'Saima Elite Enclave in Block 11, Gulistan-e-Johar, Karachi. View 4, 5 and 6-room apartments, prices and payment plan. Contact us to book today!', 'Saima Elite Enclave, luxury villas, properties', '/images/projects/1793694555_hero_featured-saima-elite-enclave.jpg', '2026-11-03 08:29:15', '2026-11-10 10:10:32'),
(108, 'Saima Paari Excellency', 'saima-paari-excellency', '<p>At its core, Saima Paari Excellency is defined by its layering: a ground-plus-22-floor tower where the first five floors are entirely parking, the 6th floor is a shared amenity level, and everything from floor 7 to 22 is residential. That solves two problems older North Nazimabad buildings never could. Firstly, the daily fight for parking, and secondly, the absence of any shared recreational space in a neighbourhood where every square foot counts.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Within Saima Builders residential projects Karachi, Paari Excellency is the North Nazimabad family tower, and among high-rise apartments Karachi it keeps showing up on shortlists for three reasons: the location, the two proper family layouts, and the dedicated amenity floor. For family apartments Karachi buyers who want to stay central, it is one of the more practical options in this part of the city.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Key Project Highlights</h2>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n<tbody><tr>\r\n<th>Feature</th>\r\n<th>Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Developer</td>\r\n<td>Saima Builders</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Property Type</td>\r\n<td>Residential</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Unit Types</td>\r\n<td>4-room (Type B) & 5-room (Type A) apartments</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Total Land Size</td>\r\n<td>2 Acres</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Handover</td>\r\n<td>To be confirmed</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Location</td>\r\n<td>Block A, North Nazimabad, between Dil Pasand Sweets & Saifee Hospital, Karachi</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Payment Plan</td>\r\n<td>On Easy Installments</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Lifestyle</td>\r\n<td>Family living</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<h2>Master Plan and Development Framework</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Saima Paari Excellency Saima Builders is planned as a single layered tower rather than a spread-out scheme: parking down low across five floors, amenities in the middle on the 6th floor, and homes stacked strictly residential above.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The framework reflects deliberate planning for a dense neighbourhood: residents pass from parking through the amenity level to their homes, visitor parking is kept separate so guests do not fight residents for space, and both apartment types follow the same idea of separated, functional rooms like drawing room, dining, and lounge, instead of one big open zone. The Saima Paari Excellency floor plan keeps shared space up front and bedrooms tucked toward the quieter end of each unit.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Unit Types: 4-Room (Type B) & 5-Room (Type A) Apartments</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>For buyers searching for apartments for sale Saima Paari Excellency or flats for sale Saima Paari Excellency Karachi, Saima Paari Excellency Saima Builders offers family layouts in two categories.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>5-Room Apartments (Type A) in Saima Paari Excellency</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>The 5-room Type A is the larger of the two layouts, meant for larger families: three bedrooms, each with an attached bathroom, a separate drawing room, a dining and living area, an extra lounge, a kitchen with a store and balcony access, and a genuinely spacious terrace.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>4-Room Apartments (Type B) in Saima Paari Excellency</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>The 4-room Type B is more compact, better for smaller families who still want a proper multi-room layout: two bedrooms with attached bathrooms, a family or living area, a dining space, a kitchen with a service balcony, a drawing room, and its own terrace.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Floor Plan</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>A floor plan for both types is available through the developer\'s authorised sales channel. Buyers seeking a Saima Paari Excellency apartment price or floor plan should request the unit schedule alongside the floor plan, as reading about a layout only goes so far compared to seeing it.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Price and Booking Status</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>The Saima Paari Excellency price depends on which type is picked, the floor, and the unit\'s position, and current pricing is disclosed through the developer\'s authorised sales channel. Extra charges apply for corner, road-facing, and west-facing units, so the total payable differs unit by unit.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>A Saima Paari Excellency booking is processed through the developer\'s sales team, and the Saima Paari Excellency booking amount should be confirmed in writing alongside the Saima Paari Excellency payment plan. The practical route to buy flat in Saima Paari Excellency Karachi is to register interest directly with Saima Builders or its designated sales partners and obtain the current Saima Paari Excellency apartment price before booking.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Saima Paari Excellency Karachi buyers should also confirm whether Saima Paari Excellency apartments on installments are being offered through a priority allocation system or on a first-come, first-served basis.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>NOC and Approval Status</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Saima Paari Excellency Saima Builders buyers should verify the project-specific approvals directly with the developer or the relevant authority before booking, as NOC status applies to the individual project.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Regulations shift and documentation gets updated, so a status reported earlier should be re-confirmed at the time of booking rather than assumed to still apply.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Possession Timeline</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>A formal possession date for Saima Paari Excellency Saima Builders has not been announced as a single project-wide date. Buyers should secure a documented possession schedule at the point of Saima Paari Excellency booking, and Saima Paari Excellency Saima Builders possession timelines should be confirmed in writing with the developer.</p>', 1, 1, 0, 59, 1, 'publish', 'Saima Paari Excellency Karachi | Apartments Prices & Payment Plan', 'Saima Paari Excellency in North Nazimabad, Karachi. Explore 4 and 5-room apartments, prices and payment plan. Find details and book your apartment!', 'Saima Paari Excellency, luxury villas, properties', NULL, '2026-11-03 10:41:11', '2026-11-10 10:09:59'),
(109, 'Saima Jinnah Icon', 'saima-jinnah-icon', '<p>At its core, Saima Jinnah Icon Main Jinnah Avenue is built around something a lot of Karachi buyers actually want: big apartments upstairs, a proper mall and shops downstairs, all under one roof. The apartments come in 5-room and 6-room configurations for families who want room to breathe rather than something compact, and below the residential floors sits the mall level with retail shops and a food court, giving the tower its mixed-use character.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Saima Jinnah Icon Mall is listed as a completed project by Saima Group, which changes the buying conversation entirely: most people researching it today are not asking when it will finish, but what is actually available and what it costs. Among Main Jinnah Avenue Karachi projects, it is the corridor\'s clearest example of Jinnah Avenue commercial + residential combined in one high-rise.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Key Project Highlights</h2>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n<tbody><tr>\r\n<th>Feature</th>\r\n<th>Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Developer</td>\r\n<td>Saima Builders / ZSZ Group</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Property Type</td>\r\n<td>Mixed-use</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Unit Types</td>\r\n<td>5 & 6-room apartments; mall shops</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Total Land Size</td>\r\n<td>4.4 acres</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Handover</td>\r\n<td>Mall Completed, residential area under construction</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Location</td>\r\n<td>Main Jinnah Avenue, Sector 40, near Malir Cantt Checkpost 6, opposite Askari 5, Karachi</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Payment Plan</td>\r\n<td>Resale / inventory terms</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Lifestyle</td>\r\n<td>Mixed-use luxury</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<h2>Master Plan and Development Framework</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Saima Jinnah Icon Saima Builders is planned as a vertical mixed-use tower: the mall and retail at the lower floors, dedicated parking above the mall, and the residential apartments above that, so commercial activity stays down low and private living stays up high.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>That vertical split works well on a busy road like Jinnah Avenue: residents can shop and eat without leaving the building, mall foot traffic stays away from the residential floors, and parking is kept practical for both groups. The Saima Jinnah Icon floor plan revolves around its 5-room and 6-room types, with multiple bedrooms, attached bathrooms, a kitchen, and shared living and dining space.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Unit Types: Apartments and Mall Shops</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>For buyers searching for 5 bed luxury apartments Jinnah Avenue Karachi or 6 bed luxury apartments Jinnah Avenue Karachi, Saima Jinnah Icon Saima Builders offers mixed-use units in three categories.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>5-Room Apartments in Saima Jinnah Icon</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>The 5-room apartments in Saima Jinnah Icon Main Jinnah Avenue are marketed as executive units for families who want generous space, with multiple bedrooms, attached bathrooms, and shared living and dining areas.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>6-Room Apartments in Saima Jinnah Icon</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>The 6-room apartments in Saima Jinnah Icon Main Jinnah Avenue are the tower\'s largest residences, aimed at bigger and joint families who want maximum space on Main Jinnah Avenue.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Mall Shops and Commercial Spaces in Saima Jinnah Icon</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>The Jinnah Icon Mall across the lower floors was built to house retail shops for national and international brands, a food court, and wider commercial spaces, forming the commercial spaces Jinnah Avenue Karachi component of the project.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Floor Plan</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Current availability for each layout in Saima Jinnah Icon Main Jinnah Avenue should be confirmed with the sales team. Buyers should request the official floor plan documentation for the specific unit rather than relying on listing descriptions.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Price and Booking Status</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>The Saima Jinnah Icon price depends heavily on unit size, floor, and whether the unit is developer inventory or resale, for both apartments and mall shops. Rather than relying on a figure that may already be outdated, buyers should request a current price quote for the specific unit type that interests them.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>A Saima Jinnah Icon booking today means clarifying first which category the unit falls into, primary developer inventory or an existing owner\'s resale, because the Saima Jinnah Icon booking amount and terms differ between the two. Buyers comparing the 5 bed apartment Saima Jinnah Icon price and 6 bed apartment Saima Jinnah Icon price should request current quotes for both categories together.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>For shops, prices inside Jinnah Icon Mall vary by size, floor, and position within the mall, and a current list of operating tenants should be obtained from mall management rather than from older listings.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>NOC and Approval Status</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Saima Jinnah Icon Saima Builders buyers should verify the project-specific SBCA approval documents directly with the developer or the relevant authority before purchase. As the residential towers remain under construction, buyers must inspect the unit’s formal allotment agreement and approved building plans carefully. Because the attached Jinnah Icon Mall is already operational while residences are still being built, buyers should confirm current tenant mixes and commercial arrangements directly with mall management at the time of purchase.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Possession Timeline</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Saima Jinnah Icon Main Jinnah Avenue is listed as an active construction project, so possession follows the developer\'s delivery timeline for the specific unit rather than immediate sale and transfer formalities. Buyers should confirm whether a unit is developer inventory or resale, and secure the possession and documentation process in writing before paying.</p>', 1, 1, 0, 60, 1, 'publish', 'Saima Jinnah Icon Karachi | Apartments & Mall Prices', 'Saima Jinnah Icon on Main Jinnah Avenue, near Malir Cantt, Karachi. View apartments, mall shops, prices and payment plan. Contact us to book today!', 'Saima Jinnah Icon, luxury villas, properties', NULL, '2026-11-03 10:57:13', '2026-11-10 10:09:41');
INSERT INTO `pages` (`id`, `title`, `slug`, `body`, `in_navbar`, `show_in_projects`, `show_in_commercial`, `navbar_order`, `is_published`, `status`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`, `meta_keywords`, `og_image`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(110, 'Scheme 33', 'scheme-33', '<p class=\"saimaIntroP\">A premier benchmark for luxury waterfront living, seamlessly blending contemporary architectural elegance with a tranquil coastal sanctuary. Residents enjoy fresh sea breezes, private beach access, and immediate connectivity to key metropolitan hubs.</p>\r\n<p class=\"saimaIntroP\">Located along prestigious shoreline corridors, the community offers an inspired lifestyle for professionals, investors, and families seeking refined island elegance away from urban congestion.</p>\r\n<p class=\"saimaIntroP\">Every residence offers a harmonious blend of sophistication, security, and long-term capital appreciation, presenting an extraordinary investment opportunity in one of the most coveted coastal addresses.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>About the Developers</h2>\r\n<p>Crafted by premier developers renowned for shaping iconic waterfront communities across the region for decades. Buyers and international investors benefit from a celebrated track record of timely delivery, construction excellence, and sustainable urban design.</p>\r\n<p>Working alongside leading international architectural consultants and market advisory firms, every aspect of the project is engineered to global standards of prestige and durability.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Approvals &amp; Clearances</h2>\r\n<p>The project holds full regulatory clearance and title approvals from all relevant municipal and developmental authorities. Complying strictly with environmental and structural guidelines, purchasers can invest with absolute peace of mind and secure freehold ownership.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Prime Location &amp; Seamless Connectivity</h2>\r\n<p>Set within a scenic coastal landscape, the project offers rapid access to international airports, commercial business districts, premier private schools, and luxury retail destinations.</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/TOC1.png\" alt=\"Strategic Location &amp; Connectivity Map\" style=\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); width: 100%; margin: 15px 0;\"></p>\r\n<p>Surrounded by protected green reserves and pristine waters, residents wake up to panoramic coastal vistas and unpolluted air throughout the year.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Architectural Excellence &amp; Floor Plans</h2>\r\n<p>The layouts focus on space efficiency, panoramic natural lighting, and seamless indoor-outdoor living with spacious private terraces and balconies.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Curated Residences &amp; Layout Types</h3>\r\n<p><img src=\"/TOC2.png\" alt=\"Luxury Layout Plan - Type C\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\"></p>\r\n<p>Featuring open-plan living rooms, floor-to-ceiling double-glazed windows, designer show kitchens, and lavish en-suite master bedrooms designed for modern family living.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img src=\"/TOC3.png\" alt=\"Executive Layout Plan - Type B\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\"></p>\r\n<p>Expansive terraces provide seamless entertaining spaces overlooking lush landscaped courtyards and the sparkling coastline.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img src=\"/TOC4.png\" alt=\"Presidential Villa Layout Plan - Type A\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\"></p>\r\n<p>Generous multi-level accommodations including private elevators, maid\'s quarters, private swimming pools, and dedicated family lounges.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Master Plan &amp; Community Lifestyle</h2>\r\n<p>The community master plan establishes a secure, private, and walkable residential haven. Dedicated subterranean parking ensures pedestrian safety across surface walkways, cycling trails, and waterfront boardwalks.</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/TOC8.png\" alt=\"Community Master Plan Overview\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\"></p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Flexible Investment &amp; Payment Plan</h2>\r\n<p>A buyer-friendly, construction-linked payment structure is offered with flexible milestones, making property acquisition straightforward and stress-free.</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/TOC12.png\" alt=\"Milestone Payment Structure\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\"></p>\r\n\r\n<h2>World-Class Facilities &amp; Amenities</h2>\r\n<p>Enjoy infinity swimming pools, state-of-the-art fitness centres, private beach cabanas, children\'s play areas, multi-sport courts, and fine-dining waterfront restaurants just steps from your front door.</p>', 1, 1, 0, 61, 1, 'publish', 'Scheme 33 Karachi Properties | Luxury Investment & Community Guide', 'Explore luxury waterfront homes, real estate, and investment projects in Scheme 33, Karachi.', 'Scheme 33, real estate in Scheme 33, properties for sale in Scheme 33', '/images/hero/slide-1.jpg', '2026-11-03 11:05:38', '2026-11-03 11:05:38'),
(111, 'Saima Boulevard', 'saima-boulevard', '<p>At its core, Saima Boulevard is a residential apartment project built as multiple towers rather than one single building, which gives it more of an actual community feel than a single-block apartment building usually has. A designated commercial zone and green spaces are built into the layout, and parking has been planned properly, which is a detail that sounds minor until you have lived somewhere in Karachi where finding a spot every evening becomes its own small battle.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Within Saima Builders projects Scheme 33, Saima Boulevard Saima Builders is one of the larger schemes, and among apartments in Scheme 33 Karachi it keeps coming up in conversations for three reasons: the connectivity, the developer\'s track record of occupied projects, and a payment plan that does not ask for a buyer\'s entire savings upfront. What matters most is whether it is actually built the way it is advertised, which buyers should verify on site.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Key Project Highlights</h2>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n<tbody><tr>\r\n<th>Feature</th>\r\n<th>Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Developer</td>\r\n<td>Saima Builders</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Property Type</td>\r\n<td>Residential</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Unit Types</td>\r\n<td>2, 3 & 4-bedroom apartments (Types B, A, XL)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Total Land Size</td>\r\n<td>2 acres</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Handover</td>\r\n<td>Under construction</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Location</td>\r\n<td>Sector 29, Gulzar-e-Hijri, Scheme 33, Karachi</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Payment Plan</td>\r\n<td>On Easy Installments</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Lifestyle</td>\r\n<td>Family living</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<h2>Master Plan and Development Framework</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Saima Boulevard Scheme 33 is structured as a multi-tower master plan around shared amenities: residential towers, a small commercial strip on the ground level, dedicated parking, and green areas woven through the layout.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The framework is designed so residents should not need to leave the gate for most day-to-day things: shops for everyday essentials, play areas and green spaces for families, and security within the compound. The Saima Boulevard floor plan keeps interiors consistent across types — spacious bedrooms, modern kitchens, attached bathrooms, separate drawing rooms, private balconies, and dedicated wash areas, with large windows for natural light and ventilation.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Unit Types: 2, 3 & 4-Bedroom Apartments</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>For buyers searching for apartments for sale Saima Boulevard or flats for sale Saima Boulevard Karachi, Saima Boulevard Scheme 33 offers family layouts in three categories.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>2-Bedroom Apartments (Type B) in Saima Boulevard</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>The 2-bedroom Type B apartments in Saima Boulevard Saima Builders are designed for young couples, small families, and first-time homebuyers, with two spacious bedrooms, a comfortable lounge and dining area, a separate drawing room, a modern kitchen, attached bathrooms, a balcony, and a dedicated wash area.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>3-Bedroom Apartments (Type A) in Saima Boulevard</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>The 3-bedroom Type A apartments in Saima Boulevard Scheme 33 provide additional space for growing families: three well-sized bedrooms, a spacious lounge and dining area, a separate drawing room, a modern kitchen, multiple attached bathrooms, a powder room, a balcony, and a dedicated wash area.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>4-Bedroom Apartments (Type XL) in Saima Boulevard</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>The 4-bedroom Type XL apartments in Saima Boulevard Saima Builders are the largest residential option, designed for large and joint families, with four spacious bedrooms, an expansive lounge and dining area, a separate drawing room, a modern kitchen, multiple attached bathrooms, a powder room, a wide balcony, and a dedicated wash area.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Floor Plan</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Floor plans for all three types are available through the developer\'s authorised sales channel. Buyers seeking a Saima Boulevard apartment price or floor plan should request the unit schedule alongside it, and verify on site what has actually been built so far.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Price and Booking Status</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>The Saima Boulevard price scales by type: 2-bedroom units sit at the entry-level price point, 3-bedroom units come next, balancing space and affordability, and the larger Type XL units sit at the top of the pricing scale. Prices shift with construction progress and demand, so current figures should be obtained directly.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>A Saima Boulevard booking is processed through the developer\'s authorised sales channel, and the Saima Boulevard booking amount should be confirmed in writing alongside the Saima Boulevard payment plan. The practical route to buy flat in Saima Boulevard Karachi is to register interest with Saima Builders or its authorised consultants and obtain the current Saima Boulevard apartment price before booking.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Saima Boulevard Karachi buyers should also confirm whether Saima Boulevard apartments on installments are being allocated through a priority system or on a first-come, first-served basis, and ask for current construction progress photos or a site visit.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>NOC and Approval Status</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Saima Boulevard Scheme 33 buyers should check the NOC before handing over any money: ask the sales office directly for the current No Objection Certificate and the approved building plan, and get the actual document or reference number rather than a verbal assurance.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Approval status can shift as a project moves through different construction phases, so whatever a buyer is told needs to be current, not something pulled from an old listing.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Possession Timeline</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Saima Boulevard Saima Builders is under construction, and no single possession date applies project-wide. Whatever timeline is given at booking should be reconfirmed periodically and secured in writing, as large residential projects can see deadlines shift. Buyers should also ask whether possession is handed over tower by tower.</p>', 1, 1, 0, 62, 1, 'publish', 'Saima Boulevard Karachi | Payment Plan, Location & Prices', 'Saima Boulevard in Sector 29, Gulzar-e-Hijri, Scheme 33, Karachi. Explore 2, 3 and 4-bedroom apartments, prices and payment plan. Book your unit today!', 'Saima Boulevard, luxury villas, properties', NULL, '2026-11-03 11:05:58', '2026-11-10 10:09:11'),
(112, 'Saima ACE Avenue', 'saima-ace-avenue', '<p>At its core, Saima ACE Avenue is a ground-plus-10 apartment building of roughly 277,839 square feet, with work having started back in mid-2021. Structurally, the apartments are wrapped around a central lift and lobby core on every floor, which is the kind of layout meant to keep units bright and airy rather than dark and boxed in, which is still a problem in a lot of older Karachi buildings.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Saima ACE Avenue Saima Builders does not stand alone: it is part of Saima\'s larger cluster in Scheme 33, sitting near projects like Saima Boulevard and Saima Meadows Avenue, so the roads and basic civic groundwork around it have been developing for years thanks to the group\'s earlier work in the same pocket. Among apartments on Main Super Highway Karachi, it is pitched at salaried buyers who want a home they can actually plan around.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Key Project Highlights</h2>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n<tbody><tr>\r\n<th>Feature</th>\r\n<th>Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Developer</td>\r\n<td>Saima Builders</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Property Type</td>\r\n<td>Residential</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Unit Types</td>\r\n<td>3-room (Type C), 4-room (Type B) & 5-room (Type A) apartments</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Total Land Size</td>\r\n<td>2 Acres</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Handover</td>\r\n<td>Under construction</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Location</td>\r\n<td>Gulzar-e-Hijri, Scheme 33, Main Super Highway, Karachi</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Payment Plan</td>\r\n<td>On Easy Installments</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Lifestyle</td>\r\n<td>Family living</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<h2>Master Plan and Development Framework</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Saima Ace Avenue Scheme 33 is planned as a single ground-plus-10 residential building: ten residential floors of roughly eight apartments each, shared amenities spread across the ground floor and rooftop, and dedicated parking floors baked into the plan.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The framework prioritises function over show: living areas, bedrooms, and kitchens are placed to catch as much natural light as possible, and shared spaces like community center, family zone, landscaped park are built into the scheme rather than added later. Whether any ground-floor commercial component applies specifically to Saima Ace Avenue Scheme 33 has not been pinned down in public sources, so buyers seeking commercial space should ask the developer directly.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Unit Types: 3, 4 & 5-Room Apartments</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>For buyers searching for apartments for sale Saima ACE Avenue or flats for sale Saima ACE Avenue Karachi, Saima ACE Avenue Saima Builders offers family layouts in three categories.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>3-Room Apartments (Type C) in Saima ACE Avenue</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>The 3-room Type C in Saima Ace Avenue Scheme 33 is the entry-level unit, around 850 square feet: a good fit for smaller families or first-time buyers who want into Scheme 33 without stretching too far, while still getting the full run of the building\'s shared amenities.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>4-Room Apartments (Type B) in Saima ACE Avenue</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>The 4-room Type B in Saima ACE Avenue Saima Builders, roughly 1,100 square feet, sits neatly between Type C and Type A: usually the sweet spot for growing families who need one more room but are not ready to jump straight to the biggest unit.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>5-Room Apartments (Type A) in Saima ACE Avenue</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>The 5-room Type A in Saima ACE Avenue Saima Builders is the largest option, around 1,300 square feet, built for bigger households or anyone who wants an extra room for a home office or guests.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Floor Plan</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>The three unit types map directly to three, four, and five rooms, so matching size to family need is straightforward. Buyers seeking a Saima ACE Avenue apartment price or floor plan should request the current unit schedule from the sales office.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Price and Booking Status</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>The Saima ACE Avenue price depends on the floor, the unit\'s position in the building, and how far along construction is at the time of booking. Book earlier and the price is generally lower, as with almost every under-construction project in the city. Current figures are available through the developer\'s sales office.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>A Saima ACE Avenue booking is processed through Saima\'s own sales network and authorised real estate partners, and the Saima ACE Avenue booking amount should be confirmed in writing alongside the Saima ACE Avenue payment plan, since offers are revised, especially during promotional periods.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Saima ACE Avenue Karachi buyers should also confirm current stock before making a final call, as floor allocations and unit availability change fairly often on an under-construction building.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>NOC and Approval Status</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Saima Ace Avenue Scheme 33 buyers should verify the project-specific approvals directly with the developer or the relevant authority before booking, as NOC status applies to the individual project.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Because the building is under construction, buyers should also confirm the current construction status directly with the sales office rather than relying on how the developer\'s other projects have progressed, since every project has its own pace.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Possession Timeline</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Saima ACE Avenue Saima Builders is under construction, and a firm, publicly confirmed completion date has not been published. Possession follows once floors are actually finished, and buyers should ask whether handover happens floor by floor or as one handover, and get any move-in timeline in writing from the developer before booking. Finishing installments and getting possession are not the same event.</p>', 1, 1, 0, 63, 1, 'publish', 'Saima ACE Avenue Karachi | Prices, Payment Plan & Location', 'Saima ACE Avenue in Gulzar-e-Hijri, Scheme 33, Karachi. View 3, 4 and 5-room apartments, prices and payment plan. Explore details and book today!', 'Saima ACE Avenue, luxury villas, properties', NULL, '2026-11-03 11:16:30', '2026-11-10 10:08:52'),
(113, 'Saima Luxury Apartments', 'saima-luxury-apartments', '<p>At its core, Saima Luxury Apartments Saima Builders is apartment living from the ground up: five towers, each ground plus 12 floors, currently under construction with limited units still available. The layout is fairly standard but well thought out, including a terrace, a proper drawing room, a separate lounge, and attached baths in the bedrooms, a real step up from the cramped, single-purpose layouts found in older, cheaper buildings around the same area.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>What actually stands out here is the payment structure, spread over 48 monthly installments, which is the real reason this project keeps coming up whenever people search for affordable installment-based apartments in this part of Karachi. Within Saima Builders projects Karachi, it is the Bagh-e-Korangi apartment offer, and among apartments in Shah Faisal Karachi it is one of the most searched projects.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Key Project Highlights</h2>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n<tbody><tr>\r\n<th>Feature</th>\r\n<th>Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Developer</td>\r\n<td>Saima Builders</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Property Type</td>\r\n<td>Residential</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Unit Types</td>\r\n<td>3-room (Type C) & 4-room (Types B1, B, A) apartments</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Total Land Size</td>\r\n<td>3.5 Acres</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Handover</td>\r\n<td>Under construction</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Location</td>\r\n<td>Bagh-e-Korangi, Shah Faisal, Karachi</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Payment Plan</td>\r\n<td>On Easy Installments</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Lifestyle</td>\r\n<td>Family living</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<h2>Master Plan and Development Framework</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Saima Luxury Apartments Shah Faisal is planned as five separate towers, each ground plus 12 floors, giving the project a genuinely multi-building footprint rather than one standalone structure, with dedicated parking and shared common areas built into the overall site plan.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Each tower carries a mix of the available unit types, so buyers have some choice in configuration within the same building instead of being locked into a single layout per tower. The framework keeps functional spaces distinct, like terrace, drawing room, lounge, attached baths, instead of merging everything into one, and shared spaces are meant to give residents a sense of community across the five towers rather than five disconnected buildings sharing a name.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Unit Types: 3-Room & 4-Room Apartments</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>For buyers searching for apartments for sale Saima Luxury Apartments or flats for sale Saima Luxury Apartments Karachi, Saima Luxury Apartments Saima Builders offers family layouts in two categories.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>3-Room Apartments (Type C) in Saima Luxury Apartments</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Type C is the entry point at Saima Luxury Apartments Shah Faisal: a 3-room unit positioned as the most accessible price tier in the project, built around a terrace, a separate drawing room, a lounge, and attached baths.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>4-Room Apartments (Types B1, B & A) in Saima Luxury Apartments</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Types B1, B, and A at Saima Luxury Apartments Saima Builders are all 4-room configurations, differing mainly in size, positioning, and finish rather than fundamental layout, with Type A the largest of the three. Each keeps the project\'s signature layout of terrace, drawing room, lounge, and attached baths.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Floor Plan</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>The exact covered area varies by unit type and has not been published consistently, so buyers should confirm it directly for the unit they are interested in. Buyers seeking a Saima Luxury Apartments apartment price or floor plan should request the current unit schedule from the authorised sales channel.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Price and Booking Status</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>The Saima Luxury Apartments price is set by unit type: Type C at 3 rooms is the entry point, and Types B1, B, and A, which are all 4-room units, are priced progressively higher by differences in exact size, layout, and position within the towers rather than a flat price per room count. Floor level, tower position, and construction progress at booking also affect the final price.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>A Saima Luxury Apartments booking is processed through the developer\'s authorised sales channel, and the Saima Luxury Apartments booking amount should be confirmed in writing alongside the Saima Luxury Apartments payment plan. Since the project is marketed as having limited units left, buyers should check current availability directly rather than trusting an older listing.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Most transactions at Saima Luxury Apartments right now are pre-completion bookings rather than ready-to-move purchases, so buyers should factor the construction timeline into their decision alongside the payment schedule.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>NOC and Approval Status</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Saima Luxury Apartments Shah Faisal buyers should verify the project-specific approvals directly with the developer or the relevant authority before booking, as NOC status applies to the individual project.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Specific covered area figures have not been published consistently for every type, so buyers should confirm the exact area and documentation for the unit they are interested in at the time of booking.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Possession Timeline</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Saima Luxury Apartments Saima Builders is under construction, and no fixed completion date has been consistently published. Possession will follow completion of each buyer\'s own payment plan alongside the construction timeline for their specific tower, so buyers with a specific timeline in mind should confirm it directly with the developer and secure it in writing.</p>', 1, 1, 0, 64, 1, 'publish', 'Saima Luxury Apartments Karachi | Prices & Location', 'Saima Luxury Apartments in Bagh-e-Korangi, Shah Faisal, Karachi. Explore 3 and 4-room apartments, prices and payment plan. Contact us to book today!', 'Saima Luxury Apartments, luxury villas, properties', NULL, '2026-11-03 11:57:16', '2026-11-10 10:08:41'),
