(129, 'Memon Goth', 'memon-goth', '<p class=\"saimaIntroP\">A premier benchmark for luxury waterfront living, seamlessly blending contemporary architectural elegance with a tranquil coastal sanctuary. Residents enjoy fresh sea breezes, private beach access, and immediate connectivity to key metropolitan hubs.</p>\r\n<p class=\"saimaIntroP\">Located along prestigious shoreline corridors, the community offers an inspired lifestyle for professionals, investors, and families seeking refined island elegance away from urban congestion.</p>\r\n<p class=\"saimaIntroP\">Every residence offers a harmonious blend of sophistication, security, and long-term capital appreciation, presenting an extraordinary investment opportunity in one of the most coveted coastal addresses.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>About the Developers</h2>\r\n<p>Crafted by premier developers renowned for shaping iconic waterfront communities across the region for decades. Buyers and international investors benefit from a celebrated track record of timely delivery, construction excellence, and sustainable urban design.</p>\r\n<p>Working alongside leading international architectural consultants and market advisory firms, every aspect of the project is engineered to global standards of prestige and durability.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Approvals &amp; Clearances</h2>\r\n<p>The project holds full regulatory clearance and title approvals from all relevant municipal and developmental authorities. Complying strictly with environmental and structural guidelines, purchasers can invest with absolute peace of mind and secure freehold ownership.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Prime Location &amp; Seamless Connectivity</h2>\r\n<p>Set within a scenic coastal landscape, the project offers rapid access to international airports, commercial business districts, premier private schools, and luxury retail destinations.</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/TOC1.png\" alt=\"Strategic Location &amp; Connectivity Map\" style=\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); width: 100%; margin: 15px 0;\"></p>\r\n<p>Surrounded by protected green reserves and pristine waters, residents wake up to panoramic coastal vistas and unpolluted air throughout the year.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Architectural Excellence &amp; Floor Plans</h2>\r\n<p>The layouts focus on space efficiency, panoramic natural lighting, and seamless indoor-outdoor living with spacious private terraces and balconies.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Curated Residences &amp; Layout Types</h3>\r\n<p><img src=\"/TOC2.png\" alt=\"Luxury Layout Plan - Type C\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\"></p>\r\n<p>Featuring open-plan living rooms, floor-to-ceiling double-glazed windows, designer show kitchens, and lavish en-suite master bedrooms designed for modern family living.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img src=\"/TOC3.png\" alt=\"Executive Layout Plan - Type B\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\"></p>\r\n<p>Expansive terraces provide seamless entertaining spaces overlooking lush landscaped courtyards and the sparkling coastline.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img src=\"/TOC4.png\" alt=\"Presidential Villa Layout Plan - Type A\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\"></p>\r\n<p>Generous multi-level accommodations including private elevators, maid\'s quarters, private swimming pools, and dedicated family lounges.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Master Plan &amp; Community Lifestyle</h2>\r\n<p>The community master plan establishes a secure, private, and walkable residential haven. Dedicated subterranean parking ensures pedestrian safety across surface walkways, cycling trails, and waterfront boardwalks.</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/TOC8.png\" alt=\"Community Master Plan Overview\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\"></p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Flexible Investment &amp; Payment Plan</h2>\r\n<p>A buyer-friendly, construction-linked payment structure is offered with flexible milestones, making property acquisition straightforward and stress-free.</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/TOC12.png\" alt=\"Milestone Payment Structure\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\"></p>\r\n\r\n<h2>World-Class Facilities &amp; Amenities</h2>\r\n<p>Enjoy infinity swimming pools, state-of-the-art fitness centres, private beach cabanas, children\'s play areas, multi-sport courts, and fine-dining waterfront restaurants just steps from your front door.</p>', 1, 1, 0, 74, 1, 'publish', 'Memon Goth Karachi Properties | Luxury Investment & Community Guide', 'Explore luxury waterfront homes, real estate, and investment projects in Memon Goth, Karachi.', 'Memon Goth, real estate in Memon Goth, properties for sale in Memon Goth', '/images/hero/slide-1.jpg', '2026-11-09 10:41:09', '2026-11-09 10:41:09'),
(130, 'Saima Prestige Park', 'saima-prestige-park', '<p>Saima Prestige Park is an upcoming plotting development associated with Saima Group in the Memon Goth and Malir 15 area of Karachi. The project is situated along Memon Goth Road in Gadap Town, offering a residential land opportunity in an expanding part of Karachi.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The development is planned with different residential plot categories and a commercial component. Its proposed layout includes designated residential blocks, internal roads, green spaces, and community facilities.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>For buyers exploring Saima Group projects Karachi, Saima Prestige Park presents an option to consider for future residential construction or long-term land ownership. However, buyers should review the latest project documents, plot availability, and approval status before proceeding.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Key Project Highlights</h3>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n    <thead>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <th>Feature</th>\r\n            <th>Details</th>\r\n        </tr>\r\n    </thead>\r\n    <tbody>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td>Developer</td>\r\n            <td>Saima Group</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td>Project Type</td>\r\n            <td>Residential and Commercial Plots</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td>Total Land Size</td>\r\n            <td>Approximately 24 Acres (reported)</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td>Total Plots</td>\r\n            <td>Approximately 300 (reported)</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td>Residential Plot Sizes</td>\r\n            <td>120, 175 and 240 Sq. Yds.</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td>Commercial Plots</td>\r\n            <td>Included in reported layout</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td>Location</td>\r\n            <td>Memon Goth Road, Gadap Town, Karachi</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td>Main Road</td>\r\n            <td>60 Feet (reported)</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td>Payment Plan</td>\r\n            <td>3 Years (reported)</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td>Booking</td>\r\n            <td>Starting from PKR 5 Lakh for 120 Sq. Yds. (reported)</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td>Possession</td>\r\n            <td>Linked with completion of payment and development</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td>NOC</td>\r\n            <td>Project-specific approval number not publicly verified</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n    </tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<h2>Master Plan and Development Framework</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>The Saima Prestige Park master plan is designed around residential plot blocks, internal road networks, green spaces, and community-use areas. The reported layout identifies blocks R, R1, and A, with a 60-foot main road and internal roads ranging from approximately 30 to 40 feet.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The proposed development framework also includes a mosque, two school sites, eight parks, and a commercial area near the entrance. These elements are intended to support an organised residential environment and provide residents with access to everyday community facilities.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Buyers interested in Saima Prestige Park Karachi should request the latest authorised master plan to verify plot locations, road widths, block arrangements, and the availability of designated facilities.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Plot Types: Available Categories</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Saima Prestige Park offers residential plot categories intended for buyers with different land requirements and investment budgets. The reported primary residential sizes are 120, 175, and 240 square yards.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Some third-party promotional listings also mention 160 and 500 square yard plots. However, these additional categories should be confirmed through the developer\'s current inventory and official plot schedule before being considered available.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Residential Plots in Saima Prestige Park</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>The reported residential plot categories provide options for buyers planning to construct a family home or hold land as a property investment.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The available plot sizes are:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n    <li>120 Square Yards</li>\r\n    <li>175 Square Yards</li>\r\n    <li>240 Square Yards</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Buyers searching for residential plots for sale Saima Prestige Park should review the official layout plan and confirm the availability of their preferred plot size, block, and location before booking.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Plot Layout Plan</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>The Saima Prestige Park layout plan provides an overview of the proposed residential blocks, internal roads, and community facilities. It is intended to help buyers understand the development\'s overall arrangement and identify suitable plot locations.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>According to the reported layout, the development includes a 60-foot main road, 30 to 40-foot internal roads, designated parks, a mosque, school sites, and a commercial area.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Buyers should request the latest authorised layout plan from the sales office before selecting a plot. They should also confirm whether the selected plot is park-facing, road-facing, corner, or west-open, as these preferences may involve additional charges.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Saima Prestige Park Price and Booking Status</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Saima Prestige Park has reported residential plot prices for different categories under a three-year installment structure. According to the payment schedules dated 5 November 2026, the reported prices are PKR 68.5 lakh for 120 square yards, PKR 1 crore for 175 square yards, and PKR 1.37 crore for 240 square yards.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The reported opening payment for a 120-square-yard plot starts at PKR 5 lakh, while larger plot categories require higher initial payments.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Buyers searching for Saima Prestige Park price or Saima Prestige Park booking should obtain the latest authorised price list and plot availability before making a financial commitment. Additional charges for preferred locations, documentation, utilities, and external development may apply.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Reported Residential Plot Prices</h3>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n    <thead>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <th>Plot Size</th>\r\n            <th>Reported Total Price</th>\r\n        </tr>\r\n    </thead>\r\n    <tbody>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td>120 Sq. Yds.</td>\r\n            <td>PKR 68.5 Lakh</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td>175 Sq. Yds.</td>\r\n            <td>PKR 1 Crore</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td>240 Sq. Yds.</td>\r\n            <td>PKR 1.37 Crore</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n    </tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>Prices are based on reported Saima payment schedules dated 5 November 2026. Verify current prices and inventory with the authorised sales office.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>NOC and Approval Status</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>The approval status of Saima Prestige Park should be independently verified before buyers proceed with booking or payment.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Some launch advertisements describe the project as NOC approved. However, the available published information does not establish a verifiable approval number, approving authority, or approval date.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Buyers should request a copy of the project-specific NOC and approved layout plan from the developer and independently verify the documents with the relevant authority.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>It is important not to rely solely on promotional statements or verbal assurances when evaluating the legal status of a residential development.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Possession Timeline</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Saima Prestige Park has a reported three-year installment structure, with possession linked to completion of the payment schedule and relevant development stages.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The available payment information includes payments associated with road development, sewerage work, demarcation, and final possession. However, buyers should obtain a written possession commitment and confirm the development milestones in their booking agreement.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Any possession timeline should be treated as subject to the developer\'s official documentation and contractual terms.</p>', 1, 1, 0, 75, 1, 'publish', 'Saima Prestige Park Karachi | Location, Prices & Payment Plan', 'Saima Prestige Park plots on Memon Goth Road, Gadap Town, Karachi. Check prices, plot details and payment plan. Explore the project and book your plot today!', 'Saima Prestige Park Saima Group, Saima Prestige Park Karachi, Saima Prestige Park Memon Goth, Saima Prestige Park price', NULL, '2026-11-09 10:57:57', '2026-11-10 10:08:10'),
