(576, 76, 'content', 'Content', 6, 1, '{\"title\":\"saima Center Point 2 Living & Waterfront Sanctuary\",\"intro\":\"<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">saima Center Point 2 is a premier benchmark for luxury waterfront living, seamlessly blending contemporary architectural elegance with a tranquil coastal sanctuary. Residents enjoy fresh sea breezes, private beach access, and immediate connectivity to key metropolitan hubs.<\\/p><p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:1rem\\\">Located along prestigious shoreline corridors, the community offers an inspired lifestyle for professionals, investors, and families seeking refined island elegance away from urban congestion.<\\/p><p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:1rem\\\">Every residence offers a harmonious blend of sophistication, security, and long-term capital appreciation, presenting an extraordinary investment opportunity in one of the most coveted coastal addresses.<\\/p>\",\"html\":\"<p>At present, Saima Center Point 2 M.A. Jinnah Road exists as a name in circulation rather than a launched project: it has been described as a Coming Soon development, but no dedicated official page, launch event, or documentation set has been published for it. That makes it fundamentally different from a project buyers can inspect, price, or book today.<\\/p><p>Within Saima Builders projects Karachi, the confirmed M.A. Jinnah Road project is Saima Center Point. Until Saima Builders publishes a launch announcement for Saima Center Point 2 Saima Builders, the accurate position is that buyers can register interest and monitor official channels. Nothing more should be promised, and no payment should change hands against this name.<\\/p><h2>Key Project Highlights<\\/h2><table><thead><tr><th>Feature<\\/th><th>Details<\\/th><\\/tr><\\/thead><tbody><tr><td>Developer<\\/td><td>Saima Builders<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td>Property Type<\\/td><td>To be announced<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td>Unit Types<\\/td><td>To be announced<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td>Total Land Size<\\/td><td>Not disclosed<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td>Handover<\\/td><td>To be announced<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td>Location<\\/td><td>M.A. Jinnah Road, Karachi (reported, unconfirmed)<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td>Payment Plan<\\/td><td>To be announced<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td>Lifestyle<\\/td><td>To be announced<\\/td><\\/tr><\\/tbody><\\/table><h2>Master Plan and Development Framework<\\/h2><p>No master plan has been published for Saima Center Point 2. The project\'s structure, tower count, and layout will only become clear if and when the developer releases official documentation.<\\/p><p>Buyers comparing material online should be careful: details belonging to the original Saima Center Point are sometimes repeated under the Center Point 2 name. Floor plans, unit types, and schedules from the first project must not be assumed to apply to Saima Center Point 2 M.A. Jinnah Road.<\\/p><h2>Unit Types: To Be Announced<\\/h2><p>No unit schedule has been published for Saima Center Point 2 Saima Builders, so the honest position is set out below rather than a list of invented apartment types.<\\/p><h3>Apartments in Saima Center Point 2 (To Be Announced)<\\/h3><p>The unit mix for Saima Center Point 2 M.A. Jinnah Road has not been announced. Apartment sizes, bedroom counts, and floor plans will only be known when the developer publishes a unit schedule at launch, and no layout from Saima Center Point should be assumed to carry over.<\\/p><p>Buyers seeking apartments for sale Saima Center Point 2 or flats for sale Saima Center Point 2 Karachi should register interest and wait for the official unit schedule rather than relying on third-party listings.<\\/p><h2>Floor Plan<\\/h2><p>A floor plan for every unit category is available through the developer\'s authorised sales channel. Buyers seeking a Saima Center Point 2 price or a Saima Center Point floor plan should request the unit schedule alongside the floor plan from the authorised sales channel.<\\/p><h2>Price and Booking Status<\\/h2><p>There is no official Saima Center Point 2 price, because no price list has been published. Pricing will only become real when the developer releases an authorised schedule at launch.<\\/p><p>No Saima Center Point 2 booking is officially open. Buyers searching for a Saima Center Point 2 apartment price or Saima Center Point 2 booking amount should register interest only and should not pay any amount to any party claiming to collect bookings for this project before an official launch.<\\/p><p>Buyers who need a bookable M.A. Jinnah Road option today should instead review the confirmed Saima Center Point project through the developer\'s authorised sales channel.<\\/p><h2>NOC and Approval Status<\\/h2><p>No NOC or approval documentation specific to Saima Center Point 2 Saima Builders has been published. Buyers should verify the position directly with the developer or the relevant authority if the project is formally launched.<\\/p><p>Approvals granted to Saima Center Point do not automatically extend to a separate project under the Center Point 2 name, and the two should never be treated as interchangeable in documentation.<\\/p><h2>Possession Timeline<\\/h2><p>No possession timeline exists for Saima Center Point 2 M.A. Jinnah Road, because the project has not been formally launched. Any possession date quoted today would be speculation, and buyers should wait for the developer\'s official launch documentation.<\\/p>\",\"appt_title\":\"BOOK AN APPOINTMENT\",\"body\":\"<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">A premier benchmark for luxury waterfront living, seamlessly blending contemporary architectural elegance with a tranquil coastal sanctuary. Residents enjoy fresh sea breezes, private beach access, and immediate connectivity to key metropolitan hubs.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Located along prestigious shoreline corridors, the community offers an inspired lifestyle for professionals, investors, and families seeking refined island elegance away from urban congestion.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Every residence offers a harmonious blend of sophistication, security, and long-term capital appreciation, presenting an extraordinary investment opportunity in one of the most coveted coastal addresses.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>About the Developers<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Crafted by premier developers renowned for shaping iconic waterfront communities across the region for decades. Buyers and international investors benefit from a celebrated track record of timely delivery, construction excellence, and sustainable urban design.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Working alongside leading international architectural consultants and market advisory firms, every aspect of the project is engineered to global standards of prestige and durability.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Approvals &amp; Clearances<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The project holds full regulatory clearance and title approvals from all relevant municipal and developmental authorities. Complying strictly with environmental and structural guidelines, purchasers can invest with absolute peace of mind and secure freehold ownership.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Prime Location &amp; Seamless Connectivity<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Set within a scenic coastal landscape, the project offers rapid access to international airports, commercial business districts, premier private schools, and luxury retail destinations.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC1.png\\\" alt=\\\"Strategic Location &amp; Connectivity Map\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); width: 100%; margin: 15px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Surrounded by protected green reserves and pristine waters, residents wake up to panoramic coastal vistas and unpolluted air throughout the year.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Architectural Excellence &amp; Floor Plans<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The layouts focus on space efficiency, panoramic natural lighting, and seamless indoor-outdoor living with spacious private terraces and balconies.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>Curated Residences &amp; Layout Types<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC2.png\\\" alt=\\\"Luxury Layout Plan - Type C\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Featuring open-plan living rooms, floor-to-ceiling double-glazed windows, designer show kitchens, and lavish en-suite master bedrooms designed for modern family living.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC3.png\\\" alt=\\\"Executive Layout Plan - Type B\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Expansive terraces provide seamless entertaining spaces overlooking lush landscaped courtyards and the sparkling coastline.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC4.png\\\" alt=\\\"Presidential Villa Layout Plan - Type A\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Generous multi-level accommodations including private elevators, maid\'s quarters, private swimming pools, and dedicated family lounges.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Master Plan &amp; Community Lifestyle<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The community master plan establishes a secure, private, and walkable residential haven. Dedicated subterranean parking ensures pedestrian safety across surface walkways, cycling trails, and waterfront boardwalks.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC8.png\\\" alt=\\\"Community Master Plan Overview\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Flexible Investment &amp; Payment Plan<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>A buyer-friendly, construction-linked payment structure is offered with flexible milestones, making property acquisition straightforward and stress-free.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC12.png\\\" alt=\\\"Milestone Payment Structure\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>World-Class Facilities &amp; Amenities<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Enjoy infinity swimming pools, state-of-the-art fitness centres, private beach cabanas, children\'s play areas, multi-sport courts, and fine-dining waterfront restaurants just steps from your front door.<\\/p>\"}', '2026-10-29 12:04:38', '2026-11-03 07:00:03'),
(577, 76, 'payment_plan', 'Payment Plan', 7, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Center Point 2 Payment Plan\",\"description\":\"<div>No payment plan has been officially released for Saima Center Point 2 Saima Builders. If the project launches, its schedule will be published through the developer\'s authorised sales channel at that time. Until then, any payment plan or booking amount quoted under this name should be treated as unverified.<\\/div><div><br><\\/div>\",\"down_payment\":\"10%\",\"during_construction\":\"40%\",\"on_handover\":\"50%\",\"items\":[{\"milestone\":\"Down Payment\",\"percentage\":\"10%\",\"due\":\"On Booking Date\"},{\"milestone\":\"Construction Milestone 1\",\"percentage\":\"10%\",\"due\":\"6 Months after Booking\"},{\"milestone\":\"Construction Milestone 2\",\"percentage\":\"10%\",\"due\":\"12 Months after Booking\"},{\"milestone\":\"Construction Milestone 3\",\"percentage\":\"10%\",\"due\":\"18 Months after Booking\"},{\"milestone\":\"Construction Milestone 4\",\"percentage\":\"10%\",\"due\":\"24 Months after Booking\"},{\"milestone\":\"On Handover\",\"percentage\":\"50%\",\"due\":\"100% Completion\"}],\"plan_tabs\":null,\"download_text\":\"DOWNLOAD PAYMENT PLAN\",\"download_url\":\"#\"}', '2026-10-29 12:04:38', '2026-11-03 07:00:03'),
(578, 76, 'master_plan', 'Master Plan', 8, 1, '{\"title\":\"Master Plan\",\"description\":\"The master plan creates a harmonious, walkable enclave where residential clusters are woven naturally into open green parklands, pedestrian corridors, and scenic waterfront trails.\",\"image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793689203_6ae98673bc8f7.jpg\",\"badge\":\"Click to Enlarge\"}', '2026-10-29 12:04:38', '2026-11-03 07:00:03'),
(579, 76, 'location', 'Location & Connectivity', 9, 1, '{\"title\":\"Seamless Access, Prime Location\",\"description\":\"Conveniently located on Hudayriyat Island with direct access via modern bridges to Abu Dhabi\\u2019s key commercial, cultural, and travel hubs.\",\"items\":[{\"place\":\"Downtown Abu Dhabi\",\"time\":\"20 mins\"},{\"place\":\"Emirates Palace\",\"time\":\"23 mins\"},{\"place\":\"Sheikh Zayed Grand Mosque\",\"time\":\"23 mins\"},{\"place\":\"Abu Dhabi Global Financial Centre\",\"time\":\"30 mins\"},{\"place\":\"Louvre Abu Dhabi\",\"time\":\"33 mins\"},{\"place\":\"Zayed International Airport\",\"time\":\"34 mins\"}],\"subtitle\":null,\"image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793689203_6ae98673c243e.jpg\",\"categories\":[{\"name\":\"Near By Places\",\"items\":[{\"name\":\"M.A. Jinnah Road\",\"time\":\"2 Minutes\"},{\"name\":\"Saddar\",\"time\":\"5 Minutes\"},{\"name\":\"Numaish Chowrangi\",\"time\":\"8 Minutes\"}]}]}', '2026-10-29 12:04:38', '2026-11-03 07:00:03'),
(580, 76, 'faq', 'FAQ Accordion', 10, 1, '{\"title\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\",\"description\":\"Key information and helpful answers regarding property purchases on Hudayriyat Island.\",\"items\":[{\"q\":\"Where is Saima Center Point 2 Karachi located?\",\"a\":\"Where is Saima Center Point 2 Karachi located?\\r\\nSaima Center Point 2 has been reported in connection with M.A. Jinnah Road, Karachi, but its exact location has not been officially confirmed or released by the developer. Buyers should treat any plot-level address in third-party listings as unverified.\"},{\"q\":\"What is Saima Center Point 2 price?\",\"a\":\"No official Saima Center Point 2 price exists yet, because no price list has been published. Any figure quoted before an official launch should be treated as speculation, and buyers should wait for the developer\'s authorised price schedule.\"},{\"q\":\"How many bedrooms in Saima Center Point 2?\",\"a\":\"The unit mix for Saima Center Point 2 M.A. Jinnah Road has not been announced, so the number and size of apartments \\u2014 including bedroom counts \\u2014 remain unconfirmed until the developer publishes a unit schedule.\"},{\"q\":\"What is Saima Center Point 2 payment plan?\",\"a\":\"No Saima Center Point 2 payment plan or Saima Center Point 2 booking amount has been officially released. Buyers should not pay any amount against this project name until the developer opens booking through its authorised sales channel.\"},{\"q\":\"Is Saima Center Point 2 NOC approved?\",\"a\":\"No project-specific approval documentation for Saima Center Point 2 Saima Builders has been published. Buyers should verify the NOC and approval status directly with the developer or the relevant authority once the project is formally launched.\"},{\"q\":\"Is Saima Center Point 2 the same as Saima Center Point?\",\"a\":\"No. Saima Center Point is an established Saima Builders project on Main M.A. Jinnah Road near Saddar\\/Numaish with its own official project page, while Saima Center Point 2 is a separate, unconfirmed name. Buyers should confirm which project any payment or document refers to before proceeding.\"},{\"q\":\"Who is developing Saima Center Point 2?\",\"a\":\"The name is associated with Saima Builders, but the developer has not published a dedicated project page or launch announcement for Saima Center Point 2. Any booking claim should be verified with Saima Builders directly.\"},{\"q\":\"Can overseas buyers book in Saima Center Point 2?\",\"a\":\"There is no official booking open for Saima Center Point 2 yet. Overseas buyers should register interest only through the developer\'s authorised channels and should not remit funds against unverified offers.\"},{\"q\":\"Why consider Saima Center Point 2 Karachi?\",\"a\":\"Only as a watch-list name for buyers who specifically want the M.A. Jinnah Road corridor: the sensible step today is to register interest, follow the developer\'s official channels, and wait for confirmed launch documentation rather than acting on rumours.\"}],\"heading\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\"}', '2026-10-29 12:04:38', '2026-11-03 07:00:03'),
(581, 76, 'contact', 'Contact & Booking CTA', 11, 1, '{\"title\":\"Register Your Interest\",\"subtitle\":\"Register your interest in Saima Center Point 2 Karachi. Contact our advisory team for personalized guidance on Saima Center Point 2 Saima Builders, the official launch position, and private updates. Whether you are exploring apartments for sale Saima Center Point 2 or seeking to buy flat in Saima Center Point 2 Karachi when it launches, our consultants can keep you informed as verified details are released.\",\"button_text\":\"REGISTER INTEREST\",\"phone\":\"+971 2 000 0000\",\"email\":\"info@hudayriyat-island.com\",\"pretitle\":\"GET IN TOUCH\",\"heading\":\"Elevate Your Portfolio\",\"form_small\":\"REQUEST\",\"form_large\":\"A CALL BACK\",\"submit_button\":\"REQUEST NOW\",\"bg_image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793689203_6ae98673c709f.jpg\"}', '2026-10-29 12:04:38', '2026-11-03 07:00:03');
