(610, 80, 'content', 'Content', 6, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Corporate Center at PIDC Karachi Living & Waterfront Sanctuary\",\"intro\":\"<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Saima Corporate Center at PIDC Karachi is a premier benchmark for luxury waterfront living, seamlessly blending contemporary architectural elegance with a tranquil coastal sanctuary. Residents enjoy fresh sea breezes, private beach access, and immediate connectivity to key metropolitan hubs.<\\/p><p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:1rem\\\">Located along prestigious shoreline corridors, the community offers an inspired lifestyle for professionals, investors, and families seeking refined island elegance away from urban congestion.<\\/p><p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:1rem\\\">Every residence offers a harmonious blend of sophistication, security, and long-term capital appreciation, presenting an extraordinary investment opportunity in one of the most coveted coastal addresses.<\\/p>\",\"html\":\"<p>At its core, Saima Corporate Center is a mixed-use commercial tower with corporate offices, retail shops, showrooms, and business suites, all housed under one roof rather than scattered across separate buildings. The idea of Saima Corporate Center Saima Builders is fairly straightforward: give business owners a modern workspace that also functions as a legitimate investment property, and give investors a building with enough variety in unit types that demand does not rely on just one kind of tenant. There is a clear separation between the retail floors, which are meant to handle daily footfall and walk-in customers, and the office floors above, which are quieter and meant for people who actually work there.<\\/p><p>Saima Corporate Center Saima Builders has become one of the names that comes up fairly often in investor circles when the conversation turns to serious business addresses in Karachi, usually in the same breath as questions about location, pricing, and whether it is actually worth the money. With a known developer, a location that is not buried somewhere inconvenient, and a mix of office space, retail shops, and business suites, Saima Corporate Center offices is one of the notable commercial projects Karachi buyers compare when looking at corporate commercial towers Karachi.<\\/p><h2>Key Project Highlights<\\/h2><table><tbody><tr><th>Feature<\\/th><th>Details<\\/th><\\/tr><tr><td>Developer<\\/td><td>Saima Builders<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td>Property Type<\\/td><td>Commercial<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td>Unit Types<\\/td><td>Corporate offices, retail shops, showrooms and business suites<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td>Total Land Size<\\/td><td>Not disclosed<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td>Handover<\\/td><td>To be confirmed<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td>Location<\\/td><td>PIDC, opposite PC Hotel, Karachi<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td>Payment Plan<\\/td><td>Flexible installments<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td>Lifestyle<\\/td><td>Business hub<\\/td><\\/tr><\\/tbody><\\/table><h2>Master Plan and Development Framework<\\/h2><p>Saima Corporate Center offices are planned as a contemporary business hub rather than a traditional commercial plaza, with a master plan prepared with an emphasis on functionality, efficient circulation, and separating business activity by floor.<\\/p><p>The master plan of Saima Corporate Center Saima Builders reflects an attempt to balance pure functionality with something closer to an actual business district feel: dedicated parking that does not feel like an afterthought, common areas built with business use in mind rather than just decorative lobbies, and enough vertical space to comfortably fit a genuine mix of unit types without the building feeling cramped. The Saima Corporate Center floor plan follows a well-planned vertical layout that separates retail, parking, and corporate office spaces, with dedicated parking levels, premium office floors, and recreational facilities creating a complete commercial ecosystem for business offices Karachi.<\\/p><h2>Unit Types: Offices, Shops, Showrooms and Business Suites<\\/h2><p>For buyers searching for commercial offices for sale Karachi, office space for sale Karachi, or corporate offices Karachi, Saima Corporate Center offices offers commercial layouts in four unit categories.<\\/p><ul><li>Corporate offices<\\/li><li>Retail shops<\\/li><li>Showrooms<\\/li><li>Business suites<\\/li><\\/ul><h3>Corporate Offices in Saima Corporate Center<\\/h3><p>Saima Corporate Center offers premium office spaces for businesses that value a professional corporate address and a modern working environment. Saima Corporate Center offices are ideal for consultancies, corporate headquarters, branch offices, IT firms, financial institutions, and other service-based businesses looking to establish a strong presence among corporate offices Karachi.<\\/p><h3>Retail Shops in Saima Corporate Center<\\/h3><p>Ground and lower floors are generally set aside for retail, and shop owners on these floors get visibility and passing footfall that upper-floor units simply cannot compete with, no matter how nicely they are finished.<\\/p><h3>Showrooms in Saima Corporate Center<\\/h3><p>Larger-format units of Saima Corporate Center offices are meant for businesses that genuinely need display space, including furniture retailers, electronics brands, lifestyle stores, anything that benefits from a strong visual presence rather than a small storefront tucked in a corner.<\\/p><h3>Business Suites in Saima Corporate Center<\\/h3><p>Smaller, more flexible spaces are aimed at startups, freelancers, and small teams who want a legitimate business address without committing to an entire floor they do not actually need yet, which is a practical small office for sale Karachi option inside a recognised commercial tower.<\\/p><h2>Floor Plan<\\/h2><p>A floor plan for every unit category in Saima Corporate Center offices is available through the developer\'s authorised sales channel. Buyers seeking a Saima Corporate Center floor plan should request the unit schedule alongside the floor plan from the authorised sales channel, as office for sale Saima Corporate Center Karachi listings are often incomplete.<\\/p><h2>Price and Booking Status<\\/h2><p>The Saima Corporate Center price varies depending on unit type, floor, and size, and is disclosed through the developer\'s authorised sales channel. Retail shops on lower floors usually carry a premium over office units higher up, while business suites tend to sit at a more accessible price point. The Saima Corporate Center payment plan is structured to accommodate various buyer profiles, with flexible instalment options available on request.<\\/p><p>A Saima Corporate Center booking is processed through the developer\'s sales team, and the Saima Corporate Center booking amount should be confirmed in writing alongside the Saima Corporate Center payment plan. For buyers seeking a commercial office on installments Karachi, the practical route to buy office in Saima Corporate Center Karachi is to register interest directly with Saima Builders or its designated sales partners and obtain the current Saima Corporate Center payment plan before booking. Buyers should also request the Saima Corporate Center office price per sqft for their preferred unit type and floor.<\\/p><p>Saima Corporate Center Saima Builders buyers should also confirm whether office space for sale Karachi at this project is being offered through a priority allocation system or on a first-come, first-served basis.<\\/p><h2>NOC and Approval Status<\\/h2><p>Saima Corporate Center is stated to have obtained its No Objection Certificate from the relevant municipal authorities, which is a reassuring sign for anyone considering a purchase in a market where projects have run into regulatory trouble, stalled construction, and missing approvals.<\\/p><p>That said, buyers should still independently verify the current approval status directly with the developer or the authority in question before committing any money. Regulations shift, documentation gets updated, and a status that was accurate six months ago is not necessarily accurate today.<\\/p><h2>Possession Timeline<\\/h2><p>A formal possession date for Saima Corporate Center offices has not been announced as a single project-wide date. The final payment is made before possession, after which buyers can take ownership of their office space. Buyers should secure a documented possession schedule at the point of Saima Corporate Center booking, and Saima Corporate Center Karachi possession timelines should be confirmed in writing with the developer.<\\/p>\",\"appt_title\":\"BOOK AN APPOINTMENT\",\"body\":\"<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">A premier benchmark for luxury waterfront living, seamlessly blending contemporary architectural elegance with a tranquil coastal sanctuary. Residents enjoy fresh sea breezes, private beach access, and immediate connectivity to key metropolitan hubs.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Located along prestigious shoreline corridors, the community offers an inspired lifestyle for professionals, investors, and families seeking refined island elegance away from urban congestion.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Every residence offers a harmonious blend of sophistication, security, and long-term capital appreciation, presenting an extraordinary investment opportunity in one of the most coveted coastal addresses.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>About the Developers<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Crafted by premier developers renowned for shaping iconic waterfront communities across the region for decades. Buyers and international investors benefit from a celebrated track record of timely delivery, construction excellence, and sustainable urban design.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Working alongside leading international architectural consultants and market advisory firms, every aspect of the project is engineered to global standards of prestige and durability.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Approvals &amp; Clearances<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The project holds full regulatory clearance and title approvals from all relevant municipal and developmental authorities. Complying strictly with environmental and structural guidelines, purchasers can invest with absolute peace of mind and secure freehold ownership.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Prime Location &amp; Seamless Connectivity<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Set within a scenic coastal landscape, the project offers rapid access to international airports, commercial business districts, premier private schools, and luxury retail destinations.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC1.png\\\" alt=\\\"Strategic Location &amp; Connectivity Map\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); width: 100%; margin: 15px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Surrounded by protected green reserves and pristine waters, residents wake up to panoramic coastal vistas and unpolluted air throughout the year.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Architectural Excellence &amp; Floor Plans<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The layouts focus on space efficiency, panoramic natural lighting, and seamless indoor-outdoor living with spacious private terraces and balconies.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>Curated Residences &amp; Layout Types<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC2.png\\\" alt=\\\"Luxury Layout Plan - Type C\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Featuring open-plan living rooms, floor-to-ceiling double-glazed windows, designer show kitchens, and lavish en-suite master bedrooms designed for modern family living.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC3.png\\\" alt=\\\"Executive Layout Plan - Type B\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Expansive terraces provide seamless entertaining spaces overlooking lush landscaped courtyards and the sparkling coastline.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC4.png\\\" alt=\\\"Presidential Villa Layout Plan - Type A\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Generous multi-level accommodations including private elevators, maid\'s quarters, private swimming pools, and dedicated family lounges.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Master Plan &amp; Community Lifestyle<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The community master plan establishes a secure, private, and walkable residential haven. Dedicated subterranean parking ensures pedestrian safety across surface walkways, cycling trails, and waterfront boardwalks.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC8.png\\\" alt=\\\"Community Master Plan Overview\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Flexible Investment &amp; Payment Plan<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>A buyer-friendly, construction-linked payment structure is offered with flexible milestones, making property acquisition straightforward and stress-free.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC12.png\\\" alt=\\\"Milestone Payment Structure\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>World-Class Facilities &amp; Amenities<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Enjoy infinity swimming pools, state-of-the-art fitness centres, private beach cabanas, children\'s play areas, multi-sport courts, and fine-dining waterfront restaurants just steps from your front door.<\\/p>\"}', '2026-10-30 06:46:11', '2026-11-03 06:54:56'),
(611, 80, 'payment_plan', 'Payment Plan', 7, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Corporate Center Payment Plan\",\"description\":\"<p>The payment plan for Saima Corporate Center Saima Builders offers flexible options tailored to different buyer needs, including booking, allocation and confirmation, monthly and quarterly installments, and construction-linked milestone payments, with the final payment made before possession. Exact terms, schedules, and amounts are provided upon request through the developer\'s authorised sales channel, subject to revision.<\\/p>\",\"down_payment\":\"10%\",\"during_construction\":\"40%\",\"on_handover\":\"50%\",\"items\":[{\"milestone\":\"Down Payment\",\"percentage\":\"10%\",\"due\":\"On Booking Date\"},{\"milestone\":\"Construction Milestone 1\",\"percentage\":\"10%\",\"due\":\"6 Months after Booking\"},{\"milestone\":\"Construction Milestone 2\",\"percentage\":\"10%\",\"due\":\"12 Months after Booking\"},{\"milestone\":\"Construction Milestone 3\",\"percentage\":\"10%\",\"due\":\"18 Months after Booking\"},{\"milestone\":\"Construction Milestone 4\",\"percentage\":\"10%\",\"due\":\"24 Months after Booking\"},{\"milestone\":\"On Handover\",\"percentage\":\"50%\",\"due\":\"100% Completion\"}],\"plan_tabs\":null,\"download_text\":\"DOWNLOAD PAYMENT PLAN\",\"download_url\":\"#\"}', '2026-10-30 06:46:11', '2026-11-03 06:54:56'),
(612, 80, 'master_plan', 'Master Plan', 8, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Corporate Center Master Plan\",\"description\":\"The master plan creates a harmonious, walkable enclave where residential clusters are woven naturally into open green parklands, pedestrian corridors, and scenic waterfront trails.\",\"image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793688896_6ae9854097f34.jpg\",\"badge\":\"Click to Enlarge\"}', '2026-10-30 06:46:11', '2026-11-03 06:54:56'),
(613, 80, 'location', 'Location & Connectivity', 9, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Corporate Center Location at PIDC, Karachi\",\"description\":\"Conveniently located on Hudayriyat Island with direct access via modern bridges to Abu Dhabi\\u2019s key commercial, cultural, and travel hubs.\",\"items\":[{\"place\":\"Downtown Abu Dhabi\",\"time\":\"20 mins\"},{\"place\":\"Emirates Palace\",\"time\":\"23 mins\"},{\"place\":\"Sheikh Zayed Grand Mosque\",\"time\":\"23 mins\"},{\"place\":\"Abu Dhabi Global Financial Centre\",\"time\":\"30 mins\"},{\"place\":\"Louvre Abu Dhabi\",\"time\":\"33 mins\"},{\"place\":\"Zayed International Airport\",\"time\":\"34 mins\"}],\"subtitle\":\"The Saima Corporate Center Karachi location is at PIDC, opposite Pearl Continental (PC) Hotel, placing it in the heart of Karachi\'s commercial district. Its central position provides excellent connectivity to the city\'s major business hubs, financial institutions, and upscale residential communities. Saima Corporate Center offices offer direct access to Beaumont Road and is only minutes away from Shahrah-e-Faisal, with Clifton, DHA, Saddar, and I.I. Chundrigar Road nearby, making it an ideal destination among office spaces in Karachi for corporate offices, retail businesses, and investors.\",\"image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793688896_6ae9854099d00.jpg\",\"categories\":[{\"name\":\"Near By Places & Attractions\",\"items\":[{\"name\":\"Pearl Continental (PC) Hotel\",\"time\":\"2 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"Shahrah-e-Faisal\",\"time\":\"5 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"I.I. Chundrigar Road\",\"time\":\"10 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"Clifton\",\"time\":\"10 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"DHA Karachi\",\"time\":\"15 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"Tariq Road\",\"time\":\"15 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"PECHS\",\"time\":\"15 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"Jinnah International Airport\",\"time\":\"30 minutes\"}]}]}', '2026-10-30 06:46:11', '2026-11-03 06:54:56'),
(614, 80, 'faq', 'FAQ Accordion', 10, 1, '{\"title\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\",\"description\":\"Key information and helpful answers regarding property purchases on Hudayriyat Island.\",\"items\":[{\"q\":\"Where is Saima Corporate Center located?\",\"a\":\"Saima Corporate Center Saima Builders is located at PIDC, Karachi, opposite Pearl Continental (PC) Hotel, with direct access to Beaumont Road and Shahrah-e-Faisal nearby. Saima Corporate Center Karachi is easily accessible from Clifton, DHA, Saddar, and I.I. Chundrigar Road.\"},{\"q\":\"What is Saima Corporate Center price?\",\"a\":\"A confirmed public Saima Corporate Center price list has not been released; pricing varies by unit type, floor, and size and is available through the developer\'s authorised sales channel for Saima Corporate Center Karachi.\"},{\"q\":\"What office sizes in Saima Corporate Center?\",\"a\":\"Office sizes vary by floor and unit type across corporate offices, retail shops, showrooms, and business suites, but exact sizes should be confirmed against the official Saima Corporate Center floor plan for Saima Corporate Center Karachi.\"},{\"q\":\"What is Saima Corporate Center payment plan?\",\"a\":\"The Saima Corporate Center payment plan and Saima Corporate Center booking amount are disclosed through sales engagement rather than a public schedule\"},{\"q\":\"Is Saima Corporate Center NOC approved?\",\"a\":\"Saima Corporate Center offices is stated to have obtained its No Objection Certificate from the relevant municipal authorities; a project-specific NOC for Saima Corporate Center Karachi should still be verified directly with the developer or the authority in question before purchase.\"},{\"q\":\"When is Saima Corporate Center possession?\",\"a\":\"When is Saima Corporate Center possession?\\r\\nPossession is not publicly fixed, so Saima Corporate Center Saima Builders buyers should confirm the schedule in writing at booking.\"},{\"q\":\"Who is developing Saima Corporate Center?\",\"a\":\"Saima Corporate Center is developed by Saima Group, which has built both residential communities and commercial towers across Karachi over several decades.\"},{\"q\":\"Is Saima Corporate Center part of a larger project?\",\"a\":\"No, Saima Corporate Center is a standalone mixed-use commercial tower, housing corporate offices, retail shops, showrooms, and business suites under one roof.\"},{\"q\":\"Can overseas buyers book in Saima Corporate Center?\",\"a\":\"Overseas buyers can engage through authorised channels, but remittance and documentation procedures should be confirmed directly with the Saima Corporate Center sales team.\"},{\"q\":\"Why consider Saima Corporate Center Karachi?\",\"a\":\"Because Saima Corporate Center sits at PIDC opposite PC Hotel in the heart of Karachi\'s commercial district, offering a recognised business address, high rental potential, and a mix of unit types that does not rely on one kind of tenant. Saima Corporate Center Karachi also provides a clear commercial identity within Saima Builders\' portfolio.\"}],\"heading\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\"}', '2026-10-30 06:46:11', '2026-11-03 06:54:56'),
(615, 80, 'contact', 'Contact & Booking CTA', 11, 1, '{\"title\":\"Register Your Interest\",\"subtitle\":\"Discover exceptional commercial opportunities at Saima Corporate Center Karachi. Contact our advisory team for personalized guidance onSaima Corporate Center Saima Builders, updated pricing, and private viewings. Whether you are exploring commercial offices for sale Karachi or seeking to buy office in Saima Corporate Center Karachi, our consultants can navigate the Saima Corporate Center booking process.\",\"button_text\":\"REGISTER INTEREST\",\"phone\":\"+971 2 000 0000\",\"email\":\"info@hudayriyat-island.com\",\"pretitle\":\"LET\'S CONNECT\",\"heading\":\"Invest in Your Future\",\"form_small\":\"REQUEST\",\"form_large\":\"A CALL BACK\",\"submit_button\":\"REQUEST NOW\",\"bg_image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793688896_6ae985409b57b.jpg\"}', '2026-10-30 06:46:11', '2026-11-03 06:54:56'),
(616, 81, 'hero', 'Hero Banner', 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Main Super Highway\",\"subtitle\":\"Explore Premier Properties & Real Estate Investment in Main Super Highway, Karachi\",\"badge\":\"Prime Real Estate Destination\",\"bg_image\":\"\\/images\\/hero\\/slide-1.jpg\"}', '2026-10-30 06:52:14', '2026-10-30 06:52:14'),
(617, 81, 'content', 'Table of Contents & Article', 2, 1, '{\"title\":\"Main Super Highway Living & Waterfront Sanctuary\",\"intro\":\"<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Main Super Highway is a premier benchmark for luxury waterfront living, seamlessly blending contemporary architectural elegance with a tranquil coastal sanctuary. Residents enjoy fresh sea breezes, private beach access, and immediate connectivity to key metropolitan hubs.<\\/p><p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:1rem\\\">Located along prestigious shoreline corridors, the community offers an inspired lifestyle for professionals, investors, and families seeking refined island elegance away from urban congestion.<\\/p><p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:1rem\\\">Every residence offers a harmonious blend of sophistication, security, and long-term capital appreciation, presenting an extraordinary investment opportunity in one of the most coveted coastal addresses.<\\/p>\",\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">A premier benchmark for luxury waterfront living, seamlessly blending contemporary architectural elegance with a tranquil coastal sanctuary. Residents enjoy fresh sea breezes, private beach access, and immediate connectivity to key metropolitan hubs.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Located along prestigious shoreline corridors, the community offers an inspired lifestyle for professionals, investors, and families seeking refined island elegance away from urban congestion.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Every residence offers a harmonious blend of sophistication, security, and long-term capital appreciation, presenting an extraordinary investment opportunity in one of the most coveted coastal addresses.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>About the Developers<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Crafted by premier developers renowned for shaping iconic waterfront communities across the region for decades. Buyers and international investors benefit from a celebrated track record of timely delivery, construction excellence, and sustainable urban design.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Working alongside leading international architectural consultants and market advisory firms, every aspect of the project is engineered to global standards of prestige and durability.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Approvals &amp; Clearances<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The project holds full regulatory clearance and title approvals from all relevant municipal and developmental authorities. Complying strictly with environmental and structural guidelines, purchasers can invest with absolute peace of mind and secure freehold ownership.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Prime Location &amp; Seamless Connectivity<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Set within a scenic coastal landscape, the project offers rapid access to international airports, commercial business districts, premier private schools, and luxury retail destinations.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC1.png\\\" alt=\\\"Strategic Location &amp; Connectivity Map\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); width: 100%; margin: 15px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Surrounded by protected green reserves and pristine waters, residents wake up to panoramic coastal vistas and unpolluted air throughout the year.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Architectural Excellence &amp; Floor Plans<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The layouts focus on space efficiency, panoramic natural lighting, and seamless indoor-outdoor living with spacious private terraces and balconies.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>Curated Residences &amp; Layout Types<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC2.png\\\" alt=\\\"Luxury Layout Plan - Type C\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Featuring open-plan living rooms, floor-to-ceiling double-glazed windows, designer show kitchens, and lavish en-suite master bedrooms designed for modern family living.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC3.png\\\" alt=\\\"Executive Layout Plan - Type B\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Expansive terraces provide seamless entertaining spaces overlooking lush landscaped courtyards and the sparkling coastline.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC4.png\\\" alt=\\\"Presidential Villa Layout Plan - Type A\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Generous multi-level accommodations including private elevators, maid\'s quarters, private swimming pools, and dedicated family lounges.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Master Plan &amp; Community Lifestyle<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The community master plan establishes a secure, private, and walkable residential haven. Dedicated subterranean parking ensures pedestrian safety across surface walkways, cycling trails, and waterfront boardwalks.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC8.png\\\" alt=\\\"Community Master Plan Overview\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Flexible Investment &amp; Payment Plan<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>A buyer-friendly, construction-linked payment structure is offered with flexible milestones, making property acquisition straightforward and stress-free.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC12.png\\\" alt=\\\"Milestone Payment Structure\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>World-Class Facilities &amp; Amenities<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Enjoy infinity swimming pools, state-of-the-art fitness centres, private beach cabanas, children\'s play areas, multi-sport courts, and fine-dining waterfront restaurants just steps from your front door.<\\/p>\",\"appt_title\":\"BOOK AN APPOINTMENT\",\"body\":\"<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">A premier benchmark for luxury waterfront living, seamlessly blending contemporary architectural elegance with a tranquil coastal sanctuary. Residents enjoy fresh sea breezes, private beach access, and immediate connectivity to key metropolitan hubs.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Located along prestigious shoreline corridors, the community offers an inspired lifestyle for professionals, investors, and families seeking refined island elegance away from urban congestion.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Every residence offers a harmonious blend of sophistication, security, and long-term capital appreciation, presenting an extraordinary investment opportunity in one of the most coveted coastal addresses.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>About the Developers<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Crafted by premier developers renowned for shaping iconic waterfront communities across the region for decades. Buyers and international investors benefit from a celebrated track record of timely delivery, construction excellence, and sustainable urban design.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Working alongside leading international architectural consultants and market advisory firms, every aspect of the project is engineered to global standards of prestige and durability.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Approvals &amp; Clearances<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The project holds full regulatory clearance and title approvals from all relevant municipal and developmental authorities. Complying strictly with environmental and structural guidelines, purchasers can invest with absolute peace of mind and secure freehold ownership.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Prime Location &amp; Seamless Connectivity<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Set within a scenic coastal landscape, the project offers rapid access to international airports, commercial business districts, premier private schools, and luxury retail destinations.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC1.png\\\" alt=\\\"Strategic Location &amp; Connectivity Map\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); width: 100%; margin: 15px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Surrounded by protected green reserves and pristine waters, residents wake up to panoramic coastal vistas and unpolluted air throughout the year.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Architectural Excellence &amp; Floor Plans<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The layouts focus on space efficiency, panoramic natural lighting, and seamless indoor-outdoor living with spacious private terraces and balconies.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>Curated Residences &amp; Layout Types<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC2.png\\\" alt=\\\"Luxury Layout Plan - Type C\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Featuring open-plan living rooms, floor-to-ceiling double-glazed windows, designer show kitchens, and lavish en-suite master bedrooms designed for modern family living.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC3.png\\\" alt=\\\"Executive Layout Plan - Type B\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Expansive terraces provide seamless entertaining spaces overlooking lush landscaped courtyards and the sparkling coastline.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC4.png\\\" alt=\\\"Presidential Villa Layout Plan - Type A\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Generous multi-level accommodations including private elevators, maid\'s quarters, private swimming pools, and dedicated family lounges.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Master Plan &amp; Community Lifestyle<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The community master plan establishes a secure, private, and walkable residential haven. Dedicated subterranean parking ensures pedestrian safety across surface walkways, cycling trails, and waterfront boardwalks.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC8.png\\\" alt=\\\"Community Master Plan Overview\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Flexible Investment &amp; Payment Plan<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>A buyer-friendly, construction-linked payment structure is offered with flexible milestones, making property acquisition straightforward and stress-free.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC12.png\\\" alt=\\\"Milestone Payment Structure\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>World-Class Facilities &amp; Amenities<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Enjoy infinity swimming pools, state-of-the-art fitness centres, private beach cabanas, children\'s play areas, multi-sport courts, and fine-dining waterfront restaurants just steps from your front door.<\\/p>\"}', '2026-10-30 06:52:14', '2026-10-30 06:52:14'),
(618, 81, 'communities', 'Project Cards', 3, 1, '{\"heading\":\"Featured Projects\",\"subtitle\":\"Explore premium residential and commercial developments\",\"items\":[{\"name\":\"Wadeem Gardens\",\"location\":\"Hudayriyat Island, Abu Dhabi\",\"price\":\"Launch Price: 8.7M AED\",\"delivery\":\"Delivery Date: Q2 2031\",\"developer\":\"Modon Properties\",\"paymentPlan\":\"Flexible Payment Plan\",\"href\":\"\\/wadeem-gardens\",\"image\":\"\\/images\\/communities\\/wadeem-gardens.png\"}],\"selected_ids\":[],\"project_ids\":[]}', '2026-10-30 06:52:14', '2026-10-30 06:52:14'),
(619, 81, 'about', 'About Main Super Highway', 4, 1, '{\"title\":\"About the Community\",\"description\":\"A meticulously planned coastal sanctuary seamlessly integrating contemporary luxury living with untouched nature. Spanning scenic waterfronts, lush mangroves, and cycling corridors, the master community offers an unmatched urban lifestyle for residents and high-yield potential for global real estate investors.\",\"video_poster\":\"\\/images\\/projects\\/poster.jpg\",\"video_src\":\"\\/images\\/nawayef-park-views\\/asset_15.mp4\",\"heading\":\"About the Community\",\"video_url\":\"https:\\/\\/stream.mux.com\\/A3200aZtT5Wq7VlYwQv3wP9W2hX8.m3u8\",\"poster_image\":\"\\/images\\/projects\\/poster.jpg\"}', '2026-10-30 06:52:14', '2026-10-30 06:52:14'),
(620, 81, 'faq', 'Frequently Asked Questions', 5, 1, '{\"title\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\",\"description\":\"<p>Key information and helpful answers regarding Main Super Highway and property purchases on Hudayriyat Island.<\\/p>\",\"items\":[{\"q\":\"Are properties in this city freehold for foreign and overseas investors?\",\"a\":\"Yes, designated luxury master developments offer 100% freehold ownership for local and international buyers with complete title deed registration.\"},{\"q\":\"What are the typical payment plans available?\",\"a\":\"Flexible installment plans are offered typically linked to construction milestones, with down payments starting from 5% to 10%.\"}],\"heading\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\",\"subtitle\":\"Find answers to common questions about properties, buying process, and payment plans.\"}', '2026-10-30 06:52:14', '2026-10-30 06:52:14'),
(621, 81, 'contact', 'Contact & Booking CTA', 6, 1, '{\"title\":\"Register Your Interest in Main Super Highway\",\"subtitle\":\"Connect with our dedicated city property advisors for personalized availability, floor plans, and VIP access.\",\"button_text\":\"REGISTER INTEREST\",\"phone\":\"+971 2 000 0000\",\"email\":\"info@hudayriyat-island.ae\"}', '2026-10-30 06:52:14', '2026-10-30 06:52:14'),
(622, 82, 'hero', 'Hero Banner & Form', 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"ZSZ Midtown Farms at Main Super Highway Karachi\",\"subtitle\":\"ZSZ Midtown Farms at Main Super Highway Karachi\",\"badge\":null,\"bg_image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793688713_6ae98489e203e.jpg\",\"bg_image_alt\":\"ZSZ Midtown Farms at Main Super Highway Karachi\",\"image_alt\":\"ZSZ Midtown Farms at Main Super Highway Karachi\"}', '2026-10-30 06:53:44', '2026-11-03 06:51:53'),
(623, 82, 'highlights', 'Project Highlights', 2, 1, '{\"developer\":\"Modon Properties\",\"price\":\"AED 2,500,000\",\"handover\":\"Q4 2028\",\"property_type\":\"Luxury Villas & Apartments\",\"bedrooms\":\"2 to 5 Bedrooms\",\"items\":[],\"highlight_0\":\"Saima Builders\",\"highlight_1\":\"Coming Soon\",\"highlight_2\":\"Q4 2028\",\"highlight_3\":\"Residential plots\",\"highlight_4\":\"Freehold\",\"location\":\"Main Super Highway Karachi\",\"highlight_new_1793343359099\":\"\"}', '2026-10-30 06:53:44', '2026-11-10 10:19:02'),
(624, 82, 'about', 'About Community', 3, 1, '{\"title\":\"ZSZ Midtown Farms by Saima Builders\",\"description\":\"<p>ZSZ Midtown Farms is a residential gated community project by Saima Group (Saima Builders) on the Main Super Highway (Karachi-Hyderabad Highway), adjacent to Bahria Town Karachi (Bahria-2), Karachi, Pakistan, spread over 390 acres, offering residential plots of 175, 240, 500, and 1,000 square yards, with a Coming Soon status.<\\/p>\",\"video_poster\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793688713_6ae98489e4181.jpg\",\"video_src\":\"\\/images\\/nawayef-park-views\\/asset_15.mp4\",\"video_url\":\"\\/images\\/nawayef-park-views\\/asset_15.mp4\"}', '2026-10-30 06:53:44', '2026-11-03 06:51:53'),
(625, 82, 'amenities', 'Amenities & Facilities', 4, 1, '{\"title\":\"ZSZ Midtown Farms Amenities\",\"subtitle\":\"ZSZ Midtown Farms Karachi provides community facilities planned across its 390-acre gated layout, including CCTV surveillance, wide carpeted roads, reliable utilities covering electricity, gas, and water, a community center, mosques, play areas, jogging tracks, extensive green spaces, and dedicated commercial zones within the ZSZ Midtown Farms development.\",\"items\":[]}', '2026-10-30 06:53:44', '2026-11-10 10:19:02'),
(626, 82, 'gallery', 'Project Gallery', 5, 1, '{\"title\":\"Project Gallery\",\"images\":[{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793688713_6ae98489e64cc.jpg\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"},{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793688713_6ae98489e6c7c.jpg\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"},{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793688713_6ae98489e753f.jpg\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"},{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793688713_6ae98489e7d56.jpg\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"}]}', '2026-10-30 06:53:44', '2026-11-03 06:51:53');
