(681, 89, 'about', 'About Community', 3, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Excellency by Saima Builders\",\"description\":\"<p>Saima Excellency is a completed residential apartment project in Gulshan-e-Iqbal, Karachi, offering 2-bedroom and 3-bedroom apartments by Saima Builders, featuring a ready-to-move address in one of Karachi\'s most established family neighbourhoods.<\\/p>\",\"video_poster\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793688006_6ae981c6c9604.webp\",\"video_src\":\"\\/images\\/nawayef-park-views\\/asset_15.mp4\",\"video_url\":\"\\/images\\/nawayef-park-views\\/asset_15.mp4\"}', '2026-10-30 07:36:33', '2026-11-03 06:40:06'),
(682, 89, 'amenities', 'Amenities & Facilities', 4, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Excellency Amenities\",\"subtitle\":\"Saima Excellency Karachi provides facilities that support comfortable family living, including a swimming pool, a gym, double-basement parking, landscaped gardens, and 24\\/7 CCTV security within the Saima Excellency Saima Builders development.\",\"items\":[]}', '2026-10-30 07:36:33', '2026-11-10 10:17:30'),
(683, 89, 'gallery', 'Project Gallery', 5, 1, '{\"title\":\"Project Gallery\",\"images\":[{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793688006_6ae981c6ca972.webp\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"},{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793688006_6ae981c6caa93.webp\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"},{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793688006_6ae981c6cab70.webp\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"},{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793688006_6ae981c6cac3c.webp\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"}]}', '2026-10-30 07:36:33', '2026-11-03 06:40:06'),
(684, 89, 'content', 'Content', 6, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Excellency at Gulshan-e-Iqbal Karachi Living & Waterfront Sanctuary\",\"intro\":\"<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Saima Excellency at Gulshan-e-Iqbal Karachi is a premier benchmark for luxury waterfront living, seamlessly blending contemporary architectural elegance with a tranquil coastal sanctuary. Residents enjoy fresh sea breezes, private beach access, and immediate connectivity to key metropolitan hubs.<\\/p><p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:1rem\\\">Located along prestigious shoreline corridors, the community offers an inspired lifestyle for professionals, investors, and families seeking refined island elegance away from urban congestion.<\\/p><p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:1rem\\\">Every residence offers a harmonious blend of sophistication, security, and long-term capital appreciation, presenting an extraordinary investment opportunity in one of the most coveted coastal addresses.<\\/p>\",\"html\":\"<p>At its core, Saima Excellency Saima Builders is a completed apartment project, which changes the buying equation completely: instead of purchasing a promise and waiting through construction, families can view finished homes in an established neighbourhood and plan an actual move. Saima Excellency apartments offer 2-bedroom and 3-bedroom apartments suited to small and growing households.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Saima Excellency Saima Builders sits within Saima Builders luxury projects Karachi in the broader sense of the developer\'s established portfolio, and it competes in the segment of high-rise apartments Karachi buyers shortlist when they want a ready home in a proven location rather than a long construction timeline. For families, the combination of a completed building and a settled district is the main draw.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Key Project Highlights<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<table>\\r\\n<tbody><tr>\\r\\n<th>Feature<\\/th>\\r\\n<th>Details<\\/th>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Developer<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Saima Builders<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Property Type<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Residential<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Unit Types<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>2 & 3-bedroom apartments<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Total Land Size<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Approximately 1-acre parcel<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Handover<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Ready to move<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Location<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Gulshan-e-Iqbal, Karachi<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Payment Plan<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Ready-to-move terms<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Lifestyle<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Family living<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<\\/tbody><\\/table>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Master Plan and Development Framework<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Saima Excellency Saima Builders was planned as a family residential development in Gulshan-e-Iqbal, with a master plan that emphasises efficient apartment layouts, shared amenities, and organised parking rather than a scattered low-rise layout.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The framework reflects a practical approach to urban family living: double-basement parking that keeps vehicles organised, landscaped open areas within the development, and apartment floors planned around everyday family use. The Saima Excellency floor plan keeps the living spaces functional and the bedrooms private, consistent with a completed, occupied-style residential project.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Unit Types: 2 & 3-Bedroom Apartments<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>For buyers searching for apartments for sale Saima Excellency Karachi or flats for sale Saima Excellency Karachi, Saima Excellency Karachi offers ready-to-move layouts in two categories.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>2-Bedroom Apartments in Saima Excellency<\\/h3>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The 2-bedroom apartments in Saima Excellency Saima Builders suit small families, couples, and first-time buyers who want a ready home in Gulshan-e-Iqbal without a construction wait. The layout keeps the living area practical and the bedrooms comfortable for everyday family use.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>3-Bedroom Apartments in Saima Excellency<\\/h3>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The 3-bedroom apartments in Saima Excellency Saima Builders suit larger and growing families who need an extra room for children, parents, or a home office. These units offer more living space within the same established Gulshan-e-Iqbal address.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Floor Plan<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>A floor plan for each apartment type is available through the developer\'s authorised sales channel. Buyers seeking a Saima Excellency apartment price or a Saima Excellency floor plan should request the unit schedule alongside the floor plan from the authorised sales channel, as listings for completed projects change with availability.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Price and Booking Status<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The Saima Excellency price varies depending on unit type, size, and floor, and current pricing is disclosed through the developer\'s authorised sales channel. The Saima Excellency payment plan should be confirmed alongside pricing, as ready-to-move projects are sold on different terms from under-construction launches.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>A Saima Excellency booking is processed through the developer\'s sales team, and the Saima Excellency booking amount should be confirmed in writing alongside the Saima Excellency payment plan. Buyers asking about Saima Excellency apartments on installments should confirm the current terms in writing at booking, as the project is completed and ready to move. The practical route to buy flat in Saima Excellency Saima Builders is to register interest directly with Saima Builders or its designated sales partners and obtain the current Saima Excellency apartment price before booking.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Saima Ace Residency Saima Builders buyers should also confirm whether flats for sale Saima Excellency Karachi are available directly or through resale, as availability in a completed project changes over time.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>NOC and Approval Status<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Because Saima Excellency is a completed project listed among Saima Builders\' delivered developments, its approval documentation should be available for inspection through the developer. Buyers should still request the project-specific approval documents for their unit before purchase.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Regulations and records can be updated over time, so current documentation should be checked directly with the developer or the relevant authority rather than relying on older listings.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Possession Timeline<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Saima Ace Residency Saima Builders is a completed project, so possession follows completion of the payment and transfer formalities rather than a future construction date. Buyers should confirm the possession and documentation process in writing at booking for their Saima Excellency apartments unit.<\\/p>\",\"appt_title\":\"BOOK AN APPOINTMENT\",\"body\":\"<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">A premier benchmark for luxury waterfront living, seamlessly blending contemporary architectural elegance with a tranquil coastal sanctuary. Residents enjoy fresh sea breezes, private beach access, and immediate connectivity to key metropolitan hubs.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Located along prestigious shoreline corridors, the community offers an inspired lifestyle for professionals, investors, and families seeking refined island elegance away from urban congestion.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Every residence offers a harmonious blend of sophistication, security, and long-term capital appreciation, presenting an extraordinary investment opportunity in one of the most coveted coastal addresses.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>About the Developers<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Crafted by premier developers renowned for shaping iconic waterfront communities across the region for decades. Buyers and international investors benefit from a celebrated track record of timely delivery, construction excellence, and sustainable urban design.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Working alongside leading international architectural consultants and market advisory firms, every aspect of the project is engineered to global standards of prestige and durability.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Approvals &amp; Clearances<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The project holds full regulatory clearance and title approvals from all relevant municipal and developmental authorities. Complying strictly with environmental and structural guidelines, purchasers can invest with absolute peace of mind and secure freehold ownership.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Prime Location &amp; Seamless Connectivity<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Set within a scenic coastal landscape, the project offers rapid access to international airports, commercial business districts, premier private schools, and luxury retail destinations.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC1.png\\\" alt=\\\"Strategic Location &amp; Connectivity Map\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); width: 100%; margin: 15px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Surrounded by protected green reserves and pristine waters, residents wake up to panoramic coastal vistas and unpolluted air throughout the year.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Architectural Excellence &amp; Floor Plans<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The layouts focus on space efficiency, panoramic natural lighting, and seamless indoor-outdoor living with spacious private terraces and balconies.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>Curated Residences &amp; Layout Types<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC2.png\\\" alt=\\\"Luxury Layout Plan - Type C\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Featuring open-plan living rooms, floor-to-ceiling double-glazed windows, designer show kitchens, and lavish en-suite master bedrooms designed for modern family living.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC3.png\\\" alt=\\\"Executive Layout Plan - Type B\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Expansive terraces provide seamless entertaining spaces overlooking lush landscaped courtyards and the sparkling coastline.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC4.png\\\" alt=\\\"Presidential Villa Layout Plan - Type A\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Generous multi-level accommodations including private elevators, maid\'s quarters, private swimming pools, and dedicated family lounges.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Master Plan &amp; Community Lifestyle<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The community master plan establishes a secure, private, and walkable residential haven. Dedicated subterranean parking ensures pedestrian safety across surface walkways, cycling trails, and waterfront boardwalks.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC8.png\\\" alt=\\\"Community Master Plan Overview\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Flexible Investment &amp; Payment Plan<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>A buyer-friendly, construction-linked payment structure is offered with flexible milestones, making property acquisition straightforward and stress-free.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC12.png\\\" alt=\\\"Milestone Payment Structure\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>World-Class Facilities &amp; Amenities<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Enjoy infinity swimming pools, state-of-the-art fitness centres, private beach cabanas, children\'s play areas, multi-sport courts, and fine-dining waterfront restaurants just steps from your front door.<\\/p>\"}', '2026-10-30 07:36:33', '2026-11-03 06:40:06'),
(685, 89, 'payment_plan', 'Payment Plan', 7, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Excellency Payment Plan\",\"description\":\"Because Saima Excellency apartments are completed , the payment terms differ from under-construction launches: the Saima Excellency payment plan, booking amount, and transfer process are confirmed in writing through the developer\'s authorised sales channel at the time of booking, and the exact terms should be obtained before committing.\",\"down_payment\":\"10%\",\"during_construction\":\"40%\",\"on_handover\":\"50%\",\"items\":[{\"milestone\":\"Down Payment\",\"percentage\":\"10%\",\"due\":\"On Booking Date\"},{\"milestone\":\"Construction Milestone 1\",\"percentage\":\"10%\",\"due\":\"6 Months after Booking\"},{\"milestone\":\"Construction Milestone 2\",\"percentage\":\"10%\",\"due\":\"12 Months after Booking\"},{\"milestone\":\"Construction Milestone 3\",\"percentage\":\"10%\",\"due\":\"18 Months after Booking\"},{\"milestone\":\"Construction Milestone 4\",\"percentage\":\"10%\",\"due\":\"24 Months after Booking\"},{\"milestone\":\"On Handover\",\"percentage\":\"50%\",\"due\":\"100% Completion\"}],\"plan_tabs\":null,\"download_text\":\"DOWNLOAD PAYMENT PLAN\",\"download_url\":\"#\"}', '2026-10-30 07:36:33', '2026-11-03 06:40:06'),
(686, 89, 'master_plan', 'Master Plan', 8, 1, '{\"title\":\"Master Plan\",\"description\":\"The master plan creates a harmonious, walkable enclave where residential clusters are woven naturally into open green parklands, pedestrian corridors, and scenic waterfront trails.\",\"image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793688006_6ae981c6cf0d0.webp\",\"badge\":\"Click to Enlarge\"}', '2026-10-30 07:36:33', '2026-11-03 06:40:06'),
(687, 89, 'location', 'Location & Connectivity', 9, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Excellency Location in Gulshan-e-Iqbal, Karachi\",\"description\":\"Conveniently located on Hudayriyat Island with direct access via modern bridges to Abu Dhabi\\u2019s key commercial, cultural, and travel hubs.\",\"items\":[{\"place\":\"Downtown Abu Dhabi\",\"time\":\"20 mins\"},{\"place\":\"Emirates Palace\",\"time\":\"23 mins\"},{\"place\":\"Sheikh Zayed Grand Mosque\",\"time\":\"23 mins\"},{\"place\":\"Abu Dhabi Global Financial Centre\",\"time\":\"30 mins\"},{\"place\":\"Louvre Abu Dhabi\",\"time\":\"33 mins\"},{\"place\":\"Zayed International Airport\",\"time\":\"34 mins\"}],\"subtitle\":\"The Saima Excellency Karachi location is in Gulshan-e-Iqbal, one of Karachi\'s most established residential districts. The neighbourhood of Saima Excellency apartments offers access to University Road and the wider city, along with schools, hospitals, markets, and everyday retail that suit family living. For buyers comparing family apartments Karachi, this is a settled address rather than a developing one.\",\"image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793688006_6ae981c6d0377.webp\",\"categories\":[{\"name\":\"Nearby Landmarks And Attractions:\",\"items\":[{\"name\":\"Millennium Mall\",\"time\":\"3\\u20135 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"Aga Khan University Hospital (Main Campus)\",\"time\":\"7\\u201310 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"University Road\",\"time\":\"3\\u20135 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"Karachi University\",\"time\":\"10\\u201315 minutes\"}]}]}', '2026-10-30 07:36:33', '2026-11-03 06:40:06'),
(688, 89, 'faq', 'FAQ Accordion', 10, 1, '{\"title\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\",\"description\":\"Key information and helpful answers regarding property purchases on Hudayriyat Island.\",\"items\":[{\"q\":\"Where is Saima Excellency located?\",\"a\":\"Saima Excellency is located in Gulshan-e-Iqbal, Karachi, one of the city\'s most established residential districts. The Saima Excellency Karachi location offers access to University Road, with Millennium Mall and Aga Khan University Hospital nearby.\"},{\"q\":\"What is Saima Excellency price?\",\"a\":\"A confirmed public Saima Excellency price list has not been released; pricing varies by unit type, size, and floor and is available through the developer\'s authorised sales channel for Saima Excellency apartments.\"},{\"q\":\"How many bedrooms in Saima Excellency?\",\"a\":\"Saima Excellency apartments offer 2-bedroom and 3-bedroom apartments, so buyers can choose a layout that matches their household size within Saima Ace Residency Saima Builders.\"},{\"q\":\"What is Saima Excellency payment plan?\",\"a\":\"Because Saima Excellency apartments are completed and ready to move, the Saima Excellency payment plan and Saima Excellency booking amount should be confirmed in writing through the developer\'s authorised sales channel at booking.\"},{\"q\":\"Is Saima Excellency NOC approved?\",\"a\":\"Buyers should verify the project-specific NOC and approval documents for Saima Excellency Karachi directly with the developer or the relevant authority before purchase.\"},{\"q\":\"Who is developing Saima Excellency?\",\"a\":\"Saima Excellency is developed by Saima Group, which has built residential communities across Karachi over several decades.\"},{\"q\":\"Is Saima Excellency part of a larger project?\",\"a\":\"No,Saima Ace Residency Saima Builders  is a standalone completed apartment project in Gulshan-e-Iqbal, Karachi.\"},{\"q\":\"Can overseas buyers book in Saima Excellency?\",\"a\":\"Overseas buyers can engage through authorised channels, but remittance and documentation procedures should be confirmed directly with the Saima Excellency sales team.\"},{\"q\":\"Why consider Saima Excellency Karachi?\",\"a\":\"Because Saima Excellency is a completed, ready-to-move project in established Gulshan-e-Iqbal, so families can move in without waiting on construction, and investors get an address in a neighbourhood with proven rental demand. Saima Ace Residency Saima Builders also provides a clear ready-home identity within Saima Builders\' portfolio.\"}],\"heading\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\"}', '2026-10-30 07:36:33', '2026-11-03 06:40:06'),
(689, 89, 'contact', 'Contact & Booking CTA', 11, 1, '{\"title\":\"Register Your Interest\",\"subtitle\":\"Discover exceptional opportunities at Saima Excellency Karachi, Saima Excellency Saima Builders. Contact our advisory team for personalized guidance on Saima Excellency price, payment plan, booking amount, floor plan, and private viewings. Whether exploring apartments for sale Saima Excellency Karachi or flats for sale Saima Excellency Karachi, our consultants navigate Saima Excellency apartment booking process.\",\"button_text\":\"REGISTER INTEREST\",\"phone\":\"+971 2 000 0000\",\"email\":\"info@hudayriyat-island.com\",\"pretitle\":\"LET\'S CONNECT\",\"heading\":\"Invest in Your Future\",\"form_small\":\"REQUEST\",\"form_large\":\"A CALL BACK\",\"submit_button\":\"REQUEST NOW\",\"bg_image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793688006_6ae981c6d1b7a.webp\"}', '2026-10-30 07:36:33', '2026-11-03 06:40:06'),
(690, 90, 'hero', 'Hero Banner', 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Gulzar-e-Hijri\",\"subtitle\":\"Explore Premier Properties & Real Estate Investment in Gulzar-e-Hijri, Karachi\",\"badge\":\"Prime Real Estate Destination\",\"bg_image\":\"\\/images\\/hero\\/slide-1.jpg\"}', '2026-10-30 07:51:49', '2026-10-30 07:51:49'),
(691, 90, 'content', 'Table of Contents & Article', 2, 1, '{\"title\":\"Gulzar-e-Hijri Living & Waterfront Sanctuary\",\"intro\":\"<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Gulzar-e-Hijri is a premier benchmark for luxury waterfront living, seamlessly blending contemporary architectural elegance with a tranquil coastal sanctuary. Residents enjoy fresh sea breezes, private beach access, and immediate connectivity to key metropolitan hubs.<\\/p><p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:1rem\\\">Located along prestigious shoreline corridors, the community offers an inspired lifestyle for professionals, investors, and families seeking refined island elegance away from urban congestion.<\\/p><p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:1rem\\\">Every residence offers a harmonious blend of sophistication, security, and long-term capital appreciation, presenting an extraordinary investment opportunity in one of the most coveted coastal addresses.<\\/p>\",\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">A premier benchmark for luxury waterfront living, seamlessly blending contemporary architectural elegance with a tranquil coastal sanctuary. Residents enjoy fresh sea breezes, private beach access, and immediate connectivity to key metropolitan hubs.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Located along prestigious shoreline corridors, the community offers an inspired lifestyle for professionals, investors, and families seeking refined island elegance away from urban congestion.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Every residence offers a harmonious blend of sophistication, security, and long-term capital appreciation, presenting an extraordinary investment opportunity in one of the most coveted coastal addresses.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>About the Developers<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Crafted by premier developers renowned for shaping iconic waterfront communities across the region for decades. Buyers and international investors benefit from a celebrated track record of timely delivery, construction excellence, and sustainable urban design.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Working alongside leading international architectural consultants and market advisory firms, every aspect of the project is engineered to global standards of prestige and durability.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Approvals &amp; Clearances<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The project holds full regulatory clearance and title approvals from all relevant municipal and developmental authorities. Complying strictly with environmental and structural guidelines, purchasers can invest with absolute peace of mind and secure freehold ownership.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Prime Location &amp; Seamless Connectivity<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Set within a scenic coastal landscape, the project offers rapid access to international airports, commercial business districts, premier private schools, and luxury retail destinations.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC1.png\\\" alt=\\\"Strategic Location &amp; Connectivity Map\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); width: 100%; margin: 15px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Surrounded by protected green reserves and pristine waters, residents wake up to panoramic coastal vistas and unpolluted air throughout the year.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Architectural Excellence &amp; Floor Plans<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The layouts focus on space efficiency, panoramic natural lighting, and seamless indoor-outdoor living with spacious private terraces and balconies.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>Curated Residences &amp; Layout Types<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC2.png\\\" alt=\\\"Luxury Layout Plan - Type C\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Featuring open-plan living rooms, floor-to-ceiling double-glazed windows, designer show kitchens, and lavish en-suite master bedrooms designed for modern family living.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC3.png\\\" alt=\\\"Executive Layout Plan - Type B\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Expansive terraces provide seamless entertaining spaces overlooking lush landscaped courtyards and the sparkling coastline.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC4.png\\\" alt=\\\"Presidential Villa Layout Plan - Type A\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Generous multi-level accommodations including private elevators, maid\'s quarters, private swimming pools, and dedicated family lounges.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Master Plan &amp; Community Lifestyle<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The community master plan establishes a secure, private, and walkable residential haven. Dedicated subterranean parking ensures pedestrian safety across surface walkways, cycling trails, and waterfront boardwalks.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC8.png\\\" alt=\\\"Community Master Plan Overview\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Flexible Investment &amp; Payment Plan<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>A buyer-friendly, construction-linked payment structure is offered with flexible milestones, making property acquisition straightforward and stress-free.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC12.png\\\" alt=\\\"Milestone Payment Structure\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>World-Class Facilities &amp; Amenities<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Enjoy infinity swimming pools, state-of-the-art fitness centres, private beach cabanas, children\'s play areas, multi-sport courts, and fine-dining waterfront restaurants just steps from your front door.<\\/p>\",\"appt_title\":\"BOOK AN APPOINTMENT\",\"body\":\"<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">A premier benchmark for luxury waterfront living, seamlessly blending contemporary architectural elegance with a tranquil coastal sanctuary. Residents enjoy fresh sea breezes, private beach access, and immediate connectivity to key metropolitan hubs.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Located along prestigious shoreline corridors, the community offers an inspired lifestyle for professionals, investors, and families seeking refined island elegance away from urban congestion.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Every residence offers a harmonious blend of sophistication, security, and long-term capital appreciation, presenting an extraordinary investment opportunity in one of the most coveted coastal addresses.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>About the Developers<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Crafted by premier developers renowned for shaping iconic waterfront communities across the region for decades. Buyers and international investors benefit from a celebrated track record of timely delivery, construction excellence, and sustainable urban design.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Working alongside leading international architectural consultants and market advisory firms, every aspect of the project is engineered to global standards of prestige and durability.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Approvals &amp; Clearances<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The project holds full regulatory clearance and title approvals from all relevant municipal and developmental authorities. Complying strictly with environmental and structural guidelines, purchasers can invest with absolute peace of mind and secure freehold ownership.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Prime Location &amp; Seamless Connectivity<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Set within a scenic coastal landscape, the project offers rapid access to international airports, commercial business districts, premier private schools, and luxury retail destinations.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC1.png\\\" alt=\\\"Strategic Location &amp; Connectivity Map\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); width: 100%; margin: 15px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Surrounded by protected green reserves and pristine waters, residents wake up to panoramic coastal vistas and unpolluted air throughout the year.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Architectural Excellence &amp; Floor Plans<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The layouts focus on space efficiency, panoramic natural lighting, and seamless indoor-outdoor living with spacious private terraces and balconies.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>Curated Residences &amp; Layout Types<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC2.png\\\" alt=\\\"Luxury Layout Plan - Type C\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Featuring open-plan living rooms, floor-to-ceiling double-glazed windows, designer show kitchens, and lavish en-suite master bedrooms designed for modern family living.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC3.png\\\" alt=\\\"Executive Layout Plan - Type B\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Expansive terraces provide seamless entertaining spaces overlooking lush landscaped courtyards and the sparkling coastline.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC4.png\\\" alt=\\\"Presidential Villa Layout Plan - Type A\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Generous multi-level accommodations including private elevators, maid\'s quarters, private swimming pools, and dedicated family lounges.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Master Plan &amp; Community Lifestyle<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The community master plan establishes a secure, private, and walkable residential haven. Dedicated subterranean parking ensures pedestrian safety across surface walkways, cycling trails, and waterfront boardwalks.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC8.png\\\" alt=\\\"Community Master Plan Overview\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Flexible Investment &amp; Payment Plan<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>A buyer-friendly, construction-linked payment structure is offered with flexible milestones, making property acquisition straightforward and stress-free.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC12.png\\\" alt=\\\"Milestone Payment Structure\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>World-Class Facilities &amp; Amenities<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Enjoy infinity swimming pools, state-of-the-art fitness centres, private beach cabanas, children\'s play areas, multi-sport courts, and fine-dining waterfront restaurants just steps from your front door.<\\/p>\"}', '2026-10-30 07:51:49', '2026-10-30 07:51:49'),
(692, 90, 'communities', 'Project Cards', 3, 1, '{\"heading\":\"Featured Projects\",\"subtitle\":\"Explore premium residential and commercial developments\",\"items\":[{\"name\":\"Wadeem Gardens\",\"location\":\"Hudayriyat Island, Abu Dhabi\",\"price\":\"Launch Price: 8.7M AED\",\"delivery\":\"Delivery Date: Q2 2031\",\"developer\":\"Modon Properties\",\"paymentPlan\":\"Flexible Payment Plan\",\"href\":\"\\/wadeem-gardens\",\"image\":\"\\/images\\/communities\\/wadeem-gardens.png\"}],\"selected_ids\":[],\"project_ids\":[]}', '2026-10-30 07:51:49', '2026-10-30 07:51:49'),
(693, 90, 'about', 'About Gulzar-e-Hijri', 4, 1, '{\"title\":\"About the Community\",\"description\":\"A meticulously planned coastal sanctuary seamlessly integrating contemporary luxury living with untouched nature. Spanning scenic waterfronts, lush mangroves, and cycling corridors, the master community offers an unmatched urban lifestyle for residents and high-yield potential for global real estate investors.\",\"video_poster\":\"\\/images\\/projects\\/poster.jpg\",\"video_src\":\"\\/images\\/nawayef-park-views\\/asset_15.mp4\",\"heading\":\"About the Community\",\"video_url\":\"https:\\/\\/stream.mux.com\\/A3200aZtT5Wq7VlYwQv3wP9W2hX8.m3u8\",\"poster_image\":\"\\/images\\/projects\\/poster.jpg\"}', '2026-10-30 07:51:49', '2026-10-30 07:51:49'),
(694, 90, 'faq', 'Frequently Asked Questions', 5, 1, '{\"title\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\",\"description\":\"<p>Key information and helpful answers regarding Gulzar-e-Hijri and property purchases on Hudayriyat Island.<\\/p>\",\"items\":[{\"q\":\"Are properties in this city freehold for foreign and overseas investors?\",\"a\":\"Yes, designated luxury master developments offer 100% freehold ownership for local and international buyers with complete title deed registration.\"},{\"q\":\"What are the typical payment plans available?\",\"a\":\"Flexible installment plans are offered typically linked to construction milestones, with down payments starting from 5% to 10%.\"}],\"heading\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\",\"subtitle\":\"Find answers to common questions about properties, buying process, and payment plans.\"}', '2026-10-30 07:51:49', '2026-10-30 07:51:49'),
(695, 90, 'contact', 'Contact & Booking CTA', 6, 1, '{\"title\":\"Register Your Interest in Gulzar-e-Hijri\",\"subtitle\":\"Connect with our dedicated city property advisors for personalized availability, floor plans, and VIP access.\",\"button_text\":\"REGISTER INTEREST\",\"phone\":\"+971 2 000 0000\",\"email\":\"info@hudayriyat-island.ae\"}', '2026-10-30 07:51:49', '2026-10-30 07:51:49'),
(696, 91, 'hero', 'Hero Banner & Form', 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Dreams at Scheme 33 Karachi\",\"subtitle\":\"Saima Dreams, 4, 5 & 6-room apartments by Saima Builders in Scheme 33, near Safoora Chowrangi, Karachi. See key details and investment potential.\",\"badge\":null,\"bg_image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793687685_6ae980855dec6.jpg\",\"bg_image_alt\":\"Saima Dreams at Scheme 33 Karachi\",\"image_alt\":\"Saima Dreams at Scheme 33 Karachi\"}', '2026-10-30 07:56:08', '2026-11-03 06:34:45'),
(697, 91, 'highlights', 'Project Highlights', 2, 1, '{\"developer\":\"Modon Properties\",\"price\":\"AED 2,500,000\",\"handover\":\"Q4 2028\",\"property_type\":\"Luxury Villas & Apartments\",\"bedrooms\":\"2 to 5 Bedrooms\",\"items\":[],\"highlight_0\":\"Saima Builders\",\"highlight_1\":\"Coming Soon\",\"highlight_2\":\"Q4 2028\",\"highlight_3\":\"Apartments\",\"highlight_4\":\"Freehold\",\"location\":\"Scheme 33 Karachi\"}', '2026-10-30 07:56:08', '2026-11-10 10:17:06');
