(698, 91, 'about', 'About Community', 3, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Dreams by Saima Builders\",\"description\":\"<p>Saima Dreams is a residential apartment project in Scheme 33, Gulzar-e-Hijri, Karachi, near Safoora Chowrangi, offering spacious 4-room, 5-room, and 6-room apartments by Saima Builders, featuring larger family layouts in one of Karachi\'s fastest-growing residential corridors.<\\/p>\",\"video_poster\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793687685_6ae98085600c3.jpg\",\"video_src\":\"\\/images\\/nawayef-park-views\\/asset_15.mp4\",\"video_url\":\"\\/images\\/nawayef-park-views\\/asset_15.mp4\"}', '2026-10-30 07:56:08', '2026-11-03 06:34:45'),
(699, 91, 'amenities', 'Amenities & Facilities', 4, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Dreams Amenities\",\"subtitle\":\"Saima Dreams Karachi provides facilities that support comfortable family living, including a community swimming pool, a community gym with sauna and jacuzzi, high-speed elevators, spacious parking, a community hall, a kids\' play area, a prayer area, landscaped community lawns, a reception, 24\\/7 standby generators, and an R.O. plant water supply within the Saima Dreams Saima Builders development.\",\"items\":[]}', '2026-10-30 07:56:08', '2026-11-10 10:17:06'),
(700, 91, 'gallery', 'Project Gallery', 5, 1, '{\"title\":\"Project Gallery\",\"images\":[{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793687685_6ae980856213d.jpg\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"},{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793687685_6ae9808562b7f.jpg\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"},{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793687685_6ae980856357f.jpg\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"},{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793687685_6ae9808563f81.jpg\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"}]}', '2026-10-30 07:56:08', '2026-11-03 06:34:45'),
(701, 91, 'content', 'Content', 6, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Dreams at Scheme 33 Karachi Living & Waterfront Sanctuary\",\"intro\":\"<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Saima Dreams at Scheme 33 Karachi is a premier benchmark for luxury waterfront living, seamlessly blending contemporary architectural elegance with a tranquil coastal sanctuary. Residents enjoy fresh sea breezes, private beach access, and immediate connectivity to key metropolitan hubs.<\\/p><p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:1rem\\\">Located along prestigious shoreline corridors, the community offers an inspired lifestyle for professionals, investors, and families seeking refined island elegance away from urban congestion.<\\/p><p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:1rem\\\">Every residence offers a harmonious blend of sophistication, security, and long-term capital appreciation, presenting an extraordinary investment opportunity in one of the most coveted coastal addresses.<\\/p>\",\"html\":\"<p>At its core, Saima Dreams Saima Builders is a family apartment project whose standout feature is sizing: 4-room, 5-room, and 6-room apartments, which is bigger than what most projects in this price bracket offer. That alone changes who Saima Dreams Saima Builders makes sense for, a joint family that has been renting a house for years and finally wants to own something with enough rooms for everyone is exactly the buyer these layouts are built for. The towers are planned as high-rise buildings, so the larger layouts come with lift access and shared facilities rather than a low-rise walk-up format.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Within Saima Builders residential projects Karachi, Saima Dreams Saima Builders represents the larger-family end of the Scheme 33 supply, and it is regularly compared with other high-rise apartments Karachi buyers shortlist in the Gulzar-e-Hijri corridor. Its position near Safoora Chowrangi, in a neighbourhood where the developer has several projects, gives it a recognisable address for both end-users and investors.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Key Project Highlights<\\/h2>\\r\\n<table>\\r\\n<tbody><tr>\\r\\n<th>Feature<\\/th>\\r\\n<th>Details<\\/th>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Developer<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Saima Builders<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Property Type<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Residential<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Unit Types<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>4, 5 & 6-room apartments<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Total Land Size<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>2 acres<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Handover<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>To be confirmed<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Location<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Scheme 33, near Safoora Chowrangi, Karachi<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Payment Plan<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>On easy installments<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Lifestyle<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Family living<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<\\/tbody><\\/table>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Master Plan and Development Framework<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Saima Dreams is planned around contemporary family living, with a master plan that balances apartment towers with shared open and recreational spaces rather than filling the entire site with built-up area.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The framework is designed to provide residents with a balance of comfort, convenience, and usable shared space: apartments arranged for space efficiency, natural light, and ventilation, with community areas, parking, and facilities planned into the layout. The Saima Dreams floor plan reflects this approach, keeping family living spaces generous in line with the project\'s larger room counts.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Unit Types: 4, 5 & 6-Room Apartments<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>For buyers searching for apartments for sale Saima Dreams Karachi or flats for sale Saima Dreams Karachi, Saima Dreams Karachi offers family layouts in three categories.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>4-Room Apartments in Saima Dreams<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p>The Saima Dreams apartments Karachi 4-room apartments suit families who want more space than a standard compact flat, with room for a growing household while staying within the project\'s most accessible layout category.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>5-Room Apartments in Saima Dreams<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p>The Saima Dreams apartments Karachi 5-room apartments suit larger families who need an additional bedroom or a flexible room for guests, parents, or a home office, without moving up to the largest category.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>6-Room Apartments in Saima Dreams<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p>The Saima Dreams apartments Karachi 6-room apartments are the project\'s largest layouts, aimed at joint families who want everyone under one roof with proper living space, the category that most clearly sets this project apart from typical Scheme 33 supply.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Floor Plan<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>A floor plan for each apartment type in Saima Dreams Saima Builders is available through the developer\'s authorised sales channel. Buyers seeking a Saima Dreams apartment price or a Saima Dreams floor plan should request the unit schedule alongside the floor plan from the authorised sales channel, as secondary listings are often incomplete.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Price and Booking Status<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The Saima Dreams price varies depending on unit type, size, and floor, and is disclosed through the developer\'s authorised sales channel. The Saima Dreams payment plan is structured to accommodate various buyer profiles, with flexible instalment options available on request.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>A Saima Dreams booking is processed through the developer\'s sales team, and the Saima Dreams booking amount should be confirmed in writing alongside the Saima Dreams payment plan. The practical route to buy flat in Saima Dreams Karachi is to register interest directly with Saima Builders or its designated sales partners and obtain the current Saima Dreams apartment price before booking.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Saima Dreams Saima Builders buyers should also confirm whether Saima Dreams apartments on installments are being offered through a priority allocation system or on a first-come, first-served basis.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>NOC and Approval Status<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Saima Dreams apartments Karachi buyers should verify the project-specific approvals for the project directly with the developer or the relevant authority before booking, as NOC status applies to the individual project and its phases.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Regulations shift and documentation gets updated, so a status reported earlier should be re-confirmed at the time of booking rather than assumed to still apply.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Possession Timeline<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>A formal possession date for Saima Dreams has not been announced as a single project-wide date, and handover in a project of this type is normally phased by tower. Buyers should secure a documented possession schedule at the point of Saima Dreams booking, and the possession timelines for Saima Dreams 4-room apartments should be confirmed in writing with the developer.<\\/p>\",\"appt_title\":\"BOOK AN APPOINTMENT\",\"body\":\"<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">A premier benchmark for luxury waterfront living, seamlessly blending contemporary architectural elegance with a tranquil coastal sanctuary. Residents enjoy fresh sea breezes, private beach access, and immediate connectivity to key metropolitan hubs.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Located along prestigious shoreline corridors, the community offers an inspired lifestyle for professionals, investors, and families seeking refined island elegance away from urban congestion.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Every residence offers a harmonious blend of sophistication, security, and long-term capital appreciation, presenting an extraordinary investment opportunity in one of the most coveted coastal addresses.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>About the Developers<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Crafted by premier developers renowned for shaping iconic waterfront communities across the region for decades. Buyers and international investors benefit from a celebrated track record of timely delivery, construction excellence, and sustainable urban design.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Working alongside leading international architectural consultants and market advisory firms, every aspect of the project is engineered to global standards of prestige and durability.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Approvals &amp; Clearances<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The project holds full regulatory clearance and title approvals from all relevant municipal and developmental authorities. Complying strictly with environmental and structural guidelines, purchasers can invest with absolute peace of mind and secure freehold ownership.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Prime Location &amp; Seamless Connectivity<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Set within a scenic coastal landscape, the project offers rapid access to international airports, commercial business districts, premier private schools, and luxury retail destinations.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC1.png\\\" alt=\\\"Strategic Location &amp; Connectivity Map\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); width: 100%; margin: 15px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Surrounded by protected green reserves and pristine waters, residents wake up to panoramic coastal vistas and unpolluted air throughout the year.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Architectural Excellence &amp; Floor Plans<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The layouts focus on space efficiency, panoramic natural lighting, and seamless indoor-outdoor living with spacious private terraces and balconies.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>Curated Residences &amp; Layout Types<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC2.png\\\" alt=\\\"Luxury Layout Plan - Type C\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Featuring open-plan living rooms, floor-to-ceiling double-glazed windows, designer show kitchens, and lavish en-suite master bedrooms designed for modern family living.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC3.png\\\" alt=\\\"Executive Layout Plan - Type B\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Expansive terraces provide seamless entertaining spaces overlooking lush landscaped courtyards and the sparkling coastline.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC4.png\\\" alt=\\\"Presidential Villa Layout Plan - Type A\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Generous multi-level accommodations including private elevators, maid\'s quarters, private swimming pools, and dedicated family lounges.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Master Plan &amp; Community Lifestyle<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The community master plan establishes a secure, private, and walkable residential haven. Dedicated subterranean parking ensures pedestrian safety across surface walkways, cycling trails, and waterfront boardwalks.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC8.png\\\" alt=\\\"Community Master Plan Overview\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Flexible Investment &amp; Payment Plan<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>A buyer-friendly, construction-linked payment structure is offered with flexible milestones, making property acquisition straightforward and stress-free.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC12.png\\\" alt=\\\"Milestone Payment Structure\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>World-Class Facilities &amp; Amenities<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Enjoy infinity swimming pools, state-of-the-art fitness centres, private beach cabanas, children\'s play areas, multi-sport courts, and fine-dining waterfront restaurants just steps from your front door.<\\/p>\"}', '2026-10-30 07:56:08', '2026-11-03 06:34:45'),
(702, 91, 'payment_plan', 'Payment Plan', 7, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Dreams Payment Plan\",\"description\":\"The payment plan for The Saima Dreams apartments Karachi is structured around booking and subsequent instalments, with the exact current schedule, amounts, and terms provided upon request through Saima Builders\' authorised sales channel. Schedules are subject to revision, so buyers should obtain the plan in writing for their specific unit.\",\"down_payment\":\"10%\",\"during_construction\":\"40%\",\"on_handover\":\"50%\",\"items\":[{\"milestone\":\"Down Payment\",\"percentage\":\"10%\",\"due\":\"On Booking Date\"},{\"milestone\":\"Construction Milestone 1\",\"percentage\":\"10%\",\"due\":\"6 Months after Booking\"},{\"milestone\":\"Construction Milestone 2\",\"percentage\":\"10%\",\"due\":\"12 Months after Booking\"},{\"milestone\":\"Construction Milestone 3\",\"percentage\":\"10%\",\"due\":\"18 Months after Booking\"},{\"milestone\":\"Construction Milestone 4\",\"percentage\":\"10%\",\"due\":\"24 Months after Booking\"},{\"milestone\":\"On Handover\",\"percentage\":\"50%\",\"due\":\"100% Completion\"}],\"plan_tabs\":null,\"download_text\":\"DOWNLOAD PAYMENT PLAN\",\"download_url\":\"#\"}', '2026-10-30 07:56:08', '2026-11-03 06:34:45'),
(703, 91, 'master_plan', 'Master Plan', 8, 1, '{\"title\":\"Master Plan\",\"description\":\"The master plan creates a harmonious, walkable enclave where residential clusters are woven naturally into open green parklands, pedestrian corridors, and scenic waterfront trails.\",\"image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793687685_6ae9808567138.jpg\",\"badge\":\"Click to Enlarge\"}', '2026-10-30 07:56:08', '2026-11-03 06:34:45'),
(704, 91, 'location', 'Location & Connectivity', 9, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Dreams Location in Scheme 33, Karachi\",\"description\":\"Conveniently located on Hudayriyat Island with direct access via modern bridges to Abu Dhabi\\u2019s key commercial, cultural, and travel hubs.\",\"items\":[{\"place\":\"Downtown Abu Dhabi\",\"time\":\"20 mins\"},{\"place\":\"Emirates Palace\",\"time\":\"23 mins\"},{\"place\":\"Sheikh Zayed Grand Mosque\",\"time\":\"23 mins\"},{\"place\":\"Abu Dhabi Global Financial Centre\",\"time\":\"30 mins\"},{\"place\":\"Louvre Abu Dhabi\",\"time\":\"33 mins\"},{\"place\":\"Zayed International Airport\",\"time\":\"34 mins\"}],\"subtitle\":\"The Saima Dreams Karachi location is in Scheme 33, Gulzar-e-Hijri, near Safoora Chowrangi and along Saima Boulevard. The position keeps residents connected to the Superhighway corridor and the wider city, with shopping, parks, universities, and the airport all within practical reach. For buyers comparing family apartments Karachi, Scheme 33 is one of the districts where new residential supply is concentrated.\",\"image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793687685_6ae9808568882.jpg\",\"categories\":[{\"name\":\"Nearby Landmarks And Attractions\",\"items\":[{\"name\":\"Safoora Chowrangi\",\"time\":\"3\\u20135 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"LuckyOne Mall\",\"time\":\"18\\u201325 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"Saima Mall\",\"time\":\"12\\u201318 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"Safari Park\",\"time\":\"8\\u201312 minutes\"}]}]}', '2026-10-30 07:56:08', '2026-11-03 06:34:45'),
(705, 91, 'faq', 'FAQ Accordion', 10, 1, '{\"title\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\",\"description\":\"Key information and helpful answers regarding property purchases on Hudayriyat Island.\",\"items\":[{\"q\":\"Can overseas buyers book in Saima Dreams?\",\"a\":\"Overseas buyers can engage through authorised channels, but remittance and documentation procedures should be confirmed directly with the Saima Dreams sales team.\"},{\"q\":\"Why consider Saima Dreams Karachi?\",\"a\":\"Because Saima Dreams offers larger 4, 5, and 6-room layouts that suit joint and growing families, in a Scheme 33 location near Safoora Chowrangi that keeps improving as the corridor develops. Saima Dreams Karachi also provides a clear family identity within Saima Builders\' portfolio.\"},{\"q\":\"Where is Saima Dreams Karachi located?\",\"a\":\"Saima Dreams is located in Scheme 33, Gulzar-e-Hijri, Karachi, near Safoora Chowrangi and along Saima Boulevard. The Saima Dreams Karachi location offers access to the Superhighway corridor, with Lucky One Mall, Safari Park, and Karachi University within reach.\"},{\"q\":\"What is Saima Dreams price?\",\"a\":\"A confirmed public Saima Dreams price list has not been released; pricing varies by unit type, size, and floor and is available through the developer\'s authorised sales channel for Saima Dreams Karachi.\"},{\"q\":\"How many bedrooms in Saima Dreams?\",\"a\":\"The Saima Dreams apartments Karachi offers apartments in 4-room, 5-room, and 6-room layouts, which is a larger sizing range than most projects in this corridor, so buyers can choose a layout that matches their household size within Saima Dreams Karachi.\"},{\"q\":\"What is Saima Dreams payment plan?\",\"a\":\"The Saima Dreams payment plan and Saima Dreams booking amount are disclosed through sales engagement rather than a public schedule.\"},{\"q\":\"Is Saima Dreams NOC approved?\",\"a\":\"Buyers should verify the project-specific NOC and approval status for Saima Dreams Karachi directly with the developer or the relevant authority before purchase, and should not rely on a general portfolio-level statement.\"},{\"q\":\"Who is developing Saima Dreams?\",\"a\":\"Saima Dreams is developed by Saima Group, which has built residential communities across Karachi over several decades.\"},{\"q\":\"Is Saima Dreams part of a larger project?\",\"a\":\"No, Saima Dreams is a standalone residential apartment project in Scheme 33, Gulzar-e-Hijri, Karachi, although it sits in a corridor with several other Saima developments nearby.\"}],\"heading\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\"}', '2026-10-30 07:56:08', '2026-11-03 06:34:45'),
(706, 91, 'contact', 'Contact & Booking CTA', 11, 1, '{\"title\":\"Register Your Interest\",\"subtitle\":\"Our property specialists will contact you with VIP floor plans, pricing sheets, and private site visit bookings.\",\"button_text\":\"REGISTER INTEREST\",\"phone\":\"+971 2 000 0000\",\"email\":\"info@hudayriyat-island.com\",\"pretitle\":\"LET\'S CONNECT\",\"heading\":\"Invest in Your Future\",\"form_small\":\"REQUEST\",\"form_large\":\"A CALL BACK\",\"submit_button\":\"REQUEST NOW\",\"bg_image\":\"\\/images\\/form image.jpg\"}', '2026-10-30 07:56:09', '2026-11-03 06:34:45'),
