(709, 92, 'about', 'About Community', 3, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Shield Towers by Saima Builders\",\"description\":\"<p>Saima Shield Towers is a residential high-rise project in Gulshan-e-Iqbal, Karachi, near Mosamiyat, offering 4-room and 5-room apartments across multiple towers by Saima Builders, featuring modern family living in one of Karachi\'s most established residential neighbourhoods.<\\/p>\",\"video_poster\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793687426_6ae97f82f3bb2.webp\",\"video_src\":\"\\/images\\/nawayef-park-views\\/asset_15.mp4\",\"video_url\":\"\\/images\\/nawayef-park-views\\/asset_15.mp4\"}', '2026-10-30 10:38:19', '2026-11-03 06:30:27'),
(710, 92, 'amenities', 'Amenities & Facilities', 4, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Shield Towers Amenities\",\"subtitle\":\"Saima Shield Towers Saima Builders provides facilities that support secure, comfortable family living, including a gated community with controlled access, dedicated parking, an internal commercial zone for everyday shopping, community spaces, spacious balconies, and wider corridors within the Saima Shield Towers development.\",\"items\":[]}', '2026-10-30 10:38:19', '2026-11-10 10:15:12'),
(711, 92, 'gallery', 'Project Gallery', 5, 1, '{\"title\":\"Project Gallery\",\"images\":[{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793687427_6ae97f8300dc8.webp\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"},{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793687427_6ae97f8300eb1.webp\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"},{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793687427_6ae97f8300f93.webp\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"},{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793687427_6ae97f83010b1.jpg\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"}]}', '2026-10-30 10:38:19', '2026-11-03 06:30:27'),
(712, 92, 'content', 'Content', 6, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Shield Towers at Gulshan-e-Iqbal Karachi Living & Waterfront Sanctuary\",\"intro\":\"<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Saima Shield Towers at Gulshan-e-Iqbal Karachi is a premier benchmark for luxury waterfront living, seamlessly blending contemporary architectural elegance with a tranquil coastal sanctuary. Residents enjoy fresh sea breezes, private beach access, and immediate connectivity to key metropolitan hubs.<\\/p><p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:1rem\\\">Located along prestigious shoreline corridors, the community offers an inspired lifestyle for professionals, investors, and families seeking refined island elegance away from urban congestion.<\\/p><p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:1rem\\\">Every residence offers a harmonious blend of sophistication, security, and long-term capital appreciation, presenting an extraordinary investment opportunity in one of the most coveted coastal addresses.<\\/p>\",\"html\":\"<p>At its core, Saima Shield Towers Saima Builders is high-rise living built for families, not singles or couples looking for a small flat: bigger balconies, wider corridors, and apartments finished a notch above the older buildings around Gulshan-e-Iqbal. Instead of one lone block, the project features multiple residential towers, which gives it more of a community feel, and the gated setting provides controlled access and improved security for residents.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Among high-rise towers Karachi buyers compare, Saima Shield Towers stands out for bringing a gated, planned format to an established neighbourhood rather than a developing one. It sits naturally within Saima Builders towers Karachi, and its rental logic is straightforward: universities and hospitals nearby keep demand steady in this area, which is why gated community apartments Karachi investors watch include this project.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Key Project Highlights<\\/h2>\\r\\n<table>\\r\\n<tbody><tr>\\r\\n<th>Feature<\\/th>\\r\\n<th>Details<\\/th>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Developer<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Saima Builders<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Property Type<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Residential<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Unit Types<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>4 & 5-room apartments<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Total Land Size<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>3.5 acres<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Handover<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>To be confirmed<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Location<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Gulshan-e-Iqbal, near Mosamiyat, Karachi<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Payment Plan<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>On easy installments<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Lifestyle<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Gated community<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<\\/tbody><\\/table>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Master Plan and Development Framework<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Saima Shield Towers Saima Builders is planned as a multi-tower gated community rather than a single apartment block, with a master plan that separates the residential towers, parking, and an internal commercial zone for everyday shopping.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The framework reflects an attempt to give residents a complete community inside the boundary: properly planned parking, community spaces where residents can hold a function without renting an outside venue, and towers arranged for privacy, natural ventilation, and efficient space use. The Saima Shield Towers floor plan follows this approach, with separate living and dining areas, spacious bedrooms, modern kitchens, and well-planned bathrooms in each layout.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Unit Types: 4 & 5-Room Apartments<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>For buyers searching for apartments for sale Saima Shield Towers or flats for sale Shield Towers Karachi, Saima Shield Towers Karachi offers family layouts in two categories.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>4-Room Apartments in Saima Shield Towers<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p>The 4-room apartments (Types B and B1) in Saima Shield Towers include 2 bedrooms and 3 bathrooms, making them suitable for small families and professionals who want a modern layout in Gulshan-e-Iqbal at the project\'s more accessible price point.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>5-Room Apartments in Saima Shield Towers<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p>The 5-room apartments (Types A and A1) in Saima Shield Towers feature 3 bedrooms and 4 bathrooms, providing additional space for larger families who need the extra room without leaving the neighbourhood.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Floor Plan<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>A floor plan for each apartment type is available through the developer\'s authorised sales channel. Buyers seeking a Saima Shield Towers apartment price or a Saima Shield Towers floor plan should request the unit schedule alongside the floor plan from the authorised sales channel, as secondary listings are often incomplete.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Price and Booking Status<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The Saima Shield Towers price varies depending on unit type, size, and floor, and is disclosed through the developer\'s authorised sales channel. The Saima Shield Towers payment plan is structured to accommodate various buyer profiles, with flexible instalment options available on request.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>A Saima Shield Towers booking is processed through the developer\'s sales team, and the Shield Towers Karachi booking amount should be confirmed in writing alongside the Saima Shield Towers payment plan. The practical route to buy flat in Saima Shield Towers Karachi is to register interest directly with Saima Builders or its designated sales partners and obtain the current Saima Shield Towers apartment price before booking.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Saima Shield Towers Saima Builders buyers should also confirm whether Saima Shield Towers apartments on installments are being offered through a priority allocation system or on a first-come, first-served basis.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>NOC and Approval Status<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Saima Shield Towers Saima Builders buyers should ask for the actual NOC before paying anything, not a verbal assurance, but the document and reference number that can be verified independently with the relevant authority.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Approval status and reference details can be updated as a project moves through different phases of construction, so whatever a buyer is told should be current, not something carried over from an older listing.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Possession Timeline<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>A formal possession date for Saima Shield Towers has not been announced as a single project-wide date, and the project is under construction, so handover is expected to be phased by tower. Buyers should secure a documented possession schedule at the point of Saima Shield Towers booking, and Saima Shield Towers Saima Builders possession timelines should be confirmed in writing with the developer.<\\/p>\",\"appt_title\":\"BOOK AN APPOINTMENT\",\"body\":\"<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">A premier benchmark for luxury waterfront living, seamlessly blending contemporary architectural elegance with a tranquil coastal sanctuary. Residents enjoy fresh sea breezes, private beach access, and immediate connectivity to key metropolitan hubs.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Located along prestigious shoreline corridors, the community offers an inspired lifestyle for professionals, investors, and families seeking refined island elegance away from urban congestion.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Every residence offers a harmonious blend of sophistication, security, and long-term capital appreciation, presenting an extraordinary investment opportunity in one of the most coveted coastal addresses.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>About the Developers<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Crafted by premier developers renowned for shaping iconic waterfront communities across the region for decades. Buyers and international investors benefit from a celebrated track record of timely delivery, construction excellence, and sustainable urban design.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Working alongside leading international architectural consultants and market advisory firms, every aspect of the project is engineered to global standards of prestige and durability.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Approvals &amp; Clearances<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The project holds full regulatory clearance and title approvals from all relevant municipal and developmental authorities. Complying strictly with environmental and structural guidelines, purchasers can invest with absolute peace of mind and secure freehold ownership.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Prime Location &amp; Seamless Connectivity<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Set within a scenic coastal landscape, the project offers rapid access to international airports, commercial business districts, premier private schools, and luxury retail destinations.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC1.png\\\" alt=\\\"Strategic Location &amp; Connectivity Map\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); width: 100%; margin: 15px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Surrounded by protected green reserves and pristine waters, residents wake up to panoramic coastal vistas and unpolluted air throughout the year.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Architectural Excellence &amp; Floor Plans<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The layouts focus on space efficiency, panoramic natural lighting, and seamless indoor-outdoor living with spacious private terraces and balconies.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>Curated Residences &amp; Layout Types<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC2.png\\\" alt=\\\"Luxury Layout Plan - Type C\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Featuring open-plan living rooms, floor-to-ceiling double-glazed windows, designer show kitchens, and lavish en-suite master bedrooms designed for modern family living.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC3.png\\\" alt=\\\"Executive Layout Plan - Type B\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Expansive terraces provide seamless entertaining spaces overlooking lush landscaped courtyards and the sparkling coastline.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC4.png\\\" alt=\\\"Presidential Villa Layout Plan - Type A\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Generous multi-level accommodations including private elevators, maid\'s quarters, private swimming pools, and dedicated family lounges.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Master Plan &amp; Community Lifestyle<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The community master plan establishes a secure, private, and walkable residential haven. Dedicated subterranean parking ensures pedestrian safety across surface walkways, cycling trails, and waterfront boardwalks.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC8.png\\\" alt=\\\"Community Master Plan Overview\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Flexible Investment &amp; Payment Plan<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>A buyer-friendly, construction-linked payment structure is offered with flexible milestones, making property acquisition straightforward and stress-free.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC12.png\\\" alt=\\\"Milestone Payment Structure\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>World-Class Facilities &amp; Amenities<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Enjoy infinity swimming pools, state-of-the-art fitness centres, private beach cabanas, children\'s play areas, multi-sport courts, and fine-dining waterfront restaurants just steps from your front door.<\\/p>\"}', '2026-10-30 10:38:19', '2026-11-03 06:30:27'),
(713, 92, 'payment_plan', 'Payment Plan', 7, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Shield Towers Payment Plan\",\"description\":\"The payment plan for Saima Shield Towers Saima Builders is spread across the construction period rather than charged as one large amount, moving through booking, allocation, confirmation, monthly and quarterly installments, construction-linked milestone payments, and a final possession payment. Exact terms, schedules, and amounts are provided upon request through the developer\'s authorised sales channel, subject to revision.\",\"down_payment\":\"10%\",\"during_construction\":\"40%\",\"on_handover\":\"50%\",\"items\":[{\"milestone\":\"Down Payment\",\"percentage\":\"10%\",\"due\":\"On Booking Date\"},{\"milestone\":\"Construction Milestone 1\",\"percentage\":\"10%\",\"due\":\"6 Months after Booking\"},{\"milestone\":\"Construction Milestone 2\",\"percentage\":\"10%\",\"due\":\"12 Months after Booking\"},{\"milestone\":\"Construction Milestone 3\",\"percentage\":\"10%\",\"due\":\"18 Months after Booking\"},{\"milestone\":\"Construction Milestone 4\",\"percentage\":\"10%\",\"due\":\"24 Months after Booking\"},{\"milestone\":\"On Handover\",\"percentage\":\"50%\",\"due\":\"100% Completion\"}],\"plan_tabs\":null,\"download_text\":\"DOWNLOAD PAYMENT PLAN\",\"download_url\":\"#\"}', '2026-10-30 10:38:19', '2026-11-03 06:30:27'),
(714, 92, 'master_plan', 'Master Plan', 8, 1, '{\"title\":\"Master Plan\",\"description\":\"The master plan creates a harmonious, walkable enclave where residential clusters are woven naturally into open green parklands, pedestrian corridors, and scenic waterfront trails.\",\"image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793687427_6ae97f8303a92.webp\",\"badge\":\"Click to Enlarge\"}', '2026-10-30 10:38:19', '2026-11-03 06:30:27'),
(715, 92, 'location', 'Location & Connectivity', 9, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Shield Towers Location in Gulshan-e-Iqbal, Karachi\",\"description\":\"Conveniently located on Hudayriyat Island with direct access via modern bridges to Abu Dhabi\\u2019s key commercial, cultural, and travel hubs.\",\"items\":[{\"place\":\"Downtown Abu Dhabi\",\"time\":\"20 mins\"},{\"place\":\"Emirates Palace\",\"time\":\"23 mins\"},{\"place\":\"Sheikh Zayed Grand Mosque\",\"time\":\"23 mins\"},{\"place\":\"Abu Dhabi Global Financial Centre\",\"time\":\"30 mins\"},{\"place\":\"Louvre Abu Dhabi\",\"time\":\"33 mins\"},{\"place\":\"Zayed International Airport\",\"time\":\"34 mins\"}],\"subtitle\":\"The Saima Shield Towers Karachi location is in Gulshan-e-Iqbal, near Mosamiyat, one of Karachi\'s well-connected residential areas. The project offers quick access to University Road and Rashid Minhas Road, with the Superhighway and M-9 Motorway also accessible. Leading institutions including the University of Karachi and Dow University Ojha Campus are a short drive away, along with schools, hospitals, shopping centres, and daily convenience stores.\",\"image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793687427_6ae97f83048d8.webp\",\"categories\":[{\"name\":\"Nearby Landmarks And Attractions\",\"items\":[{\"name\":\"University Road\",\"time\":\"2\\u20135 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"Rashid Minhas Road\",\"time\":\"3\\u20137 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"University of Karachi\",\"time\":\"8\\u201312 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"Dow University Ojha Campus\",\"time\":\"6\\u201310 minutes\"}]}]}', '2026-10-30 10:38:19', '2026-11-03 06:30:27'),
(716, 92, 'faq', 'FAQ Accordion', 10, 1, '{\"title\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\",\"description\":\"Key information and helpful answers regarding property purchases on Hudayriyat Island.\",\"items\":[{\"q\":\"Where is Saima Shield Towers Karachi located?\",\"a\":\"Saima Shield Towers Saima Builders is located in Gulshan-e-Iqbal, Karachi, near Mosamiyat, at Zoramin Residency Society. The Saima Shield Towers Karachi location offers quick access to University Road and Rashid Minhas Road, with the University of Karachi and Dow University Ojha Campus a short drive away.\"},{\"q\":\"What is Saima Shield Towers price?\",\"a\":\"A confirmed public Saima Shield Towers price list has not been released; pricing varies by unit type, size, and floor and is available through the developer\'s authorised sales channel for Saima Shield Towers Karachi.\"},{\"q\":\"How many bedrooms in Saima Shield Towers?\",\"a\":\"Saima Shield Towers offers 4-room apartments (Types B and B1, with 2 bedrooms) and 5-room apartments (Types A and A1, with 3 bedrooms), so buyers can choose a layout that matches their household size within Saima Shield Towers Karachi.\"},{\"q\":\"What is Saima Shield Towers payment plan?\",\"a\":\"The Saima Shield Towers payment plan and Shield Towers Karachi booking amount are disclosed through sales engagement rather than a public schedule.\"},{\"q\":\"Is Saima Shield Towers NOC approved?\",\"a\":\"Buyers should ask for the actual NOC document and verify the project-specific approval status for Saima Shield Towers Karachi directly with the developer or the relevant authority before paying anything.\"},{\"q\":\"Who is developing Saima Shield Towers?\",\"a\":\"Saima Shield Towers is a joint development by Saima Builders & Developers and the Zeeshan Saleem Zaki Group, combining Saima Group\'s delivery record across Karachi with an established development partner.\"},{\"q\":\"Is Saima Shield Towers part of a larger project?\",\"a\":\"Saima Shield Towers is a multi-tower residential development in its own right, planned as a gated community with its own parking, commercial zone, and community spaces.\"},{\"q\":\"Can overseas buyers book in Saima Shield Towers?\",\"a\":\"Overseas buyers can engage through authorised channels, but remittance and documentation procedures should be confirmed directly with the Saima Shield Towers sales team.\"},{\"q\":\"Why consider Saima Shield Towers Karachi?\",\"a\":\"Because Gulshan-e-Iqbal is about as central as this side of Karachi gets, and Saima Shield Towers adds modern high-rise living, gated security, and dedicated parking to an established neighbourhood with steady rental demand from nearby universities and hospitals. Saima Shield Towers Karachi also provides a clear tower identity among Saima Builders towers Karachi.\"}],\"heading\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\"}', '2026-10-30 10:38:19', '2026-11-03 06:30:27'),
(717, 92, 'contact', 'Contact & Booking CTA', 11, 1, '{\"title\":\"Register Your Interest\",\"subtitle\":\"Discover modern high-rise apartments at Saima Shield Towers Karachi. Contact our advisory team for personalized guidance on Saima Shield Towers, updated pricing, and private viewings. Whether you are exploring apartments for sale Saima Shield Towers or seeking to buy flat in Saima Shield Towers Karachi, our consultants can navigate the Saima Shield Towers booking process.\",\"button_text\":\"REGISTER INTEREST\",\"phone\":\"+971 2 000 0000\",\"email\":\"info@hudayriyat-island.com\",\"pretitle\":\"LET\'S CONNECT\",\"heading\":\"Invest in Your Future\",\"form_small\":\"REQUEST\",\"form_large\":\"A CALL BACK\",\"submit_button\":\"REQUEST NOW\",\"bg_image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793357161_6ae475694782d.jpg\"}', '2026-10-30 10:38:19', '2026-11-03 06:30:27'),
(718, 93, 'hero', 'Hero Banner & Form', 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Ace Residency at Karachi\",\"subtitle\":\"Saima Ace Residency, a residential apartment project by Saima Builders in Karachi. See key project details and investment potential.\",\"badge\":null,\"bg_image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793687164_6ae97e7c3749c.webp\",\"bg_image_alt\":\"Saima Ace Residency at Karachi\",\"image_alt\":\"Saima Ace Residency at Karachi\"}', '2026-10-30 10:52:38', '2026-11-03 06:27:27'),
(719, 93, 'highlights', 'Project Highlights', 2, 1, '{\"developer\":\"Modon Properties\",\"price\":\"AED 2,500,000\",\"handover\":\"Q4 2028\",\"property_type\":\"Luxury Villas & Apartments\",\"bedrooms\":\"2 to 5 Bedrooms\",\"items\":[],\"highlight_0\":\"Saima Builders\",\"highlight_1\":\"Coming Soon\",\"highlight_2\":\"Q4 2028\",\"highlight_3\":\"Luxury Apartments\",\"highlight_4\":\"Freehold\",\"location\":\"Gulzar E Hijri Scheme 33\"}', '2026-10-30 10:52:38', '2026-11-10 10:14:58'),
(720, 93, 'about', 'About Community', 3, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Ace Residency by Saima Builders\",\"description\":\"<p>Saima Ace Residency is a residential apartment project by Saima Builders in Karachi, featuring luxury family apartments. Saima Ace Residency apartments exact location, unit mix, and launch details have not been published on an official project page and are being released through the developer\'s authorised sales channels.<\\/p>\",\"video_poster\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793687164_6ae97e7c39735.webp\",\"video_src\":\"\\/images\\/nawayef-park-views\\/asset_15.mp4\",\"video_url\":\"\\/images\\/nawayef-park-views\\/asset_15.mp4\"}', '2026-10-30 10:52:38', '2026-11-03 06:27:27'),
(721, 93, 'amenities', 'Amenities & Facilities', 4, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Ace Residency Amenities\",\"subtitle\":\"The facility list for Saima Ace Residency Karachi has not been published in an official brochure yet. In line with other Saima Builders residential projects Karachi, buyers can expect the project brochure to cover security arrangements, lifts, parking, and community facilities, and the confirmed list should be obtained from the authorised sales channel before booking.\",\"items\":[]}', '2026-10-30 10:52:38', '2026-11-10 10:14:58'),
(722, 93, 'gallery', 'Project Gallery', 5, 1, '{\"title\":\"Project Gallery\",\"images\":[{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793687164_6ae97e7c3b47b.webp\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"},{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793687164_6ae97e7c3b662.webp\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"},{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793687164_6ae97e7c3b939.jpeg\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"},{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793687164_6ae97e7c3bcaf.jpg\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"}]}', '2026-10-30 10:52:38', '2026-11-03 06:27:27');
