(723, 93, 'content', 'Content', 6, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Ace Residency at Karachi Living & Waterfront Sanctuary\",\"intro\":\"<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Saima Ace Residency at Karachi is a premier benchmark for luxury waterfront living, seamlessly blending contemporary architectural elegance with a tranquil coastal sanctuary. Residents enjoy fresh sea breezes, private beach access, and immediate connectivity to key metropolitan hubs.<\\/p><p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:1rem\\\">Located along prestigious shoreline corridors, the community offers an inspired lifestyle for professionals, investors, and families seeking refined island elegance away from urban congestion.<\\/p><p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:1rem\\\">Every residence offers a harmonious blend of sophistication, security, and long-term capital appreciation, presenting an extraordinary investment opportunity in one of the most coveted coastal addresses.<\\/p>\",\"html\":\"<p>At its core, Saima Ace Residency Saima Builders is positioned as a luxury residential apartment project within Saima Builders residential projects Karachi. Official project documentation, like the brochure, floor plans, and price schedule, has not been published yet, so this page sets out what is known, what is still to be confirmed, and how buyers should approach a pre-launch project of this kind.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Among high-rise apartments Karachi buyers research, new announcements from established developers attract early interest because launch-stage buyers usually get the widest unit choice. Saima Ace Residency apartments sits in that category: a name to register interest in early, while keeping every commitment conditional on the official documents. It should not be confused with gated community apartments Karachi listings for other Saima projects, and it is a separate project from Saima Ace Avenue in Scheme 33.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Key Project Highlights<\\/h2>\\r\\n<table>\\r\\n<tbody><tr>\\r\\n<th>Feature<\\/th>\\r\\n<th>Details<\\/th>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Developer<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Saima Builders<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Property Type<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Residential<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Unit Types<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Apartments (mix to be confirmed)<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Total Land Size<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Not publicly disclosed<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Handover<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>To be confirmed<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Location<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Karachi (exact location to be confirmed)<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Payment Plan<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>On easy installments<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Lifestyle<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Family living<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<\\/tbody><\\/table>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Master Plan and Development Framework<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>A detailed master plan for Saima Ace Residency apartments has not been published yet. Based on the developer\'s other residential projects, the plan is expected to organise apartment towers with parking and shared facilities, but the confirmed layout will only be available with the official brochure.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Buyers should request the approved master plan and the Saima Ace Residency floor plan together when they are released, and check that the unit they are offered matches the approved layout before paying a booking amount.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Unit Types: Luxury Apartments<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>For buyers searching for apartments for sale Saima Ace Residency Karachi or flats for sale Saima Ace Residency Karachi, the confirmed unit mix is still to be published, and the categories below reflect the project\'s announced positioning.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>Apartments in Saima Ace Residency<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p>Saima Ace Residency apartments is planned as an apartment project, and the marketed positioning is luxury apartments Saima Ace Residency within the developer\'s Karachi portfolio. The confirmed unit categories and sizes will be published with the official brochure.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>New Apartments in Saima Ace Residency Karachi<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p>As new apartments Saima Ace Residency Karachi are released at launch, early buyers typically get the widest choice of floors and orientations. Buyers should compare the released floor plans carefully rather than booking from pre-launch descriptions.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Floor Plan<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The official Saima Ace Residency floor plan has not been released yet. Buyers seeking a Saima Ace Residency apartment price or floor plan should register with the authorised sales channel and request the documents as soon as they are published.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Price and Booking Status<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The Saima Ace Residency apartments price has not been officially released, and any figures circulating in third-party listings should be treated as unverified. Confirmed pricing will be disclosed through the developer\'s authorised sales channel at launch.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>A Saima Ace Residency booking should only be processed through the developer\'s authorised sales team once official documentation is available, and the Saima Ace Residency booking amount should be confirmed in writing alongside the Saima Ace Residency payment plan. The practical route to buy flat in Saima Ace Residency Karachi is to register interest now and complete the booking when the official Saima Ace Residency apartment price is published.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Saima Ace Residency apartments buyers should also confirm whether Saima Ace Residency apartments on installments will be offered through a priority allocation system or on a first-come, first-served basis at launch.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>NOC and Approval Status<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Saima Ace Residency Saima Builders buyers should verify the project-specific approvals directly with the developer or the relevant authority once the documentation is released, and should not book on the basis of a portfolio-level claim.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Regulations shift and documentation gets updated, so approval status should be confirmed as current at the time of booking rather than assumed from an announcement.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Possession Timeline<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>A formal possession date for Saima Ace Residency apartments has not been announced. Buyers should secure a documented possession schedule at the point of Saima Ace Residency booking once the project is formally launched, and confirm Saima Ace Residency Saima Builders possession timelines in writing with the developer.<\\/p>\",\"appt_title\":\"BOOK AN APPOINTMENT\",\"body\":\"<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">A premier benchmark for luxury waterfront living, seamlessly blending contemporary architectural elegance with a tranquil coastal sanctuary. Residents enjoy fresh sea breezes, private beach access, and immediate connectivity to key metropolitan hubs.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Located along prestigious shoreline corridors, the community offers an inspired lifestyle for professionals, investors, and families seeking refined island elegance away from urban congestion.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Every residence offers a harmonious blend of sophistication, security, and long-term capital appreciation, presenting an extraordinary investment opportunity in one of the most coveted coastal addresses.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>About the Developers<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Crafted by premier developers renowned for shaping iconic waterfront communities across the region for decades. Buyers and international investors benefit from a celebrated track record of timely delivery, construction excellence, and sustainable urban design.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Working alongside leading international architectural consultants and market advisory firms, every aspect of the project is engineered to global standards of prestige and durability.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Approvals &amp; Clearances<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The project holds full regulatory clearance and title approvals from all relevant municipal and developmental authorities. Complying strictly with environmental and structural guidelines, purchasers can invest with absolute peace of mind and secure freehold ownership.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Prime Location &amp; Seamless Connectivity<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Set within a scenic coastal landscape, the project offers rapid access to international airports, commercial business districts, premier private schools, and luxury retail destinations.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC1.png\\\" alt=\\\"Strategic Location &amp; Connectivity Map\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); width: 100%; margin: 15px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Surrounded by protected green reserves and pristine waters, residents wake up to panoramic coastal vistas and unpolluted air throughout the year.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Architectural Excellence &amp; Floor Plans<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The layouts focus on space efficiency, panoramic natural lighting, and seamless indoor-outdoor living with spacious private terraces and balconies.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>Curated Residences &amp; Layout Types<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC2.png\\\" alt=\\\"Luxury Layout Plan - Type C\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Featuring open-plan living rooms, floor-to-ceiling double-glazed windows, designer show kitchens, and lavish en-suite master bedrooms designed for modern family living.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC3.png\\\" alt=\\\"Executive Layout Plan - Type B\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Expansive terraces provide seamless entertaining spaces overlooking lush landscaped courtyards and the sparkling coastline.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC4.png\\\" alt=\\\"Presidential Villa Layout Plan - Type A\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Generous multi-level accommodations including private elevators, maid\'s quarters, private swimming pools, and dedicated family lounges.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Master Plan &amp; Community Lifestyle<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The community master plan establishes a secure, private, and walkable residential haven. Dedicated subterranean parking ensures pedestrian safety across surface walkways, cycling trails, and waterfront boardwalks.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC8.png\\\" alt=\\\"Community Master Plan Overview\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Flexible Investment &amp; Payment Plan<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>A buyer-friendly, construction-linked payment structure is offered with flexible milestones, making property acquisition straightforward and stress-free.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC12.png\\\" alt=\\\"Milestone Payment Structure\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>World-Class Facilities &amp; Amenities<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Enjoy infinity swimming pools, state-of-the-art fitness centres, private beach cabanas, children\'s play areas, multi-sport courts, and fine-dining waterfront restaurants just steps from your front door.<\\/p>\"}', '2026-10-30 10:52:38', '2026-11-03 06:27:27'),
(724, 93, 'payment_plan', 'Payment Plan', 7, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Ace Residency Payment Plan\",\"description\":\"The payment plan for Saima Ace Residency Saima Builders will be published through the developer\'s authorised sales channel at launch. Buyers should obtain the written schedule for their specific unit, including booking, instalment structure, and any additional charges, before committing.\",\"down_payment\":\"10%\",\"during_construction\":\"40%\",\"on_handover\":\"50%\",\"items\":[{\"milestone\":\"Down Payment\",\"percentage\":\"10%\",\"due\":\"On Booking Date\"},{\"milestone\":\"Construction Milestone 1\",\"percentage\":\"10%\",\"due\":\"6 Months after Booking\"},{\"milestone\":\"Construction Milestone 2\",\"percentage\":\"10%\",\"due\":\"12 Months after Booking\"},{\"milestone\":\"Construction Milestone 3\",\"percentage\":\"10%\",\"due\":\"18 Months after Booking\"},{\"milestone\":\"Construction Milestone 4\",\"percentage\":\"10%\",\"due\":\"24 Months after Booking\"},{\"milestone\":\"On Handover\",\"percentage\":\"50%\",\"due\":\"100% Completion\"}],\"plan_tabs\":null,\"download_text\":\"DOWNLOAD PAYMENT PLAN\",\"download_url\":\"#\"}', '2026-10-30 10:52:38', '2026-11-03 06:27:27'),
(725, 93, 'master_plan', 'Master Plan', 8, 1, '{\"title\":\"Master Plan\",\"description\":\"The master plan creates a harmonious, walkable enclave where residential clusters are woven naturally into open green parklands, pedestrian corridors, and scenic waterfront trails.\",\"image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793687164_6ae97e7c3f709.webp\",\"badge\":\"Click to Enlarge\"}', '2026-10-30 10:52:38', '2026-11-03 06:27:27'),
(726, 93, 'location', 'Location & Connectivity', 9, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Ace Residency Location in Karachi\",\"description\":\"Conveniently located on Hudayriyat Island with direct access via modern bridges to Abu Dhabi\\u2019s key commercial, cultural, and travel hubs.\",\"items\":[{\"place\":\"Downtown Abu Dhabi\",\"time\":\"20 mins\"},{\"place\":\"Emirates Palace\",\"time\":\"23 mins\"},{\"place\":\"Sheikh Zayed Grand Mosque\",\"time\":\"23 mins\"},{\"place\":\"Abu Dhabi Global Financial Centre\",\"time\":\"30 mins\"},{\"place\":\"Louvre Abu Dhabi\",\"time\":\"33 mins\"},{\"place\":\"Zayed International Airport\",\"time\":\"34 mins\"}],\"subtitle\":\"The exact Saima Ace Residency Karachi location has not been released on an official project page, and no dedicated page for the project exists on the developer\'s website yet. Until Saima Builders publishes the confirmed address, buyers should treat third-party location claims with caution and obtain the location in writing from the authorised sales channel. This page will reflect the confirmed location once it is officially released.\",\"image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793687164_6ae97e7c406e8.jpg\",\"categories\":[{\"name\":\"Nearby Landmarks And Attractions\",\"items\":[{\"name\":\"Malir Halt\",\"time\":\"10\\u201315 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"Shahrah-e-Faisal\",\"time\":\"15\\u201320 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"Model Colony\",\"time\":\"10\\u201315 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"Safoora Chowrangi\",\"time\":\"20\\u201325 minutes\"}]}]}', '2026-10-30 10:52:38', '2026-11-03 06:27:27'),
(727, 93, 'faq', 'FAQ Accordion', 10, 1, '{\"title\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\",\"description\":\"Key information and helpful answers regarding property purchases on Hudayriyat Island.\",\"items\":[{\"q\":\"Where is Saima Ace Residency located?\",\"a\":\"The exact Saima Ace Residency Karachi location has not been published on an official project page. Buyers should confirm the confirmed address directly with Saima Builders or its authorised sales channel, and should not rely on third-party listings that guess a neighbourhood.\"},{\"q\":\"What is Saima Ace Residency price?\",\"a\":\"A confirmed public Saima Ace Residency price list has not been released; pricing will be disclosed through the developer\'s authorised sales channel for Saima Ace Residency Karachi once official details are published.\"},{\"q\":\"How many bedrooms in Saima Ace Residency?\",\"a\":\"The official unit mix forSaima Ace Residency apartments has not been published yet, so bedroom configurations should be confirmed against the official Saima Ace Residency floor plan when it is released.\"},{\"q\":\"What is Saima Ace Residency payment plan?\",\"a\":\"The Saima Ace Residency payment plan and Saima Ace Residency booking amount will be disclosed through the developer\'s authorised sales channel rather than a public schedule.\"},{\"q\":\"Is Saima Ace Residency NOC approved?\",\"a\":\"Buyers should verify the project-specific NOC and approval status for Saima Ace Residency Saima Builders directly with the developer or the relevant authority once documentation is released, before paying any booking amount.\"},{\"q\":\"When is Saima Ace Residency possession?\",\"a\":\"Possession is not publicly fixed, so Saima Ace Residency apartments buyers should confirm the schedule in writing at booking once the project is formally launched.\"},{\"q\":\"Is Saima Ace Residency the same as Saima Ace Avenue?\",\"a\":\"No. Saima Ace Residency and Saima Ace Avenue are separate names: Saima Ace Avenue is the Scheme 33 project with its own official listing, while Saima Ace Residency has no dedicated official page yet. Buyers comparing Saima Ace Residency vs Saima Ace Avenue should confirm which project a listing actually refers to before paying anything.\"},{\"q\":\"Who is developing Saima Ace Residency?\",\"a\":\"Saima Ace Residency Saima Builders is attributed to Saima Group, which has built residential communities across Karachi over several decades.\"},{\"q\":\"Can overseas buyers book in Saima Ace Residency?\",\"a\":\"Overseas buyers can engage through authorised channels, but remittance and documentation procedures should be confirmed directly with the Saima Ace Residency sales team.\"},{\"q\":\"Why consider Saima Ace Residency Karachi?\",\"a\":\"Because early registration in a new Saima Builders project can give buyers first access to unit choice and launch terms, provided they verify the project\'s documents when they are released. Saima Ace Residency Karachi should be assessed on its official brochure, not on pre-launch listings.\"}],\"heading\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\"}', '2026-10-30 10:52:38', '2026-11-03 06:27:27'),
(728, 93, 'contact', 'Contact & Booking CTA', 11, 1, '{\"title\":\"Register Your Interest\",\"subtitle\":\"Register your interest in Saima Ace Residency Karachi. Contact our advisory team for personalized guidance on Saima Ace Residency, updated pricing, and booking information as official details are released. Whether you are exploring apartments for sale Saima Ace Residency Karachi or seeking to buy flat in Saima Ace Residency Karachi, our consultants can guide you through the process.\",\"button_text\":\"REGISTER INTEREST\",\"phone\":\"+971 2 000 0000\",\"email\":\"info@hudayriyat-island.com\",\"pretitle\":\"LET\'S CONNECT\",\"heading\":\"Invest in Your Future\",\"form_small\":\"REQUEST\",\"form_large\":\"A CALL BACK\",\"submit_button\":\"REQUEST NOW\",\"bg_image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793687164_6ae97e7c42718.jpeg\"}', '2026-10-30 10:52:38', '2026-11-03 06:27:27'),
(729, 94, 'hero', 'Hero Banner', 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Indus Chowrangi\",\"subtitle\":\"Explore Premier Properties & Real Estate Investment in Indus Chowrangi, Karachi\",\"badge\":\"Prime Real Estate Destination\",\"bg_image\":\"\\/images\\/hero\\/slide-1.jpg\"}', '2026-10-30 11:05:47', '2026-10-30 11:05:47'),
(730, 94, 'content', 'Table of Contents & Article', 2, 1, '{\"title\":\"Indus Chowrangi Living & Waterfront Sanctuary\",\"intro\":\"<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Indus Chowrangi is a premier benchmark for luxury waterfront living, seamlessly blending contemporary architectural elegance with a tranquil coastal sanctuary. Residents enjoy fresh sea breezes, private beach access, and immediate connectivity to key metropolitan hubs.<\\/p><p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:1rem\\\">Located along prestigious shoreline corridors, the community offers an inspired lifestyle for professionals, investors, and families seeking refined island elegance away from urban congestion.<\\/p><p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:1rem\\\">Every residence offers a harmonious blend of sophistication, security, and long-term capital appreciation, presenting an extraordinary investment opportunity in one of the most coveted coastal addresses.<\\/p>\",\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">A premier benchmark for luxury waterfront living, seamlessly blending contemporary architectural elegance with a tranquil coastal sanctuary. Residents enjoy fresh sea breezes, private beach access, and immediate connectivity to key metropolitan hubs.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Located along prestigious shoreline corridors, the community offers an inspired lifestyle for professionals, investors, and families seeking refined island elegance away from urban congestion.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Every residence offers a harmonious blend of sophistication, security, and long-term capital appreciation, presenting an extraordinary investment opportunity in one of the most coveted coastal addresses.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>About the Developers<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Crafted by premier developers renowned for shaping iconic waterfront communities across the region for decades. Buyers and international investors benefit from a celebrated track record of timely delivery, construction excellence, and sustainable urban design.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Working alongside leading international architectural consultants and market advisory firms, every aspect of the project is engineered to global standards of prestige and durability.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Approvals &amp; Clearances<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The project holds full regulatory clearance and title approvals from all relevant municipal and developmental authorities. Complying strictly with environmental and structural guidelines, purchasers can invest with absolute peace of mind and secure freehold ownership.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Prime Location &amp; Seamless Connectivity<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Set within a scenic coastal landscape, the project offers rapid access to international airports, commercial business districts, premier private schools, and luxury retail destinations.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC1.png\\\" alt=\\\"Strategic Location &amp; Connectivity Map\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); width: 100%; margin: 15px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Surrounded by protected green reserves and pristine waters, residents wake up to panoramic coastal vistas and unpolluted air throughout the year.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Architectural Excellence &amp; Floor Plans<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The layouts focus on space efficiency, panoramic natural lighting, and seamless indoor-outdoor living with spacious private terraces and balconies.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>Curated Residences &amp; Layout Types<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC2.png\\\" alt=\\\"Luxury Layout Plan - Type C\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Featuring open-plan living rooms, floor-to-ceiling double-glazed windows, designer show kitchens, and lavish en-suite master bedrooms designed for modern family living.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC3.png\\\" alt=\\\"Executive Layout Plan - Type B\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Expansive terraces provide seamless entertaining spaces overlooking lush landscaped courtyards and the sparkling coastline.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC4.png\\\" alt=\\\"Presidential Villa Layout Plan - Type A\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Generous multi-level accommodations including private elevators, maid\'s quarters, private swimming pools, and dedicated family lounges.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Master Plan &amp; Community Lifestyle<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The community master plan establishes a secure, private, and walkable residential haven. Dedicated subterranean parking ensures pedestrian safety across surface walkways, cycling trails, and waterfront boardwalks.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC8.png\\\" alt=\\\"Community Master Plan Overview\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Flexible Investment &amp; Payment Plan<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>A buyer-friendly, construction-linked payment structure is offered with flexible milestones, making property acquisition straightforward and stress-free.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC12.png\\\" alt=\\\"Milestone Payment Structure\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>World-Class Facilities &amp; Amenities<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Enjoy infinity swimming pools, state-of-the-art fitness centres, private beach cabanas, children\'s play areas, multi-sport courts, and fine-dining waterfront restaurants just steps from your front door.<\\/p>\",\"appt_title\":\"BOOK AN APPOINTMENT\",\"body\":\"<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">A premier benchmark for luxury waterfront living, seamlessly blending contemporary architectural elegance with a tranquil coastal sanctuary. Residents enjoy fresh sea breezes, private beach access, and immediate connectivity to key metropolitan hubs.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Located along prestigious shoreline corridors, the community offers an inspired lifestyle for professionals, investors, and families seeking refined island elegance away from urban congestion.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Every residence offers a harmonious blend of sophistication, security, and long-term capital appreciation, presenting an extraordinary investment opportunity in one of the most coveted coastal addresses.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>About the Developers<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Crafted by premier developers renowned for shaping iconic waterfront communities across the region for decades. Buyers and international investors benefit from a celebrated track record of timely delivery, construction excellence, and sustainable urban design.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Working alongside leading international architectural consultants and market advisory firms, every aspect of the project is engineered to global standards of prestige and durability.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Approvals &amp; Clearances<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The project holds full regulatory clearance and title approvals from all relevant municipal and developmental authorities. Complying strictly with environmental and structural guidelines, purchasers can invest with absolute peace of mind and secure freehold ownership.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Prime Location &amp; Seamless Connectivity<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Set within a scenic coastal landscape, the project offers rapid access to international airports, commercial business districts, premier private schools, and luxury retail destinations.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC1.png\\\" alt=\\\"Strategic Location &amp; Connectivity Map\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); width: 100%; margin: 15px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Surrounded by protected green reserves and pristine waters, residents wake up to panoramic coastal vistas and unpolluted air throughout the year.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Architectural Excellence &amp; Floor Plans<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The layouts focus on space efficiency, panoramic natural lighting, and seamless indoor-outdoor living with spacious private terraces and balconies.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>Curated Residences &amp; Layout Types<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC2.png\\\" alt=\\\"Luxury Layout Plan - Type C\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Featuring open-plan living rooms, floor-to-ceiling double-glazed windows, designer show kitchens, and lavish en-suite master bedrooms designed for modern family living.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC3.png\\\" alt=\\\"Executive Layout Plan - Type B\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Expansive terraces provide seamless entertaining spaces overlooking lush landscaped courtyards and the sparkling coastline.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC4.png\\\" alt=\\\"Presidential Villa Layout Plan - Type A\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Generous multi-level accommodations including private elevators, maid\'s quarters, private swimming pools, and dedicated family lounges.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Master Plan &amp; Community Lifestyle<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The community master plan establishes a secure, private, and walkable residential haven. Dedicated subterranean parking ensures pedestrian safety across surface walkways, cycling trails, and waterfront boardwalks.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC8.png\\\" alt=\\\"Community Master Plan Overview\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Flexible Investment &amp; Payment Plan<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>A buyer-friendly, construction-linked payment structure is offered with flexible milestones, making property acquisition straightforward and stress-free.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC12.png\\\" alt=\\\"Milestone Payment Structure\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>World-Class Facilities &amp; Amenities<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Enjoy infinity swimming pools, state-of-the-art fitness centres, private beach cabanas, children\'s play areas, multi-sport courts, and fine-dining waterfront restaurants just steps from your front door.<\\/p>\"}', '2026-10-30 11:05:47', '2026-10-30 11:05:47'),
(731, 94, 'communities', 'Project Cards', 3, 1, '{\"heading\":\"Featured Projects\",\"subtitle\":\"Explore premium residential and commercial developments\",\"items\":[{\"name\":\"Wadeem Gardens\",\"location\":\"Hudayriyat Island, Abu Dhabi\",\"price\":\"Launch Price: 8.7M AED\",\"delivery\":\"Delivery Date: Q2 2031\",\"developer\":\"Modon Properties\",\"paymentPlan\":\"Flexible Payment Plan\",\"href\":\"\\/wadeem-gardens\",\"image\":\"\\/images\\/communities\\/wadeem-gardens.png\"}],\"selected_ids\":[],\"project_ids\":[]}', '2026-10-30 11:05:47', '2026-10-30 11:05:47'),
(732, 94, 'about', 'About Indus Chowrangi', 4, 1, '{\"title\":\"About the Community\",\"description\":\"A meticulously planned coastal sanctuary seamlessly integrating contemporary luxury living with untouched nature. Spanning scenic waterfronts, lush mangroves, and cycling corridors, the master community offers an unmatched urban lifestyle for residents and high-yield potential for global real estate investors.\",\"video_poster\":\"\\/images\\/projects\\/poster.jpg\",\"video_src\":\"\\/images\\/nawayef-park-views\\/asset_15.mp4\",\"heading\":\"About the Community\",\"video_url\":\"https:\\/\\/stream.mux.com\\/A3200aZtT5Wq7VlYwQv3wP9W2hX8.m3u8\",\"poster_image\":\"\\/images\\/projects\\/poster.jpg\"}', '2026-10-30 11:05:47', '2026-10-30 11:05:47'),
(733, 94, 'faq', 'Frequently Asked Questions', 5, 1, '{\"title\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\",\"description\":\"<p>Key information and helpful answers regarding Indus Chowrangi and property purchases on Hudayriyat Island.<\\/p>\",\"items\":[{\"q\":\"Are properties in this city freehold for foreign and overseas investors?\",\"a\":\"Yes, designated luxury master developments offer 100% freehold ownership for local and international buyers with complete title deed registration.\"},{\"q\":\"What are the typical payment plans available?\",\"a\":\"Flexible installment plans are offered typically linked to construction milestones, with down payments starting from 5% to 10%.\"}],\"heading\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\",\"subtitle\":\"Find answers to common questions about properties, buying process, and payment plans.\"}', '2026-10-30 11:05:47', '2026-10-30 11:05:47'),
(734, 94, 'contact', 'Contact & Booking CTA', 6, 1, '{\"title\":\"Register Your Interest in Indus Chowrangi\",\"subtitle\":\"Connect with our dedicated city property advisors for personalized availability, floor plans, and VIP access.\",\"button_text\":\"REGISTER INTEREST\",\"phone\":\"+971 2 000 0000\",\"email\":\"info@hudayriyat-island.ae\"}', '2026-10-30 11:05:47', '2026-10-30 11:05:47'),
(735, 95, 'hero', 'Hero Banner & Form', 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Business Park at Korangi Township Karachi\",\"subtitle\":\"Saima Business Park, a commercial project by Saima Builders at Sector 19, Korangi Township, Karachi. See key details and investment potential.\",\"badge\":null,\"bg_image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793686789_6ae97d058407e.jpg\",\"bg_image_alt\":\"Saima Business Park at Korangi Township Karachi\",\"image_alt\":\"Saima Business Park at Korangi Township Karachi\"}', '2026-10-30 11:06:26', '2026-11-03 06:19:49'),
(736, 95, 'highlights', 'Project Highlights', 2, 1, '{\"developer\":\"Modon Properties\",\"price\":\"AED 2,500,000\",\"handover\":\"Q4 2028\",\"property_type\":\"Luxury Villas & Apartments\",\"bedrooms\":\"2 to 5 Bedrooms\",\"items\":[],\"highlight_0\":\"Saima Builders\",\"highlight_1\":\"Coming Soon\",\"highlight_2\":\"Q4 2028\",\"highlight_3\":\"Luxury Apartments\",\"highlight_4\":\"Freehold\",\"location\":\"Korangi, Karachi\"}', '2026-10-30 11:06:26', '2026-11-10 10:14:22'),
(737, 95, 'about', 'About Community', 3, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Business Park by Saima Builders\",\"description\":\"<p>Saima Business Park is a commercial project at Sector 19, Korangi Township, Karachi, near Singer Chowrangi, offering offices and shops by Saima Builders, featuring a planned business address inside Karachi\'s Korangi industrial and commercial corridor.<\\/p>\",\"video_poster\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793686789_6ae97d0585aef.jpg\",\"video_src\":\"\\/images\\/nawayef-park-views\\/asset_15.mp4\",\"video_url\":\"\\/images\\/nawayef-park-views\\/asset_15.mp4\"}', '2026-10-30 11:06:26', '2026-11-03 06:19:49'),
(738, 95, 'amenities', 'Amenities & Facilities', 4, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Business Park Amenities\",\"subtitle\":\"Saima Business Park Karachi provides facilities that support everyday commercial operations, including dedicated parking, lift access, security arrangements, and wide internal access planned for business traffic within the Saima Business Park Korangi Karachi development, serving the surrounding Korangi Industrial Area workforce and traders.\",\"items\":[]}', '2026-10-30 11:06:26', '2026-11-10 10:14:22'),
(739, 95, 'gallery', 'Project Gallery', 5, 1, '{\"title\":\"Project Gallery\",\"images\":[{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793686789_6ae97d0587669.jpg\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"},{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793686789_6ae97d0587cd3.jpg\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"},{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793686789_6ae97d05882f7.jpg\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"},{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793686789_6ae97d058882b.jpg\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"}]}', '2026-10-30 11:06:26', '2026-11-03 06:19:49'),
(740, 95, 'content', 'Content', 6, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Business Park at Korangi Township Karachi Living & Waterfront Sanctuary\",\"intro\":\"<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Saima Business Park at Korangi Township Karachi is a premier benchmark for luxury waterfront living, seamlessly blending contemporary architectural elegance with a tranquil coastal sanctuary. Residents enjoy fresh sea breezes, private beach access, and immediate connectivity to key metropolitan hubs.<\\/p><p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:1rem\\\">Located along prestigious shoreline corridors, the community offers an inspired lifestyle for professionals, investors, and families seeking refined island elegance away from urban congestion.<\\/p><p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:1rem\\\">Every residence offers a harmonious blend of sophistication, security, and long-term capital appreciation, presenting an extraordinary investment opportunity in one of the most coveted coastal addresses.<\\/p>\",\"html\":\"<p>At its core, Saima Business Park Korangi Township is a commercial project built for the Korangi economy: offices for the firms that run the industrial area, and shops for the traders who serve it. Unlike a high-street plaza, a business park format groups the units in one planned development with organised access and parking, which matters in a district where commercial space is usually scattered and improvised.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Among Korangi commercial projects Karachi, Saima Business Park Korangi Township stands out for carrying an established developer\'s name into a district dominated by industrial plots and older commercial buildings. As business parks in Karachi are still relatively few, a purpose-planned scheme in Korangi Township offices territory gives both end-users and investors a clearer product to evaluate among commercial hubs Karachi.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Key Project Highlights<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<table>\\r\\n<tbody><tr>\\r\\n<th>Feature<\\/th>\\r\\n<th>Details<\\/th>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Developer<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Saima Builders<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Property Type<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Commercial<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Unit Types<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Offices and shops<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Total Land Size<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Not disclosed<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Handover<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>To be confirmed<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Location<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Korangi Township, near Singer Chowrangi, Karachi<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Payment Plan<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>On Easy Installments<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Lifestyle<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Business hub<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<\\/tbody><\\/table>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Master Plan and Development Framework<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Saima Business Park Korangi Karachi is planned as a commercial development rather than a single building, with a master plan that organises office and shop units, parking, and internal access for business traffic.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The framework reflects the needs of an industrial district: practical unit layouts, room for loading and customer parking, and a layout that separates office activity from retail frontage where the plan allows. The Saima Business Park floor plan should be reviewed unit by unit, as sizes and frontage differ across the scheme.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Unit Types: Offices and Shops<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>For buyers searching for offices for sale Korangi Karachi, shops for sale Korangi Karachi, or commercial property Korangi Township Karachi, Saima Business Park Korangi Township offers commercial units in two categories.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>Offices in Saima Business Park<\\/h3>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The offices in Saima Business Park Korangi Karachi suit the firms that operate in and around the Korangi Industrial Area, including traders, service providers, and company offices that need a planned business address in the district rather than a converted residential unit.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>Shops in Saima Business Park<\\/h3>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The shops in Saima Business Park are aimed at retailers serving the township\'s large residential and workforce population, with frontage units positioned for passing trade within the scheme.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>A floor plan for each unit category is available through the developer\'s authorised sales channel.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Floor Plan<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Buyers seeking a Saima Business Park floor plan should request the unit schedule alongside the floor plan from the authorised sales channel, as secondary listings are often incomplete.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Price and Booking Status<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The Saima Business Park price varies depending on unit type, size, and floor, and is disclosed through the developer\'s authorised sales channel. Shops with main frontage usually carry a premium over internal units, while offices are priced by size and floor. The Saima Business Park Korangi Township payment plan is structured to accommodate various buyer profiles, with flexible instalment options available on request.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>A Saima Business Park booking is processed through the developer\'s sales team, and the booking amount should be confirmed in writing alongside the Saima Business Park payment plan. Buyers should request the Saima Business Park office price per sqft for their preferred unit, and the practical route to an office for sale Saima Business Park Korangi is to register interest directly with Saima Builders or its designated sales partners.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Saima Business Park Karachi buyers should also confirm whether a commercial office on installments Korangi Karachi at this project is being offered through a priority allocation system or on a first-come, first-served basis.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>NOC and Approval Status<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Saima Business Park Korangi Karachi buyers should verify the project-specific approvals directly with the developer or the relevant authority before booking, as NOC status applies to the individual project and its phases.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Regulations shift and documentation gets updated, so a status reported earlier should be re-confirmed at the time of booking rather than assumed to still apply.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Possession Timeline<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>A formal possession date for Saima Business Park has not been announced as a single project-wide date, and handover in a commercial scheme of this type is normally phased. Buyers should secure a documented possession schedule at the point of Saima Business Park booking, and Saima Business Park Korangi Township possession timelines should be confirmed in writing with the developer.<\\/p>\",\"appt_title\":\"BOOK AN APPOINTMENT\",\"body\":\"<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">A premier benchmark for luxury waterfront living, seamlessly blending contemporary architectural elegance with a tranquil coastal sanctuary. Residents enjoy fresh sea breezes, private beach access, and immediate connectivity to key metropolitan hubs.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Located along prestigious shoreline corridors, the community offers an inspired lifestyle for professionals, investors, and families seeking refined island elegance away from urban congestion.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Every residence offers a harmonious blend of sophistication, security, and long-term capital appreciation, presenting an extraordinary investment opportunity in one of the most coveted coastal addresses.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>About the Developers<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Crafted by premier developers renowned for shaping iconic waterfront communities across the region for decades. Buyers and international investors benefit from a celebrated track record of timely delivery, construction excellence, and sustainable urban design.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Working alongside leading international architectural consultants and market advisory firms, every aspect of the project is engineered to global standards of prestige and durability.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Approvals &amp; Clearances<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The project holds full regulatory clearance and title approvals from all relevant municipal and developmental authorities. Complying strictly with environmental and structural guidelines, purchasers can invest with absolute peace of mind and secure freehold ownership.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Prime Location &amp; Seamless Connectivity<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Set within a scenic coastal landscape, the project offers rapid access to international airports, commercial business districts, premier private schools, and luxury retail destinations.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC1.png\\\" alt=\\\"Strategic Location &amp; Connectivity Map\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); width: 100%; margin: 15px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Surrounded by protected green reserves and pristine waters, residents wake up to panoramic coastal vistas and unpolluted air throughout the year.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Architectural Excellence &amp; Floor Plans<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The layouts focus on space efficiency, panoramic natural lighting, and seamless indoor-outdoor living with spacious private terraces and balconies.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>Curated Residences &amp; Layout Types<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC2.png\\\" alt=\\\"Luxury Layout Plan - Type C\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Featuring open-plan living rooms, floor-to-ceiling double-glazed windows, designer show kitchens, and lavish en-suite master bedrooms designed for modern family living.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC3.png\\\" alt=\\\"Executive Layout Plan - Type B\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Expansive terraces provide seamless entertaining spaces overlooking lush landscaped courtyards and the sparkling coastline.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC4.png\\\" alt=\\\"Presidential Villa Layout Plan - Type A\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Generous multi-level accommodations including private elevators, maid\'s quarters, private swimming pools, and dedicated family lounges.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Master Plan &amp; Community Lifestyle<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The community master plan establishes a secure, private, and walkable residential haven. Dedicated subterranean parking ensures pedestrian safety across surface walkways, cycling trails, and waterfront boardwalks.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC8.png\\\" alt=\\\"Community Master Plan Overview\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Flexible Investment &amp; Payment Plan<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>A buyer-friendly, construction-linked payment structure is offered with flexible milestones, making property acquisition straightforward and stress-free.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC12.png\\\" alt=\\\"Milestone Payment Structure\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>World-Class Facilities &amp; Amenities<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Enjoy infinity swimming pools, state-of-the-art fitness centres, private beach cabanas, children\'s play areas, multi-sport courts, and fine-dining waterfront restaurants just steps from your front door.<\\/p>\"}', '2026-10-30 11:06:26', '2026-11-03 06:19:49'),
(741, 95, 'payment_plan', 'Payment Plan', 7, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Business Park Payment Plan\",\"description\":\"The payment plan for Saima Business Park Korangi Karachi is structured around booking and subsequent installments, with the exact current schedule, amounts, and terms provided upon request through the developer\'s authorised sales channel. Schedules are subject to revision, so buyers should obtain the plan in writing for their specific unit.\",\"down_payment\":\"10%\",\"during_construction\":\"40%\",\"on_handover\":\"50%\",\"items\":[{\"milestone\":\"Down Payment\",\"percentage\":\"10%\",\"due\":\"On Booking Date\"},{\"milestone\":\"Construction Milestone 1\",\"percentage\":\"10%\",\"due\":\"6 Months after Booking\"},{\"milestone\":\"Construction Milestone 2\",\"percentage\":\"10%\",\"due\":\"12 Months after Booking\"},{\"milestone\":\"Construction Milestone 3\",\"percentage\":\"10%\",\"due\":\"18 Months after Booking\"},{\"milestone\":\"Construction Milestone 4\",\"percentage\":\"10%\",\"due\":\"24 Months after Booking\"},{\"milestone\":\"On Handover\",\"percentage\":\"50%\",\"due\":\"100% Completion\"}],\"plan_tabs\":null,\"download_text\":\"DOWNLOAD PAYMENT PLAN\",\"download_url\":\"#\"}', '2026-10-30 11:06:26', '2026-11-03 06:19:49'),
(742, 95, 'master_plan', 'Master Plan', 8, 1, '{\"title\":\"Master Plan\",\"description\":\"The master plan creates a harmonious, walkable enclave where residential clusters are woven naturally into open green parklands, pedestrian corridors, and scenic waterfront trails.\",\"image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793686789_6ae97d058b87e.jpg\",\"badge\":\"Click to Enlarge\"}', '2026-10-30 11:06:26', '2026-11-03 06:19:49');
INSERT INTO `page_sections` (`id`, `page_id`, `section_key`, `section_name`, `order`, `is_active`, `content`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(743, 95, 'location', 'Location & Connectivity', 9, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Business Park Location in Korangi Township, Karachi\",\"description\":\"Conveniently located on Hudayriyat Island with direct access via modern bridges to Abu Dhabi\\u2019s key commercial, cultural, and travel hubs.\",\"items\":[{\"place\":\"Downtown Abu Dhabi\",\"time\":\"20 mins\"},{\"place\":\"Emirates Palace\",\"time\":\"23 mins\"},{\"place\":\"Sheikh Zayed Grand Mosque\",\"time\":\"23 mins\"},{\"place\":\"Abu Dhabi Global Financial Centre\",\"time\":\"30 mins\"},{\"place\":\"Louvre Abu Dhabi\",\"time\":\"33 mins\"},{\"place\":\"Zayed International Airport\",\"time\":\"34 mins\"}],\"subtitle\":\"The Saima Business Park Karachi location is at Sector 19, Korangi Township, near Singer Chowrangi. Korangi is one of Karachi\'s principal industrial and commercial districts, and the Sector 19 Korangi Township commercial zone places the project within reach of factories, warehouses, trading businesses, and the residential areas their workforce lives in, including Shah Faisal Colony and Landhi.\",\"image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793686789_6ae97d058cce5.jpg\",\"categories\":[{\"name\":\"Nearby Landmarks And Attractions\",\"items\":[{\"name\":\"Singer Chowrangi (Indus Chowrangi)\",\"time\":\"3\\u20135 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"Korangi Industrial Area\",\"time\":\"3\\u20138 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"Shah Faisal Colony\",\"time\":\"7\\u201315 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"Shah Faisal Colony\",\"time\":\"15\\u201325 minutes\"}]}]}', '2026-10-30 11:06:26', '2026-11-03 06:19:49'),
(744, 95, 'faq', 'FAQ Accordion', 10, 1, '{\"title\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\",\"description\":\"Key information and helpful answers regarding property purchases on Hudayriyat Island.\",\"items\":[{\"q\":\"Where is Saima Business Park located?\",\"a\":\"Saima Business Park is located at Sector 19, Korangi Township, Karachi, near Singer Chowrangi and the Korangi Industrial Area. The Saima Business Park Korangi Karachi location serves one of the city\'s largest industrial and trading zones.\"},{\"q\":\"What is Saima Business Park price?\",\"a\":\"A confirmed public Saima Business Park price list has not been released; pricing varies by unit type, size, and floor and is available through the developer\'s authorised sales channel for Saima Business Park Karachi.\"},{\"q\":\"What office \\/ shop sizes in Saima Business Park?\",\"a\":\"Office and shop sizes vary by unit and floor across Saima Business Park Korangi Township, but exact sizes should be confirmed against the official Saima Business Park floor plan for Saima Business Park Karachi.\"},{\"q\":\"What is Saima Business Park payment plan?\",\"a\":\"The Saima Business Park payment plan and booking amount are disclosed through sales engagement rather than a public schedule.\"},{\"q\":\"Is Saima Business Park NOC approved?\",\"a\":\"Buyers should verify the project-specific NOC and approval status for Saima Business Park Karachi directly with the developer or the relevant authority before purchase.\"},{\"q\":\"When is Saima Business Park possession?\",\"a\":\"Possession is not publicly fixed, so Saima Business Park Korangi Karachi buyers should confirm the schedule in writing at booking.\"},{\"q\":\"Who is developing Saima Business Park?\",\"a\":\"Saima Business Park is developed by Saima Group, which has built residential communities and commercial projects across Karachi over several decades.\"},{\"q\":\"Is Saima Business Park part of a larger project?\",\"a\":\"No, Saima Business Park is a standalone commercial project in Korangi Township, planned as a business park with offices and shops serving the surrounding industrial area.\"},{\"q\":\"Can overseas buyers book in Saima Business Park?\",\"a\":\"Overseas buyers can engage through authorised channels, but remittance and documentation procedures should be confirmed directly with the Saima Business Park sales team.\"},{\"q\":\"Why consider Saima Business Park Karachi?\",\"a\":\"Because Korangi is one of Karachi\'s biggest employment and trading zones, and a planned business park address gives small and mid-sized firms a more organised base than scattered street shops. Saima Business Park Karachi also suits investors looking at business park offices Karachi for investment in an industrial corridor with built-in demand.\"}],\"heading\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\"}', '2026-10-30 11:06:26', '2026-11-03 06:19:49'),
(745, 95, 'contact', 'Contact & Booking CTA', 11, 1, '{\"title\":\"Register Your Interest\",\"subtitle\":\"Discover commercial opportunities at Saima Business Park Korangi Township. Contact our advisory team for personalized guidance on Saima Business Park, updated pricing, and private viewings. Whether you are exploring offices for sale Korangi Karachi or a shop for sale Saima Business Park Karachi, our consultants can navigate the Saima Business Park booking process.\",\"button_text\":\"REGISTER INTEREST\",\"phone\":\"+971 2 000 0000\",\"email\":\"info@hudayriyat-island.com\",\"pretitle\":\"LET\'S CONNECT\",\"heading\":\"Invest in Your Future\",\"form_small\":\"REQUEST\",\"form_large\":\"A CALL BACK\",\"submit_button\":\"REQUEST NOW\",\"bg_image\":\"\\/images\\/form image.jpg\"}', '2026-10-30 11:06:26', '2026-11-03 06:19:49'),
(746, 96, 'hero', 'Hero Banner & Form', 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Jinnah Mall and Residence\",\"subtitle\":\"Saima Jinnah Mall and Residence, a mixed-use project by Saima Builders on Main Jinnah Avenue, opposite Malir Cantt, Karachi. See key details.\",\"badge\":null,\"bg_image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793686486_6ae97bd6b0cfd.png\",\"bg_image_alt\":\"Saima Jinnah Mall and Residence\",\"image_alt\":\"Saima Jinnah Mall and Residence\"}', '2026-10-30 11:22:17', '2026-11-03 06:14:46'),
(747, 96, 'highlights', 'Project Highlights', 2, 1, '{\"developer\":\"Modon Properties\",\"price\":\"AED 2,500,000\",\"handover\":\"Q4 2028\",\"property_type\":\"Luxury Villas & Apartments\",\"bedrooms\":\"2 to 5 Bedrooms\",\"items\":[],\"highlight_0\":\"Saima Builders\",\"highlight_1\":\"Coming Soon\",\"highlight_2\":\"Q4 2028\",\"highlight_3\":\"Mall & Apartments\",\"highlight_4\":\"Freehold\",\"location\":\"Main Jinnah Avenue\"}', '2026-10-30 11:22:17', '2026-11-10 10:14:07'),
(748, 96, 'about', 'About Community', 3, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Jinnah Mall and Residence by Saima Builders\",\"description\":\"<p>Saima Jinnah Mall and Residence is a mixed-use project on Main Jinnah Avenue, Karachi, opposite Malir Cantt Checkpost No. 5, offering 3-bed and 4-bed apartments along with shops and showrooms by Saima Builders, featuring residential living above a retail mall in the Malir corridor.<\\/p>\",\"video_poster\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793686486_6ae97bd6b4b84.png\",\"video_src\":\"\\/images\\/nawayef-park-views\\/asset_15.mp4\",\"video_url\":\"\\/images\\/nawayef-park-views\\/asset_15.mp4\"}', '2026-10-30 11:22:17', '2026-11-03 06:14:46'),
(749, 96, 'amenities', 'Amenities & Facilities', 4, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Jinnah Mall and Residence Amenities\",\"subtitle\":\"Saima Jinnah Mall and Residence Karachi provides facilities that support secure, convenient living and trading, including 24\\/7 security, a gymnasium, modern lifts, and a mosque within the Saima Jinnah Mall Main Jinnah Avenue development, with the retail mall component serving residents\' everyday shopping needs.\",\"items\":[]}', '2026-10-30 11:22:17', '2026-11-10 10:14:07'),
(750, 96, 'gallery', 'Project Gallery', 5, 1, '{\"title\":\"Project Gallery\",\"images\":[{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793686486_6ae97bd6b8b6d.jpeg\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"},{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793686486_6ae97bd6b8e23.jpeg\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"},{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793686486_6ae97bd6b9254.jpeg\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"}]}', '2026-10-30 11:22:17', '2026-11-03 06:14:46'),
(751, 96, 'content', 'Content', 6, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Jinnah Mall and Residence at Main Jinnah Avenue Karachi Living & Waterfront Sanctuary\",\"intro\":\"<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Saima Jinnah Mall and Residence at Main Jinnah Avenue Karachi is a premier benchmark for luxury waterfront living, seamlessly blending contemporary architectural elegance with a tranquil coastal sanctuary. Residents enjoy fresh sea breezes, private beach access, and immediate connectivity to key metropolitan hubs.<\\/p><p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:1rem\\\">Located along prestigious shoreline corridors, the community offers an inspired lifestyle for professionals, investors, and families seeking refined island elegance away from urban congestion.<\\/p><p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:1rem\\\">Every residence offers a harmonious blend of sophistication, security, and long-term capital appreciation, presenting an extraordinary investment opportunity in one of the most coveted coastal addresses.<\\/p>\",\"html\":\"<p>At its core, Saima Jinnah Mall Main Jinnah Avenue is a mixed-use project: a retail mall component with shops and showrooms, and residential apartments above it, in one development on Main Jinnah Avenue. That structure sets Saima Jinnah Mall Main Jinnah Avenue apart from the purely residential Saima projects \\u2014 a single buyer can choose between a shop, an apartment, or eventually both, all within the same building.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Among mixed-use developments Karachi, this project is positioned for the Jinnah Avenue corridor\'s growth: as Scheme 33 and the surrounding population keep expanding, main-road retail with a residential catchment above it has a built-in customer base. Within opposite Malir Cantt projects, Saima Jinnah Mall Main Jinnah Avenue mall-plus-residence format is the differentiator, and it is regularly compared with other Scheme 33 Jinnah Avenue projects by both families and shop investors.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Key Project Highlights<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<table>\\r\\n<tbody><tr>\\r\\n<th>Feature<\\/th>\\r\\n<th>Details<\\/th>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Developer<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Saima Builders<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Property Type<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Mixed-use<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Unit Types<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>3 & 4-bed apartments, shops and showrooms<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Total Land Size<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>4.4 acres<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Handover<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>To be confirmed<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Location<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Main Jinnah Avenue, opposite Malir Cantt Checkpost 5, Karachi<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Payment Plan<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>On Easy Installments<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Lifestyle<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Mixed-use living<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<\\/tbody><\\/table>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Master Plan and Development Framework<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Saima Jinnah Mall Malir Karachi and Residence is planned as a mixed-use development, with a master plan that separates the retail mall floors from the residential floors above while sharing access, parking, and services within one scheme.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The framework reflects how such projects work in practice: retail activity concentrated at the lower levels where footfall is natural, and residences placed above with their own lift access and privacy. The Saima Jinnah Mall and Residence floor plan should be reviewed separately for shop and apartment units, as sizes and frontage differ sharply between the two.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Unit Types: Apartments, Shops and Showrooms<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>For buyers searching for shops for sale Main Jinnah Avenue Karachi, a 3 bed apartment Main Jinnah Avenue Karachi, or a 4 bed apartment Main Jinnah Avenue Karachi, Saima Jinnah Mall and Residence Karachi offers mixed-use units in three categories.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>3-Bedroom Apartments in Saima Jinnah Mall and Residence<\\/h3>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The 3-bed apartments (5-room layouts) in Saima Jinnah Mall and Residence suit families who want a main-avenue address with shopping downstairs, in the Malir\\u2013Scheme 33 corridor.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>4-Bedroom Apartments in Saima Jinnah Mall and Residence<\\/h3>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The 4-bed apartments (6-room layouts) in Saima Jinnah Mall Main Jinnah Avenue are the project\'s larger residences, aimed at bigger families who need the extra room in the same mixed-use setting.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>Shops and Showrooms in Saima Jinnah Mall and Residence<\\/h3>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The retail component offers shops and showrooms within the mall, aimed at traders and brands serving the Jinnah Avenue traffic and the project\'s own residents \\u2014 the mall shops for sale Karachi category within this development.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Floor Plan<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>A floor plan for each unit category is available through the developer\'s authorised sales channel. Buyers seeking a Saima Jinnah Mall and Residence price or floor plan should request the unit schedule alongside the floor plan from the authorised sales channel, as secondary listings are often incomplete.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Price and Booking Status<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The Saima Jinnah Mall and Residence price varies depending on unit type, size, and floor, and is disclosed through the developer\'s authorised sales channel. Mall shops with main-road frontage usually carry a premium, while apartment pricing follows size and floor. The Saima Jinnah Mall and Residence payment plan is structured to accommodate various buyer profiles, with flexible instalment options available on request.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>A Saima Jinnah Mall and Residence booking is processed through the developer\'s sales team, and the Saima Jinnah Mall booking amount should be confirmed in writing alongside the payment plan. Buyers comparing the shop for sale Saima Jinnah Mall price, 3 bed apartment Saima Jinnah Mall price, and 4 bed apartment Saima Jinnah Mall price should request all three schedules together to compare total payable.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Saima Jinnah Mall and Residence Karachi buyers should also confirm whether units in this mixed-use project Main Jinnah Avenue Karachi are being offered through a priority allocation system or on a first-come, first-served basis.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>NOC and Approval Status<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Saima Jinnah Mall Main Jinnah Avenue buyers should verify the project-specific approvals directly with the developer or the relevant authority before booking, as NOC status applies to the individual project and, in mixed-use schemes, can differ between the commercial and residential components.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Regulations shift and documentation gets updated, so a status reported earlier should be re-confirmed at the time of booking rather than assumed to still apply.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Possession Timeline<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>A formal possession date for Saima Jinnah Mall Malir Karachi and Residence has not been announced as a single project-wide date, and handover in a mixed-use project is normally phased between the retail and residential components. Buyers should secure a documented possession schedule at the point of Saima Jinnah Mall and Residence booking, confirmed in writing with the developer.<\\/p>\",\"appt_title\":\"BOOK AN APPOINTMENT\",\"body\":\"<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">A premier benchmark for luxury waterfront living, seamlessly blending contemporary architectural elegance with a tranquil coastal sanctuary. Residents enjoy fresh sea breezes, private beach access, and immediate connectivity to key metropolitan hubs.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Located along prestigious shoreline corridors, the community offers an inspired lifestyle for professionals, investors, and families seeking refined island elegance away from urban congestion.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Every residence offers a harmonious blend of sophistication, security, and long-term capital appreciation, presenting an extraordinary investment opportunity in one of the most coveted coastal addresses.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>About the Developers<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Crafted by premier developers renowned for shaping iconic waterfront communities across the region for decades. Buyers and international investors benefit from a celebrated track record of timely delivery, construction excellence, and sustainable urban design.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Working alongside leading international architectural consultants and market advisory firms, every aspect of the project is engineered to global standards of prestige and durability.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Approvals &amp; Clearances<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The project holds full regulatory clearance and title approvals from all relevant municipal and developmental authorities. Complying strictly with environmental and structural guidelines, purchasers can invest with absolute peace of mind and secure freehold ownership.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Prime Location &amp; Seamless Connectivity<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Set within a scenic coastal landscape, the project offers rapid access to international airports, commercial business districts, premier private schools, and luxury retail destinations.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC1.png\\\" alt=\\\"Strategic Location &amp; Connectivity Map\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); width: 100%; margin: 15px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Surrounded by protected green reserves and pristine waters, residents wake up to panoramic coastal vistas and unpolluted air throughout the year.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Architectural Excellence &amp; Floor Plans<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The layouts focus on space efficiency, panoramic natural lighting, and seamless indoor-outdoor living with spacious private terraces and balconies.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>Curated Residences &amp; Layout Types<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC2.png\\\" alt=\\\"Luxury Layout Plan - Type C\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Featuring open-plan living rooms, floor-to-ceiling double-glazed windows, designer show kitchens, and lavish en-suite master bedrooms designed for modern family living.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC3.png\\\" alt=\\\"Executive Layout Plan - Type B\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Expansive terraces provide seamless entertaining spaces overlooking lush landscaped courtyards and the sparkling coastline.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC4.png\\\" alt=\\\"Presidential Villa Layout Plan - Type A\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Generous multi-level accommodations including private elevators, maid\'s quarters, private swimming pools, and dedicated family lounges.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Master Plan &amp; Community Lifestyle<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The community master plan establishes a secure, private, and walkable residential haven. Dedicated subterranean parking ensures pedestrian safety across surface walkways, cycling trails, and waterfront boardwalks.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC8.png\\\" alt=\\\"Community Master Plan Overview\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Flexible Investment &amp; Payment Plan<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>A buyer-friendly, construction-linked payment structure is offered with flexible milestones, making property acquisition straightforward and stress-free.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC12.png\\\" alt=\\\"Milestone Payment Structure\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>World-Class Facilities &amp; Amenities<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Enjoy infinity swimming pools, state-of-the-art fitness centres, private beach cabanas, children\'s play areas, multi-sport courts, and fine-dining waterfront restaurants just steps from your front door.<\\/p>\"}', '2026-10-30 11:22:17', '2026-11-03 06:14:46'),
(752, 96, 'payment_plan', 'Payment Plan', 7, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Jinnah Mall and Residence Payment Plan\",\"description\":\"The payment plan for Saima Jinnah Mall Malir Karachi is structured around booking and subsequent installments, with separate schedules typically applying to shop and apartment units. Exact terms, amounts, and schedules are provided upon request through the developer\'s authorised sales channel and should be obtained in writing for the specific unit.\",\"down_payment\":\"10%\",\"during_construction\":\"40%\",\"on_handover\":\"50%\",\"items\":[{\"milestone\":\"Down Payment\",\"percentage\":\"10%\",\"due\":\"On Booking Date\"},{\"milestone\":\"Construction Milestone 1\",\"percentage\":\"10%\",\"due\":\"6 Months after Booking\"},{\"milestone\":\"Construction Milestone 2\",\"percentage\":\"10%\",\"due\":\"12 Months after Booking\"},{\"milestone\":\"Construction Milestone 3\",\"percentage\":\"10%\",\"due\":\"18 Months after Booking\"},{\"milestone\":\"Construction Milestone 4\",\"percentage\":\"10%\",\"due\":\"24 Months after Booking\"},{\"milestone\":\"On Handover\",\"percentage\":\"50%\",\"due\":\"100% Completion\"}],\"plan_tabs\":null,\"download_text\":\"DOWNLOAD PAYMENT PLAN\",\"download_url\":\"#\"}', '2026-10-30 11:22:17', '2026-11-03 06:14:46'),
(753, 96, 'master_plan', 'Master Plan', 8, 1, '{\"title\":\"Master Plan\",\"description\":\"The master plan creates a harmonious, walkable enclave where residential clusters are woven naturally into open green parklands, pedestrian corridors, and scenic waterfront trails.\",\"image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793686486_6ae97bd6bbd73.jpeg\",\"badge\":\"Click to Enlarge\"}', '2026-10-30 11:22:17', '2026-11-03 06:14:46'),
(754, 96, 'location', 'Location & Connectivity', 9, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Jinnah Mall and Residence Location on Main Jinnah Avenue, Karachi\",\"description\":\"Conveniently located on Hudayriyat Island with direct access via modern bridges to Abu Dhabi\\u2019s key commercial, cultural, and travel hubs.\",\"items\":[{\"place\":\"Downtown Abu Dhabi\",\"time\":\"20 mins\"},{\"place\":\"Emirates Palace\",\"time\":\"23 mins\"},{\"place\":\"Sheikh Zayed Grand Mosque\",\"time\":\"23 mins\"},{\"place\":\"Abu Dhabi Global Financial Centre\",\"time\":\"30 mins\"},{\"place\":\"Louvre Abu Dhabi\",\"time\":\"33 mins\"},{\"place\":\"Zayed International Airport\",\"time\":\"34 mins\"}],\"subtitle\":\"The Saima Jinnah Mall and Residence Karachi location is on Main Jinnah Avenue, opposite Malir Cantt Checkpost No. 5. Jinnah Avenue is the main corridor between Scheme 33 and Malir, so the project draws on both catchments: the growing residential population of Scheme 33 on one side and the established Malir Cantonment side on the other. Main Jinnah Avenue apartments \\/ shops in this position serve residents, commuters, and the cantonment community alike.\",\"image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793686486_6ae97bd6bd20c.jpeg\",\"categories\":[{\"name\":\"Nearby Landmarks And Attractions\",\"items\":[{\"name\":\"Malir Cantonment Checkpost 5\",\"time\":\"1\\u20132 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"Main Jinnah Avenue\",\"time\":\"1\\u20133 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"Scheme 33\",\"time\":\"5\\u201310 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"Askari 5, Malir Cantt\",\"time\":\"7\\u201312 minutes\"}]}]}', '2026-10-30 11:22:17', '2026-11-03 06:14:46'),
(755, 96, 'faq', 'FAQ Accordion', 10, 1, '{\"title\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\",\"description\":\"Key information and helpful answers regarding property purchases on Hudayriyat Island.\",\"items\":[{\"q\":\"Where is Saima Jinnah Mall and Residence located?\",\"a\":\"Saima Jinnah Mall and Residence is located on Main Jinnah Avenue, Karachi, opposite Malir Cantt Checkpost No. 5, on the Scheme 33 side of Jinnah Avenue. The Saima Jinnah Mall Malir Karachi location serves the Malir and Scheme 33 catchments.\"},{\"q\":\"What is Saima Jinnah Mall and Residence price?\",\"a\":\"A confirmed public Saima Jinnah Mall and Residence price list has not been released; pricing varies by unit type, size, and floor and is available through the developer\'s authorised sales channel for Saima Jinnah Mall and Residence Karachi.\"},{\"q\":\"What shops \\/ apartments in Saima Jinnah Mall?\",\"a\":\"Saima Jinnah Mall and Residence combines a retail component of shops and showrooms with residential apartments above, offered as 3-bed apartments (5-room layouts) and 4-bed apartments (6-room layouts) in Saima Jinnah Mall Karachi.\"},{\"q\":\"What is Saima Jinnah Mall payment plan?\",\"a\":\"The Saima Jinnah Mall payment plan and Saima Jinnah Mall booking amount are disclosed through sales engagement rather than a public schedule; the formal project name for payment documents is Saima Jinnah Mall and Residence.\"},{\"q\":\"Is Saima Jinnah Mall and Residence NOC approved?\",\"a\":\"Buyers should verify the project-specific NOC and approval status for Saima Jinnah Mall Main Jinnah Avenue directly with the developer or the relevant authority before purchase.\"},{\"q\":\"When is Saima Jinnah Mall and Residence possession?\",\"a\":\"Possession is not publicly fixed, so Saima Jinnah Mall and Residence buyers should confirm the schedule in writing at booking.\"},{\"q\":\"Is Saima Jinnah Mall and Residence the same as Saima Jinnah Icon?\",\"a\":\"No. Saima Jinnah Mall and Residence (opposite Malir Cantt Checkpost No. 5) and Saima Jinnah Icon (near Checkpost 6, Sector 40) are separate projects on Main Jinnah Avenue. Buyers should confirm which project a listing refers to before paying anything.\"},{\"q\":\"Who is developing Saima Jinnah Mall and Residence?\",\"a\":\"Saima Jinnah Mall and Residence is developed by Saima Group, which has built residential communities and mixed-use projects across Karachi over several decades.\"},{\"q\":\"Can overseas buyers book in Saima Jinnah Mall and Residence?\",\"a\":\"Overseas buyers can engage through authorised channels, but remittance and documentation procedures should be confirmed directly with the Saima Jinnah Mall and Residence sales team.\"},{\"q\":\"Why consider Saima Jinnah Mall and Residence Karachi?\",\"a\":\"Because it is the Saima project on Jinnah Avenue that lets one buyer choose between a shop, an apartment, or both in the same development, opposite Malir Cantt, with the growing Scheme 33 and Malir population as its catchment. Saima Jinnah Mall Malir Karachi and Residence also provides a clear mixed-use identity within the developer\'s portfolio.\"}],\"heading\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\"}', '2026-10-30 11:22:17', '2026-11-03 06:14:46'),
(756, 96, 'contact', 'Contact & Booking CTA', 11, 1, '{\"title\":\"Register Your Interest\",\"subtitle\":\"Discover apartments and shops at Saima Jinnah Mall and Residence Karachi. Contact our advisory team for personalized guidance on Saima Jinnah Mall and Residence, updated pricing, and private viewings. Whether you are exploring apartments for sale Malir Karachi or seeking to buy shop in Saima Jinnah Mall Karachi, our consultants can navigate the Saima Jinnah Mall and Residence booking process.\",\"button_text\":\"REGISTER INTEREST\",\"phone\":\"+971 2 000 0000\",\"email\":\"info@hudayriyat-island.com\",\"pretitle\":\"LET\'S CONNECT\",\"heading\":\"Invest in Your Future\",\"form_small\":\"REQUEST\",\"form_large\":\"A CALL BACK\",\"submit_button\":\"REQUEST NOW\",\"bg_image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793686486_6ae97bd6be6ce.jpeg\"}', '2026-10-30 11:22:17', '2026-11-03 06:14:46'),
(757, 97, 'hero', 'Hero Banner & Form', 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Center Point at M.A. Jinnah Road Karachi\",\"subtitle\":\"Saima Center Point, 2, 3 & 4-bed apartments by Saima Builders on Main M.A. Jinnah Road, near Saddar, Karachi. See key details.\",\"badge\":null,\"bg_image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793685916_6ae9799c0f926.jpg\",\"bg_image_alt\":\"Saima Center Point at M.A. Jinnah Road Karachi\",\"image_alt\":\"Saima Center Point at M.A. Jinnah Road Karachi\"}', '2026-10-30 11:41:01', '2026-11-03 06:05:39'),
(758, 97, 'highlights', 'Project Highlights', 2, 1, '{\"developer\":\"Modon Properties\",\"price\":\"AED 2,500,000\",\"handover\":\"Q4 2028\",\"property_type\":\"Luxury Villas & Apartments\",\"bedrooms\":\"2 to 5 Bedrooms\",\"items\":[],\"highlight_0\":\"Saima Builders\",\"highlight_1\":\"Coming Soon\",\"highlight_2\":\"Q4 2028\",\"highlight_3\":\"Luxury Apartments\",\"highlight_4\":\"Freehold\",\"location\":\"M.A. Jinnah Road\"}', '2026-10-30 11:41:01', '2026-11-10 07:23:57'),
(759, 97, 'about', 'About Community', 3, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Center Point by Saima Builders\",\"description\":\"<p>Saima Center Point is a residential apartment project on Main M.A. Jinnah Road, Karachi, near Saddar and Numaish, offering 2-bed, 3-bed, and 4-bed apartments by Saima Builders, featuring central-city living on Karachi\'s most historic commercial corridor.<\\/p>\",\"video_poster\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793685916_6ae9799c127f4.jpg\",\"video_src\":\"\\/images\\/nawayef-park-views\\/asset_15.mp4\",\"video_url\":\"\\/images\\/nawayef-park-views\\/asset_15.mp4\"}', '2026-10-30 11:41:01', '2026-11-03 06:05:39'),
(760, 97, 'amenities', 'Amenities & Facilities', 4, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Center Point Amenities\",\"subtitle\":\"Saima Center Point Saddar Karachi provides facilities that support secure, convenient city living, including modern elevators, security systems, standby power backup, and dedicated parking within the Saima Center Point M.A. Jinnah Road development, in a location where everyday retail and services are already established along M.A. Jinnah Road.\",\"items\":[]}', '2026-10-30 11:41:01', '2026-11-10 07:23:57'),
(761, 97, 'gallery', 'Project Gallery', 5, 1, '{\"title\":\"Project Gallery\",\"images\":[{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793685916_6ae9799c14190.jpg\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"},{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793685916_6ae9799c14562.jpg\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"},{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793685916_6ae9799c1492b.jpg\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"},{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793685916_6ae9799c14c7a.jpg\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"}]}', '2026-10-30 11:41:01', '2026-11-03 06:05:39'),
(762, 97, 'content', 'Content', 6, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Center Point Living & Waterfront Sanctuary\",\"intro\":\"<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Saima Center Point is a premier benchmark for luxury waterfront living, seamlessly blending contemporary architectural elegance with a tranquil coastal sanctuary. Residents enjoy fresh sea breezes, private beach access, and immediate connectivity to key metropolitan hubs.<\\/p><p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:1rem\\\">Located along prestigious shoreline corridors, the community offers an inspired lifestyle for professionals, investors, and families seeking refined island elegance away from urban congestion.<\\/p><p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:1rem\\\">Every residence offers a harmonious blend of sophistication, security, and long-term capital appreciation, presenting an extraordinary investment opportunity in one of the most coveted coastal addresses.<\\/p>\",\"html\":\"<p>At its core, Saima Center Point M.A. Jinnah Road is a central-city apartment project: instead of a suburban scheme, it places 2-bed, 3-bed, and 4-bed apartments on the road that runs through the middle of Karachi\'s oldest commercial district. That positioning is the whole story \\u2014 new residential supply in Saddar is rare because land here is built up and expensive, so a developer-backed project on this corridor serves a demand that mostly relies on old buildings and resale flats.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Among Saddar Karachi luxury projects and central Karachi apartments generally, Saima Center Point Saddar Karachi competes on address rather than sprawl: established markets, hospitals, schools, and transport are already around it, and rental demand in Saddar does not depend on a new neighbourhood developing. It is one of the few Saima Builders projects aimed squarely at the old-city buyer.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Key Project Highlights<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<table>\\r\\n<tbody><tr>\\r\\n<th>Feature<\\/th>\\r\\n<th>Details<\\/th>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Developer<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Saima Builders<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Property Type<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Residential<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Unit Types<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>2, 3 & 4-bed apartments<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Total Land Size<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>11-15 acres<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Handover<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>To be confirmed<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Location<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Main M.A. Jinnah Road, near Saddar, Karachi<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Payment Plan<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>On Easy Installments<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Lifestyle<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Central city living<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<\\/tbody><\\/table>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Master Plan and Development Framework<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Saima Center Point is planned as a high-rise residential development on a central-city plot, with a master plan that has to balance apartment floors, parking, and services on a constrained Saddar site rather than a large suburban layout.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The framework reflects that constraint: vertical planning, lift-served floors, and organised parking instead of open sprawl. The Saima Center Point floor plan keeps family living spaces practical within city-centre plot sizes, and buyers should review the plan for their specific unit type before booking.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Unit Types: 2, 3 & 4-Bedroom Apartments<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>For buyers searching for a 2 bed apartment M.A. Jinnah Road Karachi, 3 bed apartment M.A. Jinnah Road Karachi, or 4 bed apartment M.A. Jinnah Road Karachi, Saima Center Point Karachi offers central-city layouts in three categories.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>2-Bedroom Apartments in Saima Center Point<\\/h3>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The 2-bed apartments in Saima Center Point M.A. Jinnah Road suit small families and professionals who work in Saddar or the old city and want a central address at the project\'s most accessible price point.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>3-Bedroom Apartments in Saima Center Point<\\/h3>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The 3-bed apartments in Saima Center Point M.A. Jinnah Road suit growing families who need an extra bedroom while keeping a central location, and they are typically the most balanced option in the project\'s mix.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>4-Bedroom Apartments in Saima Center Point<\\/h3>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The 4-bed apartments in Saima Center Point M.A. Jinnah Road are the project\'s largest layouts, aimed at joint families and buyers who want maximum space in the centre of the city.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Floor Plan<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>A floor plan for each apartment type is available through the developer\'s authorised sales channel. Buyers seeking a Saima Center Point Saddar Karachi price or floor plan should request the unit schedule alongside the floor plan from the authorised sales channel, as secondary listings are often incomplete.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Price and Booking Status<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The Saima Center Point price varies depending on unit type, size, and floor, and is disclosed through the developer\'s authorised sales channel. The Saima Center Point M.A. Jinnah Road payment plan is structured to accommodate various buyer profiles, with flexible instalment options available on request.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>A Saima Center Point booking is processed through the developer\'s sales team, and the Saima Center Point booking amount should be confirmed in writing alongside the Saima Center Point payment plan. Buyers comparing the 2 bed apartment Saima Center Point price, 3 bed apartment price, and 4 bed apartment Saima Center Point price should request all three schedules together to compare total payable.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Saima Center Point Karachi buyers should also confirm whether units in this project are being offered through a priority allocation system or on a first-come, first-served basis.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>NOC and Approval Status<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Saima Center Point Saddar Karachi buyers should verify the project-specific approvals directly with the developer or the relevant authority before booking, as NOC status applies to the individual project.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Regulations shift and documentation gets updated, so a status reported earlier should be re-confirmed at the time of booking rather than assumed to still apply.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Possession Timeline<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>A formal possession date for Saima Center Point has not been announced as a single project-wide date. Buyers should secure a documented possession schedule at the point of Saima Center Point booking, and Saima Center Point M.A. Jinnah Road Karachi possession timelines should be confirmed in writing with the developer.<\\/p>\",\"appt_title\":\"BOOK AN APPOINTMENT\",\"body\":\"<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">A premier benchmark for luxury waterfront living, seamlessly blending contemporary architectural elegance with a tranquil coastal sanctuary. Residents enjoy fresh sea breezes, private beach access, and immediate connectivity to key metropolitan hubs.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Located along prestigious shoreline corridors, the community offers an inspired lifestyle for professionals, investors, and families seeking refined island elegance away from urban congestion.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Every residence offers a harmonious blend of sophistication, security, and long-term capital appreciation, presenting an extraordinary investment opportunity in one of the most coveted coastal addresses.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>About the Developers<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Crafted by premier developers renowned for shaping iconic waterfront communities across the region for decades. Buyers and international investors benefit from a celebrated track record of timely delivery, construction excellence, and sustainable urban design.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Working alongside leading international architectural consultants and market advisory firms, every aspect of the project is engineered to global standards of prestige and durability.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Approvals &amp; Clearances<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The project holds full regulatory clearance and title approvals from all relevant municipal and developmental authorities. Complying strictly with environmental and structural guidelines, purchasers can invest with absolute peace of mind and secure freehold ownership.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Prime Location &amp; Seamless Connectivity<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Set within a scenic coastal landscape, the project offers rapid access to international airports, commercial business districts, premier private schools, and luxury retail destinations.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC1.png\\\" alt=\\\"Strategic Location &amp; Connectivity Map\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); width: 100%; margin: 15px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Surrounded by protected green reserves and pristine waters, residents wake up to panoramic coastal vistas and unpolluted air throughout the year.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Architectural Excellence &amp; Floor Plans<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The layouts focus on space efficiency, panoramic natural lighting, and seamless indoor-outdoor living with spacious private terraces and balconies.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>Curated Residences &amp; Layout Types<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC2.png\\\" alt=\\\"Luxury Layout Plan - Type C\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Featuring open-plan living rooms, floor-to-ceiling double-glazed windows, designer show kitchens, and lavish en-suite master bedrooms designed for modern family living.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC3.png\\\" alt=\\\"Executive Layout Plan - Type B\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Expansive terraces provide seamless entertaining spaces overlooking lush landscaped courtyards and the sparkling coastline.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC4.png\\\" alt=\\\"Presidential Villa Layout Plan - Type A\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Generous multi-level accommodations including private elevators, maid\'s quarters, private swimming pools, and dedicated family lounges.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Master Plan &amp; Community Lifestyle<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The community master plan establishes a secure, private, and walkable residential haven. Dedicated subterranean parking ensures pedestrian safety across surface walkways, cycling trails, and waterfront boardwalks.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC8.png\\\" alt=\\\"Community Master Plan Overview\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Flexible Investment &amp; Payment Plan<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>A buyer-friendly, construction-linked payment structure is offered with flexible milestones, making property acquisition straightforward and stress-free.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC12.png\\\" alt=\\\"Milestone Payment Structure\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>World-Class Facilities &amp; Amenities<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Enjoy infinity swimming pools, state-of-the-art fitness centres, private beach cabanas, children\'s play areas, multi-sport courts, and fine-dining waterfront restaurants just steps from your front door.<\\/p>\"}', '2026-10-30 11:41:01', '2026-11-03 06:05:39'),
(763, 97, 'payment_plan', 'Payment Plan', 7, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Center Point Payment Plan\",\"description\":\"The payment plan for Saima Center Point Saddar Karachi is structured around booking and subsequent instalments, with the exact current schedule, amounts, and terms provided upon request through the developer\'s authorised sales channel. Schedules are subject to revision, so buyers should obtain the plan in writing for their specific unit.\",\"down_payment\":\"10%\",\"during_construction\":\"40%\",\"on_handover\":\"50%\",\"items\":[{\"milestone\":\"Down Payment\",\"percentage\":\"10%\",\"due\":\"On Booking Date\"},{\"milestone\":\"Construction Milestone 1\",\"percentage\":\"10%\",\"due\":\"6 Months after Booking\"},{\"milestone\":\"Construction Milestone 2\",\"percentage\":\"10%\",\"due\":\"12 Months after Booking\"},{\"milestone\":\"Construction Milestone 3\",\"percentage\":\"10%\",\"due\":\"18 Months after Booking\"},{\"milestone\":\"Construction Milestone 4\",\"percentage\":\"10%\",\"due\":\"24 Months after Booking\"},{\"milestone\":\"On Handover\",\"percentage\":\"50%\",\"due\":\"100% Completion\"}],\"plan_tabs\":null,\"download_text\":\"DOWNLOAD PAYMENT PLAN\",\"download_url\":\"#\"}', '2026-10-30 11:41:01', '2026-11-03 06:05:39'),
(764, 97, 'master_plan', 'Master Plan', 8, 1, '{\"title\":\"Master Plan\",\"description\":\"The master plan creates a harmonious, walkable enclave where residential clusters are woven naturally into open green parklands, pedestrian corridors, and scenic waterfront trails.\",\"image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793685916_6ae9799c17389.jpg\",\"badge\":\"Click to Enlarge\"}', '2026-10-30 11:41:01', '2026-11-03 06:05:39'),
(765, 97, 'location', 'Location & Connectivity', 9, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Center Point Location on M.A. Jinnah Road, Karachi\",\"description\":\"Conveniently located on Hudayriyat Island with direct access via modern bridges to Abu Dhabi\\u2019s key commercial, cultural, and travel hubs.\",\"items\":[{\"place\":\"Downtown Abu Dhabi\",\"time\":\"20 mins\"},{\"place\":\"Emirates Palace\",\"time\":\"23 mins\"},{\"place\":\"Sheikh Zayed Grand Mosque\",\"time\":\"23 mins\"},{\"place\":\"Abu Dhabi Global Financial Centre\",\"time\":\"30 mins\"},{\"place\":\"Louvre Abu Dhabi\",\"time\":\"33 mins\"},{\"place\":\"Zayed International Airport\",\"time\":\"34 mins\"}],\"subtitle\":\"The Saima Center Point Karachi location is on Main M.A. Jinnah Road, near Saddar and Numaish \\u2014 the centre of old Karachi. M.A. Jinnah Road apartments in this stretch sit between the commercial heart of Saddar and the residential colonies around it, including Parsi Colony, with Empress Market, the Quaid-e-Azam Mazar, and the city\'s main transport routes all close by. For buyers who work in the old city, very few addresses are more central.\",\"image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793685916_6ae9799c181ed.jpg\",\"categories\":[{\"name\":\"Nearby Landmarks And Attractions:\",\"items\":[{\"name\":\"Numaish Chowrangi\",\"time\":\"3\\u20135 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"Quaid-e-Azam Mazar (Mazar-e-Quaid)\",\"time\":\"5\\u20138 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"Saddar\",\"time\":\"3\\u20137 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"Parsi Colony\",\"time\":\"1\\u20133 minutes\"}]}]}', '2026-10-30 11:41:01', '2026-11-03 06:05:39'),
(766, 97, 'faq', 'FAQ Accordion', 10, 1, '{\"title\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\",\"description\":\"Key information and helpful answers regarding property purchases on Hudayriyat Island.\",\"items\":[{\"q\":\"Where is Saima Center Point Karachi located?\",\"a\":\"Saima Center Point is located on Main M.A. Jinnah Road, Karachi, near Saddar and Numaish Chowrangi. The Saima Center Point Saddar Karachi location places it on the city\'s central corridor, with Parsi Colony, Empress Market, and Quaid-e-Azam Mazar in the surrounding area.\"},{\"q\":\"What is Saima Center Point price?\",\"a\":\"A confirmed public Saima Center Point price list has not been released; pricing varies by unit type, size, and floor and is available through the developer\'s authorised sales channel for Saima Center Point Karachi.\"},{\"q\":\"How many bedrooms in Saima Center Point?\",\"a\":\"Saima Center Point M.A. Jinnah Road offers 2-bed, 3-bed, and 4-bed apartments, so buyers can choose a layout that matches their household size within Saima Center Point Saddar Karachi.\"},{\"q\":\"What is Saima Center Point payment plan?\",\"a\":\"The Saima Center Point payment plan and Saima Center Point booking amount are disclosed through sales engagement rather than a public schedule.\"},{\"q\":\"Is Saima Center Point NOC approved?\",\"a\":\"Buyers should verify the project-specific NOC and approval status for Saima Center Point Karachi directly with the developer or the relevant authority before purchase.\"},{\"q\":\"Is Saima Center Point the same as Saima Center Point 2?\",\"a\":\"No. Saima Center Point is the established project name with an official project listing, while \'Saima Center Point 2\' has been reported as a separate upcoming name whose exact location and details are not officially confirmed. Buyers should confirm which project a listing refers to before paying anything.\"},{\"q\":\"Who is developing Saima Center Point?\",\"a\":\"Saima Center Point is developed by Saima Group, which has built residential communities across Karachi over several decades.\"},{\"q\":\"Can overseas buyers book in Saima Center Point?\",\"a\":\"Overseas buyers can engage through authorised channels, but remittance and documentation procedures should be confirmed directly with the Saima Center Point sales team.\"},{\"q\":\"Why consider Saima Center Point Karachi?\",\"a\":\"Because very few new apartment projects come up on M.A. Jinnah Road in Saddar, and a central address here serves both end-users who work in the old city and investors relying on Saddar\'s permanent rental demand. Saima Center Point Karachi also provides a clear central-city identity among central Karachi apartments.\"}],\"heading\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\"}', '2026-10-30 11:41:01', '2026-11-03 06:05:39'),
(767, 97, 'contact', 'Contact & Booking CTA', 11, 1, '{\"title\":\"Register Your Interest\",\"subtitle\":\"Discover central Karachi apartments at Saima Center Point Karachi. Contact our advisory team for personalized guidance on Saima Center Point, updated pricing, and private viewings. Whether you are exploring apartments for sale Saddar Karachi or planning to buy apartment on M.A. Jinnah Road Karachi, our consultants can navigate the Saima Center Point booking process.\",\"button_text\":\"REGISTER INTEREST\",\"phone\":\"+971 2 000 0000\",\"email\":\"info@hudayriyat-island.com\",\"pretitle\":\"LET\'S CONNECT\",\"heading\":\"Invest in Your Future\",\"form_small\":\"REQUEST\",\"form_large\":\"A CALL BACK\",\"submit_button\":\"REQUEST NOW\",\"bg_image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793685916_6ae9799c197e8.jpg\"}', '2026-10-30 11:41:01', '2026-11-03 06:05:39'),
(768, 98, 'hero', 'Hero Banner', 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Main Shahra-e-Faisal\",\"subtitle\":\"Explore Premier Properties & Real Estate Investment in Main Shahra-e-Faisal, Karachi\",\"badge\":\"Prime Real Estate Destination\",\"bg_image\":\"\\/images\\/hero\\/slide-1.jpg\"}', '2026-10-30 12:05:43', '2026-10-30 12:05:43');
