(776, 99, 'about', 'About Community', 3, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Greens by Saima Builders\",\"description\":\"<p>Saima Greens is a residential apartment project in Tariq Bin Ziyad Society, Karachi, on Main Shahrah-e-Faisal near Jinnah International Airport, offering 4-room, 5-room, and 6-room apartments by Saima Builders, featuring landscaped parks and open green spaces across more than 40% of the project area.<\\/p>\",\"video_poster\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793685532_6ae9781c64f83.jpg\",\"video_src\":\"\\/images\\/nawayef-park-views\\/asset_15.mp4\",\"video_url\":\"\\/images\\/nawayef-park-views\\/asset_15.mp4\"}', '2026-10-30 12:12:45', '2026-11-03 11:43:41'),
(777, 99, 'amenities', 'Amenities & Facilities', 4, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Greens Amenities\",\"subtitle\":\"Saima Greens Karachi provides facilities that support comfortable, green family living, including landscaped parks and open green spaces across a large share of the site, a community centre, children\'s play areas, a prayer area, standby generators, and gated security arrangements within the Saima Greens Saima Builders development.\",\"items\":[]}', '2026-10-30 12:12:45', '2026-11-10 10:12:32'),
(778, 99, 'gallery', 'Project Gallery', 5, 1, '{\"title\":\"Project Gallery\",\"images\":[{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793685532_6ae9781c66708.jpg\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"},{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793685532_6ae9781c6695e.jpg\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"},{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793685532_6ae9781c66bcd.jpg\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"},{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793685532_6ae9781c66e94.jpg\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"}]}', '2026-10-30 12:12:45', '2026-11-03 11:43:41'),
(779, 99, 'content', 'Content', 6, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Greens at Tariq Bin Ziyad Society Karachi Living & Waterfront Sanctuary\",\"intro\":\"<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Saima Greens at Tariq Bin Ziyad Society Karachi is a premier benchmark for luxury waterfront living, seamlessly blending contemporary architectural elegance with a tranquil coastal sanctuary. Residents enjoy fresh sea breezes, private beach access, and immediate connectivity to key metropolitan hubs.<\\/p><p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:1rem\\\">Located along prestigious shoreline corridors, the community offers an inspired lifestyle for professionals, investors, and families seeking refined island elegance away from urban congestion.<\\/p><p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:1rem\\\">Every residence offers a harmonious blend of sophistication, security, and long-term capital appreciation, presenting an extraordinary investment opportunity in one of the most coveted coastal addresses.<\\/p>\",\"html\":\"<p>At its core, Saima Greens is a family apartment project built around greenery: more than 40% of the total project area is dedicated to landscaped parks and open green spaces, which is unusual for a site on one of Karachi\'s busiest roads. The apartments themselves are large, with 4-room, 5-room, and 6-room layouts ranging from about 1,200 to 2,300 square feet, designed for families who need more living space and greater comfort.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>This corridor of Shahrah-e-Faisal has become one of Karachi\'s fastest-growing residential and investment destinations, and Saima Greens Saima Builders is regularly shortlisted among green \\/ gated apartments Karachi buyers compare on the airport side of the city. For family apartments Karachi searches, its combination of a main-road address and internal green space is the main draw.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Key Project Highlights<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<table>\\r\\n<tbody><tr>\\r\\n<th>Feature<\\/th>\\r\\n<th>Details<\\/th>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Developer<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Saima Builders<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Property Type<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Residential<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Unit Types<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>4, 5 & 6-room apartments<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Total Land Size<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>15 acres<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Handover<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>To be confirmed<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Location<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Main Shahrah-e-Faisal, near Jinnah International Airport, Karachi<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Payment Plan<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>On Easy Installments<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Lifestyle<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Green living<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<\\/tbody><\\/table>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Master Plan and Development Framework<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Saima Greens Saima Builders is planned as a green residential community rather than a solid built-up block, with a master plan that reserves a large share of the site for landscaped parks and open spaces between the apartment buildings.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The framework reflects that green-first approach: towers arranged around open areas, community facilities placed within the scheme, and apartment layouts planned for light and ventilation. The Saima Greens floor plan keeps family living spaces generous, consistent with the project\'s larger-than-typical unit sizes.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Unit Types: 4, 5 & 6-Room Apartments<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>For buyers searching for apartments for sale Saima Greens Karachi or flats for sale Saima Greens Karachi, Saima Greens apartments Karachi offers large family layouts in three categories.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>4-Room Apartments in Saima Greens<\\/h3>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The 4-room apartments in Saima Greens apartments Karachi are the project\'s entry category, offering a spacious layout for smaller families who still want the project\'s green setting and main-road location.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>5-Room Apartments in Saima Greens<\\/h3>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The 5-room apartments in Saima Greens apartments Karachi suit larger families who need an additional bedroom or a flexible room, with sizes at the larger end of the project\'s range.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>6-Room Apartments in Saima Greens<\\/h3>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The 6-room apartments in Saima Greens apartments Karachi are the project\'s largest residences, aimed at joint families who want maximum space within a gated, green community on Shahrah-e-Faisal.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Floor Plan<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>A floor plan for each apartment type in Saima Greens Saima Builders is available through the developer\'s authorised sales channel. Buyers seeking a Saima Greens apartment price or a Saima Greens floor plan should request the unit schedule alongside the floor plan from the authorised sales channel, as secondary listings are often incomplete.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Price and Booking Status<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The Saima Greens price varies depending on unit type, size, and floor, and is disclosed through the developer\'s authorised sales channel. The Saima Greens payment plan is structured to accommodate various buyer profiles, with flexible instalment options available on request.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>A Saima Greens booking is processed through the developer\'s sales team, and the Saima Greens booking amount should be confirmed in writing alongside the Saima Greens apartments Karachi payment plan. The practical route to buy flat in Saima Greens Karachi is to register interest directly with Saima Builders or its designated sales partners and obtain the current Saima Greens apartment price before booking.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Saima Greens Karachi buyers should also confirm whether Saima Greens apartments on installments are being offered through a priority allocation system or on a first-come, first-served basis.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>NOC and Approval Status<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Saima Greens Saima Builders buyers should verify the project-specific approvals directly with the developer or the relevant authority before booking. Third-party pages claim approval for this project, but the current documents should be inspected rather than assumed.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Regulations shift and documentation gets updated, so a status reported earlier should be re-confirmed at the time of booking.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Possession Timeline<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>A formal possession date for Saima Greens apartments Karachi has not been announced as a single project-wide date, and the project is under construction, so handover is expected to be phased. Buyers should secure a documented possession schedule at the point of Saima Greens booking, and Saima Greens Saima Builders possession timelines should be confirmed in writing with the developer.<\\/p>\",\"appt_title\":\"BOOK AN APPOINTMENT\",\"body\":\"<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">A premier benchmark for luxury waterfront living, seamlessly blending contemporary architectural elegance with a tranquil coastal sanctuary. Residents enjoy fresh sea breezes, private beach access, and immediate connectivity to key metropolitan hubs.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Located along prestigious shoreline corridors, the community offers an inspired lifestyle for professionals, investors, and families seeking refined island elegance away from urban congestion.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Every residence offers a harmonious blend of sophistication, security, and long-term capital appreciation, presenting an extraordinary investment opportunity in one of the most coveted coastal addresses.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>About the Developers<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Crafted by premier developers renowned for shaping iconic waterfront communities across the region for decades. Buyers and international investors benefit from a celebrated track record of timely delivery, construction excellence, and sustainable urban design.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Working alongside leading international architectural consultants and market advisory firms, every aspect of the project is engineered to global standards of prestige and durability.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Approvals &amp; Clearances<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The project holds full regulatory clearance and title approvals from all relevant municipal and developmental authorities. Complying strictly with environmental and structural guidelines, purchasers can invest with absolute peace of mind and secure freehold ownership.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Prime Location &amp; Seamless Connectivity<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Set within a scenic coastal landscape, the project offers rapid access to international airports, commercial business districts, premier private schools, and luxury retail destinations.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC1.png\\\" alt=\\\"Strategic Location &amp; Connectivity Map\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); width: 100%; margin: 15px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Surrounded by protected green reserves and pristine waters, residents wake up to panoramic coastal vistas and unpolluted air throughout the year.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Architectural Excellence &amp; Floor Plans<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The layouts focus on space efficiency, panoramic natural lighting, and seamless indoor-outdoor living with spacious private terraces and balconies.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>Curated Residences &amp; Layout Types<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC2.png\\\" alt=\\\"Luxury Layout Plan - Type C\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Featuring open-plan living rooms, floor-to-ceiling double-glazed windows, designer show kitchens, and lavish en-suite master bedrooms designed for modern family living.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC3.png\\\" alt=\\\"Executive Layout Plan - Type B\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Expansive terraces provide seamless entertaining spaces overlooking lush landscaped courtyards and the sparkling coastline.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC4.png\\\" alt=\\\"Presidential Villa Layout Plan - Type A\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Generous multi-level accommodations including private elevators, maid\'s quarters, private swimming pools, and dedicated family lounges.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Master Plan &amp; Community Lifestyle<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The community master plan establishes a secure, private, and walkable residential haven. Dedicated subterranean parking ensures pedestrian safety across surface walkways, cycling trails, and waterfront boardwalks.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC8.png\\\" alt=\\\"Community Master Plan Overview\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Flexible Investment &amp; Payment Plan<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>A buyer-friendly, construction-linked payment structure is offered with flexible milestones, making property acquisition straightforward and stress-free.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC12.png\\\" alt=\\\"Milestone Payment Structure\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>World-Class Facilities &amp; Amenities<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Enjoy infinity swimming pools, state-of-the-art fitness centres, private beach cabanas, children\'s play areas, multi-sport courts, and fine-dining waterfront restaurants just steps from your front door.<\\/p>\"}', '2026-10-30 12:12:45', '2026-11-03 11:43:41'),
(780, 99, 'payment_plan', 'Payment Plan', 7, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Greens Payment Plan\",\"description\":\"The payment plan for Saima Greens is structured around booking and subsequent instalments, with the exact current schedule, amounts, and terms provided upon request through the developer\'s authorised sales channel. Schedules are subject to revision, so buyers should obtain the plan in writing for their specific unit.\",\"down_payment\":\"10%\",\"during_construction\":\"40%\",\"on_handover\":\"50%\",\"items\":[{\"milestone\":\"Down Payment\",\"percentage\":\"10%\",\"due\":\"On Booking Date\"},{\"milestone\":\"Construction Milestone 1\",\"percentage\":\"10%\",\"due\":\"6 Months after Booking\"},{\"milestone\":\"Construction Milestone 2\",\"percentage\":\"10%\",\"due\":\"12 Months after Booking\"},{\"milestone\":\"Construction Milestone 3\",\"percentage\":\"10%\",\"due\":\"18 Months after Booking\"},{\"milestone\":\"Construction Milestone 4\",\"percentage\":\"10%\",\"due\":\"24 Months after Booking\"},{\"milestone\":\"On Handover\",\"percentage\":\"50%\",\"due\":\"100% Completion\"}],\"plan_tabs\":null,\"download_text\":\"DOWNLOAD PAYMENT PLAN\",\"download_url\":\"#\"}', '2026-10-30 12:12:45', '2026-11-03 11:43:41'),
(781, 99, 'master_plan', 'Master Plan', 8, 1, '{\"title\":\"Master Plan\",\"description\":\"The master plan creates a harmonious, walkable enclave where residential clusters are woven naturally into open green parklands, pedestrian corridors, and scenic waterfront trails.\",\"image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793685532_6ae9781c6a4ec.jpg\",\"badge\":\"Click to Enlarge\"}', '2026-10-30 12:12:45', '2026-11-03 11:43:41'),
(782, 99, 'location', 'Location & Connectivity', 9, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Greens Location in Tariq Bin Ziyad Society, Karachi\",\"description\":\"Conveniently located on Hudayriyat Island with direct access via modern bridges to Abu Dhabi\\u2019s key commercial, cultural, and travel hubs.\",\"items\":[{\"place\":\"Downtown Abu Dhabi\",\"time\":\"20 mins\"},{\"place\":\"Emirates Palace\",\"time\":\"23 mins\"},{\"place\":\"Sheikh Zayed Grand Mosque\",\"time\":\"23 mins\"},{\"place\":\"Abu Dhabi Global Financial Centre\",\"time\":\"30 mins\"},{\"place\":\"Louvre Abu Dhabi\",\"time\":\"33 mins\"},{\"place\":\"Zayed International Airport\",\"time\":\"34 mins\"}],\"subtitle\":\"The Saima Greens Karachi location is in Tariq Bin Ziyad Society, on Main Shahrah-e-Faisal, minutes from Jinnah International Airport and Faisal Cantonment. Tariq Bin Ziyad Society Karachi sits on the airport side of the city, so the project serves families and professionals connected to the airport, the cantonment, and the Shahrah-e-Faisal commercial corridor, with Millennium Mall and University Road also within reach.\",\"image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793685532_6ae9781c6b156.jpg\",\"categories\":[{\"name\":\"Nearby Landmarks And Attractions\",\"items\":[{\"name\":\"Jinnah International Airport\",\"time\":\"5\\u201310 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"Faisal Cantonment\",\"time\":\"3\\u20137 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"Shahrah-e-Faisal\",\"time\":\"2\\u20135 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"Millennium Mall\",\"time\":\"15\\u201325 minutes\"}]}]}', '2026-10-30 12:12:45', '2026-11-03 11:43:41'),
(783, 99, 'faq', 'FAQ Accordion', 10, 1, '{\"title\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\",\"description\":\"Key information and helpful answers regarding property purchases on Hudayriyat Island.\",\"items\":[{\"q\":\"Where is Saima Greens Karachi located?\",\"a\":\"Saima Greens is located in Tariq Bin Ziyad Society, Karachi, on Main Shahrah-e-Faisal, just minutes from Jinnah International Airport and Faisal Cantonment. The Saima Greens Karachi location sits on one of the city\'s main corridors, with Millennium Mall and Habib University within reach.\"},{\"q\":\"What is Saima Greens price?\",\"a\":\"A confirmed public Saima Greens price list has not been released; pricing varies by unit type, size, and floor and is available through the developer\'s authorised sales channel for Saima Greens Karachi.\"},{\"q\":\"How many bedrooms in Saima Greens?\",\"a\":\"Saima Greens apartments Karachi offers apartments in 4-room, 5-room, and 6-room layouts, ranging from roughly 1,200 to 2,300 square feet, so buyers can choose a layout that matches their household size within Saima Greens Karachi.\"},{\"q\":\"What is Saima Greens payment plan?\",\"a\":\"The Saima Greens payment plan and Saima Greens booking amount are disclosed through sales engagement rather than a public schedule.\"},{\"q\":\"Is Saima Greens NOC approved?\",\"a\":\"Buyers should verify the project-specific NOC and approval status for Saima Greens Karachi directly with the developer or the relevant authority before purchase, rather than relying on third-party claims of approval.\"},{\"q\":\"Is Saima Greens the same as Saima Greens Residencia?\",\"a\":\"Saima Greens is also marketed in some listings as \\u2018Saima Greens Residencia\\u2019; buyers should confirm that any listing refers to the same Airport Road project before paying.\"},{\"q\":\"Who is developing Saima Greens?\",\"a\":\"Saima Greens Saima Builders is developed by Saima Group, which has built residential communities across Karachi over several decades.\"},{\"q\":\"Can overseas buyers book in Saima Greens?\",\"a\":\"Overseas buyers can engage through authorised channels, but remittance and documentation procedures should be confirmed directly with the Saima Greens sales team.\"},{\"q\":\"Why consider Saima Greens Karachi?\",\"a\":\"Because it combines a Shahrah-e-Faisal address near the airport with unusually large green space for a main-road project, and family-sized layouts that are bigger than typical new apartments. Saima Greens Karachi also suits airport and cantonment professionals who want a short commute.\"}],\"heading\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\"}', '2026-10-30 12:12:45', '2026-11-03 11:43:41'),
(784, 99, 'contact', 'Contact & Booking CTA', 11, 1, '{\"title\":\"Register Your Interest\",\"subtitle\":\"Discover green family apartments at Saima Greens Karachi. Contact our advisory team for personalized guidance on Saima Greens, updated pricing, and private viewings. Whether you are exploring apartments for sale Saima Greens Karachi or seeking to buy flat in Saima Greens Karachi, our consultants can navigate the Saima Greens booking process.\",\"button_text\":\"REGISTER INTEREST\",\"phone\":\"+971 2 000 0000\",\"email\":\"info@hudayriyat-island.com\",\"pretitle\":\"LET\'S CONNECT\",\"heading\":\"Invest in Your Future\",\"form_small\":\"REQUEST\",\"form_large\":\"A CALL BACK\",\"submit_button\":\"REQUEST NOW\",\"bg_image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793685532_6ae9781c6c38e.jpg\"}', '2026-10-30 12:12:45', '2026-11-03 11:43:41'),
(785, 100, 'hero', 'Hero Banner & Form', 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Twin Tower Islamabad Pakistan\",\"subtitle\":\"Saima Twin Tower Islamabad Pakistan\",\"badge\":null,\"bg_image\":\"\\/images\\/projects\\/1793689907_hero_modern-high-rise-towers-by-the-waterfront.png\",\"bg_image_alt\":\"Saima Twin Tower Islamabad Pakistan\",\"image_alt\":\"Saima Twin Tower Islamabad Pakistan\"}', '2026-11-03 07:11:47', '2026-11-03 07:23:51'),
(786, 100, 'highlights', 'Project Highlights', 2, 1, '{\"items\":[]}', '2026-11-03 07:11:47', '2026-11-03 07:23:51'),
(787, 100, 'about', 'About Community', 3, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Twin Tower by Saima Builders\",\"description\":\"Saima Twin Tower Islamabad Pakistan is an under-construction twin-tower project listed under Saima Group in Capital Enclave, Islamabad. It will reportedly have studio, one-, two- and three-bedroom lounge apartments split across two towers, tagged as affordable luxury, off-plan residential. It is marketed among luxury apartments in Islamabad and residential apartments in Islamabad for professionals, families and investors.\",\"video_poster\":\"\\/images\\/projects\\/1793689907_poster_84ea3729-cb84-4c78-833b-f21bbc0226d5.png\",\"video_src\":\"\"}', '2026-11-03 07:11:47', '2026-11-03 07:23:51'),
(788, 100, 'amenities', 'Amenities & Facilities', 4, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Twin Tower Amenities\",\"subtitle\":\"Saima Twin Tower Islamabad Pakistan lists everyday facilities for family and high-rise living. Listed amenities include 24\\/7 CCTV security, car parking, elevators, fire fighting systems, a garbage chute, a prayer area and a play area, with electricity, sweet water and maintenance as utilities. The listing also mentions wide internal corridors, dedicated electrical rooms and multiple high-speed passenger elevators.\",\"items\":[]}', '2026-11-03 07:11:47', '2026-11-03 07:23:51'),
(789, 100, 'gallery', 'Project Gallery', 5, 1, '{\"title\":null,\"images\":[{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793690268_6ae98a9c354b3.jpeg\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"},{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793690268_6ae98a9c359f9.jpeg\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"},{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793690268_6ae98a9c35e28.jpeg\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"}]}', '2026-11-03 07:11:47', '2026-11-03 07:23:51'),
(790, 100, 'content', 'Content', 6, 1, '{\"title\":\"\",\"intro\":\"\",\"html\":\"<p>The project is a twin-tower residential high-rise on the CDA Service Road in Capital Enclave. Among high-rise apartments in Islamabad, a twin-tower layout gives buyers a choice of studios for compact living and lounge apartments for families. For anyone reviewing Islamabad real estate projects or luxury residential projects in Islamabad, the appeal here is an expressway-corridor address and an instalment-based route to ownership, not a finished building.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The listing shows Under Construction and carries a verified badge. As a Saima Builders Islamabad project, it should be judged on its own paperwork, not on the developer\\u2019s Karachi record.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Investors weighing Saima Twin Tower Islamabad investment opportunities usually look at studios and one-bedroom apartments, but rental income and resale gains are never guaranteed. Anyone comparing apartments for investment in Islamabad should also look at finished stock, which carries less construction risk.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Key Project Highlights<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<table>\\r\\n<tbody><tr>\\r\\n<th>Feature<\\/th>\\r\\n<th>Details<\\/th>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Developer<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Saima Group (Saima Builders)<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Property Type<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Apartments<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Unit Types<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Studio, 1, 2 and 3-bed lounge apartments<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Towers<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Two<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Location<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Capital Enclave, CDA Service Road, Islamabad<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Status<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Under construction<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Handover<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Not announced<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Payment Plan<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Construction-linked; amounts to be confirmed<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<\\/tbody><\\/table>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Master Plan and Development Framework<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>No public master plan has been released for Saima Twin Tower Islamabad Pakistan. The listing splits the homes across two wings:<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Tower A offers studios and one- and two-bedroom lounge apartments (types B1 to B4 and C1 to C3).<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Tower B offers studios, one- and two-bedroom lounge apartments, and three-bedroom lounge apartments (Type A1).<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Because the towers are described as a pair, ask whether they share podium parking, lifts, security and maintenance charges. Listings mention gated security and ongoing professional management. Who will run the building, and how service charges will be set, should be agreed in writing before you pay.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Unit Types: Studio, 1, 2 and 3 Bed Lounge Apartments<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>For buyers searching for apartments in Saima Twin Tower Islamabad, the portal\\u2019s unit selector shows studio types S1 and S2, one-bedroom lounge types C1 to C4, two-bedroom lounge types B1 to B6 and a three-bedroom lounge Type A1. Unit areas are not public, so request them in writing.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>Studio Apartments<\\/h3>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Studios are the compact entry option and appear in both towers. Check the usable area, kitchen layout and balcony before comparing the price per square foot.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>1 Bed Lounge Apartments<\\/h3>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>One-bedroom lounge types suit couples, single professionals and small investors. Ask whether the lounge is separate or combined with the dining space.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>2 Bed Lounge Apartments<\\/h3>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Two-bedroom lounge types come in the most variants, so compare layouts side by side. They suit small families and shared living.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>3 Bed Lounge Apartments<\\/h3>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The three-bedroom lounge apartment is listed as Type A1 in Tower B. It is the family-size option, so confirm how many units exist and their covered area.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Floor Plan<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Unit-wise floor plans and unit pricing are not confirmed yet. Request the full set from Saima\\u2019s authorised sales channel, along with a unit-wise Saima Twin Tower price list and the approved building plan. Compare orientation, balcony size and lift access before choosing a floor.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Price and Booking Status<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The Saima Twin Tower price starts from around PKR 7.85 million to PKR 8.95 million, so treat both figures as indicative. Buyers who need Saima Twin Tower Islamabad apartment prices by unit type should ask for a written price list.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>A Saima Twin Tower booking typically involves registering interest, choosing a unit, confirming the booking amount and signing written terms. Saima Twin Tower Islamabad booking details, including receipts, unit number, allocation terms and refund conditions, should be confirmed before any payment. Buyers comparing apartments for sale in Islamabad should also ask whether the Saima Twin Tower payment plan differs by tower and unit type.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>NOC and Approval Status<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The NOC and approval status of Saima Twin Tower Islamabad Pakistan is not publicly documented by Saima. Ask for the approved building plan, the NOC with its reference number and the title documents, then confirm them directly with CDA.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Possession Timeline<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>No possession date has been announced for the project, and the listing shows Under Construction without a completion date. Secure a documented possession schedule, including delay terms, at the point of booking. Plan for a medium- to long-term investment horizon, not immediate occupancy.<\\/p>\",\"body\":\"\"}', '2026-11-03 07:11:47', '2026-11-03 07:23:51'),
(791, 100, 'payment_plan', 'Payment Plan', 7, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Twin Tower Payment Plan\",\"description\":\"<p>The Saima Twin Tower Islamabad payment plan is described as an allocation payment, a confirmation payment and construction-linked installments, with the possession payment due at transfer. Amounts vary by unit type, and the portal asks buyers to register to view payment schedules.<\\/p>\",\"down_payment\":\"\",\"during_construction\":\"\",\"on_handover\":\"\",\"items\":[],\"rows\":[]}', '2026-11-03 07:11:47', '2026-11-03 07:23:51'),
(792, 100, 'master_plan', 'Master Plan', 8, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Twin Tower Master Plan\",\"description\":\"\",\"image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793690572_6ae98bcc0d49c.jpeg\",\"badge\":\"Click to Enlarge\"}', '2026-11-03 07:11:47', '2026-11-03 07:23:51'),
(793, 100, 'location', 'Location & Connectivity', 9, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Twin Tower Islamabad Pakistan Location\",\"description\":\"\",\"items\":[],\"subtitle\":\"The listed address is Plot No 3, CDA Service Road, Capital Enclave, Madina Town, Islamabad. Capital Enclave sits in Zone V under CDA jurisdiction, near PWD Housing Society, Bahria Town and Soan Garden. That makes it a practical base for residential apartments in Islamabad within reach of the Expressway corridor, and for Islamabad residential apartments aimed at commuters.\\r\\nBuyers comparing luxury apartments in Islamabad should test the commute at peak hours. CDA has begun building a six-lane parallel road along the Islamabad Expressway to ease congestion. Confirm how those works will affect this site\\u2019s own service road.\",\"image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793690572_6ae98bcc0e3c5.jpeg\",\"categories\":[{\"name\":\"Nearby Landmarks And Attractions\",\"items\":[{\"name\":\"Islamabad Expressway\",\"time\":\"2\\u20135 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"PWD Housing Society\",\"time\":\"10\\u201315 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"Bahria Town (Phase 7\\/8)\",\"time\":\"15\\u201325 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"Soan Garden\",\"time\":\"7\\u201312 minutes\"}]}]}', '2026-11-03 07:11:47', '2026-11-03 07:23:51'),
(794, 100, 'faq', 'FAQ Accordion', 10, 1, '{\"title\":\"\",\"description\":\"\",\"items\":[{\"q\":\"Where is Saima Twin Tower Islamabad located?\",\"a\":\"The listed address is Plot No 3, CDA Service Road, Capital Enclave, Madina Town, Islamabad. Capital Enclave sits in Zone V near the Islamabad Expressway, so confirm the exact entrance on site.\"},{\"q\":\"What is the price of Saima Twin Tower Islamabad?\",\"a\":\"Listings quote prices from PKR 7.85 million to PKR 8.95 million. Ask for a unit-wise price list in writing.\"},{\"q\":\"Who is the developer of Saima Twin Tower Islamabad?\",\"a\":\"Saima Twin Tower by Saima Builders is listed under Saima Group. Saima\\u2019s official lists do not yet show an Islamabad project, so confirm directly.\"},{\"q\":\"What is the payment plan for Saima Twin Tower Islamabad?\",\"a\":\"It is described as allocation, confirmation and construction-linked instalments, with possession payment at transfer. Amounts are not public, so request the schedule for your unit.\"},{\"q\":\"How can I book an apartment in Saima Twin Tower Islamabad?\",\"a\":\"Register interest, pick a unit and confirm the amount and terms before paying. A Saima Twin Tower booking should come with a written receipt and unit number.\"},{\"q\":\"Is Saima Twin Tower Islamabad NOC approved?\",\"a\":\"Saima has not publicly disclosed the NOC or approval status of Saima Twin Tower, Islamabad. Request the approved building plan, NOC with its reference number, and title documents, then independently verify them with CDA.\"},{\"q\":\"What apartment types are available?\",\"a\":\"Apartments in Saima Twin Tower Islamabad are listed as studios, one-bedroom lounge, two-bedroom lounge and three-bedroom lounge units across two towers. Sizes are not published.\"},{\"q\":\"Is it the same as Saima Twin Tower in Karachi?\",\"a\":\"No. Saima\\u2019s official site lists a completed Saima Twin Tower in Karachi\\u2019s Mohammad Ali Society, which is a separate project.\"},{\"q\":\"How many floors does it have?\",\"a\":\"Listings disagree, with one saying ground plus 16 floors and another 20 storeys. The approved building plan will confirm it.\"},{\"q\":\"When is the possession of this project ?\",\"a\":\"No date has been announced. Get a written possession schedule and delay terms at booking.\"}],\"heading\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\"}', '2026-11-03 07:11:47', '2026-11-03 07:23:51'),
(795, 100, 'contact', 'Contact & Booking CTA', 11, 1, '{\"title\":\"\",\"subtitle\":\"Discover high-rise living at Saima Twin Tower Islamabad Pakistan. Contact our advisory team for guidance on floor plans, updated pricing and approval documents. Whether you are exploring apartments for sale in Islamabad or want to buy apartment in Saima Twin Tower Islamabad, we can help you verify the project and its paperwork first.\",\"button_text\":\"\",\"phone\":\"\",\"email\":\"\",\"pretitle\":\"LET\'S CONNECT\",\"heading\":\"Invest in Your Future\",\"form_small\":\"REQUEST\",\"form_large\":\"A CALL BACK\",\"submit_button\":\"REQUEST NOW\",\"bg_image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793690572_6ae98bcc10032.jpeg\"}', '2026-11-03 07:11:47', '2026-11-03 07:23:51'),
(796, 101, 'hero', 'Hero Banner', 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"North Nazimabad\",\"subtitle\":\"Explore Premier Properties & Real Estate Investment in North Nazimabad, Karachi\",\"badge\":\"Prime Real Estate Destination\",\"bg_image\":\"\\/images\\/hero\\/slide-1.jpg\"}', '2026-11-03 07:26:08', '2026-11-03 07:26:08');
INSERT INTO `page_sections` (`id`, `page_id`, `section_key`, `section_name`, `order`, `is_active`, `content`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(797, 101, 'content', 'Table of Contents & Article', 2, 1, '{\"title\":\"\",\"intro\":\"\",\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">A premier benchmark for luxury waterfront living, seamlessly blending contemporary architectural elegance with a tranquil coastal sanctuary. Residents enjoy fresh sea breezes, private beach access, and immediate connectivity to key metropolitan hubs.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Located along prestigious shoreline corridors, the community offers an inspired lifestyle for professionals, investors, and families seeking refined island elegance away from urban congestion.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Every residence offers a harmonious blend of sophistication, security, and long-term capital appreciation, presenting an extraordinary investment opportunity in one of the most coveted coastal addresses.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>About the Developers<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Crafted by premier developers renowned for shaping iconic waterfront communities across the region for decades. Buyers and international investors benefit from a celebrated track record of timely delivery, construction excellence, and sustainable urban design.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Working alongside leading international architectural consultants and market advisory firms, every aspect of the project is engineered to global standards of prestige and durability.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Approvals &amp; Clearances<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The project holds full regulatory clearance and title approvals from all relevant municipal and developmental authorities. Complying strictly with environmental and structural guidelines, purchasers can invest with absolute peace of mind and secure freehold ownership.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Prime Location &amp; Seamless Connectivity<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Set within a scenic coastal landscape, the project offers rapid access to international airports, commercial business districts, premier private schools, and luxury retail destinations.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC1.png\\\" alt=\\\"Strategic Location &amp; Connectivity Map\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); width: 100%; margin: 15px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Surrounded by protected green reserves and pristine waters, residents wake up to panoramic coastal vistas and unpolluted air throughout the year.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Architectural Excellence &amp; Floor Plans<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The layouts focus on space efficiency, panoramic natural lighting, and seamless indoor-outdoor living with spacious private terraces and balconies.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>Curated Residences &amp; Layout Types<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC2.png\\\" alt=\\\"Luxury Layout Plan - Type C\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Featuring open-plan living rooms, floor-to-ceiling double-glazed windows, designer show kitchens, and lavish en-suite master bedrooms designed for modern family living.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC3.png\\\" alt=\\\"Executive Layout Plan - Type B\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Expansive terraces provide seamless entertaining spaces overlooking lush landscaped courtyards and the sparkling coastline.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC4.png\\\" alt=\\\"Presidential Villa Layout Plan - Type A\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Generous multi-level accommodations including private elevators, maid\'s quarters, private swimming pools, and dedicated family lounges.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Master Plan &amp; Community Lifestyle<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The community master plan establishes a secure, private, and walkable residential haven. Dedicated subterranean parking ensures pedestrian safety across surface walkways, cycling trails, and waterfront boardwalks.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC8.png\\\" alt=\\\"Community Master Plan Overview\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Flexible Investment &amp; Payment Plan<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>A buyer-friendly, construction-linked payment structure is offered with flexible milestones, making property acquisition straightforward and stress-free.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC12.png\\\" alt=\\\"Milestone Payment Structure\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>World-Class Facilities &amp; Amenities<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Enjoy infinity swimming pools, state-of-the-art fitness centres, private beach cabanas, children\'s play areas, multi-sport courts, and fine-dining waterfront restaurants just steps from your front door.<\\/p>\",\"body\":\"<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">A premier benchmark for luxury waterfront living, seamlessly blending contemporary architectural elegance with a tranquil coastal sanctuary. Residents enjoy fresh sea breezes, private beach access, and immediate connectivity to key metropolitan hubs.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Located along prestigious shoreline corridors, the community offers an inspired lifestyle for professionals, investors, and families seeking refined island elegance away from urban congestion.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Every residence offers a harmonious blend of sophistication, security, and long-term capital appreciation, presenting an extraordinary investment opportunity in one of the most coveted coastal addresses.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>About the Developers<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Crafted by premier developers renowned for shaping iconic waterfront communities across the region for decades. Buyers and international investors benefit from a celebrated track record of timely delivery, construction excellence, and sustainable urban design.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Working alongside leading international architectural consultants and market advisory firms, every aspect of the project is engineered to global standards of prestige and durability.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Approvals &amp; Clearances<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The project holds full regulatory clearance and title approvals from all relevant municipal and developmental authorities. Complying strictly with environmental and structural guidelines, purchasers can invest with absolute peace of mind and secure freehold ownership.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Prime Location &amp; Seamless Connectivity<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Set within a scenic coastal landscape, the project offers rapid access to international airports, commercial business districts, premier private schools, and luxury retail destinations.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC1.png\\\" alt=\\\"Strategic Location &amp; Connectivity Map\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); width: 100%; margin: 15px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Surrounded by protected green reserves and pristine waters, residents wake up to panoramic coastal vistas and unpolluted air throughout the year.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Architectural Excellence &amp; Floor Plans<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The layouts focus on space efficiency, panoramic natural lighting, and seamless indoor-outdoor living with spacious private terraces and balconies.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>Curated Residences &amp; Layout Types<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC2.png\\\" alt=\\\"Luxury Layout Plan - Type C\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Featuring open-plan living rooms, floor-to-ceiling double-glazed windows, designer show kitchens, and lavish en-suite master bedrooms designed for modern family living.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC3.png\\\" alt=\\\"Executive Layout Plan - Type B\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Expansive terraces provide seamless entertaining spaces overlooking lush landscaped courtyards and the sparkling coastline.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC4.png\\\" alt=\\\"Presidential Villa Layout Plan - Type A\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Generous multi-level accommodations including private elevators, maid\'s quarters, private swimming pools, and dedicated family lounges.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Master Plan &amp; Community Lifestyle<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The community master plan establishes a secure, private, and walkable residential haven. Dedicated subterranean parking ensures pedestrian safety across surface walkways, cycling trails, and waterfront boardwalks.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC8.png\\\" alt=\\\"Community Master Plan Overview\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Flexible Investment &amp; Payment Plan<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>A buyer-friendly, construction-linked payment structure is offered with flexible milestones, making property acquisition straightforward and stress-free.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC12.png\\\" alt=\\\"Milestone Payment Structure\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>World-Class Facilities &amp; Amenities<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Enjoy infinity swimming pools, state-of-the-art fitness centres, private beach cabanas, children\'s play areas, multi-sport courts, and fine-dining waterfront restaurants just steps from your front door.<\\/p>\"}', '2026-11-03 07:26:08', '2026-11-03 07:26:08'),
