(838, 105, 'location', 'Location & Connectivity', 9, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Arabian Ranches Location in North Karachi\",\"description\":\"\",\"items\":[],\"categories\":[{\"name\":\"Nearby Landmarks And Attractions\",\"items\":[{\"name\":\"4K Chowrangi\",\"time\":\"3\\u20135 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"Surjani Town\",\"time\":\"5\\u201310 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"M-10 Karachi Northern Bypass\",\"time\":\"5\\u201310 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"Dreamworld Resort\",\"time\":\"15\\u201320 minutes\"}]}],\"subtitle\":\"The Saima Arabian Ranches Karachi location is within the Saima Arabian Villas society, near 4K Chowrangi in North Karachi \\u2014 if you know where Arabian Villas is, you know where Ranches is, as it forms part of the same overall footprint. Access runs through the 4K Chowrangi corridor via Surjani Road West and Manghopir Road, with the M-10 Karachi Northern Bypass a few minutes\' drive away and Surjani Town and Ittihad Town close by.\",\"image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793693822_6ae9987ed11c3.jpg\"}', '2026-11-03 08:10:40', '2026-11-03 08:20:54'),
(839, 105, 'faq', 'FAQ Accordion', 10, 1, '{\"title\":\"\",\"description\":\"\",\"items\":[{\"q\":\"Where is Saima Arabian Ranches Karachi located?\",\"a\":\"Saima Arabian Ranches is situated within the Saima Arabian Villas society, near 4K Chowrangi, North Karachi. The Saima Arabian Ranches Karachi location uses the same 4K Chowrangi access corridor as the wider society, with Surjani Town and the M-10 Karachi Northern Bypass nearby.\"},{\"q\":\"What is Saima Arabian Ranches price?\",\"a\":\"There is no fixed public Saima Arabian Ranches price: plot prices vary with market conditions, block position, and orientation, and figures in older listings may not reflect the current schedule. Buyers should obtain the current Arabian Ranches Karachi price in writing from the sales office.\"},{\"q\":\"What plot \\/ villa sizes in Saima Arabian Ranches?\",\"a\":\"The primary size marketed in Saima Arabian Ranches Saima Builders  is the 120 sq. yd. residential plot. The wider 160 and 240 sq. yd. sizes belong mainly to the older sections of Saima Arabian Villas rather than the Ranches phase, so buyers should clarify which section a listing belongs to.\"},{\"q\":\"What is Saima Arabian Ranches payment plan?\",\"a\":\"Arabian Ranches Karachi Saima is marketed on an installment plan: booking and confirmation payments, followed by monthly or quarterly installments, with development and possession charges itemised separately. The exact current schedule should be obtained in writing before booking.\"},{\"q\":\"Is Saima Arabian Ranches NOC approved?\",\"a\":\"Saima Arabian Ranches operates under the same SBCA-approved NOC as the wider Saima Arabian Villas society, according to project sources, but buyers should still verify the documentation for their specific plot before paying.\"},{\"q\":\"Who is developing Saima Arabian Ranches?\",\"a\":\"Saima Arabian Ranches is developed by Saima Builders, the same developer behind the wider Saima Arabian Villas community in North Karachi.\"},{\"q\":\"Is Saima Arabian Ranches part of a larger project?\",\"a\":\"Yes. Saima Arabian Ranches is a distinct phase within the larger Saima Arabian Villas community, with its own plot inventory and development plan, rather than a completely separate society.\"},{\"q\":\"Can overseas buyers book in Saima Arabian Ranches?\",\"a\":\"Overseas buyers can engage through authorised channels, but remittance and documentation procedures should be confirmed directly with the Saima Arabian Ranches sales team.\"},{\"q\":\"Why consider Saima Arabian Ranches Karachi?\",\"a\":\"Because it offers a newer-phase plot inventory on installments inside an already established, occupied society, so buyers get the wider community\'s facilities and resale market from day one instead of waiting for a new scheme to develop.\"}],\"heading\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\"}', '2026-11-03 08:10:40', '2026-11-03 08:20:54'),
(840, 105, 'contact', 'Contact & Booking CTA', 11, 1, '{\"title\":\"\",\"subtitle\":\"Discover plots in the newest phase of Saima Arabian Villas at Saima Arabian Ranches Karachi. Contact our advisory team for personalized guidance on Saima Arabian Ranches, current availability, and site visits. Whether you are exploring ranches for sale Karachi or seeking to buy ranch in Saima Arabian Ranches Karachi, our consultants can navigate the Saima Arabian Ranches booking process.\",\"button_text\":\"\",\"phone\":\"\",\"email\":\"\",\"pretitle\":\"LET\'S CONNECT\",\"heading\":\"Invest in Your Future\",\"form_small\":\"REQUEST\",\"form_large\":\"A CALL BACK\",\"submit_button\":\"REQUEST NOW\",\"bg_image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793694039_6ae999574561b.jpg\"}', '2026-11-03 08:10:40', '2026-11-03 08:20:54'),
(841, 106, 'hero', 'Hero Banner', 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Gulistan-e-Johar\",\"subtitle\":\"Explore Premier Properties & Real Estate Investment in Gulistan-e-Johar, Karachi\",\"badge\":\"Prime Real Estate Destination\",\"bg_image\":\"\\/images\\/hero\\/slide-1.jpg\"}', '2026-11-03 08:26:01', '2026-11-03 08:26:01'),
(842, 106, 'content', 'Table of Contents & Article', 2, 1, '{\"title\":\"\",\"intro\":\"\",\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">A premier benchmark for luxury waterfront living, seamlessly blending contemporary architectural elegance with a tranquil coastal sanctuary. Residents enjoy fresh sea breezes, private beach access, and immediate connectivity to key metropolitan hubs.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Located along prestigious shoreline corridors, the community offers an inspired lifestyle for professionals, investors, and families seeking refined island elegance away from urban congestion.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Every residence offers a harmonious blend of sophistication, security, and long-term capital appreciation, presenting an extraordinary investment opportunity in one of the most coveted coastal addresses.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>About the Developers<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Crafted by premier developers renowned for shaping iconic waterfront communities across the region for decades. Buyers and international investors benefit from a celebrated track record of timely delivery, construction excellence, and sustainable urban design.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Working alongside leading international architectural consultants and market advisory firms, every aspect of the project is engineered to global standards of prestige and durability.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Approvals &amp; Clearances<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The project holds full regulatory clearance and title approvals from all relevant municipal and developmental authorities. Complying strictly with environmental and structural guidelines, purchasers can invest with absolute peace of mind and secure freehold ownership.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Prime Location &amp; Seamless Connectivity<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Set within a scenic coastal landscape, the project offers rapid access to international airports, commercial business districts, premier private schools, and luxury retail destinations.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC1.png\\\" alt=\\\"Strategic Location &amp; Connectivity Map\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); width: 100%; margin: 15px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Surrounded by protected green reserves and pristine waters, residents wake up to panoramic coastal vistas and unpolluted air throughout the year.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Architectural Excellence &amp; Floor Plans<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The layouts focus on space efficiency, panoramic natural lighting, and seamless indoor-outdoor living with spacious private terraces and balconies.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>Curated Residences &amp; Layout Types<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC2.png\\\" alt=\\\"Luxury Layout Plan - Type C\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Featuring open-plan living rooms, floor-to-ceiling double-glazed windows, designer show kitchens, and lavish en-suite master bedrooms designed for modern family living.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC3.png\\\" alt=\\\"Executive Layout Plan - Type B\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Expansive terraces provide seamless entertaining spaces overlooking lush landscaped courtyards and the sparkling coastline.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC4.png\\\" alt=\\\"Presidential Villa Layout Plan - Type A\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Generous multi-level accommodations including private elevators, maid\'s quarters, private swimming pools, and dedicated family lounges.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Master Plan &amp; Community Lifestyle<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The community master plan establishes a secure, private, and walkable residential haven. Dedicated subterranean parking ensures pedestrian safety across surface walkways, cycling trails, and waterfront boardwalks.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC8.png\\\" alt=\\\"Community Master Plan Overview\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Flexible Investment &amp; Payment Plan<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>A buyer-friendly, construction-linked payment structure is offered with flexible milestones, making property acquisition straightforward and stress-free.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC12.png\\\" alt=\\\"Milestone Payment Structure\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>World-Class Facilities &amp; Amenities<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Enjoy infinity swimming pools, state-of-the-art fitness centres, private beach cabanas, children\'s play areas, multi-sport courts, and fine-dining waterfront restaurants just steps from your front door.<\\/p>\",\"body\":\"<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">A premier benchmark for luxury waterfront living, seamlessly blending contemporary architectural elegance with a tranquil coastal sanctuary. Residents enjoy fresh sea breezes, private beach access, and immediate connectivity to key metropolitan hubs.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Located along prestigious shoreline corridors, the community offers an inspired lifestyle for professionals, investors, and families seeking refined island elegance away from urban congestion.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Every residence offers a harmonious blend of sophistication, security, and long-term capital appreciation, presenting an extraordinary investment opportunity in one of the most coveted coastal addresses.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>About the Developers<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Crafted by premier developers renowned for shaping iconic waterfront communities across the region for decades. Buyers and international investors benefit from a celebrated track record of timely delivery, construction excellence, and sustainable urban design.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Working alongside leading international architectural consultants and market advisory firms, every aspect of the project is engineered to global standards of prestige and durability.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Approvals &amp; Clearances<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The project holds full regulatory clearance and title approvals from all relevant municipal and developmental authorities. Complying strictly with environmental and structural guidelines, purchasers can invest with absolute peace of mind and secure freehold ownership.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Prime Location &amp; Seamless Connectivity<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Set within a scenic coastal landscape, the project offers rapid access to international airports, commercial business districts, premier private schools, and luxury retail destinations.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC1.png\\\" alt=\\\"Strategic Location &amp; Connectivity Map\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); width: 100%; margin: 15px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Surrounded by protected green reserves and pristine waters, residents wake up to panoramic coastal vistas and unpolluted air throughout the year.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Architectural Excellence &amp; Floor Plans<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The layouts focus on space efficiency, panoramic natural lighting, and seamless indoor-outdoor living with spacious private terraces and balconies.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>Curated Residences &amp; Layout Types<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC2.png\\\" alt=\\\"Luxury Layout Plan - Type C\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Featuring open-plan living rooms, floor-to-ceiling double-glazed windows, designer show kitchens, and lavish en-suite master bedrooms designed for modern family living.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC3.png\\\" alt=\\\"Executive Layout Plan - Type B\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Expansive terraces provide seamless entertaining spaces overlooking lush landscaped courtyards and the sparkling coastline.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC4.png\\\" alt=\\\"Presidential Villa Layout Plan - Type A\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Generous multi-level accommodations including private elevators, maid\'s quarters, private swimming pools, and dedicated family lounges.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Master Plan &amp; Community Lifestyle<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The community master plan establishes a secure, private, and walkable residential haven. Dedicated subterranean parking ensures pedestrian safety across surface walkways, cycling trails, and waterfront boardwalks.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC8.png\\\" alt=\\\"Community Master Plan Overview\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Flexible Investment &amp; Payment Plan<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>A buyer-friendly, construction-linked payment structure is offered with flexible milestones, making property acquisition straightforward and stress-free.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC12.png\\\" alt=\\\"Milestone Payment Structure\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>World-Class Facilities &amp; Amenities<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Enjoy infinity swimming pools, state-of-the-art fitness centres, private beach cabanas, children\'s play areas, multi-sport courts, and fine-dining waterfront restaurants just steps from your front door.<\\/p>\"}', '2026-11-03 08:26:01', '2026-11-03 08:26:01'),
(843, 106, 'communities', 'Project Cards', 3, 1, '{\"heading\":\"Featured Projects\",\"subtitle\":\"Explore premium residential and commercial developments\",\"items\":[],\"selected_ids\":[],\"project_ids\":[]}', '2026-11-03 08:26:01', '2026-11-03 08:26:01'),
(844, 106, 'about', 'About Gulistan-e-Johar', 4, 1, '{\"title\":\"About the Community\",\"description\":\"A meticulously planned coastal sanctuary seamlessly integrating contemporary luxury living with untouched nature. Spanning scenic waterfronts, lush mangroves, and cycling corridors, the master community offers an unmatched urban lifestyle for residents and high-yield potential for global real estate investors.\",\"video_poster\":\"\\/images\\/projects\\/poster.jpg\",\"video_src\":\"\",\"heading\":\"About the Community\",\"video_url\":\"https:\\/\\/stream.mux.com\\/A3200aZtT5Wq7VlYwQv3wP9W2hX8.m3u8\",\"poster_image\":\"\\/images\\/projects\\/poster.jpg\"}', '2026-11-03 08:26:01', '2026-11-03 08:26:01'),
(845, 106, 'faq', 'Frequently Asked Questions', 5, 1, '{\"title\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\",\"description\":\"\",\"items\":[{\"q\":\"Are properties in this city freehold for foreign and overseas investors?\",\"a\":\"Yes, designated luxury master developments offer 100% freehold ownership for local and international buyers with complete title deed registration.\"},{\"q\":\"What are the typical payment plans available?\",\"a\":\"Flexible installment plans are offered typically linked to construction milestones, with down payments starting from 5% to 10%.\"}],\"heading\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\",\"subtitle\":\"Find answers to common questions about properties, buying process, and payment plans.\"}', '2026-11-03 08:26:01', '2026-11-03 08:26:01'),
(846, 106, 'contact', 'Contact & Booking CTA', 6, 1, '{\"title\":\"\",\"subtitle\":\"Connect with our dedicated city property advisors for personalized availability, floor plans, and VIP access.\",\"button_text\":\"\",\"phone\":\"+971 2 000 0000\",\"email\":\"info@hudayriyat-island.ae\"}', '2026-11-03 08:26:01', '2026-11-03 08:26:01'),
(847, 107, 'hero', 'Hero Banner & Form', 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Elite Enclave at Gulistan-e-Johar Karachi\",\"subtitle\":\"Saima Elite Enclave at Gulistan-e-Johar Karachi\",\"badge\":null,\"bg_image\":\"\\/images\\/projects\\/1793694555_hero_featured-saima-elite-enclave.jpg\",\"bg_image_alt\":\"Saima Elite Enclave at Gulistan-e-Johar Karachi\",\"image_alt\":\"Saima Elite Enclave at Gulistan-e-Johar Karachi\"}', '2026-11-03 08:29:15', '2026-11-03 08:42:59'),
(848, 107, 'highlights', 'Project Highlights', 2, 1, '{\"items\":[]}', '2026-11-03 08:29:15', '2026-11-03 08:42:59'),
(849, 107, 'about', 'About Community', 3, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Elite Enclave by Saima Builders\",\"description\":\"Saima Elite Enclave is a residential apartment project in Block 11, Gulistan-e-Johar, Karachi, beside Kamran Chowrangi, offering spacious 4-room, 5-room, and 6-room apartments by Saima Builders together with the ZSZ Group, featuring large family layouts with direct access to Shahrah-e-Faisal.\",\"video_poster\":\"\\/images\\/projects\\/1793694555_poster_featured-saima-elite-enclave.jpg\",\"video_src\":\"\"}', '2026-11-03 08:29:15', '2026-11-03 08:42:59'),
(850, 107, 'amenities', 'Amenities & Facilities', 4, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Elite Enclave Amenities\",\"subtitle\":\"Saima Elite Enclave Karachi provides facilities that support secure, comfortable family living, including a fully gated setup with 24\\/7 trained guards and CCTV coverage, dedicated parking, high-speed elevators, standby power backup, landscaped areas, and shared community facilities within the Saima Elite Enclave Kamran Chowrangi development.\",\"items\":[]}', '2026-11-03 08:29:15', '2026-11-03 08:42:59'),
(851, 107, 'gallery', 'Project Gallery', 5, 1, '{\"title\":\"Project Gallery\",\"images\":[{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793694971_6ae99cfbab463.jpg\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"}]}', '2026-11-03 08:29:15', '2026-11-03 08:42:59'),
(852, 107, 'content', 'Content', 6, 1, '{\"title\":\"\",\"intro\":\"\",\"html\":\"<p>At its core, Saima Elite Enclave Gulistan-e-Johar is chasing space rather than a luxury tag: 4-room, 5-room, and 6-room apartments from about 1,108 up to 2,292 square feet, with attached baths in every bedroom, a proper drawing room kept separate from the lounge, and a terrace. That combination puts it a step above much of the mid-range apartment stock in Karachi, where everything gets squeezed into one open space. It is built for families who have been renting a house for years because no apartment ever had enough rooms.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Among Kamran Chowrangi projects and high-rise apartments Gulistan-e-Johar, Saima Elite Enclave Kamran Chowrangi is regularly shortlisted by families comparing installment-based projects in this part of the city. Within Johar Karachi luxury apartments in the spacious-family sense, its differentiator is size per rupee in an established, dense, lived-in neighbourhood rather than a suburb still figuring itself out.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Key Project Highlights<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<table>\\r\\n<tbody><tr>\\r\\n<th>Feature<\\/th>\\r\\n<th>Details<\\/th>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Developer<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Saima Builders \\/ ZSZ Group<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Property Type<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Residential<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Unit Types<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>4, 5 & 6-room apartments<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Total Land Size<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>1.75 Acres<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Handover<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Phased<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Location<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Block 11, Gulistan-e-Johar, beside Kamran Chowrangi, Karachi<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Payment Plan<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>On Easy Installments<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Lifestyle<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Family living<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<\\/tbody><\\/table>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Master Plan and Development Framework<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Saima Elite Enclave Saima Builders is planned with towers arranged within Block 11 to balance privacy for individual units against easy access to shared amenities and parking, rather than stacking one repeated layout over and over.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Every residential floor carries the full mix of 4, 5, and 6-room units, so buyers get real choice within the same building. Parking is built into the master plan from the start, which is not optional in a location this busy, and landscaped and community areas are worked into the layout where it allows. The Saima Elite Enclave floor plan keeps living and drawing spaces separate, each doing its own job.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Unit Types: 4, 5 & 6-Room Apartments<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>For buyers searching for a 4 room apartment Gulistan-e-Johar Karachi, 5 room apartment Gulistan-e-Johar Karachi, or 6 room apartment Gulistan-e-Johar Karachi, Saima Elite Enclave Gulistan-e-Johar offers large family layouts in three categories.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>4-Room Apartments in Saima Elite Enclave<\\/h3>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The 4-room apartments, from around 1,108 square feet, are Saima Elite Enclave Gulistan-e-Johar\\u2019s entry category, already on the larger end for a family flat, with attached baths, a separate drawing room, a wide lounge, and a terrace.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>5-Room Apartments in Saima Elite Enclave<\\/h3>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The 5-room apartments in Saima Elite Enclave Gulistan-e-Johar give growing families an additional room while keeping the same layout principles: separate drawing and living spaces, attached baths, and a terrace.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>6-Room Apartments in Saima Elite Enclave<\\/h3>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The 6-room apartments in Saima Elite Enclave Gulistan-e-Johar, up to about 2,292 square feet, are the project\'s largest residences, aimed at joint families who need maximum space in Gulistan-e-Johar.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Floor Plan<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>A floor plan for each apartment category is available through the developer\'s authorised sales channel. Buyers seeking a Saima Elite Enclave price or floor plan should request the exact covered area for their specific unit rather than working off an average, as sizes vary widely across categories.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Price and Booking Status<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The Saima Elite Enclave Kamran Chowrangi price varies depending on room count, covered area, floor, and construction stage at booking, and current pricing is disclosed through the developer\'s authorised sales channel. This is positioned as a premium, spacious option rather than a budget entry-level flat.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>A Saima Elite Enclave booking is processed through the developer\'s sales team, and the Saima Elite Enclave booking amount should be confirmed in writing alongside the Saima Elite Enclave payment plan. Buyers comparing the 4 room apartment Saima Elite Enclave price and 5 room apartment Saima Elite Enclave price should request both schedules together to compare total payable, including whether development charges are included or separate.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Saima Elite Enclave Karachi buyers should also confirm whether units are being offered through a priority allocation system or on a first-come, first-served basis.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>NOC and Approval Status<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Saima Elite Enclave Kamran Chowrangi buyers should verify the project-specific approvals directly with the developer or the relevant authority before booking, as NOC status applies to the individual project.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Regulations shift and documentation gets updated, so a status reported earlier should be re-confirmed at the time of booking rather than assumed to still apply.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Possession Timeline<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Possession at Saima Elite Enclave Gulistan-e-Johar depends on the specific tower and unit, as development is happening in phases. Buyers should confirm the possession status and timeline for their exact unit in writing at the point of Saima Elite Enclave booking, rather than assuming it is uniform across the project.<\\/p>\",\"body\":\"\"}', '2026-11-03 08:29:15', '2026-11-03 08:42:59'),
(853, 107, 'payment_plan', 'Payment Plan', 7, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Elite Enclave Payment Plan\",\"description\":\"<p>The payment plan for Saima Elite Enclave Saima Builders is spread across installments instead of one large upfront amount: booking and confirmation payments, followed by monthly installments over an extended period, with a quarterly option, development charges where applicable, and a final possession payment at handover. Exact terms and amounts are provided upon request through the developer\'s authorised sales channel and should be obtained in writing.<\\/p>\",\"down_payment\":\"\",\"during_construction\":\"\",\"on_handover\":\"\",\"items\":[],\"rows\":[]}', '2026-11-03 08:29:15', '2026-11-03 08:42:59'),
(854, 107, 'master_plan', 'Master Plan', 8, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Elite Enclave Master Plan\",\"description\":\"\",\"image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793694971_6ae99cfbaef16.jpg\",\"badge\":\"Click to Enlarge\"}', '2026-11-03 08:29:15', '2026-11-03 08:42:59'),
(855, 107, 'location', 'Location & Connectivity', 9, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Elite Enclave Location in Gulistan-e-Johar, Karachi\",\"description\":\"\",\"items\":[],\"categories\":[{\"name\":\"New Category\",\"items\":[{\"name\":\"Kamran Chowrangi\",\"time\":\"2\\u20134 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"Shahrah-e-Faisal\",\"time\":\"3\\u20137 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"Jinnah International Airport\",\"time\":\"8\\u201315 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"Darul Sehat Hospital\",\"time\":\"5\\u20138 minutes\"}]}],\"subtitle\":\"The Saima Elite Enclave Karachi location is in Block 11, Gulistan-e-Johar, right beside Kamran Chowrangi, with direct access onto Shahrah-e-Faisal. That means Saddar, Tariq Road, and Karachi Cantt are reachable without weaving through side streets, the airport is a short drive, and Faisal Cantonment and Gulshan-e-Iqbal sit on either side, with University Road running between them. Two busy access points, Kamran Chowrangi and Shahrah-e-Faisal, mean there is rarely just one route in or out of Saima Elite Enclave Saima Builders.\",\"image\":null}', '2026-11-03 08:29:15', '2026-11-03 08:42:59'),
(856, 107, 'faq', 'FAQ Accordion', 10, 1, '{\"title\":\"\",\"description\":\"\",\"items\":[{\"q\":\"Where is Saima Elite Enclave Karachi located?\",\"a\":\"Saima Elite Enclave is located in Block 11, Gulistan-e-Johar, Karachi, right beside Kamran Chowrangi. The Saima Elite Enclave Gulistan-e-Johar position gives direct access to Shahrah-e-Faisal, with Jinnah International Airport roughly 10 to 15 minutes away and Darul Sehat Hospital a few minutes off.\"},{\"q\":\"What is Saima Elite Enclave price?\",\"a\":\"A confirmed public Saima Elite Enclave price list has not been released; pricing climbs with room count, covered area, and floor, and is available through the developer\'s authorised sales channel forSaima Elite Enclave Gulistan-e-Johar. Figures quoted in older listings should be treated as starting references, not current quotes.\"},{\"q\":\"How many rooms in Saima Elite Enclave?\",\"a\":\"Saima Elite Enclave Kamran Chowrangi offers 4-room, 5-room, and 6-room apartments, ranging from about 1,108 to 2,292 square feet. Room counts here include the drawing room and lounge alongside the bedrooms, so buyers should check the actual bedroom count for their chosen unit on the official floor plan.\"},{\"q\":\"What is Saima Elite Enclave payment plan?\",\"a\":\"The Saima Elite Enclave payment plan and Saima Elite Enclave booking amount are disclosed through sales engagement rather than a public schedule.\"},{\"q\":\"Is Saima Elite Enclave NOC approved?\",\"a\":\"Buyers should verify the project-specific NOC and approval status for Saima Elite Enclave Karachi directly with the developer or the relevant authority before purchase\"},{\"q\":\"Is Saima Elite Enclave the same as Saima Elite Villas?\",\"a\":\"No. Saima Elite Enclave Saima Builders is the apartment project in Block 11, Gulistan-e-Johar, beside Kamran Chowrangi, while Saima Elite Villas is a separate, completed project name in Scheme 33. Buyers should confirm which project a listing refers to before paying anything.\"},{\"q\":\"Who is developing Saima Elite Enclave?\",\"a\":\"Saima Elite Enclave is a joint project of Saima Real Estate Group (Saima Builders) and the ZSZ Group, both with long delivery histories in Karachi.\"},{\"q\":\"Can overseas buyers book in Saima Elite Enclave?\",\"a\":\"Overseas buyers can engage through authorised channels, but remittance and documentation procedures should be confirmed directly with the Saima Elite Enclave sales team.\"},{\"q\":\"Why consider Saima Elite Enclave Karachi?\",\"a\":\"Because it is built around space: large 4, 5, and 6-room layouts with attached baths, a separate drawing room, and a terrace, in a gated setting beside Kamran Chowrangi with Shahrah-e-Faisal access and the airport close by. That combination is rare in Johar\'s mid-range apartment stock.\"}],\"heading\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\"}', '2026-11-03 08:29:15', '2026-11-03 08:42:59'),
(857, 107, 'contact', 'Contact & Booking CTA', 11, 1, '{\"title\":\"\",\"subtitle\":\"Discover spacious family apartments at Saima Elite Enclave Saima Builders. Contact our advisory team for personalized guidance on Saima Elite Enclave, updated pricing, and private viewings. Whether you are exploring apartments for sale Gulistan-e-Johar Karachi or seeking to buy flat near Kamran Chowrangi Karachi, our consultants can navigate the Saima Elite Enclave booking process.\",\"button_text\":\"\",\"phone\":\"\",\"email\":\"\",\"pretitle\":\"LET\'S CONNECT\",\"heading\":\"Invest in Your Future\",\"form_small\":\"REQUEST\",\"form_large\":\"A CALL BACK\",\"submit_button\":\"REQUEST NOW\",\"bg_image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793694971_6ae99cfbb1b71.jpg\"}', '2026-11-03 08:29:15', '2026-11-03 08:42:59'),
(858, 108, 'hero', 'Hero Banner & Form', 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Paari Excellency at North Nazimabad Karachi\",\"subtitle\":\"Saima Paari Excellency, a G+22 tower by Saima Builders in Block A, North Nazimabad, Karachi, with 4 & 5-room apartments. See key details.\",\"badge\":null,\"bg_image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793703151_6ae9bcef664bf.jpg\",\"bg_image_alt\":\"Saima Paari Excellency at North Nazimabad Karachi\",\"image_alt\":\"Saima Paari Excellency at North Nazimabad Karachi\"}', '2026-11-03 10:41:11', '2026-11-03 10:52:44'),
(859, 108, 'highlights', 'Project Highlights', 2, 1, '{\"items\":[]}', '2026-11-03 10:41:11', '2026-11-03 10:52:44'),
(860, 108, 'about', 'About Community', 3, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Paari Excellency by Saima Builders\",\"description\":\"<p>Saima Paari Excellency is a residential high-rise in Block A, North Nazimabad, Karachi, a ground-plus-22-floor tower offering 4-room (Type B) and 5-room (Type A) apartments by Saima Builders, featuring five dedicated parking floors and a full amenity floor in one of Karachi\'s most established neighbourhoods.<\\/p>\",\"video_poster\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793703151_6ae9bcef6816c.jpg\",\"video_src\":\"\"}', '2026-11-03 10:41:11', '2026-11-03 10:52:44'),
(861, 108, 'amenities', 'Amenities & Facilities', 4, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Paari Excellency Amenities\",\"subtitle\":\"Saima Paari Excellency Karachi provides facilities concentrated on a dedicated 6th-floor amenity level, including a gym, a swimming pool, a dedicated kids\' play area, walking and jogging tracks, landscaped gardens, a community hall, a mosque, retail and convenience stores, and caf\\u00e9 options, alongside gated security, five parking floors with separate visitor parking, multiple elevators, and backup generators within the Saima Paari Excellency Saima Builderstower.\",\"items\":[]}', '2026-11-03 10:41:11', '2026-11-03 10:52:44'),
(862, 108, 'gallery', 'Project Gallery', 5, 1, '{\"title\":null,\"images\":[{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793703151_6ae9bcef69e28.jpg\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"},{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793703151_6ae9bcef6a3c4.jpg\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"},{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793703151_6ae9bcef6a8c1.jpg\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"},{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793703151_6ae9bcef6ae9f.jpg\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"}]}', '2026-11-03 10:41:11', '2026-11-03 10:52:44');
INSERT INTO `page_sections` (`id`, `page_id`, `section_key`, `section_name`, `order`, `is_active`, `content`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(863, 108, 'content', 'Content', 6, 1, '{\"title\":\"\",\"intro\":\"\",\"html\":\"<p>At its core, Saima Paari Excellency is defined by its layering: a ground-plus-22-floor tower where the first five floors are entirely parking, the 6th floor is a shared amenity level, and everything from floor 7 to 22 is residential. That solves two problems older North Nazimabad buildings never could. Firstly, the daily fight for parking, and secondly, the absence of any shared recreational space in a neighbourhood where every square foot counts.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Within Saima Builders residential projects Karachi, Paari Excellency is the North Nazimabad family tower, and among high-rise apartments Karachi it keeps showing up on shortlists for three reasons: the location, the two proper family layouts, and the dedicated amenity floor. For family apartments Karachi buyers who want to stay central, it is one of the more practical options in this part of the city.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Key Project Highlights<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<table>\\r\\n<tbody><tr>\\r\\n<th>Feature<\\/th>\\r\\n<th>Details<\\/th>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Developer<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Saima Builders<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Property Type<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Residential<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Unit Types<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>4-room (Type B) & 5-room (Type A) apartments<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Total Land Size<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>2 Acres<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Handover<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>To be confirmed<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Location<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Block A, North Nazimabad, between Dil Pasand Sweets & Saifee Hospital, Karachi<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Payment Plan<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>On Easy Installments<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Lifestyle<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Family living<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<\\/tbody><\\/table>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Master Plan and Development Framework<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Saima Paari Excellency Saima Builders is planned as a single layered tower rather than a spread-out scheme: parking down low across five floors, amenities in the middle on the 6th floor, and homes stacked strictly residential above.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The framework reflects deliberate planning for a dense neighbourhood: residents pass from parking through the amenity level to their homes, visitor parking is kept separate so guests do not fight residents for space, and both apartment types follow the same idea of separated, functional rooms like drawing room, dining, and lounge, instead of one big open zone. The Saima Paari Excellency floor plan keeps shared space up front and bedrooms tucked toward the quieter end of each unit.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Unit Types: 4-Room (Type B) & 5-Room (Type A) Apartments<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>For buyers searching for apartments for sale Saima Paari Excellency or flats for sale Saima Paari Excellency Karachi, Saima Paari Excellency Saima Builders offers family layouts in two categories.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>5-Room Apartments (Type A) in Saima Paari Excellency<\\/h3>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The 5-room Type A is the larger of the two layouts, meant for larger families: three bedrooms, each with an attached bathroom, a separate drawing room, a dining and living area, an extra lounge, a kitchen with a store and balcony access, and a genuinely spacious terrace.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>4-Room Apartments (Type B) in Saima Paari Excellency<\\/h3>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The 4-room Type B is more compact, better for smaller families who still want a proper multi-room layout: two bedrooms with attached bathrooms, a family or living area, a dining space, a kitchen with a service balcony, a drawing room, and its own terrace.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Floor Plan<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>A floor plan for both types is available through the developer\'s authorised sales channel. Buyers seeking a Saima Paari Excellency apartment price or floor plan should request the unit schedule alongside the floor plan, as reading about a layout only goes so far compared to seeing it.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Price and Booking Status<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The Saima Paari Excellency price depends on which type is picked, the floor, and the unit\'s position, and current pricing is disclosed through the developer\'s authorised sales channel. Extra charges apply for corner, road-facing, and west-facing units, so the total payable differs unit by unit.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>A Saima Paari Excellency booking is processed through the developer\'s sales team, and the Saima Paari Excellency booking amount should be confirmed in writing alongside the Saima Paari Excellency payment plan. The practical route to buy flat in Saima Paari Excellency Karachi is to register interest directly with Saima Builders or its designated sales partners and obtain the current Saima Paari Excellency apartment price before booking.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Saima Paari Excellency Karachi buyers should also confirm whether Saima Paari Excellency apartments on installments are being offered through a priority allocation system or on a first-come, first-served basis.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>NOC and Approval Status<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Saima Paari Excellency Saima Builders buyers should verify the project-specific approvals directly with the developer or the relevant authority before booking, as NOC status applies to the individual project.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Regulations shift and documentation gets updated, so a status reported earlier should be re-confirmed at the time of booking rather than assumed to still apply.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Possession Timeline<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>A formal possession date for Saima Paari Excellency Saima Builders has not been announced as a single project-wide date. Buyers should secure a documented possession schedule at the point of Saima Paari Excellency booking, and Saima Paari Excellency Saima Builders possession timelines should be confirmed in writing with the developer.<\\/p>\",\"body\":\"\"}', '2026-11-03 10:41:11', '2026-11-03 10:52:44'),
(864, 108, 'payment_plan', 'Payment Plan', 7, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Paari Excellency Payment Plan\",\"description\":\"<p>The payment plan for Saima Paari Excellency is split across booking, allocation, and confirmation, followed by a mix of monthly and quarterly installments tied to construction progress. Exact terms, amounts, and any facing or corner charges are provided upon request through the developer\'s authorised sales channel and should be obtained in writing for the specific unit.<\\/p>\",\"down_payment\":\"\",\"during_construction\":\"\",\"on_handover\":\"\",\"items\":[],\"rows\":[]}', '2026-11-03 10:41:11', '2026-11-03 10:52:44'),
(865, 108, 'master_plan', 'Master Plan', 8, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Paari Excellency Master Plan\",\"description\":\"\",\"image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793703151_6ae9bcef6e746.jpg\",\"badge\":\"Click to Enlarge\"}', '2026-11-03 10:41:11', '2026-11-03 10:52:44'),
(866, 108, 'location', 'Location & Connectivity', 9, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Paari Excellency Location in North Nazimabad, Karachi\",\"description\":\"\",\"items\":[],\"categories\":[{\"name\":\"Nearby Landmarks And Attractions\",\"items\":[{\"name\":\"Saifee Hospital\",\"time\":\"3\\u20135 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"Dil Pasand Sweets (Block A)\",\"time\":\"2\\u20133 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"Shahrah-e-Sher Shah Suri\",\"time\":\"2\\u20133 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"KDA Flyover\",\"time\":\"3\\u20135 minutes\"}]}],\"subtitle\":\"The Saima Paari Excellency Karachi location is in Block A, North Nazimabad, between Dil Pasand Sweets and Saifee Hospital, two landmarks most locals recognise without thought. From the building, Shahrah-e-Sher Shah Suri is barely a few minutes away, the KDA Flyover and Nagan Chowrangi are close behind, and Saifee Hospital, Sindh Rangers Hospital, Hydri Super Market, schools, and colleges are all within a short drive. It is a walkable, long-settled neighbourhood plugged straight into the wider North Nazimabad and North Karachi road network.\",\"image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793703151_6ae9bcef6f5aa.jpg\"}', '2026-11-03 10:41:11', '2026-11-03 10:52:44'),
(867, 108, 'faq', 'FAQ Accordion', 10, 1, '{\"title\":\"\",\"description\":\"\",\"items\":[{\"q\":\"Where is Saima Paari Excellency Karachi located?\",\"a\":\"Saima Paari Excellency is located in Block A, North Nazimabad, Karachi, tucked between Dil Pasand Sweets and Saifee Hospital. The Saima Paari Excellency Karachi location provides quick access to Shahrah-e-Sher Shah Suri, the KDA Flyover, and Nagan Chowrangi.\"},{\"q\":\"What is Saima Paari Excellency price?\",\"a\":\"A confirmed public Saima Paari Excellency price list has not been released; pricing differs between the 4-room Type B and 5-room Type A, with extra charges for corner, road-facing, and west-facing units. Current figures are available through the developer\'s authorised sales channel for Saima Paari Excellency Karachi.\"},{\"q\":\"How many bedrooms in Saima Paari Excellency?\",\"a\":\"Saima Paari Excellency Saima Builders offers two layouts: the 4-room Type B with 2 bedrooms, and the 5-room Type A with 3 bedrooms, each bedroom with an attached bathroom, alongside separate drawing, dining, and lounge spaces.\"},{\"q\":\"What is Saima Paari Excellency payment plan?\",\"a\":\"The Saima Paari Excellency payment plan and Saima Paari Excellency booking amount are disclosed through sales engagement rather than a public schedule.\"},{\"q\":\"Is Saima Paari Excellency NOC approved?\",\"a\":\"Buyers should verify the project-specific NOC and approval status for Saima Paari Excellency Karachi directly with the developer or the relevant authority before purchase.\"},{\"q\":\"Is Saima Paari Excellency the same as Saima Excellency?\",\"a\":\"No. Saima Paari Excellency is the North Nazimabad Block A tower, while Saima Excellency is a separate, completed project in Gulshan-e-Iqbal. Buyers should confirm which project a listing refers to before paying anything.\"},{\"q\":\"Who is developing Saima Paari Excellency?\",\"a\":\"Saima Paari Excellency is developed by Saima Builders, which already has several other projects in North Nazimabad and a long record of residential towers across Karachi\"},{\"q\":\"Can overseas buyers book in Saima Paari Excellency?\",\"a\":\"Overseas buyers can engage through authorised channels, but remittance and documentation procedures should be confirmed directly with the Saima Paari Excellency sales team.\"},{\"q\":\"Why consider Saima Paari Excellency Karachi?\",\"a\":\"Because of its layering: five floors of parking, a full amenity floor, and homes above, in a central North Nazimabad location where hospitals, markets, and main roads are minutes away. Older buildings nearby simply never had room for that combination.\"}],\"heading\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\"}', '2026-11-03 10:41:11', '2026-11-03 10:52:44'),
(868, 108, 'contact', 'Contact & Booking CTA', 11, 1, '{\"title\":\"\",\"subtitle\":\"Discover family apartments at Saima Paari Excellency Saima Builders. Contact our advisory team for personalized guidance on Saima Paari Excellency, updated pricing, and private viewings. Whether you are exploring apartments for sale Saima Paari Excellency or seeking to buy flat in Saima Paari Excellency Karachi, our consultants can navigate the Saima Paari Excellency booking process.\",\"button_text\":\"\",\"phone\":\"\",\"email\":\"\",\"pretitle\":\"LET\'S CONNECT\",\"heading\":\"Invest in Your Future\",\"form_small\":\"REQUEST\",\"form_large\":\"A CALL BACK\",\"submit_button\":\"REQUEST NOW\",\"bg_image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793703151_6ae9bcef712fc.jpg\"}', '2026-11-03 10:41:11', '2026-11-03 10:52:44'),
(869, 109, 'hero', 'Hero Banner & Form', 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Jinnah Icon at Main Jinnah Avenue Karachi\",\"subtitle\":\"Saima Jinnah Icon, a completed mixed-use tower by Saima Builders on Main Jinnah Avenue, Sector 40, Karachi, with 5 & 6-room apartments and a mall.\",\"badge\":null,\"bg_image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793703801_6ae9bf79c13ca.jpg\",\"bg_image_alt\":\"Saima Jinnah Icon at Main Jinnah Avenue Karachi\",\"image_alt\":\"Saima Jinnah Icon at Main Jinnah Avenue Karachi\"}', '2026-11-03 10:57:13', '2026-11-03 11:04:06'),
(870, 109, 'highlights', 'Project Highlights', 2, 1, '{\"items\":[]}', '2026-11-03 10:57:13', '2026-11-03 11:04:06'),
(871, 109, 'about', 'About Community', 3, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Jinnah Icon by Saima Builders\",\"description\":\"Saima Jinnah Icon is a partially completed mixed-use high-rise on Main Jinnah Avenue, Sector 40, Karachi, near Malir Cantt Checkpost 6 and opposite Askari 5, offering 5-room and 6-room luxury apartments above the Jinnah Icon Mall by Saima Builders in collaboration with the Zeeshan Saleem Zaki Group.\",\"video_poster\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793703801_6ae9bf79c3cd7.jpg\",\"video_src\":\"\"}', '2026-11-03 10:57:13', '2026-11-03 11:04:06'),
(872, 109, 'amenities', 'Amenities & Facilities', 4, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Jinnah Icon Amenities\",\"subtitle\":\"Saima Jinnah Icon Karachi provides facilities that support both residential and commercial use, including dedicated parking between the mall and residential floors, 24\\/7 security with CCTV coverage throughout, a reception lobby and waiting area, a gymnasium with modern equipment, a spacious lounge and recreational space, and passenger elevators within the Saima Jinnah Icon Main Jinnah Avenue tower.\",\"items\":[]}', '2026-11-03 10:57:13', '2026-11-03 11:04:06'),
(873, 109, 'gallery', 'Project Gallery', 5, 1, '{\"title\":null,\"images\":[{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793703801_6ae9bf79c53e9.jpg\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"},{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793703801_6ae9bf79c5a4a.jpg\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"},{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793703801_6ae9bf79c60f8.jpg\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"},{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793703801_6ae9bf79c6729.jpg\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"}]}', '2026-11-03 10:57:13', '2026-11-03 11:04:06'),
(874, 109, 'content', 'Content', 6, 1, '{\"title\":\"\",\"intro\":\"\",\"html\":\"<p>At its core, Saima Jinnah Icon Main Jinnah Avenue is built around something a lot of Karachi buyers actually want: big apartments upstairs, a proper mall and shops downstairs, all under one roof. The apartments come in 5-room and 6-room configurations for families who want room to breathe rather than something compact, and below the residential floors sits the mall level with retail shops and a food court, giving the tower its mixed-use character.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Saima Jinnah Icon Mall is listed as a completed project by Saima Group, which changes the buying conversation entirely: most people researching it today are not asking when it will finish, but what is actually available and what it costs. Among Main Jinnah Avenue Karachi projects, it is the corridor\'s clearest example of Jinnah Avenue commercial + residential combined in one high-rise.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Key Project Highlights<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<table>\\r\\n<tbody><tr>\\r\\n<th>Feature<\\/th>\\r\\n<th>Details<\\/th>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Developer<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Saima Builders \\/ ZSZ Group<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Property Type<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Mixed-use<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Unit Types<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>5 & 6-room apartments; mall shops<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Total Land Size<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>4.4 acres<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Handover<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Mall Completed, residential area under construction<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Location<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Main Jinnah Avenue, Sector 40, near Malir Cantt Checkpost 6, opposite Askari 5, Karachi<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Payment Plan<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Resale \\/ inventory terms<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Lifestyle<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Mixed-use luxury<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<\\/tbody><\\/table>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Master Plan and Development Framework<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Saima Jinnah Icon Saima Builders is planned as a vertical mixed-use tower: the mall and retail at the lower floors, dedicated parking above the mall, and the residential apartments above that, so commercial activity stays down low and private living stays up high.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>That vertical split works well on a busy road like Jinnah Avenue: residents can shop and eat without leaving the building, mall foot traffic stays away from the residential floors, and parking is kept practical for both groups. The Saima Jinnah Icon floor plan revolves around its 5-room and 6-room types, with multiple bedrooms, attached bathrooms, a kitchen, and shared living and dining space.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Unit Types: Apartments and Mall Shops<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>For buyers searching for 5 bed luxury apartments Jinnah Avenue Karachi or 6 bed luxury apartments Jinnah Avenue Karachi, Saima Jinnah Icon Saima Builders offers mixed-use units in three categories.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>5-Room Apartments in Saima Jinnah Icon<\\/h3>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The 5-room apartments in Saima Jinnah Icon Main Jinnah Avenue are marketed as executive units for families who want generous space, with multiple bedrooms, attached bathrooms, and shared living and dining areas.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>6-Room Apartments in Saima Jinnah Icon<\\/h3>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The 6-room apartments in Saima Jinnah Icon Main Jinnah Avenue are the tower\'s largest residences, aimed at bigger and joint families who want maximum space on Main Jinnah Avenue.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>Mall Shops and Commercial Spaces in Saima Jinnah Icon<\\/h3>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The Jinnah Icon Mall across the lower floors was built to house retail shops for national and international brands, a food court, and wider commercial spaces, forming the commercial spaces Jinnah Avenue Karachi component of the project.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Floor Plan<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Current availability for each layout in Saima Jinnah Icon Main Jinnah Avenue should be confirmed with the sales team. Buyers should request the official floor plan documentation for the specific unit rather than relying on listing descriptions.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Price and Booking Status<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The Saima Jinnah Icon price depends heavily on unit size, floor, and whether the unit is developer inventory or resale, for both apartments and mall shops. Rather than relying on a figure that may already be outdated, buyers should request a current price quote for the specific unit type that interests them.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>A Saima Jinnah Icon booking today means clarifying first which category the unit falls into, primary developer inventory or an existing owner\'s resale, because the Saima Jinnah Icon booking amount and terms differ between the two. Buyers comparing the 5 bed apartment Saima Jinnah Icon price and 6 bed apartment Saima Jinnah Icon price should request current quotes for both categories together.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>For shops, prices inside Jinnah Icon Mall vary by size, floor, and position within the mall, and a current list of operating tenants should be obtained from mall management rather than from older listings.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>NOC and Approval Status<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Saima Jinnah Icon Saima Builders buyers should verify the project-specific SBCA approval documents directly with the developer or the relevant authority before purchase. As the residential towers remain under construction, buyers must inspect the unit\\u2019s formal allotment agreement and approved building plans carefully. Because the attached Jinnah Icon Mall is already operational while residences are still being built, buyers should confirm current tenant mixes and commercial arrangements directly with mall management at the time of purchase.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Possession Timeline<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Saima Jinnah Icon Main Jinnah Avenue is listed as an active construction project, so possession follows the developer\'s delivery timeline for the specific unit rather than immediate sale and transfer formalities. Buyers should confirm whether a unit is developer inventory or resale, and secure the possession and documentation process in writing before paying.<\\/p>\",\"body\":\"\"}', '2026-11-03 10:57:13', '2026-11-03 11:04:06'),
(875, 109, 'payment_plan', 'Payment Plan', 7, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Jinnah Icon Payment Plan\",\"description\":\"Saima Jinnah Icon by Saima Builders is an ongoing construction project, the original developer installment schedule is currently still in force: current payment terms reflect either standard developer inventory terms or resale terms agreed directly between buyer and seller. Booking amount, down payment, and any installment arrangement should be confirmed case by case in writing.\",\"down_payment\":\"\",\"during_construction\":\"\",\"on_handover\":\"\",\"items\":[],\"rows\":[]}', '2026-11-03 10:57:13', '2026-11-03 11:04:06'),
(876, 109, 'master_plan', 'Master Plan', 8, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Jinnah Icon Master Plan\",\"description\":\"\",\"image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793703801_6ae9bf79c8d9b.jpg\",\"badge\":null}', '2026-11-03 10:57:13', '2026-11-03 11:04:06'),
(877, 109, 'location', 'Location & Connectivity', 9, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Jinnah Icon Location on Main Jinnah Avenue\",\"description\":\"The Saima Jinnah Icon Karachi location is on Main Jinnah Avenue, Sector 40, near Malir Cantt and Checkpost 6, opposite Askari 5. Jinnah Avenue has been one of Karachi\'s important connecting roads for decades, linking residential and commercial pockets across the eastern side of the city, and sitting directly on it gives the tower a visibility that buildings in side lanes do not get. The airport is reachable via Jinnah Avenue, University Road through Safoora Goth, and some listings also mention proximity to Acacia Country and Golf Club.\",\"items\":[],\"categories\":[{\"name\":\"Nearby Landmarks And Attractions\",\"items\":[{\"name\":\"Malir Cantt Checkpost 6\",\"time\":\"3\\u20135 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"Askari 5\",\"time\":\"5\\u20138 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"Acacia Country & Golf Club\",\"time\":\"4\\u20138 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"Jinnah International Airport\",\"time\":\"8\\u201315 minutes\"}]}],\"subtitle\":null,\"image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793703801_6ae9bf79c9f0e.jpg\"}', '2026-11-03 10:57:13', '2026-11-03 11:04:06'),
(878, 109, 'faq', 'FAQ Accordion', 10, 1, '{\"title\":\"\",\"description\":\"\",\"items\":[{\"q\":\"Where is Saima Jinnah Icon Karachi located?\",\"a\":\"Saima Jinnah Icon is located on Main Jinnah Avenue, Sector 40, Karachi, near Malir Cantt Checkpost 6, opposite Askari 5, based on developer and third-party listings. The Saima Jinnah Icon Main Jinnah Avenue position is reachable from the airport via Jinnah Avenue, or from University Road through Safoora Goth.\"},{\"q\":\"What is Saima Jinnah Icon price?\",\"a\":\"There is no fixed public Saima Jinnah Icon price: current prices depend heavily on unit size, floor, and whether the unit is leftover developer inventory or a resale. Buyers should request a current quote for the specific apartment or shop rather than relying on older listings.\"},{\"q\":\"How many bedrooms in Saima Jinnah Icon?\",\"a\":\"Current sources, including the developer, consistently point to 5-room and 6-room apartment configurations marketed as executive and luxury units in Saima Jinnah Icon Saima Builders. Some older listings mentioned smaller bedroom counts, so buyers should confirm the exact layout of the specific unit against its floor plan.\"},{\"q\":\"What is Saima Jinnah Icon payment plan?\",\"a\":\"Because the residential project is under construction, current terms reflect either resale arrangements between buyer and seller or primary developer inventory terms, following an original installment schedule. The Saima Jinnah Icon payment plan and booking amount should be confirmed case by case in writing.\"},{\"q\":\"Is Saima Jinnah Icon NOC approved?\",\"a\":\"Buyers should verify the project-specific NOC and approval documents for Saima Jinnah Icon Karachi directly with the developer or the relevant authority before purchase, including for the specific unit or shop.\"},{\"q\":\"Is Saima Jinnah Icon the same as Saima Jinnah Mall and Residence?\",\"a\":\"No. Saima Jinnah Icon Main Jinnah Avenue stands at Sector 40 near Malir Cantt Checkpost 6, opposite Askari 5, while Saima Jinnah Mall and Residence is a separate project opposite Checkpost No. 5. Both are on Main Jinnah Avenue, so buyers should confirm which project a listing refers to before paying anything.\"},{\"q\":\"Who is developing Saima Jinnah Icon?\",\"a\":\"Saima Jinnah Icon is developed by Saima Builders and Developers in collaboration with the Zeeshan Saleem Zaki Group.\"},{\"q\":\"Can overseas buyers book in Saima Jinnah Icon?\",\"a\":\"Overseas buyers can engage through authorised channels, but remittance and documentation procedures should be confirmed directly with the Saima Jinnah Icon Saima Builders sales team, particularly for resale units.\"},{\"q\":\"Why consider Saima Jinnah Icon Karachi?\",\"a\":\"Because it combines a Main Jinnah Avenue address, large luxury apartments, and a mall downstairs in one completed building, so buyers are assessing finished inventory rather than construction promises. Availability today is leftover developer stock or resale, which should be clarified before any negotiation.\"}],\"heading\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\"}', '2026-11-03 10:57:13', '2026-11-03 11:04:06'),
(879, 109, 'contact', 'Contact & Booking CTA', 11, 1, '{\"title\":\"\",\"subtitle\":\"Discover completed luxury apartments and mall shops at Saima Jinnah Icon Karachi. Contact our advisory team for personalized guidance onSaima Jinnah Icon Saima Builders, current availability, and private viewings. Whether you are exploring apartments on Main Jinnah Avenue Karachi or seeking to buy luxury apartment Main Jinnah Avenue Karachi, our consultants can navigate the Saima Jinnah Icon booking process.\",\"button_text\":\"\",\"phone\":\"\",\"email\":\"\",\"pretitle\":\"LET\'S CONNECT\",\"heading\":\"Invest in Your Future\",\"form_small\":\"REQUEST\",\"form_large\":\"A CALL BACK\",\"submit_button\":\"REQUEST NOW\",\"bg_image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793703801_6ae9bf79cb78b.jpg\"}', '2026-11-03 10:57:13', '2026-11-03 11:04:06'),
(880, 110, 'hero', 'Hero Banner', 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Scheme 33\",\"subtitle\":\"Explore Premier Properties & Real Estate Investment in Scheme 33, Karachi\",\"badge\":\"Prime Real Estate Destination\",\"bg_image\":\"\\/images\\/hero\\/slide-1.jpg\"}', '2026-11-03 11:05:38', '2026-11-03 11:05:38'),
(881, 110, 'content', 'Table of Contents & Article', 2, 1, '{\"title\":\"\",\"intro\":\"\",\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">A premier benchmark for luxury waterfront living, seamlessly blending contemporary architectural elegance with a tranquil coastal sanctuary. Residents enjoy fresh sea breezes, private beach access, and immediate connectivity to key metropolitan hubs.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Located along prestigious shoreline corridors, the community offers an inspired lifestyle for professionals, investors, and families seeking refined island elegance away from urban congestion.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Every residence offers a harmonious blend of sophistication, security, and long-term capital appreciation, presenting an extraordinary investment opportunity in one of the most coveted coastal addresses.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>About the Developers<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Crafted by premier developers renowned for shaping iconic waterfront communities across the region for decades. Buyers and international investors benefit from a celebrated track record of timely delivery, construction excellence, and sustainable urban design.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Working alongside leading international architectural consultants and market advisory firms, every aspect of the project is engineered to global standards of prestige and durability.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Approvals &amp; Clearances<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The project holds full regulatory clearance and title approvals from all relevant municipal and developmental authorities. Complying strictly with environmental and structural guidelines, purchasers can invest with absolute peace of mind and secure freehold ownership.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Prime Location &amp; Seamless Connectivity<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Set within a scenic coastal landscape, the project offers rapid access to international airports, commercial business districts, premier private schools, and luxury retail destinations.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC1.png\\\" alt=\\\"Strategic Location &amp; Connectivity Map\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); width: 100%; margin: 15px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Surrounded by protected green reserves and pristine waters, residents wake up to panoramic coastal vistas and unpolluted air throughout the year.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Architectural Excellence &amp; Floor Plans<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The layouts focus on space efficiency, panoramic natural lighting, and seamless indoor-outdoor living with spacious private terraces and balconies.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>Curated Residences &amp; Layout Types<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC2.png\\\" alt=\\\"Luxury Layout Plan - Type C\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Featuring open-plan living rooms, floor-to-ceiling double-glazed windows, designer show kitchens, and lavish en-suite master bedrooms designed for modern family living.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC3.png\\\" alt=\\\"Executive Layout Plan - Type B\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Expansive terraces provide seamless entertaining spaces overlooking lush landscaped courtyards and the sparkling coastline.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC4.png\\\" alt=\\\"Presidential Villa Layout Plan - Type A\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Generous multi-level accommodations including private elevators, maid\'s quarters, private swimming pools, and dedicated family lounges.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Master Plan &amp; Community Lifestyle<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The community master plan establishes a secure, private, and walkable residential haven. Dedicated subterranean parking ensures pedestrian safety across surface walkways, cycling trails, and waterfront boardwalks.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC8.png\\\" alt=\\\"Community Master Plan Overview\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Flexible Investment &amp; Payment Plan<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>A buyer-friendly, construction-linked payment structure is offered with flexible milestones, making property acquisition straightforward and stress-free.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC12.png\\\" alt=\\\"Milestone Payment Structure\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>World-Class Facilities &amp; Amenities<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Enjoy infinity swimming pools, state-of-the-art fitness centres, private beach cabanas, children\'s play areas, multi-sport courts, and fine-dining waterfront restaurants just steps from your front door.<\\/p>\",\"body\":\"<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">A premier benchmark for luxury waterfront living, seamlessly blending contemporary architectural elegance with a tranquil coastal sanctuary. Residents enjoy fresh sea breezes, private beach access, and immediate connectivity to key metropolitan hubs.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Located along prestigious shoreline corridors, the community offers an inspired lifestyle for professionals, investors, and families seeking refined island elegance away from urban congestion.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Every residence offers a harmonious blend of sophistication, security, and long-term capital appreciation, presenting an extraordinary investment opportunity in one of the most coveted coastal addresses.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>About the Developers<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Crafted by premier developers renowned for shaping iconic waterfront communities across the region for decades. Buyers and international investors benefit from a celebrated track record of timely delivery, construction excellence, and sustainable urban design.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Working alongside leading international architectural consultants and market advisory firms, every aspect of the project is engineered to global standards of prestige and durability.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Approvals &amp; Clearances<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The project holds full regulatory clearance and title approvals from all relevant municipal and developmental authorities. Complying strictly with environmental and structural guidelines, purchasers can invest with absolute peace of mind and secure freehold ownership.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Prime Location &amp; Seamless Connectivity<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Set within a scenic coastal landscape, the project offers rapid access to international airports, commercial business districts, premier private schools, and luxury retail destinations.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC1.png\\\" alt=\\\"Strategic Location &amp; Connectivity Map\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); width: 100%; margin: 15px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Surrounded by protected green reserves and pristine waters, residents wake up to panoramic coastal vistas and unpolluted air throughout the year.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Architectural Excellence &amp; Floor Plans<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The layouts focus on space efficiency, panoramic natural lighting, and seamless indoor-outdoor living with spacious private terraces and balconies.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>Curated Residences &amp; Layout Types<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC2.png\\\" alt=\\\"Luxury Layout Plan - Type C\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Featuring open-plan living rooms, floor-to-ceiling double-glazed windows, designer show kitchens, and lavish en-suite master bedrooms designed for modern family living.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC3.png\\\" alt=\\\"Executive Layout Plan - Type B\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Expansive terraces provide seamless entertaining spaces overlooking lush landscaped courtyards and the sparkling coastline.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC4.png\\\" alt=\\\"Presidential Villa Layout Plan - Type A\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Generous multi-level accommodations including private elevators, maid\'s quarters, private swimming pools, and dedicated family lounges.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Master Plan &amp; Community Lifestyle<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The community master plan establishes a secure, private, and walkable residential haven. Dedicated subterranean parking ensures pedestrian safety across surface walkways, cycling trails, and waterfront boardwalks.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC8.png\\\" alt=\\\"Community Master Plan Overview\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Flexible Investment &amp; Payment Plan<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>A buyer-friendly, construction-linked payment structure is offered with flexible milestones, making property acquisition straightforward and stress-free.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC12.png\\\" alt=\\\"Milestone Payment Structure\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>World-Class Facilities &amp; Amenities<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Enjoy infinity swimming pools, state-of-the-art fitness centres, private beach cabanas, children\'s play areas, multi-sport courts, and fine-dining waterfront restaurants just steps from your front door.<\\/p>\"}', '2026-11-03 11:05:38', '2026-11-03 11:05:38'),
