(905, 112, 'location', 'Location & Connectivity', 9, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima ACE Avenue Location in Scheme 33, Karachi\",\"description\":\"\",\"items\":[],\"categories\":[{\"name\":\"Nearby Landmarks And Attractions\",\"items\":[{\"name\":\"Main Super Highway (M-9)\",\"time\":\"1\\u20133 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"Jinnah International Airport\",\"time\":\"20\\u201330 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"Malir Cantonment\",\"time\":\"15\\u201320 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"Karachi Toll Plaza (M-9)\",\"time\":\"15\\u201322 minutes\"}]}],\"subtitle\":\"The Saima ACE Avenue Karachi location is in Gulzar-e-Hijri, Scheme 33, fronting the Main Super Highway directly, so residents skip the narrow internal roads that make daily commuting a headache in older parts of the city. The airport is around 15 to 20 minutes by road, Malir Cantonment is close by, Main University Road is a short drive, and Shoukat Khanum Memorial Cancer Hospital and Memon Medical Institute Hospital are both within a reasonable drive.\",\"image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793705067_6ae9c46b0198e.webp\"}', '2026-11-03 11:16:30', '2026-11-03 11:53:49'),
(906, 112, 'faq', 'FAQ Accordion', 10, 1, '{\"title\":\"\",\"description\":\"\",\"items\":[{\"q\":\"Where is Saima ACE Avenue Karachi located?\",\"a\":\"Saima ACE Avenue is located in Gulzar-e-Hijri, Scheme 33, Karachi, fronting the Main Super Highway. The Saima ACE Avenue Karachi location keeps residents close to Jinnah International Airport, Malir Cantonment, and Main University Road.\"},{\"q\":\"What is Saima ACE Avenue price?\",\"a\":\"Price at Saima Ace Avenue Scheme 33  depends on the unit type, floor, the unit\'s position in the building, and how far along construction is at the time of booking. A complete official price list covering every floor and type has not been published consistently, so buyers should obtain current figures from the sales office.\"},{\"q\":\"How many bedrooms in Saima ACE Avenue?\",\"a\":\"Saima ACE Avenue Saima Builders offers three configurations mapped directly to room count: the 3-room Type C (around 850 sq. ft.), the 4-room Type B (around 1,100 sq. ft.), and the 5-room Type A (around 1,300 sq. ft.), with roughly eight apartments per floor.\"},{\"q\":\"What is Saima ACE Avenue payment plan?\",\"a\":\"Booking at Saima ACE Avenue starts with an initial payment, followed by a confirmation stage before installments begin. Installments run on a structured monthly schedule, with a final possession-linked payment near handover; buyers should also ask whether part of the plan is tied to quarterly construction milestones and request a full cost breakdown in writing.\"},{\"q\":\"Is Saima ACE Avenue NOC approved?\",\"a\":\"Buyers should verify the project-specific NOC and approval status for Saima ACE Avenue Karachi directly with the developer or the relevant authority before purchase.\"},{\"q\":\"Is Saima ACE Avenue the same as Saima Ace Residency?\",\"a\":\"No. Saima ACE Avenue is the Scheme 33 high-rise on the Main Super Highway listed in the developer\'s own upcoming projects, while Saima Ace Residency has no dedicated official project page. Buyers should confirm which project a listing refers to before paying anything.\"},{\"q\":\"Who is developing Saima ACE Avenue?\",\"a\":\"Saima ACE Avenue is developed by Saima Builders & Developers, part of the wider Saima Group, which has a cluster of projects in Scheme 33 and is also active in Hyderabad and Sukkur.\"},{\"q\":\"Can overseas buyers book in Saima ACE Avenue?\",\"a\":\"Overseas buyers can engage through authorised channels, but remittance and documentation procedures should be confirmed directly with the Saima ACE Avenue sales team.\"},{\"q\":\"Why consider Saima ACE Avenue Karachi?\",\"a\":\"Because of the Super Highway frontage, dedicated parking floors that older buildings in Gulshan and Nazimabad lack, a simple three-type lineup that is easy to compare, and an under-construction stage where early buyers may access better rates than finished, move-in-ready units.\"}],\"heading\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\"}', '2026-11-03 11:16:30', '2026-11-03 11:53:49'),
(907, 112, 'contact', 'Contact & Booking CTA', 11, 1, '{\"title\":\"\",\"subtitle\":\"Discover family apartments atSaima ACE Avenue Saima Builders. Contact our advisory team for personalized guidance on Saima ACE Avenue, updated pricing, and private viewings. Whether you are exploring apartments for sale Saima ACE Avenue or seeking to buy flat in Saima ACE Avenue Karachi, our consultants can navigate the Saima ACE Avenue booking process.\",\"button_text\":\"\",\"phone\":\"\",\"email\":\"\",\"pretitle\":\"LET\'S CONNECT\",\"heading\":\"Invest in Your Future\",\"form_small\":\"REQUEST\",\"form_large\":\"A CALL BACK\",\"submit_button\":\"REQUEST NOW\",\"bg_image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793705067_6ae9c46b02d8e.jpeg\"}', '2026-11-03 11:16:30', '2026-11-03 11:53:49'),
