(916, 113, 'location', 'Location & Connectivity', 9, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Luxury Apartments Location in Bagh-e-Korangi, Karachi\",\"description\":\"\",\"items\":[],\"subtitle\":\"The Saima Luxury Apartments Karachi location is in Bagh-e-Korangi, Shah Faisal, close to Saima Luxury Homes, the airport, Shahrah-e-Faisal, and the Malir River Bridge. Korangi has grown into a genuinely established part of Karachi, and this pocket benefits from sitting close to some of the city\'s busier connecting roads: Shahrah-e-Faisal provides fairly direct access to the rest of Karachi, and Drigh Road Railway Station and the Airport Railway Station are both a few kilometres away.\",\"image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793708390_6ae9d1665f41c.jpg\",\"categories\":[{\"name\":\"Nearby Landmarks And Attractions\",\"items\":[{\"name\":\"Shahrah-e-Faisal\",\"time\":\"10\\u201315 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"Jinnah International Airport\",\"time\":\"10\\u201315 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"Malir River Bridge\",\"time\":\"8\\u201312 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"Shah Faisal Colony\",\"time\":\"8\\u201312 minutes\"}]}]}', '2026-11-03 11:57:16', '2026-11-03 12:21:05'),
(917, 113, 'faq', 'FAQ Accordion', 10, 1, '{\"title\":\"\",\"description\":\"\",\"items\":[{\"q\":\"Where is Saima Luxury Apartments Karachi located?\",\"a\":\"Saima Luxury Apartments Saima Builders is located in Bagh-e-Korangi, Shah Faisal, Karachi, close to Shahrah-e-Faisal, the Malir River Bridge, and Jinnah International Airport. Shah Faisal Town, Drigh Colony, and the wider Korangi district surround the project.\"},{\"q\":\"What is Saima Luxury Apartments price?\",\"a\":\"Pricing at Saima Luxury Apartments Shah Faisal  differs by unit type: Type C is the entry tier, and the 4-room Types B1, B, and A are priced progressively higher by size, layout, and position. Promotional figures date quickly on a project marketed with limited units remaining, so buyers should obtain the current official price list directly.\"},{\"q\":\"How many bedrooms in Saima Luxury Apartments?\",\"a\":\"Saima Luxury Apartments offers 3-room and 4-room configurations: Type C is the 3-room unit, while Types B1, B, and A are all 4-room units differing mainly in size, positioning, and finish. There is no standalone 1-room or 2-room category in the current mix; room counts here follow the project\'s room-based types, with bedrooms carrying attached baths.\"},{\"q\":\"What is Saima Luxury Apartments payment plan?\",\"a\":\"The Saima Luxury Apartments payment plan runs booking, then confirmation, then 48 monthly installments, with a 16-quarter installment alternative for buyers whose income is not fixed monthly, and a final possession payment once the schedule completes. Development charges are usually itemised separately; exact amounts are provided through the authorised sales channel.\"},{\"q\":\"Is Saima Luxury Apartments NOC approved?\",\"a\":\"Buyers should verify the project-specific NOC and approval status for Saima Luxury Apartments Karachi directly with the developer or the relevant authority before purchase.\"},{\"q\":\"Is Saima Luxury Apartments the same as Saima Luxury Homes?\",\"a\":\"No. Saima Luxury Apartments is the newer five-tower apartment project in Bagh-e-Korangi, still under construction, while Saima Luxury Homes is an older, established villa and house society in Sector 10, Korangi. Both are Saima Group developments in the same general belt, but they are separate projects with separate pricing and paperwork.\"},{\"q\":\"Who is developing Saima Luxury Apartments?\",\"a\":\"Saima Luxury Apartments Shah Faisal is developed by Saima Group, active in Karachi\'s real estate market for around four decades, with a portfolio that includes Saima Dreams, Saima Boulevard, Saima Arabian Villas, and Saima Elite Enclave.\"},{\"q\":\"Can overseas buyers book in Saima Luxury Apartments?\",\"a\":\"Overseas buyers can engage through authorised channels, but remittance and documentation procedures should be confirmed directly with the Saima Luxury Apartments sales team.\"},{\"q\":\"Why consider Saima Luxury Apartments Karachi?\",\"a\":\"Because of its long 48-month installment runway, which makes an apartment genuinely accessible to salaried buyers, its five-tower community format near Shah Faisal and the airport, and layouts with a terrace, drawing room, and lounge that are a real step up from the cramped single-purpose layouts in older buildings nearby.\"}],\"heading\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\"}', '2026-11-03 11:57:16', '2026-11-03 12:21:05'),
