(975, 127, 'content', 'Content', 2, 1, '{\"title\":\"\",\"intro\":\"<p><br><\\/p>\",\"html\":\"<h2>Why Saima Projects in Main Shahrah-e-Faisal Stand Out<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Main Shahrah-e-Faisal places Saima Greens near Jinnah International Airport and Faisal Cantonment, on Karachi\'s main airport corridor, with landscaped parks and open green spaces across more than 40% of the project area.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Key Facts: Saima Greens at Main Shahrah-e-Faisal<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>This table summarises the Saima new project on Main Shahrah-e-Faisal.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<table>\\r\\n  <tbody><tr>\\r\\n    <th>Detail<\\/th>\\r\\n    <th>Information<\\/th>\\r\\n  <\\/tr>\\r\\n  <tr>\\r\\n    <td>Project<\\/td>\\r\\n    <td>Saima Greens<\\/td>\\r\\n  <\\/tr>\\r\\n  <tr>\\r\\n    <td>Location<\\/td>\\r\\n    <td>Main Shahrah-e-Faisal, near Jinnah International Airport, Karachi<\\/td>\\r\\n  <\\/tr>\\r\\n  <tr>\\r\\n    <td>Developer<\\/td>\\r\\n    <td>Saima Builders<\\/td>\\r\\n  <\\/tr>\\r\\n  <tr>\\r\\n    <td>Homes<\\/td>\\r\\n    <td>4, 5 and 6-room apartments<\\/td>\\r\\n  <\\/tr>\\r\\n  <tr>\\r\\n    <td>Payment Plan<\\/td>\\r\\n    <td>On easy installments<\\/td>\\r\\n  <\\/tr>\\r\\n  <tr>\\r\\n    <td>Handover<\\/td>\\r\\n    <td>To be confirmed<\\/td>\\r\\n  <\\/tr>\\r\\n<\\/tbody><\\/table>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Saima Premium Apartments in Saima Greens: Layouts and Amenities<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The homes and units are:<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n  <li>4-room apartments<\\/li>\\r\\n  <li>5-room apartments<\\/li>\\r\\n  <li>6-room apartments<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Planned amenities include:<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n  <li>Landscaped parks and open green spaces across more than 40% of the project area<\\/li>\\r\\n  <li>A community centre<\\/li>\\r\\n  <li>Children\'s play areas<\\/li>\\r\\n  <li>A prayer area<\\/li>\\r\\n  <li>Standby generators<\\/li>\\r\\n  <li>Gated security arrangements<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Price, Installments and Booking<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>No public price list is quoted here for Saima Greens, so confirm any Saima projects on Main Shahrah-e-Faisal price in writing. The project is offered on easy installments, with the exact booking amount and payment schedule to be confirmed in writing.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Buyers asking about Saima projects on installment should request the payment schedule and booking amount. For Main Shahrah-e-Faisal apartments for sale, note that the Saima offering in this location is apartments, so confirm the exact unit type and availability in writing before booking.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Approvals Before You Book<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Approvals are project-specific, so verify the NOC and building approvals independently before booking. Anyone comparing Saima new projects in Karachi on Main Shahrah-e-Faisal should verify every document independently.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Final Thoughts<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Saima Greens is the main entry among Saima new projects in Karachi on Main Shahrah-e-Faisal. Before looking at other Saima projects on Main Shahrah-e-Faisal, get the price, payment schedule and approvals in writing.<\\/p>\",\"body\":\"<p><br><\\/p>\"}', '2026-11-09 10:23:27', '2026-11-09 10:34:44'),
(976, 127, 'faq', 'FAQ Accordion', 3, 1, '{\"title\":\"\",\"description\":\"\",\"items\":[{\"q\":\"1. Which are the Saima new projects in Karachi Main Shahrah-e-Faisal?\",\"a\":\"Saima Greens is the Saima project covered on this page for Main Shahrah-e-Faisal.\"},{\"q\":\"2. Where are Saima projects in Main Shahrah-e-Faisal located?\",\"a\":\"Saima Greens is in Tariq Bin Ziyad Society, on Main Shahrah-e-Faisal near Jinnah International Airport, Karachi.\"},{\"q\":\"3. What is the Saima projects in Main Shahrah-e-Faisal price?\",\"a\":\"No price list is quoted here, so ask Saima\'s authorised sales channel for a written rate sheet for the exact unit.\"},{\"q\":\"4. Are Main Shahrah-e-Faisal apartments for sale yet?\",\"a\":\"The Saima offering in this location is apartments. Confirm current availability for the exact unit in writing before booking.\"},{\"q\":\"5. What payment plan does Saima Greens offer?\",\"a\":\"The project is offered on easy installments, with exact booking and schedule to be confirmed in writing.\"},{\"q\":\"6. Can I buy Saima projects on installment?\",\"a\":\"Yes, installment options are listed for Saima projects in this location, but get the booking amount and full schedule in writing first.\"},{\"q\":\"7. What are Saima premium apartments at this project?\",\"a\":\"They are 4, 5 and 6-room apartments.\"},{\"q\":\"8. Who delivers Saima projects in Main Shahrah-e-Faisal?\",\"a\":\"Saima Builders, with project-specific delivery partners where listed in the Key Facts table above.\"},{\"q\":\"9. When is possession for Saima new projects in Karachi Main Shahrah-e-Faisal?\",\"a\":\"Handover is to be confirmed, so get a written schedule before booking.\"},{\"q\":\"10. Is Saima Greens NOC approved?\",\"a\":\"Approvals are project-specific, so verify the NOC and building approvals independently before booking.\"}],\"heading\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\"}', '2026-11-09 10:23:27', '2026-11-09 10:34:44'),
