(1060, 137, 'hero', 'Hero Banner & Form', 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima New Projects in Karachi Korangi Township\",\"subtitle\":\"For those searching for Saima new projects in Karachi Korangi Township, Saima Business Park is the Saima commercial address in Korangi Township, offering offices and shops at Sector 19, near Singer Chowrangi, inside Karachi\'s Korangi industrial and commercial corridor.\",\"badge\":null,\"bg_image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1794293883_6af2c07b52a3e.jpg\",\"bg_image_alt\":\"Saima New Projects in Karachi Korangi Township\",\"image_alt\":\"Saima New Projects in Karachi Korangi Township\"}', '2026-11-10 06:52:41', '2026-11-10 06:58:03'),
(1061, 137, 'content', 'Content', 2, 1, '{\"title\":\"\",\"intro\":\"<p><br><\\/p>\",\"html\":\"<h2>Why Saima Projects in Korangi Township, Karachi Stand Out<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Korangi Township places Saima Business Park at Sector 19, near Singer Chowrangi and Korangi Industrial Area, as a planned business address rather than a residential tower.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Key Facts: Saima Business Park at Korangi Township<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>This table summarises the Saima new project in Korangi Township, Karachi.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<table>\\r\\n    <tbody><tr>\\r\\n        <th>Detail<\\/th>\\r\\n        <th>Information<\\/th>\\r\\n    <\\/tr>\\r\\n    <tr>\\r\\n        <td>Project<\\/td>\\r\\n        <td>Saima Business Park<\\/td>\\r\\n    <\\/tr>\\r\\n    <tr>\\r\\n        <td>Location<\\/td>\\r\\n        <td>Sector 19, Korangi Township, near Singer Chowrangi, Karachi<\\/td>\\r\\n    <\\/tr>\\r\\n    <tr>\\r\\n        <td>Developer<\\/td>\\r\\n        <td>Saima Builders<\\/td>\\r\\n    <\\/tr>\\r\\n    <tr>\\r\\n        <td>Type<\\/td>\\r\\n        <td>Commercial<\\/td>\\r\\n    <\\/tr>\\r\\n    <tr>\\r\\n        <td>Units<\\/td>\\r\\n        <td>Offices and shops<\\/td>\\r\\n    <\\/tr>\\r\\n    <tr>\\r\\n        <td>Payment Plan<\\/td>\\r\\n        <td>On easy installments<\\/td>\\r\\n    <\\/tr>\\r\\n    <tr>\\r\\n        <td>Handover<\\/td>\\r\\n        <td>To be confirmed<\\/td>\\r\\n    <\\/tr>\\r\\n<\\/tbody><\\/table>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Saima Premium Commercial Units In Saima Business Park: Layouts and Amenities<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The available commercial units include:<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n    <li>Offices<\\/li>\\r\\n    <li>Shops<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Planned amenities include:<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n    <li>Dedicated parking<\\/li>\\r\\n    <li>Lift access<\\/li>\\r\\n    <li>Security arrangements<\\/li>\\r\\n    <li>Wide internal access planned for business traffic<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Price, Installments and Booking<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>No public price list is quoted here for Saima Business Park, so confirm any Saima projects in Korangi Township, Karachi price in writing. The project is offered on easy installments, with the exact booking amount and payment schedule to be confirmed in writing.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Buyers asking about Saima projects on installment should request the following details:<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n    <li>Complete payment schedule<\\/li>\\r\\n    <li>Initial booking amount<\\/li>\\r\\n    <li>Monthly or quarterly installment amounts<\\/li>\\r\\n    <li>Additional charges and fees<\\/li>\\r\\n    <li>Expected handover timeline<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>For Korangi Township, Karachi apartments for sale, note that the Saima offering in this location is commercial offices and shops rather than residential apartments. Confirm the exact commercial unit type and availability in writing before booking.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Approvals Before You Book<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Approvals are project-specific, so verify the NOC and building approvals independently before booking. Anyone comparing Saima new projects in Karachi Korangi Township should verify every document independently.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Before making a payment, check:<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n    <li>Valid No Objection Certificate (NOC)<\\/li>\\r\\n    <li>Approved building plans<\\/li>\\r\\n    <li>Land ownership and title documents<\\/li>\\r\\n    <li>Developer credentials<\\/li>\\r\\n    <li>Written booking terms and payment conditions<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Final Thoughts<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Saima Business Park is the main entry among Saima new projects in Karachi Korangi Township. Before looking at other Saima projects in Korangi Township, Karachi, get the price, payment schedule, handover details and approvals in writing.<\\/p>\",\"body\":\"<p><br><\\/p>\"}', '2026-11-10 06:52:41', '2026-11-10 06:55:35'),
(1062, 137, 'faq', 'FAQ Accordion', 3, 1, '{\"title\":\"\",\"description\":\"\",\"items\":[{\"q\":\"1. Which are the Saima new projects in Karachi Korangi Township?\",\"a\":\"Saima Business Park is the Saima project covered on this page for Korangi Township, Karachi.\"},{\"q\":\"2. Where are Saima projects in Korangi Township, Karachi located?\",\"a\":\"Saima Business Park is at Sector 19, Korangi Township, near Singer Chowrangi, Karachi.\"},{\"q\":\"3. What is the Saima projects in Korangi Township, Karachi price?\",\"a\":\"No price list is quoted here, so ask Saima\'s authorised sales channel for a written rate sheet for the exact unit.\"},{\"q\":\"4. Are Korangi Township, Karachi apartments for sale yet?\",\"a\":\"The Saima offering in this location is offices and shops. Confirm current availability for the exact unit in writing before booking.\"},{\"q\":\"5. What payment plan does Saima Business Park offer?\",\"a\":\"The project is offered on easy installments, with exact booking and schedule to be confirmed in writing.\"},{\"q\":\"6. Can I buy Saima projects on installment?\",\"a\":\"Yes, installment options are listed for Saima projects in this location, but get the booking amount and full schedule in writing first.\"},{\"q\":\"7. What are Saima premium apartments at this project?\",\"a\":\"They are offices and shops.\"},{\"q\":\"8. Who delivers Saima projects in Korangi Township, Karachi?\",\"a\":\"Saima Builders, with project-specific delivery partners where listed in the Key Facts table above.\"},{\"q\":\"9. When is possession for Saima new projects in Karachi Korangi Township?\",\"a\":\"Handover is to be confirmed, so get a written schedule before booking.\"},{\"q\":\"10. Is Saima Business Park NOC approved?\",\"a\":\"Approvals are project-specific, so verify the NOC and building approvals independently before booking.\"}],\"heading\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\"}', '2026-11-10 06:52:41', '2026-11-10 06:55:35'),
